  - m_Id: 2725240873
    m_Localized: Stormblade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240874
    m_Localized: Stormhammer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240875
    m_Localized: Colonel Windflow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240876
    m_Localized: Transistor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240877
    m_Localized: Lime Fizzy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240878
    m_Localized: Heartrose
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240879
    m_Localized: Professor Brownie
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240880
    m_Localized: Balefire Phoenix
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240881
    m_Localized: 'A phoenix, mutated from radiation and adapted to live in the Wasteland.
      Despite the attractive appearance, it can be quite dangerous because of his
      ability to breathe radioactive flames.

      A balefire phoenix is not aggressive
      to those, whose souls still maintain some good and mercy in them. It can be
      tamed, then it becomes your friend and companion'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240882
    m_Localized: Robo-owl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240883
    m_Localized: A small security robot that can also serve as a personal assistant
      or secretary. Has a pretty powerful laser weapon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240884
    m_Localized: Ponies, zebras and griffins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240885
    m_Localized: 'Pony - a dominant species of sentient beings inhabiting Equestria.
      They`re divided into three races: unicorns, pegasi, and earth ponies. Each
      race has its advantages and disadvantages. Unicorns have a gift of telekinesis,
      and with special training can master various magical spells, pegasi can fly,
      and earth ponies are the most strong, endurant and tenacious of all. Currently,
      you can meet many unicorns and earth ponies in the Wasteland. Pegasi on the
      other hoof are rarely encountered, as most of them live in their cloud cities
      and don`t descend to the ground.

      Zebras - residents of a distant country,
      the main enemies of the ponies in the Great War. At present, their descendants
      quite often can be found in Equestria, and, despite the centuries past, the
      old enmity has not yet been forgotten. Zebras do not have magical powers like
      unicorns but can use witchcraft, curses, potions, and amulets, and some still
      remember the ancient art of necromancy.

      Griffins are not so numerous
      in Equestria, and most of them serve as mercenaries. Physically they are stronger
      than ponies, and have the ability to fly, but do not own any magical powers'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240886
    m_Localized: Raiders
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240887
    m_Localized: 'Raiders are bandits, earth ponies, and unicorns, living on robbery,
      plunder and brute force.

      This is a real scourge of the Wasteland, who
      gathered the worst traits and vices. Raiders, as a rule, are extremely aggressive,
      cruel, greedy, mean, and often simply insane. They always look dirty, ragged
      and scarred.

      Raiders often get into packs or even large gangs, ruled
      by the leaders. They arrange dens in abandoned buildings, convenient for raiding
      settlements or robbing commercial caravans and occasional travelers. Anyone
      invading their territory will be immediately attacked. They are usually poorly
      armed with melee weapons or old and weathered firearms, and their armor is
      made from various garbage'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240888
    m_Localized: Raider-sadist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240889
    m_Localized: Psychos and maniacs, enjoying more than anything to mock and torture
      their victims. In battle rely on cold steel or on their own hooves and thick
      forehead. Because of the dumb habit of "decorating" their dwellings with fragments
      of decaying corpses, they are constantly sick with various diseases
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240890
    m_Localized: Raider-rogue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240891
    m_Localized: Considered as trash even by the raiders` standards. They are always
      dressed in rags, armed with some pieces of garbage, and their health is undermined
      by the abundant use of alcohol and drugs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240892
    m_Localized: Metalhead raider
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240893
    m_Localized: Raiders from the Metalheads gang love surrounding themselves with
      various pieces of metal, which themselves they call "armor". Because of this,
      they are heavy and slow, but they are also quite well protected from hits and
      bullets. They use cold steel or rely on spikes that decorate their armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240894
    m_Localized: Raider-pervert
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240895
    m_Localized: The gang of Lechers is a collection of all known vices. They are
      spiteful, greedy, lascivious - in a word, rare scumbags. They prefer big and
      heavy melee weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240896
    m_Localized: Raider-rebel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240897
    m_Localized: The Rebels raiders value freedom more than anything in the world.
      This, in their understanding, is expressed in the ability to freely rob and
      rape anypony wherever they please. Armed with light firearms, like pistols
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240898
    m_Localized: Raider-executioner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240899
    m_Localized: Conscience of the Executioners gang is heavy with many settlements,
      ruined and destroyed to the last inhabitant. These are ruthless killers who
      kill not for any selfish purpose, just for the hell of it. Often armed with
      shotguns, which makes them particularly dangerous at close range
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240900
    m_Localized: Raider-master
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240901
    m_Localized: Masters are the most dangerous, organized and well-equipped raider
      gang. By raiders standards, they have good armor and weapons, and what`s more,
      they know how to use them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240902
    m_Localized: Raider-scorcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240903
    m_Localized: The Scorchers gang is notorious for their unhealthy thirst for fire.
      In combat they use flamethrowers and incendiary weapons, and themselves feel
      almost no pain from burns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240904
    m_Localized: Raider-bomber
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240905
    m_Localized: Bombers are simply obsessed with explosives. They wander around
      hung with grenades, and never miss a single opportunity to use them. This makes
      them, probably, more dangerous for their fellow raiders than for enemies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240906
    m_Localized: Raider leader
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240907
    m_Localized: The leaders are almost always the biggest, the most powerful and
      the most cruel of the raiders
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240908
    m_Localized: Slavers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240909
    m_Localized: Bandits, whose main game is capturing and subsequently selling their
      victims as slaves. While being almost as cruel and immoral as raiders, slavers,
      however, are much more "civilized." Their gangs are numerous and well-organized,
      they have competent leaders, a clear hierarchy and distribution of responsibilities.
      Slavers know their cruel craft quite well, and they use much better weapons
      and armor than raiders. All this makes them way more dangerous opponents
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240910
    m_Localized: Herdspony
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240911
    m_Localized: Herdsponies occupy the lowest level of hierarchy in slavers gangs.
      Their duty is mainly transporting and escorting slaves to further trade destinations.
      They are usually armed with cold weapons, and their armor, in accordance with
      their low status, is of rather poor quality
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240912
    m_Localized: Catcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240913
    m_Localized: The duty of catchers is tracking down and capturing new slaves.
      Most slaves come from raiders, nomads, and travelers, but often catchers attack
      peaceful settlements, taking all strong and healthy residents and killing all
      the others. They are armed with various weapons and are quite dangerous for
      a lonely traveler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240914
    m_Localized: Warden
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240915
    m_Localized: The duties of the wardens include looking after slaves, preventing
      them from escaping, maintaining order and execution of punishments (the last
      usually is performed with special enthusiasm). Often accompany hunters in their
      raids. Armed with firearms and represent a considerable danger in combat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240916
    m_Localized: Guard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240917
    m_Localized: Guards is the primary force of slavers. They serve as cover and
      support troops in raids, and protect camps from external threats. They also
      look after other slavers, brutally dealing with troublemakers. Armed with a
      variety of weapons and have a good armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240918
    m_Localized: Elite guard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240919
    m_Localized: Elite guards are real professionals - strong, experienced and well-equipped.
      They usually protect gang leaders or participate in the most risky raids. Extremely
      dangerous
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240920
    m_Localized: Leader
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240921
    m_Localized: Usually, the leaders are chosen from the most cunning, fortunate
      and merciless slavers. They often command large groups of catchers, herdsponies
      and wardens, whom they lead to hunt for their live goods
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240922
    m_Localized: Mercenaries
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240923
    m_Localized: Mercenaries, also known as "Talons", is a semi-military organization,
      which mostly consists of griffins. It includes many independent fractions,
      each with its own leader. Although some mercenaries have their own code of
      honor, most of them are common scoundrels who are only interested in money
      and not limited by any morality. They undertake any work whether it`s contract
      killing, kidnapping or slave trade, and show no pity for their victims. Mercenaries
      have, as a rule, much better weapons than other Wasteland inhabitants
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240924
    m_Localized: Griffin-scout
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240925
    m_Localized: Talons scouts always come in front of the main forces. Their task
      is to observe the situation, gather information and find targets. Scouts, as
      a rule, are weakly armed and only wear light armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240926
    m_Localized: Griffin-assaulter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240927
    m_Localized: The main strike force of the Talons troops. Their task is to be
      in the battle`s forefront. For this purpose they have good armor and weapons
      like shotguns and assault rifles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240928
    m_Localized: Griffin-gunner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240929
    m_Localized: The task of machine gunners is providing fire support with heavy
      weapons. They prefer larger guns, wearing which means to sacrifice armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240930
    m_Localized: Griffin-sharpshooter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240931
    m_Localized: Snipers try to keep distance and eliminate targets from afar. They
      are often armed with large-caliber rifles, posing a considerable threat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240932
    m_Localized: Elite Talon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240933
    m_Localized: The most experienced Talon fighters. They wear combat armor and
      use the best of modern weapons, which they can handle perfectly. Additional
      danger is represented by blades fastened to the wings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240934
    m_Localized: Legion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240935
    m_Localized: It seems that not all zebras know that the Great War ended two hundred
      years ago. Recently, the zebra military organization, known as the Legion,
      began gaining strength. The goals of its leaders are still unknown, but it
      is clear to everyone that nothing good can be expected of them. Zebras have
      excellent skills of stealth, they are masters of disguise, ambush, and deadly
      in close combat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240936
    m_Localized: Zebra-spy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240937
    m_Localized: Nopony knows what the Legion spies are looking for in these parts
      - zebras never negotiate with anyone. They always act secretly and stealthily,
      but in case of detection they rush into battle with unseen fury
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240938
    m_Localized: Zebra-saboteur
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240939
    m_Localized: Legion`s saboteurs secretly penetrate various destroyed buildings
      in the Wasteland carrying a good supply of explosives. What for? Nopony knows,
      but hardly with good intentions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240940
    m_Localized: Zebra-assassin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240941
    m_Localized: Enchanted cloak of the assassin makes him almost completely invisible.
      Nothing will give out his presence until the fatal shot from a sniper rifle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240942
    m_Localized: Zebra-fighter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240943
    m_Localized: Well-trained and armed fighters of the Legion are good at striking
      quickly and then retreating, dissolving into darkness of the night
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240944
    m_Localized: Legion Officer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240945
    m_Localized: Legion officers usually wear traditional robes and armor. They aren`t
      very bulletproof, but their appearance increases morale of the legion soldiers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240946
    m_Localized: Necromancer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240947
    m_Localized: Zebra-necromancers are powerful sorcerers, in no way inferior to
      the best unicorn magicians. But, unlike them, necromancers no longer rely on
      attacking magic, but rather on dark spells and summons of various creatures
      and spirits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240948
    m_Localized: Steel Rangers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240949
    m_Localized: One of the most powerful factions of postwar Equestria. Steel Rangers
      - a closed paramilitary organization, consisting of earth ponies and unicorns,
      proclaiming its goal to find and preserve pre-war technology. Characterized
      by aggressiveness, intolerance to strangers and generally contemptuous attitude
      to other inhabitants of the Wasteland, whom they simply call "savages". They
      own many rare technologies, do not respect any guns smaller than a minigun,
      and are particularly famous for their power armor - the legacy of the Ministry
      of Wartime Technology. Power armor, powerful weapons, combat robots, and perverted
      morals only a little better than raiders` - all this makes the Steel Rangers
      ones of the most dangerous opponents you will face
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240950
    m_Localized: Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240951
    m_Localized: Knights are the main force of Steel Rangers, the lowest rank in
      their military hierarchy. They are organized into divisions commanded by Crusaders
      or into larger formations
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240952
    m_Localized: Crusader
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240953
    m_Localized: Crusaders are junior officers, roughly analogous to sergeants of
      the regular Equestrian army, who lead small detachments of eight steel rangers
      and carry out orders from higher commanders
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240954
    m_Localized: Paladin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240955
    m_Localized: Paladins are junior officers, commanding large divisions of twenty-four
      Steel Rangers. They report directly to the Senior Paladins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240956
    m_Localized: Grand Pegasus Enclave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240957
    m_Localized: The pegasi military organization that emerged from the remnants
      of the former Equestrian air forces, once giving air support to other ponies
      during the War. Shortly before the War`s end pegasi leaders refused to battle
      with zebras any longer and shut the sky with cloud barrier, separating themselves
      from the rest of ponykind. Commanding officers of Enclave regard the Wasteland
      inhabitants as a threat to pegasi society and their own position as rulers.
      Currently the Enclave possesses the most advanced technologies in all of Equestria
      including battle airships, the latest generation of magical energy weapons
      and power armor specially designed for pegasi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240958
    m_Localized: Enclave officer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240959
    m_Localized: Enclave officers are rarely encountered outside fortified areas,
      military bases or airships. They do not wear power armor and therefore are
      relatively weak opponents
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240960
    m_Localized: Enclave scout
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240961
    m_Localized: Enclave scouts often move at the front of a main force. They wear
      light power armor which leaves their wings unprotected but instead is equipped
      with a whole bunch of locators built into the helmet, allowing detection of
      even well-disguised enemies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240962
    m_Localized: Enclave stormtrooper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240963
    m_Localized: Stormtroopers usually operate in groups of three pegasi called "wings".
      Their power armor can withstand significant damage, has built-in magical energy
      cannons and a "scorpion tail" for close combat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240964
    m_Localized: Elite stormtrooper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240965
    m_Localized: Elite stormtroopers are the pride of the Enclave army. They wear
      improved power armor, which perfectly protects against any damage, and use
      especially deadly magical energy weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240966
    m_Localized: Wing of Ravagers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240967
    m_Localized: A special squad consisting of three pegasi. Takes orders only from
      the Commander-in-Chief of the Enclave personally
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240968
    m_Localized: Monsters
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240969
    m_Localized: Post-war Equestria is inhabited by hordes of diverse monsters, beasts
      and mutants. Some of them appeared under the influence of radiation, taint
      or various magical curses, while others were created artificially
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240970
    m_Localized: Ghouls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240971
    m_Localized: Ghouls are ponies that mutated under the influence of radiation.
      The ones that represent danger are so-called feral ghouls - those who lost
      their mind and turned into bloodthirsty zombies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240972
    m_Localized: Feral ghoul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240973
    m_Localized: Common feral ghouls can be found in plenty in the Wastelands. As
      a rule, they live in desolate and abandoned places, such as ruins and sewage
      tunnels, and especially prefer places with radioactive contamination
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240974
    m_Localized: Rushing ghoul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240975
    m_Localized: Mutation in this kind of ghouls did not diminish their strength
      and speed - on the contrary, it even increased them. Also, they developed an
      ability to jump with huge height and distance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240976
    m_Localized: Hungry ghoul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240977
    m_Localized: Unicorn ghouls, whose ability for telekinesis only got stronger
      after mutation. You should watch out for their telekinetic grip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240978
    m_Localized: Raging ghoul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240979
    m_Localized: The vital activity products of this kind of ghouls represents a
      real collection of diverse toxic substances. When attacking, they can release
      clouds of toxic gas
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240980
    m_Localized: Glowing ghoul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240981
    m_Localized: This ghoul glows because of the overwhelming magical radiation stored
      in it. Getting hit, you risk not only taking physical damage but a dose of
      radiation as well. They are also able to create bursts of radiation, restoring
      health of other ghouls nearby
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240982
    m_Localized: Soldier ghoul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240983
    m_Localized: Earth pony soldier turned into a ghoul. It still wears remnants
      of armor, and its physical strength has incredibly increased after mutation.
      Just by stomping hooves on the ground, he can make a small earthquake
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240984
    m_Localized: Ripper ghoul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240985
    m_Localized: A mutation of this ghoul went further compared to its relatives.
      Its strength, speed, and aggression has increased multiple times, sharp spines
      appeared on the body, and in addition, it acquired an ability to spit acid.
      As a result, it became one of the most dangerous mutants in the Wasteland
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240986
    m_Localized: Canterlot ghoul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240987
    m_Localized: There is a specific kind of wild ghouls roaming the ruins of Canterlot
      that appeared not because of radiation but under influence of the pink cloud.
      They are especially dangerous because they can not be killed by ordinary bullets,
      as after "death" they revive. To kill these ghouls for good they must be burned
      or disintegrated. In addition, unicorn ghouls are able to use attack spells
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240988
    m_Localized: Bloated ghoul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240989
    m_Localized: The pink cloud penetrated so deeply into the dead flesh of these
      ghouls that it became their very essence. Now they are able to generate it
      at will
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240990
    m_Localized: Canterlot witch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240991
    m_Localized: Probably the most dangerous of existing ghouls. It is notorious
      for incredible strength, speed and vitality. She attacks with black magic,
      from which no armor can protect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240992
    m_Localized: Alicorns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240993
    m_Localized: 'Alicorns are creatures transformed by the Goddess from ordinary
      ponies using the Impelled Metamorphosis Potion. They have a larger size than
      other ponies, huge wings and a long horn. They possess a wide range of abilities:
      they can fly, communicate using of telepathy, they excel at telekinesis, as
      well as combat and defensive spells. All together, this makes them ones of
      the most dangerous enemies'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240994
    m_Localized: Blue alicorn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240995
    m_Localized: In addition to all other abilities, blue alicorns can use an invisibility
      spell. Hiding their presence for a while, they can insidiously attack from
      an ambush. They are also the most tenacious of alicorns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240996
    m_Localized: Purple alicorn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240997
    m_Localized: Purple alicorns possess powerful telekinesis, and in addition to
      all other abilities, are able to teleport themselves. Teleportation helps them
      evade enemy attacks or persistently pursue their target
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240998
    m_Localized: Green alicorn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725240999
    m_Localized: Green alicorns can create extra-strong magic shields, and in addition
      to all other abilities, have a powerful gift for telepathy. With its help they
      can influence opponent`s mind, disorienting it or creating dreadful visions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241000
    m_Localized: Blood Moon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241001
    m_Localized: A strange alicorn of black and red colors. It seems that she somehow
      combined special powers of all three types of alicorns, which made her an extremely
      dangerous opponent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241002
    m_Localized: Ghost blade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241003
    m_Localized: Hellhounds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241004
    m_Localized: Mutated descendants of diamond dogs, intelligent, but aggressive
      towards ponies and extremely dangerous. They have natural weapons - teeth and
      huge, sharp and strong claws on the front legs which can easily cut through
      metal and stone. They also have a good scent and can easily smell a hidden
      or even invisible enemy from close enough distance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241005
    m_Localized: Enclave Hellhound
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241006
    m_Localized: The Enclave found a way to suppress will of Hellhounds using special
      helmets and transmitters, subduing them and thus turning these creatures into
      weapons. Because mind-controlling devices affect their brain, the Enclave Hellhounds
      lose a significant part of their wits, but not their strength, speed and ferocity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241007
    m_Localized: Bloatsprites
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241008
    m_Localized: Bloatsprites are, apparently, parasprites, mutated under influence
      of taint or radiation. Acquiring new dangerous features, they have not lost
      their ability for intensive reproduction, thus their numbers in the Equestrian
      Wasteland are very high
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241009
    m_Localized: Others
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241010
    m_Localized: Bloodwing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241011
    m_Localized: Mutilated and increased in size vampire bats. Usually settle in
      empty and abandoned buildings, caves, under bridges and overpasses. Persistent
      in pursuit of their victims
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241012
    m_Localized: Canterlot bat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241013
    m_Localized: The Canterlot subspecies of bloodwings, adapted to a pink cloud
      and much more terrifying
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241014
    m_Localized: Piranha
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241015
    m_Localized: A predatory mutant fish living in sewers. Fast, agile and its bites
      are one hell of a pain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241016
    m_Localized: Wolffish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241017
    m_Localized: A predatory mutant fish living in sewers. It has powerful jaws and
      huge teeth and is not so easy to kill underwater
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241018
    m_Localized: Zombie-fish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241019
    m_Localized: Monster fish, living in the pink waters of Canterlot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241020
    m_Localized: Young bloatsprite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241021
    m_Localized: This small creature is rather annoying than dangerous
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241022
    m_Localized: Acid bloatsprite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241023
    m_Localized: Bloatsprite spitting corrosive acid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241024
    m_Localized: Poisonous bloatsprite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241025
    m_Localized: Bloatsprite shooting poisonous spikes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241026
    m_Localized: Greater bloatsprite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241027
    m_Localized: Very large bloatsprite with a thick shell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241028
    m_Localized: Snappy bloatsprite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241029
    m_Localized: Bloatsprite armed with razor-sharp teeth. This species is much more
      dangerous than others
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241030
    m_Localized: Pink bloatsprite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241031
    m_Localized: This bloatsprite all soaked in a pink cloud and got the ability
      to spit its concentrate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241032
    m_Localized: Nightmare bloatsprite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241033
    m_Localized: A horrible and vile offspring of the pink cloud with sharp teeth.
      It is able to literally bite into its victim
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241034
    m_Localized: Bloatsprite king
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241035
    m_Localized: An unusual and very dangerous specimen of bloatsprite, huge like
      a barrel and incredibly tenacious
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241036
    m_Localized: Bloatsprite nest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241037
    m_Localized: A disgusting, pulsating, mucus-draining thing producing more and
      more new bloatsprites until destroyed. They say this might also be a bloatsprite,
      but monstrously mutated and grown to gigantic proportions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241038
    m_Localized: Radroach
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241039
    m_Localized: A common cockroach, mutated under the influence of radiation and
      increased in size. Not dangerous, but still capable of biting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241040
    m_Localized: Rat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241041
    m_Localized: It looks like an ordinary rat, only carnivorous and aggressive.
      Lives absolutely everywhere, as normal rats do
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241042
    m_Localized: Mole rat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241043
    m_Localized: A mutated hybrid between a rat and a mole, quite large, with sharp
      teeth and nasty temper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241044
    m_Localized: Radscorpion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241045
    m_Localized: Mutant scorpion of impressive size with a strong chitinous shell
      and a deadly sting. It is extremely not recommended approaching it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241046
    m_Localized: Bloody radscorpion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241047
    m_Localized: It looks like a normal radscorpion, but instead of poison, it injects
      an enzyme that prevents blood coagulation so that its victim can easily die
      from blood loss
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241048
    m_Localized: Horrible scorpio
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241049
    m_Localized: A scorpio, turned under the influence of the pink cloud into an
      eerie monster. Bigger and much more dangerous than ordinary radscorpions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241050
    m_Localized: Worker ant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241051
    m_Localized: Giant mutated ant, biting very painfully
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241052
    m_Localized: Soldier ant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241053
    m_Localized: This mutant ant has really giant jaws, so that its bites are a problem
      for anypony
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241054
    m_Localized: Fire ant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241055
    m_Localized: Mutant ant having a fire-making gland and capable of breathing fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241056
    m_Localized: Ant nest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241057
    m_Localized: One of many exits of an underground ant colony. Unless destroyed,
      the ants will come out again and again in an endless stream
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241058
    m_Localized: Awful slime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241059
    m_Localized: It is not known for certain what is the nature and origin of these
      strange creeping formations. It was hypothesized that this mucus is actually
      a colony of microorganisms that mutated under influence of taint. It is dangerous,
      as it contains corrosive acids and other unpleasant chemicals, but fortunately
      does not attack anypony, so it`s enough just avoiding stepping on it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241060
    m_Localized: Cryoslime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241061
    m_Localized: A very unusual creeping mucus, striking everyone stepping on it
      with deadly cold
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241062
    m_Localized: Pink slime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241063
    m_Localized: Creeping mucus, full of necromantic magic of the pink cloud. Under
      no circumstances should you touch it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241064
    m_Localized: Swarm of necrosprites
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241065
    m_Localized: Little can be said about the origin of this strange and frightening
      entity, except that it is a product of necromancy. Necrosprites freely pass
      through walls and physical attacks do them no harm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241066
    m_Localized: The phantom of death
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241067
    m_Localized: Robots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241068
    m_Localized: 'Robots are the product of technological revolution, one that Equestria
      experienced during the years before the Great War. They represent a combination
      of the most advanced earth pony technology and unicorn magic and were created
      for performing variable tasks - from housekeeping to property protection. During
      the War, combat models were also developed to be used in military operations.

      Although
      no pony produces robots nowadays, many of them are still functional despite
      centuries past. Mostly, these are combat and security robots that continue
      to execute built-in programs and are ready to bring all their power down upon
      any intruder entering their domain'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241069
    m_Localized: Turrets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241070
    m_Localized: Turrets are stationary robots designed to protect various objects.
      They have powerful weapons such as machine guns and magical energy weapons
      and they open fire on any violator stepping into their range. Typically, turrets
      are controlled by a common security system and can be disabled or reconfigured
      through the appropriate terminals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241071
    m_Localized: Ceiling turret
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241072
    m_Localized: These turrets are mounted on the ceiling. They are fairly compact,
      but poorly protected from damage, and can be destroyed by breaking the mounts.
      There are concealed versions that come out only in combat mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241073
    m_Localized: Ground turret
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241074
    m_Localized: Ground turrets are mounted on the floor, they are well fortified
      and have a strong armor protecting them from bullets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241075
    m_Localized: Wall turret
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241076
    m_Localized: Wall turrets are attached directly to the wall or mounted on a special
      rail, along which they can move from one end to the other. Their barrel can
      turn 360 degrees
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241077
    m_Localized: Armored turret
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241078
    m_Localized: This turret is mounted on a heavy, sturdy base and is protected
      by armored plates and a powerful force field effectively counteracting both
      mechanical and magical energy impact
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241079
    m_Localized: Battle turrets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241080
    m_Localized: Improved ceiling turrets. Unlike the rather flimsy conventional
      models, these are designed to protect military objects, and therefore have
      a reinforced body and strong armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241081
    m_Localized: Large robots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241082
    m_Localized: Class of pony size or even larger robots. Are designed for performing
      various tasks including military operations. Typically, such robots have advanced
      artificial intelligence, a strong metal casing, and magical energy weapons,
      especially powerful in combat models
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241083
    m_Localized: Robobrain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241084
    m_Localized: One of the first serial models of multifunctional robots, in which
      a central processor is replaced with a real living brain, placed in a glass
      tank. It has two hose-like manipulators designed to perform various actions,
      caterpillar tracks and weak armament, like electric discharger or laser. In
      general, this model has many disadvantages and is hardly suitable for combat.
      Robobrains are rather sluggish, clumsy, dull and do not pose much threat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241085
    m_Localized: Ponytron
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241086
    m_Localized: A common model of a security robot that looks like a pony. It can
      perform such functions as defending its owners, protecting property and military
      objects, maintaining order and enforcing the law and so on. For this purpose,
      they have strong armor and medium-power weapons. Some sluggishness is partly
      compensated by the built-in levitation device, allowing the robot soaring in
      the air for some time and moving to higher grounds. Despite the fact that their
      owners died centuries ago, the ponytrones continue patrolling the entrusted
      objects and do not tolerate any intruders
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241087
    m_Localized: Mister Gutsy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241088
    m_Localized: Military modification of the household robot "Mr. Handy", equipped
      with a whole arsenal of all kinds of weapons. There is a plasma gun for long
      range, a flamethrower for close one and a circular saw for direct contact with
      the enemy. For movement the robot uses levitation magic, allowing it to continuously
      soaring above the ground. During the War, these robots were actively used on
      the battlefields, and now there are not many of them left. Unfortunately, their
      electronic brains have long been bungled, and now they no longer distinguish
      friends from enemies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241089
    m_Localized: Equidroid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241090
    m_Localized: Equidroids, the gem of former Equestrian technology, were created
      shortly before the apocalypse. The first models were quite peaceful, but almost
      immediately there appeared combat modifications equipped with the latest weapons,
      energy barrier and even some spells. They did not participate in battles because
      of their exceptional complexity and high cost, but served rich and influential
      persons as guards and assistants, looking and behaving almost like living ponies.
      Now the surviving equidroids seem to have lost the last remnants of their electronic
      intelligence and pose a considerable danger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241091
    m_Localized: AJ-17
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241092
    m_Localized: Modified security robot, much cooler than usual. Equipped with heavy
      weapons and armor, an improved mechanism of levitation, as well as a special
      electromagnet circuit that protects the robot from pulse weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241093
    m_Localized: Mr. Vigilant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241094
    m_Localized: Modified for the needs of the Steel Rangers "Mr. Gutsy", equipped
      with more sophisticated weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241095
    m_Localized: Sentinel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241096
    m_Localized: The combat robot, created by Robronco during the War, designed to
      protect the most important military, state and private facilities, as well
      to be on the front lines in combat operations. It is a real tank, much larger
      than a pony, moving on four wheels. It is well-armored and equipped with several
      types of heavy warfare, such as rapid-fire machine guns, missile launchers,
      and magical energy guns. Extremely dangerous in battle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241097
    m_Localized: Ultra-sentinel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241098
    m_Localized: The larger and more dangerous version of the Sentinel and, what`s
      more, a flying one. Ultra-sentinel is equipped with heavy armor, a magic shield,
      a plasma minigun, and a compact multiple rocket launcher. A battle with such
      an opponent is a serious trial for anypony
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241099
    m_Localized: Bombardier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241100
    m_Localized: A combat drone greatly increased in size, a real flying tank. Usually
      protects the most important objects belonging to the Steel Rangers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241101
    m_Localized: Small robots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241102
    m_Localized: Compact robots designed to perform certain tasks, do not have advanced
      AI and work solely on the program there were built with
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241103
    m_Localized: Sprite-bot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241104
    m_Localized: A small flying robot, developed by the Ministry of Morale. Sprite
      bots were used as mobile transmitters, constantly broadcasting patriotic radio
      channel, while at the same time engaged in secret surveillance of citizens.
      Today sprite bots can still be found in plenty in the Wastelands. They usually
      do not represent danger, except when they are controlled by security systems
      of old closed strategic objects. In this case, they can try attacking the interloper
      using low-power weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241105
    m_Localized: Vortex
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241106
    m_Localized: Flying scout robot used to observe a situation and collect data
      during combat. It can both act autonomously or be controlled via a radio interface,
      transferring an image from robot`s camera directly to the operator`s visor.
      It can also be used in combat directly - its propeller`s blades are made of
      durable alloy and sharpened, making them quite suitable as a cutting weapon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241107
    m_Localized: Roller
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241108
    m_Localized: Small security robots that resemble a metal globe. When a hostile
      object appears in their detection range, they begin rolling towards it, aiming
      to strike and shock with a powerful electric discharge. They can jump high
      and bounce from the walls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241109
    m_Localized: Enclave Roller
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241110
    m_Localized: An improved roller equipped with its own plasma mini-reactor that
      gives it more power and explosiveness. In combination with high mobility and
      an exceptionally strong body it poses a considerable threat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241111
    m_Localized: Spider-mine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241112
    m_Localized: Robot-bomb, apparently created by zebras. Unlike common mines, these
      do not wait for the enemy to step on them, but try getting closer themselves.
      They must never be allowed to come close - once they approach the target, they
      immediately explode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241113
    m_Localized: Security drone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241114
    m_Localized: A small but quite dangerous flying robot. Has a durable composite
      case, active electric protection and a fairly powerful laser weapon. It is
      used to protect military and civilian facilities of special importance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241115
    m_Localized: Combat drone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241116
    m_Localized: Modified security drone, not so sturdy, but much faster and mobile.
      Armed with a high-voltage discharger and a plasma generator. Designed to accompany
      and support military units
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241117
    m_Localized: Enclave drone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241118
    m_Localized: Lightweight high-speed drone, often used by Enclave stormtroopers
      in combat. Thanks to its high maneuverability and advanced behavioral algorithms
      it can evade melee weapons, slow projectiles and even bullets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241119
    m_Localized: Trap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241120
    m_Localized: Can trail alarm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241121
    m_Localized: Tripwire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241122
    m_Localized: Pressure plate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241123
    m_Localized: Laser sensor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241124
    m_Localized: Grenade bouquet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241125
    m_Localized: Armed gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241126
    m_Localized: Transmitter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241127
    m_Localized: Installed explosives
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241128
    m_Localized: Training dummy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241129
    m_Localized: Captive in a cage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241130
    m_Localized: Empty cage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241131
    m_Localized: Pony
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241132
    m_Localized: Zebra
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241133
    m_Localized: Lunar blade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241134
    m_Localized: Magic turret
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241135
    m_Localized: Stable dweller
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241136
    m_Localized: Thunderhead reactor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241137
    m_Localized: Crowbar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241138
    m_Localized: Covered with peeling red paint, scratches and some sticky yuck.
      Quite handy for breaking into common doors, lockers and cabinets. Useless against
      armored doors and safes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241139
    m_Localized: '"Burglar`s mate"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241140
    m_Localized: A tool for ponies with not so righteous source of income. Much sturdier
      than a crowbar, it can break even metal doors and concrete walls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241141
    m_Localized: Piece of rebar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241142
    m_Localized: Just a piece of rebar, covered with insulating tape for holding
      by teeth. You can hardly even call it "a weapon"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241143
    m_Localized: Spear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241144
    m_Localized: Composed of a sharpened metal part fastened by wire to a firm wooden
      stick
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241145
    m_Localized: '"Viper`s bite"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241146
    m_Localized: Unlike an ordinary spear, this one is made of firm bamboo with a
      tip perfectly sharpened and, for a cherry on top, poisoned
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241147
    m_Localized: Knife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241148
    m_Localized: A large kitchen knife, not particularly suitable for a fight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241149
    m_Localized: Chopper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241150
    m_Localized: With this huge and heavy knife you can chop a cabbagehead in ten
      seconds flat... or any other head too!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241151
    m_Localized: Indented knife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241152
    m_Localized: A knife with bent and indented edge, all rusty and bloodstained.
      You don`t want know who used it and how
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241153
    m_Localized: Sacrificial knife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241154
    m_Localized: Favorite toy of raiders-sadists. The strikes by this knife cause
      heavy bleeding
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241155
    m_Localized: Combat knife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241156
    m_Localized: An outstanding knife of high quality steel, still sharp even after
      all these years. Indispensable in a close range battle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241157
    m_Localized: '"Sting"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241158
    m_Localized: A unique combat knife with a wavy edge made of durable steel. Sharp
      like a razor!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241159
    m_Localized: Bat with nails
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241160
    m_Localized: Just a piece of wood with rusty nails sticking out. In other words,
      a piece of trash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241161
    m_Localized: Machete
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241162
    m_Localized: A huge broad blade from Zebra Empire. Useful for chopping through
      dense vegetation or slicing and dicing enemies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241163
    m_Localized: '"Jungle call"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241164
    m_Localized: A heavy machete, decorated with ornament and encrusted with nephrite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241165
    m_Localized: Lead pipe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241166
    m_Localized: A heavy pipe with a massive nut on one side. Those who meet this
      in a battle quickly learn to keep away
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241167
    m_Localized: Ripper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241168
    m_Localized: Electrical saw, working on batteries. Can cut relatively fragile
      materials, including bones and skulls. Way less effective against metal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241169
    m_Localized: Sawpony
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241170
    m_Localized: A unique modified ripper. Unlike the common one, this has teeth
      of special steel, which makes it easy to cut through not that strong armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241171
    m_Localized: Autoaxe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241172
    m_Localized: Spinning edges of this tool are enchanted so that it can easily
      cut all sorts of metal garbage. Quite as easily it cuts metal armor, with its
      owner inside. Consumes Spark-batteries
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241173
    m_Localized: Chainsaw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241174
    m_Localized: Once it was used to cut down trees, now, as there are no trees left,
      one can use it to cut enemies to pieces. Magically-enhanced teeth can handle
      even the sturdiest material. Consumes Spark-batteries
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241175
    m_Localized: Shovel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241176
    m_Localized: Once it was an instrument for earthwork, but sharpened edge converted
      it into a weapon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241177
    m_Localized: Mace
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241178
    m_Localized: A heavy iron machinery part, welded to a sturdy long rod. A good
      swing - and it can easily add a couple of holes to somepony`s head
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241179
    m_Localized: Sledgehammer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241180
    m_Localized: A good tool for crushing walls as well as enemy skulls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241181
    m_Localized: '"Minotaur fist"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241182
    m_Localized: A sledgehammer turned into a deadly weapon. A prolonged handle is
      made of the sturdiest oak and reinforced with iron, and head is ribbed for
      dealing higher damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241183
    m_Localized: Axe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241184
    m_Localized: This huge axe comes in handy for cutting through enemy crowds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241185
    m_Localized: Zebra sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241186
    m_Localized: This sword was an attribute of every zebra centurion or higher officer
      during wartime. It was more a proof of status than a combat weapon though
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241187
    m_Localized: '"Dawnbreaker"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241188
    m_Localized: Obviously this zebra sword belonged to some big fish. You can tell
      that by gold decorations on the guard and zebra glyphs on the blade which,
      unfortunately, you can`t read
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241189
    m_Localized: Electrical zebra sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241190
    m_Localized: A common zebra sword at the first glance, but one can notice little
      lightnings dancing around on a surface of the blade. Which is unusual to say
      the least
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241191
    m_Localized: '"Caesar`s word"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241192
    m_Localized: A unique electric sword that once belonged to a legate of the Zebra
      legion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241193
    m_Localized: Magical energy dagger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241194
    m_Localized: Compact weapon, combining the advantages of melee and magical energy
      weapons. Inflicts plasma damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241195
    m_Localized: Hellhound`s claw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241196
    m_Localized: A long dagger made from a claw of the hellhound leader you defeated.
      This claw is stronger than steel and sharper than the best combat knife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241197
    m_Localized: Sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241198
    m_Localized: Very effective melee weapon, but it requires quite some experience
      using it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241199
    m_Localized: '"Star fury"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241200
    m_Localized: This unique sword is not made of usual steel but of metal of unknown
      origin. Its edge almost never get blunt and can cut through enemy armor like
      through cardboard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241201
    m_Localized: Magical energy sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241202
    m_Localized: May the Force be with You, young Padawan!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241203
    m_Localized: '"Aurum"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241204
    m_Localized: A more powerful energy sword glowing with golden light
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241205
    m_Localized: Super sledge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241206
    m_Localized: A high-tech weapon, equipped with an inertial accumulator, capable
      of storing kinetic energy. Being released on impact, it greatly increases power
      of the strike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241207
    m_Localized: '"War Hammer"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241208
    m_Localized: A specially weighted super sledge, clearly made for somepony big
      and strong. Scary even to think, what damage one strike of this can cause
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241209
    m_Localized: Thermic lance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241210
    m_Localized: A tungsten tip, feeding from an "infinite" power source, can get
      several thousand degrees hot and burn through flesh and armor like a small
      but angry Celestia`s sun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241211
    m_Localized: Magical energy spear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241212
    m_Localized: This thing only looks like a spear. In reality it is a complex fusion
      of magic and technology - magical energy melee weapon, causing a tremendous
      plasma damage and not requiring changing batteries for exploitation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241213
    m_Localized: '"Logos"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241214
    m_Localized: A unique magical spear, blade emitting cold moonlight and vibrating
      slightly from force hidden inside. Hard to tell what magic was used to create
      it, but one should respect it, or even better - fear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241215
    m_Localized: Grim reaper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241216
    m_Localized: A magical weapon from the zebras` land, possessing an ominous and
      unstoppable power. It is capable of cutting those invisible threads that bind
      souls to bodies of living beings, ignoring any armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241217
    m_Localized: Hoofmade sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241218
    m_Localized: Actually it is not a sword at all but a sharpened metal part of
      some mechanism, strapped to a stick
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241219
    m_Localized: Test
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241220
    m_Localized: .32 pistol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241221
    m_Localized: Old-fashioned and not very effective firearm, dealing little damage
      and having low rate of fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241222
    m_Localized: 9-mm pistol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241223
    m_Localized: The most common pistol produced before the War for civilian needs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241224
    m_Localized: 10-mm pistol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241225
    m_Localized: A standard, commonly used pistol using 10mm ammo. Its advantages
      are simplicity of design, reliability and low cost
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241226
    m_Localized: '"Lonely wanderer"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241227
    m_Localized: A unique 10-mm pistol, clearly made by some talented craftspony.
      It has a set of essential modifications and its stats are much higher than
      those of a standard model
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241228
    m_Localized: Silenced pistol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241229
    m_Localized: A slightly modified 10-mm gun, equipped with a sound suppressor.
      Makes less noise when shooting, but also does less damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241230
    m_Localized: Laser Pistol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241231
    m_Localized: The simplest example of magical energy weapon shooting red laser
      beams. Low power is compensated by low energy consumption comparing to rifles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241232
    m_Localized: '"Anarchist"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241233
    m_Localized: A unique laser pistol, likely created after the War. It has a more
      powerful and capacious battery, and there is an inscription in a red paint
      saying "OBEY"!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241234
    m_Localized: Flare gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241235
    m_Localized: Even though you cannot call this a weapon in a normal sense, it
      can ignite enemy, causing him quite a bit of discomfort
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241236
    m_Localized: Plasma Pistol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241237
    m_Localized: The plasma pistol is much more powerful than laser one, but less
      accurate and faster consumes battery charge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241238
    m_Localized: '"Honor guard"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241239
    m_Localized: A unique plasma pistol, perfected by a master-armorer. At least
      he could somehow fix the characteristic flaws of this weapon type, such as
      low accuracy and fast battery drain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241240
    m_Localized: Pulse pistol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241241
    m_Localized: The pulse pistol is called so because shooting it emits powerful
      directed electromagnetic pulses. They are capable of damaging electronic circuits
      of robots, but cause almost no harm to living beings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241242
    m_Localized: Shock gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241243
    m_Localized: Quite a primitive weapon, sending electrical discharges on target.
      It was not designed for a battle but rather for paralyzing troublemakers and
      criminals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241244
    m_Localized: Rechargeable pistol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241245
    m_Localized: An example of magical energy weaponry requiring no ammo. It takes
      energy for shooting from an "infinite" self-charging spark-battery. However,
      it comes with a price of lower damaging power and poor combat qualities
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241246
    m_Localized: Revolver cal.375
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241247
    m_Localized: Old, but powerful and reliable revolver, although recharging it
      may cause some difficulty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241248
    m_Localized: Magnum
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241249
    m_Localized: Large-caliber revolver equipped with an optical sight. It possesses
      huge destructive power and good accuracy, but uses a rare type of .44 caliber
      ammo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241250
    m_Localized: '"Little Macintosh"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241251
    m_Localized: A unique all-purpose .44 caliber revolver made by Ironshod Firearms
      exclusively for Applejack. Its white ivory handle has a picture of three red
      apples on it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241252
    m_Localized: 0.308-pistol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241253
    m_Localized: A pistol converted by unknown craftspony from a 0.308 caliber rifle.
      It resulted in a compact, fast and deadly weapon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241254
    m_Localized: 12.7mm pistol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241255
    m_Localized: Large-caliber gun going with impressive destructive power, monstrous
      recoil and deafening "Boom!". Using cartridges with special blunt-ended bullets
      that strike like a hoof kick of doom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241256
    m_Localized: '"Hoof strike"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241257
    m_Localized: This pistol is named so for a reason. Its shots are like sledge
      strikes. Hard to tell how it works, looks like some special earth pony magic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241258
    m_Localized: Terrifying gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241259
    m_Localized: Converted from a 12.7-mm pistol, this model is designed for a powerful
      cartridge of 50 MG caliber. Its lethal force is really terrifying, being only
      slightly inferior to a large-caliber rifle. At the same time, it has a much
      smaller size and a decent rate of fire, but it pays with a rather low accuracy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241260
    m_Localized: '"Black heart"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241261
    m_Localized: Modification of the "Terrifying" gun. Its elongated barrel allows
      increased accuracy and strength of the shot, and corpus, covered with black
      varnish, looks so very impressive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241262
    m_Localized: Star blaster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241263
    m_Localized: A weapon, unique and unusual in all respects. They say it was created
      not by a pony but fell from the stars. The destructive power of its shots is
      very high, and there is no defense against it, but there is a problem with
      ammunition - the star blaster uses only special energy cells that are extremely
      difficult to find
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241264
    m_Localized: '"Loyalty"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241265
    m_Localized: A unique gun belonging to Brass Buckshot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241266
    m_Localized: 9-mm submachine gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241267
    m_Localized: Submachine gun, using common 9-mm ammo. Small, cheap, effective
      and does not require special skills
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241268
    m_Localized: 10-mm submachine gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241269
    m_Localized: A compact and effective weapon, and unlike a bulky assault rifle
      is ideal for indoor use
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241270
    m_Localized: 12,7-mm submachine gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241271
    m_Localized: Heavy large-caliber submachine gun. Deals some nice damage and knocks-back
      enemies, but uses scarce type of ammo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241272
    m_Localized: '"Squall"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241273
    m_Localized: This specimen differs significantly from the standard 12.7 mm SMG
      model. Thanks to some design features, it had reduced the spread of a shot
      and increased aiming range
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241274
    m_Localized: Assault rifle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241275
    m_Localized: All-purpose firearm that combines ease of use, good firepower and
      abundant ammo type
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241276
    m_Localized: '"Patriot"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241277
    m_Localized: An upgraded model of an assault rifle. They say only several hundreds
      were produced by the end of the Great War, thus now they are super rare
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241278
    m_Localized: Assault carbine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241279
    m_Localized: Next generation of weaponry compared to assault rifles. This one
      is more compact, precise and effective
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241280
    m_Localized: '"The Last Argument"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241281
    m_Localized: Modified assault rifle with upgraded optics and increased magazine.
      A dream of every gun nut
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241282
    m_Localized: Zebra Assault Carbine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241283
    m_Localized: Equipped with a silencer and optical sight. Bullets fired from it
      are enchanted to ignite on impact with a target. Always fires three bullets
      per a pull of trigger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241284
    m_Localized: '"Atropos"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241285
    m_Localized: An improved zebra rifle owned by Centurion Upanga. It is enchanted
      with a much stronger fire spell than usual. It is clearly a work of an experienced
      shaman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241286
    m_Localized: Sparkle-gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241287
    m_Localized: High fire rate laser rifle, emitting magical rays of violet color.
      Fires three rounds per a pull of trigger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241288
    m_Localized: '"Requiem"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241289
    m_Localized: A unique sparkle-automatic, creator of which was able to increase
      fire rate by adding magical cooling system. It also has a built-in audio player,
      but it doesn`t work
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241290
    m_Localized: Plasma caster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241291
    m_Localized: Weapon of devastating power, sending a rain of scorching plasma
      on your enemies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241292
    m_Localized: '"Agony"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241293
    m_Localized: A unique plasma caster with a special spellmatrix. Its plasma blasts
      have a chance to hit through armor, which makes this weapon much more insidious
      and dangerous
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241294
    m_Localized: Novasurge rifle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241295
    m_Localized: A standard weapon of Great Pegasus Enclave forces. It represents
      the latest developments of magical energy technologies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241296
    m_Localized: '"Tsunami"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241297
    m_Localized: Improved version of the Novasurge rifle, more powerful and more
      reliable than usual. It is only given to commanders of the Enclave special
      forces
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241298
    m_Localized: Light machine gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241299
    m_Localized: Very effective, powerful and high fire rate weapon, but it requires
      a lot of experience using it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241300
    m_Localized: '"Rumble"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241301
    m_Localized: Improved version of a light machine gun, a bit more powerful and
      more accurate than a common one. It belonged to Elder Coldsight before
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241302
    m_Localized: Automatic rifle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241303
    m_Localized: This weapon is a hybrid of a rifle and a light machine gun. It is
      very precise, and at the same time sufficiently rapid to sustain a reasonable
      fire rate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241304
    m_Localized: Antidragon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241305
    m_Localized: The antiair machine gun, converted into a personal weapon, once
      indeed developed especially for fighting dragons. It is so heavy that only
      the strongest earth pony would be able to use it, or perhaps a unicorn with
      perfect telekinetic skills
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241306
    m_Localized: '"Little Gilda"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241307
    m_Localized: A unique 14.5 mm machine gun, converted into a personal weapon by
      griffins. Once belonged to one of the "Talons" detachments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241308
    m_Localized: Medium machine gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241309
    m_Localized: A large-caliber machine gun, intended primarily for reinforcing
      guard posts rather than for personal use. Too big and heavy, but its firepower
      is more than impressive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241310
    m_Localized: Rapid-fire plasma gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241311
    m_Localized: A model of a plasma gun, modified just before the Apocalypse, which
      combat characteristics were much improved. As far as we know, only a few dozen
      units were produced, after which the manufacturing plant was destroyed by a
      megaspell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241312
    m_Localized: '"Pulsar"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241313
    m_Localized: A unique high fire rate plasma caster, which design was improved
      by an unknown master. It seems, it hid in the storerooms of the "Steel Rangers"
      for years, waiting for something. And now its time has come
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241314
    m_Localized: Old shotgun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241315
    m_Localized: This ancient shotgun is all rusty and falling apart. It can still
      shoot alright, but success is unlikely. Can hold two shells maximum
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241316
    m_Localized: '"Apple bucker"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241317
    m_Localized: A vintage shotgun in a good condition. You can tell, somepony really
      cared for this weapon and yet almost never used it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241318
    m_Localized: Lever-action shotgun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241319
    m_Localized: A lever-action rifle, sawed-off and converted to a shotgun. Effective
      for a close range combat only
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241320
    m_Localized: Sawed-off shotgun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241321
    m_Localized: Double-barreled sawed-off shotgun. Quite powerful, but because of
      a widespread of shot, it is effective only at close range. Allows only two
      shots to be fired, then you have to reload. Which, of course is not very convenient
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241322
    m_Localized: '"Supreme measure"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241323
    m_Localized: A unique sawed-off shotgun that probably belonged to some sheriff.
      There is a name on a butt of the rifle. Silverstar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241324
    m_Localized: IF-9 Combat Shotgun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241325
    m_Localized: Semi-automatic shotgun with a drum magazine, one of many weapon
      models developed in Ironshod Firearms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241326
    m_Localized: '"Erebus"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241327
    m_Localized: A modified shotgun with loner barrel and improved cartridge feeding
      system, making it faster and more accurate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241328
    m_Localized: Police shotgun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241329
    m_Localized: A shotgun used by pre-War police forces, becoming very popular nowadays
      due to its combat effectiveness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241330
    m_Localized: '"Justice"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241331
    m_Localized: A unique police shotgun of outstanding quality, clearly made by
      special order. There is an engraving saying "To police chief Counterstrike,
      in gratitude for saving hostages"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241332
    m_Localized: Prism gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241333
    m_Localized: Similar to a laser rifle, but using different focusing system. Instead
      of a single impulse it emits a bunch of rays of different wavelength, that
      makes it more effective at close range
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241334
    m_Localized: '"Rainbow strike"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241335
    m_Localized: A modified prism gun, has a higher power than a standard model.
      Its rainbow colored rays can burn a target through and knock it back at the
      same time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241336
    m_Localized: Cryolator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241337
    m_Localized: A unique weapon, the only one in existence. It does not melt or
      incinerate, but freezes the target. The living creatures are particularly vulnerable
      to this effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241338
    m_Localized: Multiplasma shotgun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241339
    m_Localized: Magical energy shotgun casting three plasma bolts per one shot.
      Weapon of choice at close range, not effective at long distance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241340
    m_Localized: '"Cerberus"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241341
    m_Localized: A unique plasma shotgun, augmented by some dark magic. First, it
      emits plasma of pinkish color, second - it now causes much more damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241342
    m_Localized: Old rifle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241343
    m_Localized: A weathered, slightly rusty rifle that, surprisingly, still works.
      Even though it became obsolete long before the War, it can still make a few
      holes in somepony
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241344
    m_Localized: '"Granddaddy`s rifle"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241345
    m_Localized: This weapon is as old as the Equestrian firearms can be. But it
      was made to last, and it still surpasses many similar rifles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241346
    m_Localized: Hunting rifle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241347
    m_Localized: Do not even ask why ponies might need hunting rifles. Just a good
      and accurate weapon, besides consuming a common ammo type
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241348
    m_Localized: Cowpony repeater
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241349
    m_Localized: A lever-action rifle, slightly primitive perhaps, but accurate and
      reliable. It was quite popular before the War among civilians of Equestria,
      regarded as an outstanding self-defense weapon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241350
    m_Localized: '"Price of freedom"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241351
    m_Localized: '"And what are You ready to sacrifice for freedom?" - asks the cowpony
      from an old propaganda poster, holding a rifle exactly like this in her hooves'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241352
    m_Localized: Sniper rifle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241353
    m_Localized: Effective long-range weapon. Uses rare .308 caliber ammo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241354
    m_Localized: '"Remorse"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241355
    m_Localized: A unique sniper rifle. It is completely black, and its butt has
      hundreds of tiny notches. Its previous owner counted its every prey
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241356
    m_Localized: Brush gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241357
    m_Localized: One of the most powerful examples of non-military weapons. A shot
      from this rifle can even kill a bear, and from a reasonable distance too
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241358
    m_Localized: '"Elephant hunter"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241359
    m_Localized: Can you really kill an elephant with this? Well, we will never know
      for sure due to an absence of elephants in the Equestrian Wasteland. But judging
      by its looks - you most probably can
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241360
    m_Localized: Anti-machine rifle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241361
    m_Localized: Large-caliber armor-piercing rifle effective against robots and
      power armor. With some luck you can even take out a tank. The bad news is that
      it is not so easy to find proper ammunition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241362
    m_Localized: '"Spitfire`s Thunder"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241363
    m_Localized: A unique anti-machine rifle, enchanted to shoot without any recoil,
      even though its power is simply monstrous. Decorated with gold and precious
      stones, and every shot sounds like a thunder roll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241364
    m_Localized: Rechargeable rifle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241365
    m_Localized: This weapon represents an attempt to create a weapon that doesn`t
      require any ammo. Not very successful, as you can see. An "infinite" battery
      does not produce enough power, and the weapon itself requires frequent maintenance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241366
    m_Localized: Laser rifle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241367
    m_Localized: A more powerful and accurate weapon than a laser pistol, but also
      faster consuming battery power. Unlike bullets, a laser beam instantly reaches
      destination, hence no need to make any corrections for target distance and
      some other factors. Doesn`t work underwater
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241368
    m_Localized: '"Scarlet sunrise"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241369
    m_Localized: Limited edition laser rifle that uses magical ruby of a very rare
      kind as a focusing crystal. During the War, it was used by elite pegasi-assaulters,
      but now it is almost impossible to get
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241370
    m_Localized: Plasma rifle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241371
    m_Localized: High-power magical energy weapon casting bolts of green magical
      plasma. When shot from this gun, enemies do not just die but actually melt
      into a puddle of green slime. Can easily melt through concrete walls, but because
      of difficulties with plasma stabilization it is not highly accurate and requires
      good skills for successful exploitation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241372
    m_Localized: '"Turboplasma rifle"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241373
    m_Localized: An example of how much one can improve combat stats of a standard
      weapon with proper talent and ingenuity. This modified plasma rifle not only
      has higher fire rate, but also uses less energy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241374
    m_Localized: Pulse rifle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241375
    m_Localized: A significantly enhanced version of the pulse pistol. To create
      the most powerful electromagnetic pulse, it is stuffed with a whole bunch of
      coils, capacitors, and lamps. Unfortunately, all this stuff is very unreliable
      and wears down quickly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241376
    m_Localized: '"Mystery shard"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241377
    m_Localized: The impulse rifle of a very strange look. The blue crystals inserted
      in it emit a magical aura, which must have something to do with its increased
      fire rate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241378
    m_Localized: Laser sniper rifle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241379
    m_Localized: This weapon is more powerful and accurate in comparison to a common
      laser rifle, but consumes battery charge faster. Also it emits rays of green
      color instead of red
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241380
    m_Localized: '"Atma"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241381
    m_Localized: A long-range laser rifle made by special order, probably even unique.
      Higher quality capacitors and the finest tuning of focusing crystals makes
      this weapon able to generate laser impulses of unbelievable power!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241382
    m_Localized: Thermoemitter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241383
    m_Localized: A weapon emitting an intense flow of infrared radiation, instantly
      igniting the target. It was developed as an alternative to flamethrowers, but,
      unlike them, does not have such a demoralizing effect, and therefore has not
      become too popular
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241384
    m_Localized: '"Ashes of Equestria"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241385
    m_Localized: The unique thermoemitter, which fighting qualities are an order
      of magnitude higher compared to a usual one. Capable of turning anything into
      ashes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241386
    m_Localized: Storm rifle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241387
    m_Localized: Long range magical energy rifle. Hits enemy with a powerful bolt
      of electricity, targeted by a laser ray. For better effect target must be touching
      the ground
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241388
    m_Localized: '"Thunderer"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241389
    m_Localized: A unique storm rifle, which coolness is OVER NINE THOUSAND! It is
      not only more powerful than ordinary storm rifles, but is also enchanted to
      pierce magical armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241390
    m_Localized: Railgun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241391
    m_Localized: This gun uses electro-magnetic field for bullet acceleration. This
      way bullets reach much higher speed than when shot using gunpowder. Although
      shooting bullets, it belongs to magical energy weapons and consumes spark-batteries
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241392
    m_Localized: '"Paladin"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241393
    m_Localized: An improved railgun, developed not so long ago by what is left from
      Equestrian science. Even more deadly than before, and also equipped with improved
      power system
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241394
    m_Localized: Grenade launcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241395
    m_Localized: Single charge 40-mm grenade launcher, effective both against crowds
      of enemies as well as for punching through walls. Projectiles move in a parabolic
      trajectory, that must be considered when aiming
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241396
    m_Localized: Grenade launcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241397
    m_Localized: Automatic 40-mm grenade launcher, much more effective than an ordinary
      single charge one, as it allows keeping up intense fire. Steel Rangers are
      quite fond of this weapon for its deadly power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241398
    m_Localized: '"Apocalypse"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241399
    m_Localized: Unique automatic grenade launcher, capable of turning a battlefield
      into a burning hell. It has a bigger magazine and faster fire-rate, compared
      to a standard model
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241400
    m_Localized: Automatic grenade launcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241401
    m_Localized: A 40-mm grenade launcher with a large magazine for 12 shells and
      an excellent fire rate. Provides the highest density of fire among all weapons
      of this type
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241402
    m_Localized: Missile launcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241403
    m_Localized: A portable launcher designed for destruction of heavy machinery,
      buildings and enemy horsepower using large-caliber rockets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241404
    m_Localized: '"Vendetta"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241405
    m_Localized: A missile launcher with enhanced combat characteristics and laser
      guidance, which provides greater accuracy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241406
    m_Localized: Minigun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241407
    m_Localized: Weapon equipped with rotating several barreled cluster of impressive
      firepower. It uses small-caliber ammo, which is not very effective against
      armored targets. In addition, it takes some time to start spinning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241408
    m_Localized: '"Gale"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241409
    m_Localized: A unique minigun - machine of doom, a horrible meat grinder. Just
      a word that Gale appeared on a battlefield may cause enemy troops run in panic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241410
    m_Localized: Laser minigun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241411
    m_Localized: Multiple barreled laser gun, which gives you great power and rate
      of fire but is too large and heavy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241412
    m_Localized: '"Righteous anger"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241413
    m_Localized: Unique laser minigun that belonged to some high-ranking Steel Ranger.
      More precise and compact than standard model
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241414
    m_Localized: Plasma minigun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241415
    m_Localized: A weapon of unbelievable power, capable of turning a whole squad
      into a puddle of green goo in a matter of seconds. Its huge size, weight and
      charge consumption on the other hoof make it a poor personal weapon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241416
    m_Localized: '"Dragon`s roar"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241417
    m_Localized: Somepony could indeed find significance in dragon`s breath and flow
      of plasma spit by this weapon. But it would be right to say, that facing this
      weapon, a dragon would definitely wind himself in trouble
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241418
    m_Localized: Flamethrower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241419
    m_Localized: Incinerates enemies in a jet of fire. Has a chance of setting target
      on fire, causing even more damage with time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241420
    m_Localized: '"Scorcher"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241421
    m_Localized: An improved flamethrower, having some construction changes. Because
      of those, fire range and fuel burning temperature are increased
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241422
    m_Localized: Incinerator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241423
    m_Localized: An explosive flame-thrower, launching small portions of combustible
      mixture. Balls of fire explode on impact, splashing burning fuel all over,
      so remember to keep distance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241424
    m_Localized: Tactical flamethrower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241425
    m_Localized: A fearsome weapon, promising inevitable and very painful death,
      causing panic and chaos in enemy squads. It spits burning fuel on long distance,
      starting fires that are quite hard to extinguish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241426
    m_Localized: '"Cleansing flame"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241427
    m_Localized: A tactical flamethrower of respectable looks, all black from soot.
      Once it belonged to a notorious chief of Scorchers raider gang, who died in
      a fire in his own lair
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241428
    m_Localized: Balefire Egg Launcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241429
    m_Localized: There is nothing special about the weapon itself, it is a simple
      launcher. Its ammunition on the other hoof, balefire eggs, conceal fantastic
      destructive power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241430
    m_Localized: '"Fat pony"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241431
    m_Localized: Improved balefire Egg Launcher, more accurate, reliable and can
      maintain higher fire rate. As if this terrible weapon even needed improvement!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241432
    m_Localized: '"Igniter"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241433
    m_Localized: Attach a lighter to an aerosol can, and you get an improvised flamethrower!
      Not that it is of much use though. For burning radroaches maybe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241434
    m_Localized: Dart gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241435
    m_Localized: Hoofmade contraption shooting poisoned darts. Darts themselves do
      little damage and can hardly get through even light armor, but on the bright
      site - it is completely noiseless
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241436
    m_Localized: Acid gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241437
    m_Localized: This "weapon" shoots streams of corrosive acid, corrupting armor
      and causing chemical burns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241438
    m_Localized: Saw blade launcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241439
    m_Localized: A cunning contraption, shooting circular saws. Rapidly propelling
      and spinning saw blades are capable of causing serious damage to several enemies
      standing in a row
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241440
    m_Localized: Buckshot gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241441
    m_Localized: Hard to tell how exactly it works, but it works alright
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241442
    m_Localized: Railway rifle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241443
    m_Localized: This hoofmade rifle uses electromagical field to shoot railway spikes
      with a high speed. To make this you must be a very experienced engineer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241444
    m_Localized: Friendship cannon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241445
    m_Localized: This weapon is called so because, after seeing it in your hooves,
      anypony will be immediately struck with the idea that it is way better to be
      your friend rather than your enemy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241446
    m_Localized: '"Big Fucking Gun"|"Big Frickin Gun"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241447
    m_Localized: A weapon invented by a genius, yet obviously mad scientist. It is
      as dangerous for the owner, as for his enemies, as it shoots huge, unstable
      and explosive balls of plasma
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241448
    m_Localized: Dynamite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241449
    m_Localized: A simple stick of dynamite with a long fuse, more suitable for mining
      than fighting. Use with care!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241450
    m_Localized: Hoofmade grenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241451
    m_Localized: A primitive grenade, made of a tin can filled with gunpowder and
      metal junk. It can be easily created at a workbench
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241452
    m_Localized: Frag grenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241453
    m_Localized: An effective weapon against enemies hiding behind a cover. It looks
      like a metallic apple
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241454
    m_Localized: Gaseous grenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241455
    m_Localized: This grenade emits a cloud of toxic gases. Even small amount of
      it can cause a quick death when inhaled. Especially effective in small and
      poorly ventilated rooms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241456
    m_Localized: Acid bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241457
    m_Localized: A bottle filled with a very corrosive liquid. When smashed, it spills
      acid everywhere, causing severe chemical burns to whoever steps into it. Effective
      against robots` armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241458
    m_Localized: Plasma grenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241459
    m_Localized: Instead of common explosive substances, this grenade uses powerful
      magic charge that can melt everything! Much more powerful than usual grenades
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241460
    m_Localized: Impulse grenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241461
    m_Localized: A grenade using electromagnetic impulse for destroying robots and
      other electronics. Is not effective against live targets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241462
    m_Localized: Cryogrenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241463
    m_Localized: On explosion, the surrounding air instantly cools down to extremely
      low temperatures. The living beings receive serious hypothermic damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241464
    m_Localized: Incendiary cocktail
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241465
    m_Localized: A bottle filled with incendiary liquid and plugged with a piece
      of cloth. Ignite it, throw it - simple, cheap, effective
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241466
    m_Localized: Incendiary grenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241467
    m_Localized: Exploding, this grenade sets everything on fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241468
    m_Localized: Sparkle-grenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241469
    m_Localized: An extremely powerful version of a hoofmade grenade with increased
      radius of damage. For an explosive it uses an infernal mixture based on Sparkle-Cola
      RAD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241470
    m_Localized: Hoofmade mine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241471
    m_Localized: A mine assembled from junk and gunpowder. It operates like an ordinary
      anti-personnel mine, but not as powerful
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241472
    m_Localized: Fragmentation mine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241473
    m_Localized: A proximity mine, equipped with a friend/enemy recognition system
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241474
    m_Localized: Plasma mine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241475
    m_Localized: Powerful magically-enhanced version of a usual mine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241476
    m_Localized: Impulse mine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241477
    m_Localized: Anti-robot mine, which sensor is calibrated to react only on mechanical
      enemies. It doesn`t affect live forces
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241478
    m_Localized: Cryomine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241479
    m_Localized: On explosion of this mine, the surrounding air instantly cools down
      to extremely low temperatures. The living beings receive serious hypothermic
      damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241480
    m_Localized: Balefire mine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241481
    m_Localized: A balefire egg, turned into a mine. It is required to be a real
      explosives master to assemble and use such dangerous devices
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241482
    m_Localized: Zebra`s mine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241483
    m_Localized: This mine is more powerful than usual fragmentation and plasma mines,
      and because of its camouflage pattern it is more difficult to notice. In addition,
      zebras often cast a curse on such mines, making them even more dangerous
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241484
    m_Localized: Explosive X-37
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241485
    m_Localized: Small, yet powerful charges of plastic explosives equipped with
      a radio detonator. You can install several charges and then explode all at
      the same time by pressing the button. To detonate, press the reload button
      [R]. Only explosives in the same room will detonate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241486
    m_Localized: Dynamite pack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241487
    m_Localized: A couple of dynamite sticks, held together with duct tape. It is
      more effective for destroying walls, than ordinary dynamite, but doesn`t cause
      much damage to fortified concrete
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241488
    m_Localized: Hoofmade bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241489
    m_Localized: Explosives made for destroying fragile walls. More sturdy walls
      may require a couple of these
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241490
    m_Localized: The explosive C-4
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241491
    m_Localized: It is a very powerful explosive device that can destroy even the
      sturdiest concrete wall. Useless against steel walls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241492
    m_Localized: Telekinetic bullet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241493
    m_Localized: This spell allows to hit a remote target with a focused telekinetic
      field, dealing strike damage and knocking it back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241494
    m_Localized: Magic bullet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241495
    m_Localized: One of the basic combat spells, shooting a simple blast of magical
      energy at the enemy. By the principle of action this spell resembles plasma
      weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241496
    m_Localized: Ice shards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241497
    m_Localized: This spell launches a blast of sharp icicles, piercing and freezing
      your enemies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241498
    m_Localized: Ghost blades
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241499
    m_Localized: A spell that creates several sharp ghost blades at once, that spread
      out like a fan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241500
    m_Localized: Dragon breath
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241501
    m_Localized: This spell transforms unicorn magic power into a stream of fire,
      resembling dragon flames, even though, of course, not so devastating
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241502
    m_Localized: Lightning bolt
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241503
    m_Localized: This spell hits enemy with almost a natural lightning! It causes
      more damage if target touches the ground, but it is not so effective against
      flying targets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241504
    m_Localized: Fireball
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241505
    m_Localized: Classics of combat magic. A fiery blast exploding when hitting the
      target, like a bazooka shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241506
    m_Localized: Magic beam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241507
    m_Localized: This spell transforms unicorn magic into radiant energy of devastating
      power. It is also quite accurate at long range
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241508
    m_Localized: Deformation wave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241509
    m_Localized: A very complex spell. Allows launching a special shockwave, similar
      to one from an explosion, but of directed action. On impact enemies receive
      heavy internal damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241510
    m_Localized: Black sun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241511
    m_Localized: One of the most powerful spells in mage`s arsenal. Causes much damage
      and is very effective against crowding enemies, but is very demanding of magical
      power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241512
    m_Localized: Death ray
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241513
    m_Localized: A spell that creates the strongest flow of negative energy that
      kills all life on its way, no matter how far is the distance. Does not work
      on non-living opponents
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241514
    m_Localized: Telekinetic shock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241515
    m_Localized: The amplified version of the telekinetic bullet, producing 5 telekinetic
      projectiles simultaneously, causing target impact damage and throwing it back
      with a huge force
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241516
    m_Localized: Heavenly Lights
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241517
    m_Localized: A very powerful spell that allows you to emit streams of stellar
      energy from which there is no escape
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241518
    m_Localized: Paint spray
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241519
    m_Localized: Ghost blades
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241520
    m_Localized: Death ray
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241521
    m_Localized: Small laser
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241522
    m_Localized: Arc thrower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241523
    m_Localized: Laser cannon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241524
    m_Localized: Spark cannon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241525
    m_Localized: Plasma cannon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241526
    m_Localized: Enhanced plasma
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241527
    m_Localized: Flamethrower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241528
    m_Localized: Enhanced flamethrower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241529
    m_Localized: Enhanced laser
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241530
    m_Localized: Rapid-fire Laser
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241531
    m_Localized: Plasma caster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241532
    m_Localized: Minigun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241533
    m_Localized: Laser minigun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241534
    m_Localized: Rocket launcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241535
    m_Localized: Rocket launcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241536
    m_Localized: Plasma minigun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241537
    m_Localized: Multiple launch rocket system
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241538
    m_Localized: Gas rocket
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241539
    m_Localized: Plasma grenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241540
    m_Localized: Plasma grenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241541
    m_Localized: Plasma grenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241542
    m_Localized: Laser cannon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241543
    m_Localized: Plasma cannon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241544
    m_Localized: Spark cannon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241545
    m_Localized: Machine gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241546
    m_Localized: Laser cannon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241547
    m_Localized: Plasma cannon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241548
    m_Localized: Thermal emitter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241549
    m_Localized: Enhanced laser
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241550
    m_Localized: Heavy machine gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241551
    m_Localized: Storm Cannon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241552
    m_Localized: Lunar halberd
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241553
    m_Localized: A weapon from the Alicorn`s Armor set. A magically created ghostly
      halberd, unusually light, sharp and never breaks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241554
    m_Localized: Solar wind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241555
    m_Localized: A weapon from Alicorn`s Armor set. Similar to small arms by principle
      of action, though doesn`t require ammunition since bullets are created by magic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241556
    m_Localized: Nebula
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241557
    m_Localized: A weapon from Alicorn`s Armor set. Similar to plasma weapons, but
      uses a battery that takes power directly from the armor energy source
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241558
    m_Localized: Singularity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241559
    m_Localized: A weapon from Alicorn`s Armor set. Rapidly shoots dozens of magic
      shells that explode upon contact with a target
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241560
    m_Localized: Aurora polaris
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241561
    m_Localized: A battle spell embedded in Alicorn`s armor. Creates bursts of destructive
      cosmic energy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241562
    m_Localized: Stable jumpsuit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241563
    m_Localized: Common clothing worn by all stable dwellers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241566
    m_Localized: Strengthened jumpsuit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241567
    m_Localized: Stable jumpsuit strengthened with armor plates. It gives little
      protection, but it`s better than nothing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241568
    m_Localized: Anti-Radiation suit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241569
    m_Localized: Suit for use in areas with high background radiation. It has built-in
      air filters. It also allows breathing underwater
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241570
    m_Localized: chemical protection suit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241571
    m_Localized: Rubber suit, designed for use in the aggressive environment. Usually
      gives you full protection against any toxic and corrosive substances, but this
      one seems to have some dried-up seals in several places, so now the protection
      is not perfect. Also allows breathing underwater
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241572
    m_Localized: Leather armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241573
    m_Localized: Armor sewn with thick hides of Wasteland monsters. It gives good
      protection against most types of damage, especially against flames, but does
      not stop bullets very well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241574
    m_Localized: Metal armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241575
    m_Localized: Hoofmade armor, consisting of roughly fastened metal plates. Although
      it protects well against bullets, it is very heavy and constrains movements
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241576
    m_Localized: Combat armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241577
    m_Localized: Armor of excellent quality based on plates of complex polymers and
      ceramics. Designed to provide the good ballistic protection, while having relatively
      low weight and not constraining movements of the user
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241578
    m_Localized: Stormtrooper armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241579
    m_Localized: Improved combat armor designed especially for elite stormtroopers.
      Provides the best protection among all armor types, except power armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241580
    m_Localized: Magic armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241581
    m_Localized: Special armor, charmed to counteract effects of magical energy.
      Provides little protection against bullets and normal physical attacks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241582
    m_Localized: Moon armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241583
    m_Localized: An armor designed especially for battle mages. Built-in talismans
      not only protect from magical energy impact, but also increase your own spell
      power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241584
    m_Localized: Chitinous armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241585
    m_Localized: A light and sturdy armor made of thick chitinous radscorpion shells.
      Can be greatly improved by experienced hooves. Gives a good protection against
      physical attacks, protects against monster fangs, but poorly protects against
      bullets and magic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241586
    m_Localized: Scout armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241587
    m_Localized: A light armor designed for scouts and saboteurs. Its camouflage
      color allows you to merge with terrain and act stealthily. It also confuses
      enemies during battle, preventing them from taking steady aim
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241588
    m_Localized: Stealth Armor Prototype
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241589
    m_Localized: Unique armor with integrated active camouflage system. This system
      is similar in principle to the StealthBuck, but can be used an unlimited number
      of times, just taking some time to recharge. Press @1 or @2 to activate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241590
    m_Localized: Sapper`s Armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241591
    m_Localized: Heavy but sturdy armor, equipped with a special amortizing lining,
      a refractory outer layer and a closed helmet. Excellent protection against
      hits, fire and explosions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241592
    m_Localized: Treasure hunter`s clothes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241593
    m_Localized: While you are wearing these clothes, each enemy you kill may drop
      a precious stone (the stronger the opponent, the more likely)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241594
    m_Localized: Socks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241595
    m_Localized: As long as you wear this "costume" raiders, slavers, and mercenaries
      will not attack you unless you provoke them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241596
    m_Localized: Power armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241597
    m_Localized: This power armor was created based on the armor of the Steel Rangers,
      though with multiple modifications and simplifications - the helmet was converted
      for use by a unicorn, some armored plates removed, most of the internal mechanisms
      are missing. It has impressive protective qualities, but heavy weight greatly
      limits mobility
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241598
    m_Localized: Police armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241599
    m_Localized: Armor for law enforcement officers, designed almost at the very
      end of the War from military combat armor. The armor plates in it are replaced
      by multilayer aramid fiber
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241600
    m_Localized: Special Forces Armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241601
    m_Localized: Multipurpose armor for special forces operatives. Provides protection
      from a wide range of damage types, suitable for any situation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241602
    m_Localized: Enclave armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241603
    m_Localized: Modified power armor of the Pegasus Enclave. It is much lighter
      compared to the Steel Rangers` power armor and designed to protect more against
      magic than against physical damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241604
    m_Localized: '"Eclipse" Armor'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241605
    m_Localized: The exoskeleton is all that remains of the Alicorn`s Armor. It no
      longer gives magical enhancements, but is still quite light and sturdy, and
      most importantly - it allows you to fly!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241606
    m_Localized: Soldier`s amulet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241607
    m_Localized: An amulet made from a soldier`s dog tag, which has a deep dent from
      the bullet. Apparently, the dog tag stopped the bullet, thereby saving the
      life of its owner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241608
    m_Localized: Mechanic`s amulet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241609
    m_Localized: An amulet, skillfully made from a variety of wires, screws and gears,
      making a fascinating composition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241610
    m_Localized: Sapper`s amulet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241611
    m_Localized: An amulet made from a non-triggered detonator of an anti-personnel
      mine, endowed with almost imperceptible magic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241612
    m_Localized: Amulet of a savage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241613
    m_Localized: An amulet made of a canine of some large predator and decorated
      with feathers. Its magic should protect against wild beasts and monsters
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241614
    m_Localized: Amulet of a firewalker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241615
    m_Localized: A magical amulet made of fiery agate. Helps resist heat and fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241616
    m_Localized: Wizard`s amulet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241617
    m_Localized: A powerful amulet created by a great wizard. Protects owner from
      hostile magic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241618
    m_Localized: Shadow`s amulet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241619
    m_Localized: Amulet created by zebras with their mysterious and sinister magic.
      Improves stealth and evasion of the owner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241620
    m_Localized: Amulet of the Lightning Lord
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241621
    m_Localized: Amulet designed for Pegasi dealing with thunderclouds. Very good
      protection against lightnings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241622
    m_Localized: Warlock`s Amulet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241623
    m_Localized: Amulet of polished bone, protecting from black magic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241624
    m_Localized: The initiate`s amulet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241625
    m_Localized: Amulet made of a shiny metal plate with the sign of the Steel Rangers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241626
    m_Localized: Warrior`s amulet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241627
    m_Localized: This amulet has seen many great battles. Its mysterious power protects
      owner from physical damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241628
    m_Localized: Sniper`s amulet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241629
    m_Localized: An amulet made from a cracked optical sight lens, definitely possessing
      some kind of magic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241630
    m_Localized: Berserker`s amulet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241631
    m_Localized: A wooden amulet covered with elaborate carvings and stained with
      dried blood. Inscription on the back side says "What is dead may never die"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241632
    m_Localized: Adept`s amulet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241633
    m_Localized: A fragment of a dark crystal with a faint spark of magic glowing
      deep inside
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241634
    m_Localized: Schematics for a hoofmade sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241635
    m_Localized: Schematics for the "Igniter"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241636
    m_Localized: Schematics for the "Dart gun"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241637
    m_Localized: Schematics for the acid gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241638
    m_Localized: Schematics for the Saw blade launcher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241639
    m_Localized: Schematics for a buckshot gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241640
    m_Localized: Schematics for a railway rifle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241641
    m_Localized: Schematics for the "Big Frickin Gun"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241642
    m_Localized: Dynamite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241643
    m_Localized: Schematics for a hoofmade grenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241644
    m_Localized: Recipe for acid bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241645
    m_Localized: Schematics for the cryogrenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241646
    m_Localized: Recipe for an incendiary cocktail
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241647
    m_Localized: Schematics for Sparkle-grenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241648
    m_Localized: Schematics for the hoofmade mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241649
    m_Localized: Schematics for the cryomine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241650
    m_Localized: Schematics for the balefire mine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241651
    m_Localized: Instructions for handling dynamite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241652
    m_Localized: Schematics for a hoofmade bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241653
    m_Localized: Schematics for the claw dagger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241654
    m_Localized: Schematics for the "Friendship cannon"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241655
    m_Localized: Schematics for a pulse bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241656
    m_Localized: 9 mm round
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241657
    m_Localized: A low-power pistol ammo, quite cheap because of its low efficiency
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241658
    m_Localized: 10 mm round
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241659
    m_Localized: Widely-used handgun ammo, easily obtained in the Wasteland
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241660
    m_Localized: Round cal. 375
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241661
    m_Localized: Pistol rounds "HnH Magnum", used in some revolvers and rifles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241662
    m_Localized: Round cal. 44
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241663
    m_Localized: '"Magnum" rounds - heavier, more expensive and rare than other handgun
      ammunition'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241664
    m_Localized: Round cal. 32
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241665
    m_Localized: Handgun ammo produced in large quantities long before the War
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241666
    m_Localized: Round cal. 308
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241667
    m_Localized: Common sniper rifle rounds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241668
    m_Localized: 12,7-mm round
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241669
    m_Localized: Great and powerful handgun rounds, very effective, but rare and
      expensive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241670
    m_Localized: Round cal. 50 MG
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241671
    m_Localized: Large-caliber bullet with a steel tip - one of the most rare, expensive
      and effective kinds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241672
    m_Localized: 5,56-mm round
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241673
    m_Localized: Common assault rifle rounds, widely-used by both armies during the
      War
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241674
    m_Localized: 5-mm round
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241675
    m_Localized: Small-caliber rounds used in high fire-rate weapons, when quantity
      means more than quality
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241676
    m_Localized: Round cal. 20
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241677
    m_Localized: Ammunition that contains buckshot instead of bullets, used for shotguns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241678
    m_Localized: Round cal. 12
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241679
    m_Localized: A modern and more effective shotgun shell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241680
    m_Localized: 14,4-mm round
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241681
    m_Localized: A very large caliber ammo designed for heavy machine guns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241682
    m_Localized: Fuel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241683
    m_Localized: Flammable liquid used in flamethrowers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241684
    m_Localized: Battery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241685
    m_Localized: Compact Spark-battery of medium power used in magical energy weaponry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241686
    m_Localized: Spark-battery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241687
    m_Localized: Standard Spark-battery used in most models of magical energy weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241688
    m_Localized: Crystal battery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241689
    m_Localized: Energy cell of increased power based on rare crystals. Used as a
      power supply in the deadliest magical energy weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241690
    m_Localized: Charge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241691
    m_Localized: Infinite ammo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241692
    m_Localized: 40-mm shell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241693
    m_Localized: A small explosive projectile for use in grenade launchers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241694
    m_Localized: Rocket
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241695
    m_Localized: A self-propelled projectile for use in rocket launchers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241696
    m_Localized: Balefire egg
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241697
    m_Localized: A magical projectile, resembling an egg. Destructive energy, hidden
      deep inside, is expressed on a surface merely by elusive flickering of lights
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241698
    m_Localized: Aerosol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241699
    m_Localized: A cylinder of liquid propane and isobutane - highly flammable gases
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241700
    m_Localized: Dart
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241701
    m_Localized: A common attribute for a darts game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241702
    m_Localized: Circular saw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241703
    m_Localized: A circular saw of stainless steel with sharp teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241704
    m_Localized: Fragmentation mine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241705
    m_Localized: Acid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241706
    m_Localized: A plastic bottle with concentrated acid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241707
    m_Localized: Railway spike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241708
    m_Localized: A heavy iron thing, used to attach sleepers to rails
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241709
    m_Localized: Cryo-cell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241710
    m_Localized: If the alchemical compounds contained in this small cell react,
      this would cause an instant drop in their temperature to the almost absolute
      zero
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241711
    m_Localized: Energy cell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241712
    m_Localized: A battery used for a star blaster, many times more powerful than
      usual batteries
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241713
    m_Localized: Schematics for the chitinous armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241714
    m_Localized: Bag with caps
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241715
    m_Localized: Bottle caps used as money
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241716
    m_Localized: Biogel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241717
    m_Localized: The substance used by Auto-Doc as an expendable material for treating
      injuries and wounds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241718
    m_Localized: Kindness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241719
    m_Localized: Charmed bandage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241720
    m_Localized: Suitable for treatment of scratches and cuts and also stops bleeding
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241721
    m_Localized: Healing potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241722
    m_Localized: Intended for treatment of light injuries. Treatment effect takes
      some time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241723
    m_Localized: Large healing Potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241724
    m_Localized: Intended for treatment of injuries of medium severity. Treatment
      effect takes some time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241725
    m_Localized: Extra-strong healing potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241726
    m_Localized: Intended for treatment of severe injuries. Treatment effect takes
      some time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241727
    m_Localized: Magic potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241728
    m_Localized: Restores magical power and heals magical burnout and exhaustion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241729
    m_Localized: Large magic potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241730
    m_Localized: Restores magical power and heals magical burnout and exhaustion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241731
    m_Localized: Super-large magic potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241732
    m_Localized: Restores magical power and heals magical burnout and exhaustion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241733
    m_Localized: RadAway
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241734
    m_Localized: Clears body of magical radiation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241735
    m_Localized: Antidote
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241736
    m_Localized: Instantly neutralizes effects of any kind of toxins and increases
      poison resistance for a short time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241737
    m_Localized: Potion of life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241738
    m_Localized: Permanently increases maximum health
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241739
    m_Localized: This is not an ordinary healing potion, but a potent elixir that
      can permanently fortify your health. Drink it without hesitation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241740
    m_Localized: Potion of spirit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241741
    m_Localized: Permanently increases the maximum of magical power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241742
    m_Localized: StealthBuck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241743
    m_Localized: Portable techno-magical device developed by the Ministry of Arcane
      Sciences with support from the Ministry of Image, capable to make his owner
      invisible for a short period of time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241744
    m_Localized: Weapon repair kit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241745
    m_Localized: Can be used to repair almost any weapon. Using this, you can repair
      an equipped weapon by some degree depending on the weapon class and your repair
      skill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241746
    m_Localized: A portable workbench
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241747
    m_Localized: Using a portable bench you can repair your weapons and armor on
      a march, just like using a regular workbench
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241748
    m_Localized: Demopony`s field kit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241749
    m_Localized: Contains all the necessary equipment for creating explosives on
      a march
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241750
    m_Localized: Field lab
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241751
    m_Localized: Contains all the necessary equipment for preparing potions and chemicals
      in the field
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241752
    m_Localized: Whistle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241753
    m_Localized: Needed to call or dismiss a tamed phoenix
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241754
    m_Localized: Robo-owl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241755
    m_Localized: A small security robot that can also serve as a personal assistant
      or secretary. Has a fairly powerful laser weapon. Can be used as a companion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241756
    m_Localized: You assembled a [robo-owl], and now it can be your companion. Activate
      it through the inventory - the [equipment] section. There you can see the robo-owl
      condition and its stats. If the robo-owl is damaged in combat, you can repair
      it in the same way as any weapon or armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241757
    m_Localized: Robo-owl schematics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241758
    m_Localized: Memory orb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241759
    m_Localized: This magical item contains recorded memories of other creatures.
      Using it brings you an additional skill point
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241760
    m_Localized: You have found a memory orb - a magical repository of memories that
      contains important information, someone`s valuable experience, or just moments
      of the past that someone wanted to save. Using it, you will get an additional
      skill point
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241761
    m_Localized: An interesting book
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241762
    m_Localized: You have found a book in good condition, containing useful knowledge.
      Be sure to read it - from books you can learn a lot of useful things, thereby
      increasing one of your skills
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241763
    m_Localized: First aid kit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241764
    m_Localized: Collection of medical supplies necessary to treat light wounds and
      injuries. Basic medical skills are required to use this item
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241765
    m_Localized: Doctor`s bag
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241766
    m_Localized: A set of medical instruments needed for mending fractured bones
      and other serious injuries. Advanced medical skills are required to use this
      item
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241767
    m_Localized: Military surgeon`s bag
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241768
    m_Localized: Contains complex medical tools and healing spells for treating the
      most severe wounds. One can literally bring somepony back to life with this,
      providing he has the most advanced medical skills and lots of experience
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241769
    m_Localized: Blood pack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241770
    m_Localized: A pack of artificial blood, compatible with blood of any pony race
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241771
    m_Localized: Rad-X
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241772
    m_Localized: A substance in capsules of yellow and red colors, temporarily increasing
      radiation resistance. Recommended when working in places with high magical
      radiation background. Use one capsule per individual
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241773
    m_Localized: Mint-als
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241774
    m_Localized: Drugs in a form of peppermint-flavored candy. Temporarily gives
      you a boost to intelligence and clear thinking, and also sharpens your senses,
      but has reverse, negative after effects
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241775
    m_Localized: Party-time Mint-als
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241776
    m_Localized: Improved version of Mint-als, giving much more prominent effect.
      Incredibly boosts brain capabilities and sharpness of perception. Effect doesn`t
      add up with that of common Mint-als
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241777
    m_Localized: Dash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241778
    m_Localized: A powerful military stimulator, that gives you a feeling of time
      being slowed down. Increases speed and gives additional action points in S.A.T.S.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241779
    m_Localized: Ultra-dash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241780
    m_Localized: An advanced version of the dash, makes user fast as a lightning.
      True, there is some probability of sudden death from a heart attack. Does not
      add up with the effect of an ordinary dash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241781
    m_Localized: Rage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241782
    m_Localized: A drug developed and manufactured during the Great War in order
      to increase soldiers` courage and aggressiveness. Makes user feel unstoppable
      rage, resulting in higher amount of damage being caused
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241783
    m_Localized: Med-X
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241784
    m_Localized: A potent pain-killer for intravenous injection. For a short time
      makes you completely mute to pain, which is sometimes used to increase soldiers`
      effectiveness in combat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241785
    m_Localized: Stampede
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241786
    m_Localized: A drug that combines effects of Rage and Med-X. It makes one feel
      unstoppable rage while simultaneously suppressing any pain and self-protection
      instinct, making him or her very dangerous and deadly. Not compatible with
      common Rage or Med-X
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241787
    m_Localized: Buck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241788
    m_Localized: Steroid drug in form of green pills, used to increase physical strength
      and endurance. Starts working immediately, although only for a short period
      of time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241789
    m_Localized: Hydra
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241790
    m_Localized: Healing potion of unmatched effectiveness, formulated with essence
      of an actual hydra. Speeds up living tissue regeneration by up to a hundred
      times, mending any injuries, but it is also dangerous because of possible mutagenic
      side effects
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241791
    m_Localized: Detoxin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241792
    m_Localized: Rare and valuable medicine used to treat chemical addiction. Instantly
      removes all drug effects, both positive and negative, and also neutralizes
      poison
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241793
    m_Localized: Super-stimulation potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241794
    m_Localized: Instantly restores health. Even though it is capable of saving life
      in a critical condition, it is very toxic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241795
    m_Localized: Potion of flight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241796
    m_Localized: This potion gives you wings, thus making you able to fly. The effect
      is temporary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241797
    m_Localized: Potion of shadows
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241798
    m_Localized: Drinking the potion will turn you into a shadow. While in this form,
      it is hard to see or cause damage to you, but you won`t be able to fight as
      well. Also, it seems that it weakens unicorns` telekinesis ability
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241799
    m_Localized: Wizardry potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241800
    m_Localized: The potion reduces magical energy consumption for telekinesis and
      different spells, increasing their power, and also speeds up energy restoration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241801
    m_Localized: Infra-vision potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241802
    m_Localized: For a short period of time allows you seeing through walls and also
      to see things that are hidden or concealed with magic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241803
    m_Localized: Diver`s potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241804
    m_Localized: For five minutes allows you to breathe underwater and swim much
      faster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241805
    m_Localized: Pink potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241806
    m_Localized: This potion somewhat protects you from the harmful effects of the
      Pink Cloud
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241807
    m_Localized: Potion of the Last Chance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241808
    m_Localized: If during its action you are dealt a death blow, you gain absolute
      protection for 5 seconds and partially restore your health. Absolute protection
      does not save from poison and bleeding
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241809
    m_Localized: Joint of magic weed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241810
    m_Localized: Smokable. The effect is unpredictable!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241811
    m_Localized: Potion of fortitude
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241812
    m_Localized: This potion makes your bones sturdy and capable to endure heavy
      load. Permanent effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241813
    m_Localized: Immunity potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241814
    m_Localized: Drinking this improves your ability to resist different negative
      factors, such as poisoning, bleeding and radiation. Permanent effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241815
    m_Localized: Potion of might
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241816
    m_Localized: This potion improves your reflexes and increases aggression. You
      can deal more damage with melee weapons. Permanent effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241817
    m_Localized: Potion of vivacity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241818
    m_Localized: This potion increases running speed and stamina capacity. In other
      words you can run faster and longer. Permanent effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241819
    m_Localized: Potion of concentration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241820
    m_Localized: This potion fortifies your nervous system and sharpens sight, which
      improves your shooting accuracy. Permanent effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241821
    m_Localized: Elixir of Intuition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241822
    m_Localized: This potion gives you an ability to anticipate the near future to
      some extent, and thus evade enemy bullets. Permanent effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241823
    m_Localized: Elixir of Fortune
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241824
    m_Localized: It is hard to say what exactly this potion does and how it works,
      but with it your hits will cause critical damage more often. Permanent effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241825
    m_Localized: Elemental potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241826
    m_Localized: A potion invented by unicorns in the distant past. Strengthens magician`s
      connection to natural forces and increases power of his spells
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241827
    m_Localized: Potion of purification
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241828
    m_Localized: Purifies from curses
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241829
    m_Localized: Sparkle-cola
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241830
    m_Localized: The most popular alcohol-free fizzy beverage with carrot flavor.
      Speeds up restoration of magical energy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241831
    m_Localized: Sunrise Sarsaparilla
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241832
    m_Localized: Non-alcoholic fizzy drink produced before the War. Restores health
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241833
    m_Localized: Radioactive cookies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241834
    m_Localized: It is extremely not recommended eating this thing. But perhaps there
      is somepony who might like it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241835
    m_Localized: Sparkle-Cola RAD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241836
    m_Localized: A rare kind of Sparkle-Cola, which contains radioactive substances.
      Has a radish taste and glows in the dark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241837
    m_Localized: Coffee
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241838
    m_Localized: Tasty and healthy drink with a light stimulating effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241839
    m_Localized: Milk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241840
    m_Localized: Fresh brahmin milk, removes radiation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241841
    m_Localized: Beer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241842
    m_Localized: Low-alcoholic beverage made from local oats. The taste is not so
      great
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241843
    m_Localized: Home brew
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241844
    m_Localized: Low-alcohol beverage from potatoes. The taste leaves much to be
      desired
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241845
    m_Localized: Liqueur
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241846
    m_Localized: Alcoholic drink of medium strength from local fruits, or whatever
      is now used instead of them. Pretty pleasant to the taste
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241847
    m_Localized: Schnapps
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241848
    m_Localized: A fairly strong alcoholic beverage obtained by distillation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241849
    m_Localized: Moonshine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241850
    m_Localized: An hard draft with a scent of fusel oil. For those who simply want
      to get wasted
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241851
    m_Localized: Alcohol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241852
    m_Localized: Almost pure alcohol, rare and quite expensive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241853
    m_Localized: Apple cider "Old farm"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241854
    m_Localized: Cider of the highest quality with a delicate taste and aroma
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241855
    m_Localized: Apple wine "Pink sunset"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241856
    m_Localized: Rare rose wine for real esthetes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241857
    m_Localized: Apple liquor "Summer flavors"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241858
    m_Localized: In addition to apples, the composition of this liqueur includes
      a dozen different kinds of fruits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241859
    m_Localized: Apple Whiskey "Wild Pegasus"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241860
    m_Localized: A popular brand of whiskey before the War, currently 200-year-old!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241861
    m_Localized: Apple vodka "Crystal"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241862
    m_Localized: Vodka of elite quality, worth a lot of money before the War. Purified
      with magic crystals!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241863
    m_Localized: Granny Smith`s Apple bitter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241864
    m_Localized: They say that over the passed time this tincture has acquired an
      absolutely unique taste
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241865
    m_Localized: Apple balsam "The gift of nature"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241866
    m_Localized: '"Healing" liqueur made from apples, 24 kinds of herbs and medical
      alcohol'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241867
    m_Localized: Instant noodles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241868
    m_Localized: You can pour in hot water, or just eat it dry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241869
    m_Localized: Pasta
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241870
    m_Localized: You can cook something with it, or just chew it as it is
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241871
    m_Localized: Canned corn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241872
    m_Localized: Pretty tasty, sweet and nutritious
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241873
    m_Localized: Ready-made lunch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241874
    m_Localized: An incomprehensible gray mass with even more incomprehensible bits
      of something, perhaps dried vegetables
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241875
    m_Localized: Canned beans
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241876
    m_Localized: Food rich in vegetable protein
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241877
    m_Localized: Bread
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241878
