    m_Localized: Data disc
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241980
    m_Localized: Information downloaded from the terminal contains long forgotten
      secrets of the past. You can sell it for a good price
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241981
    m_Localized: Disc with valuable data
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241982
    m_Localized: Data on pre-war technologies is on high demand among certain communities
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241983
    m_Localized: Disc of the Min. of Image
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241984
    m_Localized: This disc contains information about the development of the StealthBuck
      M2. Perhaps Steel Rangers will find it interesting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241985
    m_Localized: Pre-War book
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241986
    m_Localized: Undamaged pre-war books - a true rarity nowadays. Most merchants
      will gladly pay for them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241987
    m_Localized: Burglar rune
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241988
    m_Localized: The burglar rune can open any lock, even a stuck one. Single use.
      To activate, hover cursor over a door or container with a tough lock and press
      @1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241989
    m_Localized: Rune of return
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241990
    m_Localized: The rune of return teleports you to the base camp from anywhere
      (confirm action by pressing the button). You can return to the nearest MAS
      terminal. One-time use
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241991
    m_Localized: Electronic lock pick
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241992
    m_Localized: A single use device used to do a deep reboot of the terminal resetting
      all passwords. It was hard to get even before the War, not to mention now.
      To use, hover over a secure terminal and press @1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241993
    m_Localized: Toaster repair
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241994
    m_Localized: Despite its name, this book can tell you not only about fixing toasters,
      but actually about repairing anything - from household equipment to modern
      weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241995
    m_Localized: Medicine - is fun!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241996
    m_Localized: In this book you can find interesting and fun facts about medicine,
      first aid, treating wounds and even basics of surgery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241997
    m_Localized: Breaking-in and infiltrating
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241998
    m_Localized: This book has detailed and well-illustrated descriptions of locks
      of different types and much advice on how to break them. An author definitely
      must`ve had problems with the law
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725241999
    m_Localized: Young hacker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242000
    m_Localized: A children`s guide, in which author introduces young readers to
      the basics of information technology, and also shares different less known
      facts about terminals and other electronic systems
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242001
    m_Localized: Fireworks for parties
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242002
    m_Localized: A book sponsored by the Ministry of Morale. It contains guidelines
      for safe handling of explosive materials used in fireworks and some other devices
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242003
    m_Localized: Ammo-nation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242004
    m_Localized: Monthly illustrated catalog of firearms. It has detailed information
      on latest technical achievements and fashion trends in this industry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242005
    m_Localized: Hack and slash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242006
    m_Localized: A book on history of melee weapons. From ancient spears and blades
      to modern magical energy swords
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242007
    m_Localized: Magic guarding our Home
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242008
    m_Localized: A book about the latest trends on everything concerning development
      and application of magical energy weapons. Although useful information is quite
      diluted with pompous speeches and propaganda
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242009
    m_Localized: Become a shadow. Self-guide.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242010
    m_Localized: A guide for beginner spies and scouts. Despite that the author was
      obviously a paranoid psycho, the book contains some useful information
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242011
    m_Localized: Why pay more?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242012
    m_Localized: This book teaches how to communicate with traders of all sorts,
      how to barter and get discounts and also recognize some common tricks and ruses
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242013
    m_Localized: Telekinesis for dummies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242014
    m_Localized: A guide for young unicorns, that is supposed to help them develop
      their telekinetic strength
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242015
    m_Localized: The Wasteland Survival Guide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242016
    m_Localized: This book was written after the War. It tells about different dangers
      of the Wasteland and ways to deal with them. The author - Ditzy Doo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242017
    m_Localized: Magical arts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242018
    m_Localized: One of many pre-war books, dedicated to unicorn magic. Far from
      being very clever and scientifically accurate, it still has colorful pictures
      and lots of practical advice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242019
    m_Localized: The mysterious power of alicorns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242020
    m_Localized: Although this book tells about true alicorns, such as the princess
      Celestia, the knowledge contained in it might help you against the Goddesses
      alicorns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
