      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242054
    m_Localized: A plastic canister containing a clear viscous liquid. With the necessary
      knowledge you can turn it into explosive nitroglycerin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242055
    m_Localized: Equidroid Data disc
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242056
    m_Localized: This disk contains schematics, wiring diagrams and other information
      useful for figuring out how equidroids work. Although, frankly, it`s unlikely
      for one to be able to understand at least some of this without being a certified
      robotics engineer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242057
    m_Localized: Smuggled cigars
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242058
    m_Localized: A box of cigars illegally imported from the zebra country. Excellent
      smokes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242059
    m_Localized: Smoking pipe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242060
    m_Localized: Excellent pipe of cherry wood. Smoky Pit will be glad to get it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242061
    m_Localized: Bong
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242062
    m_Localized: A device for heavy smokers. Perhaps Smoky Pit will like it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242063
    m_Localized: A pack of tobacco
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242064
    m_Localized: Leaf tobacco for smoking pipes. Perfectly preserved, Smoky Pit will
      gladly pay for it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242065
    m_Localized: Vaccine for the dust fever
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242066
    m_Localized: The only known cure for this disease
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242067
    m_Localized: Water talisman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242068
    m_Localized: A magical device that cleans water of chemical impurities, microbes
      and radiation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242069
    m_Localized: Balefire-battery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242070
    m_Localized: A compact device that uses Balefire technology to produce an almost
      unlimited amount of energy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242071
    m_Localized: Secret documents of the Legion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242072
    m_Localized: "The document is titled \"\u12BD\u12E4\u12CC\u1247\u1215\u127D\u1290\u12E5\u121A\u1286\u1367\"
      - whatever this means. Unfortunately, you don`t speak the zebra language and
      won`t be able to read this"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242073
    m_Localized: Stellar talisman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242074
    m_Localized: A powerful talisman, which will serve only an experienced warrior.
      Increases damage from any weapon by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242075
    m_Localized: Lunar talisman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242076
    m_Localized: A powerful talisman possessing powers that only a true hero can
      handle. Increases damage from any weapon by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242077
    m_Localized: Solar talisman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242078
    m_Localized: A great talisman, giving its power only to the chosen ones. Increases
      damage from any weapon by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242079
    m_Localized: Ether talisman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242080
    m_Localized: A legendary talisman worthy of only the best of the best. Increases
      damage from any weapon by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242081
    m_Localized: Screwdriver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242082
    m_Localized: Screwdriver is required for lock picking. You will also require
      pins. If you lack them, you can try to open the lock anyway, but the probability
      for the lock to get jammed will be much higher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242083
    m_Localized: A screwdriver! Quite a useful tool. It can help you open simple
      locks. Try it on some locked chest. If the lock doesn`t yield on the first
      try - don`t worry, just try again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242084
    m_Localized: Bobby pin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242085
    m_Localized: Pins are useful for lock picking. They are used to probe and move
      springs inside a lock with less risk of breaking and jamming it than if using
      brutal force. In case of failure, you might break the pin, but you will be
      able to try again using another one
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242086
    m_Localized: Titanium screwdriver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242087
    m_Localized: A premium screwdriver made from the sturdiest titanium alloy should
      help unscrew even the most rusty bolts. You will also find it useful for opening
      locks, and your lockpicking skill will increase by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242088
    m_Localized: Stethoscope
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242089
    m_Localized: A medical device designed to hear sounds coming from internal organs...
      or the sounds the lock makes during lockpicking. Increases your level of lockpicking
      by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242090
    m_Localized: Diamond whetstone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242091
    m_Localized: A very useful tool for sharpening weapons. Just always carry it
      with you and it will increase damage of your piercing and cutting weapons by
      #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242092
    m_Localized: Binoculars
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242093
    m_Localized: Old binoculars with scratched lenses, a gift from Calamity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242094
    m_Localized: Pulse bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242095
    m_Localized: Helps enter the Steel Rangers bunker. One-time use
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242096
    m_Localized: '"Fool" destiny card'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242097
    m_Localized: Allows changing the game difficulty to "very easy" for a single
      time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242098
    m_Localized: '"Hermit" destiny card'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242099
    m_Localized: Allows changing the game difficulty to "easy" for a single time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242100
    m_Localized: '"Mage" destiny card'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242101
    m_Localized: Allows changing the game difficulty to "normal" for a single time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242102
    m_Localized: '"Emperor" destiny card'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242103
    m_Localized: Allows changing the game difficulty to "hard" for a single time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242104
    m_Localized: '"Death" destiny card'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242105
    m_Localized: Allows changing the game difficulty to "super-hard" for a single
      time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242106
    m_Localized: Black paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242107
    m_Localized: White paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242108
    m_Localized: Grey paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242109
    m_Localized: Blue paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242110
    m_Localized: Red paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242111
    m_Localized: Green paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242112
    m_Localized: Yellow paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242113
    m_Localized: Purple paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242114
    m_Localized: Orange paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242115
    m_Localized: Brown paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242116
    m_Localized: Light blue paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242117
    m_Localized: Dark green paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242118
    m_Localized: Cyan paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242119
    m_Localized: Pink paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242120
    m_Localized: Khaki paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242121
    m_Localized: Crimson paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242122
    m_Localized: Lime paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242123
    m_Localized: Burgundy paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242124
    m_Localized: Fiery paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242125
    m_Localized: Beige paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242126
    m_Localized: Slavers` key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242127
    m_Localized: Opens various locks in the slavers` den
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242128
    m_Localized: Security access key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242129
    m_Localized: Gives access to the ManeTec Department of Special Research
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242130
    m_Localized: Overmare`s key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242131
    m_Localized: Gives access to the overmare office of stable 88
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242132
    m_Localized: Alicorn key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242133
    m_Localized: The key taken from a very strong alicorn in Manehattan, the Blood
      Moon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242134
    m_Localized: Necromancer`s key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242135
    m_Localized: The key belonging to the necromancer zebra Mchawi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242136
    m_Localized: Steel Rangers` key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242137
    m_Localized: The key that was kept by Elder Coldsight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242138
    m_Localized: Utility room key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242139
    m_Localized: Oak Stalwort`s key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242140
    m_Localized: The extremely valuable key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242141
    m_Localized: The key to some cellar in Canterlot that, according to rumors, is
      full of treasures. At least you hope so, and that the key is worth it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242142
    m_Localized: Centurion Key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242143
    m_Localized: A key found at the Legion`s headquarters
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242144
    m_Localized: Colonel`s Key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242145
    m_Localized: Key received from the commander of the Enclave base
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242146
    m_Localized: Crowbar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242147
    m_Localized: A crowbar is a universal tool. It can be used both as a weapon and
      for breaking various objects. With it, you can attack enemies, break open doors
      and break through fragile walls. You can also crack open chests and other containers
      when lock picking with a screwdriver fails. Both loot from the container and
      the crowbar itself will receive damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242148
    m_Localized: Magical energy weapon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242149
    m_Localized: The self-recharging pistol is a lucky prize. It belongs to a variety
      of magical energy weapons that does not require batteries. Its charge restores
      with time by itself
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242150
    m_Localized: Firearms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242151
    m_Localized: Firearms are weapons that use various types of cartridges for firing.
      Press @1 to reload
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242152
    m_Localized: Attacking spell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242153
    m_Localized: You found a book that describes the telekinetic bullet spell. To
      use, equip it the same way as an ordinary weapon. The spell does not require
      ammunition but consumes your magical power. Also, the attacking spell can be
      used simultaneously with any other weapon by pressing the @1 key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242154
    m_Localized: Protective spell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242155
    m_Localized: To use a protective spell first equip it from your inventory (section
      [Weapons] or [Equipment]). After that, you can apply it by pressing the @1
      key. You can also assign a protective spell to one of the quick spell slots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242156
    m_Localized: Implant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242157
    m_Localized: The implant is installed and activated. No additional actions required
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242158
    m_Localized: PipBuck module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242159
    m_Localized: The module is connected to the PipBuck and activated. No additional
      actions required
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242160
    m_Localized: Subdermal Armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242161
    m_Localized: A secret technology developed as a part of "Cyber-pony" project.
      Implant reinforces skin with polymer tissue, that raises damage threshold by
      #1. Implantation cost is included in retail price
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242162
    m_Localized: Regeneration module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242163
    m_Localized: A complex and expensive implant that combines advanced magic and
      nanotechnology. Automatically restores the user`s health by #1 units per second,
      without requiring additional resources, but no more than #2 of the maximum
      health
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242164
    m_Localized: Magic keeper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242165
    m_Localized: The implant created specifically for war mages. Never lets your
      magical power reach zero, protects from burnout
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242166
    m_Localized: Logical processor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242167
    m_Localized: A small chip that connects directly to the brain. Improves memory,
      helps to do mathematical calculations, improves the accuracy of telekinesis.
      In general, this leads to an increase of Lockpicking skill by #1 and Science
      by #2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242168
    m_Localized: Metal detector
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242169
    m_Localized: A simple device, connectable to PipBuck. Set for detection of small
      metal items, it allows you finding lost caps and ammo in the most unexpected
      places
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242170
    m_Localized: Tactical analyzer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242171
    m_Localized: An advanced module for PipBuck, allows scanning enemies to define
      strong and weak points. In S.A.T.S. you will see exact information about your
      enemies` health and armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242172
    m_Localized: Targeting module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242173
    m_Localized: A complex device, connectable to PipBuck. During battle defines
      enemies` weak points not covered by armor and marks them with a laser point.
      You have a chance to attack in the weak spot, completely ignoring any armor.
      The chance is higher when using rifles and pistols
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242174
    m_Localized: Holographic module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242175
    m_Localized: A complex techno-magical module for PipBuck, employing illusion
      magic. Acts as an active camouflage system, making it harder detecting you.
      In battle it creates illusive noise, distracting enemy`s aim. Increases Stealth
      and evasion bonus by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242176
    m_Localized: Reanimation module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242177
    m_Localized: An addition to medical PipBuck module. It constantly monitors your
      health, automatically applying medical spells in mortal danger, allowing the
      owner to survive and keep conscience even when seriously wounded. However it
      takes a long time to recharge after each use
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242178
    m_Localized: Hacker`s module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242179
    m_Localized: A complex module for PipBuck allowing you to partially automate
      the picking of a password. Increases your skill for hacking terminals by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242180
    m_Localized: Enhanced robo-owl laser
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242181
    m_Localized: Improved laser for a robo-owl, increasing damage by about one third
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242182
    m_Localized: Robo-owl active defense
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242183
    m_Localized: Strengthened body for the robo-owl, increasing its survivability
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242184
    m_Localized: Robo-owl case
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242185
    m_Localized: Just an empty case without any filling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242186
    m_Localized: Quantum cogitator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242187
    m_Localized: A small but very powerful processor. Currently connected to your
      PipBuck, which increases your level of lockpicking and terminal hacking by
      #1, as well as the number of APs in S.A.T.S. mode by #2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242188
    m_Localized: In your hooves you hold a masterpiece of the former Equestria technology.
      A very compact processor a thousand times more superior to the conventional
      one. Using your knowledge of a PipBuck technician, you connect the cogitator
      to your PipBuck. Of course, this cannot reveal the whole potential of this
      technological miracle, but still, with it, your PipBuck starts to work faster
      and better. Your skill level for opening locks and hacking terminals, as well
      as the number of APs in the S.A.T.S. mode, are increased
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242189
    m_Localized: Transistor module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242190
    m_Localized: An extension module for PipBuck increasing its computing power.
      Increases your level of lockpicking and hacking by #1, as well as the amount
      of AP in S.A.T.S. by #2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242191
    m_Localized: Twilight Sparkle figurine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242192
    m_Localized: Be Smart! Increases damage from combat spells by #1, also increases
      the chance of successful lockpicking and terminal hacking
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242193
    m_Localized: You find a figurine of a young lavender unicorn with a crimson and
      lilac stripes in a dark blue mane and with a cutie mark shaped like a magic
      star. ["Be Smart!"] - reads the golden inscription at the base of the statuette.
      You immediately feel an unusual clarity of thought, and your magical power
      has clearly increased
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242194
    m_Localized: Pinkie Pie figurine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242195
    m_Localized: Awareness! It was under "E"! Increases accuracy and stealth by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242196
    m_Localized: 'A beautifully preserved statuette of a bright pink pony, with a
      mane that looks like cotton candy, just radiating an aura of unrestrained happiness
      and fun. The inscription at the base is a bit strange: [`Awareness! It was
      under "E"!`] You are surprised to note that all your feelings magically sharpened'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242197
    m_Localized: Applejack figurine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242198
    m_Localized: Be Strong! Increases damage from melee weapons by #1, damage from
      hoof attacks by #2, and health by #3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2725242199
    m_Localized: You find a statue of an orange earth pony with a yellow mane and
      tail, depicted at the moment when her hind hooves hit the air. It is engraved
      with the inscription "Be Strong!". Amazingly, now you really feel much stronger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435136
    m_Localized: Rainbow Dash figurine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435137
    m_Localized: Be Awesome! Increases damage of all firearms by #1, and the speed
      of running and swimming by #2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435138
    m_Localized: A statuette of a sky-blue pegasus, with rainbow mane and tail. She
      is depicted in a proud pose, with straightened wings and a grin on her face.
      You see the inscription on the base ["Be awesome!"], and immediately feel...
      much cooler! In every way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435139
    m_Localized: Fluttershy figurine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435140
    m_Localized: Be Pleasant! Reduces the prices of merchants by #1 and increases
      the effectiveness of healing potions by #2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435141
    m_Localized: A statuette of a yellow pegasus, untouched by time, smiling very
      sweetly from beneath her pink mane with a gentle look in her eyes. The inscription
      at the base reads "Be Pleasant!" - and indeed you feel inside the power not
      to kill, but to heal and save lives
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435142
    m_Localized: Rarity figurine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435143
    m_Localized: Be Unwavering! Increases the damage threshold by #1, reduces consumption
      of stamina and magical power by #2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435144
    m_Localized: 'A statuette of an amazingly beautiful white unicorn with a carefully
      combed purple mane. With all its appearance, it radiates confidence and firmness,
      like diamonds on her cutie mark, and these qualities are immediately transmitted
      to you. The inscription at the base reads: ["Be Unwavering!"]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435145
    m_Localized: Alicorn Amulet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435146
    m_Localized: An ancient and mysterious relic, increasing the magical power of
      the owner but enslaving his mind. Under no circumstances should you wear this
      amulet around your neck! Although just laying in your bag, it still strengthens
      your battle spells by #1 and decreases magic consumption by #2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435147
    m_Localized: Alicorn Amulet! An ancient and mysterious relic, increasing the
      magical power of the owner but enslaving his mind. You feel a strong desire
      to immediately put the amulet around your neck, but, realizing the danger of
      such a rash act, simply put it in your bag. And still, even just being near,
      the amulet increases your magical power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435148
    m_Localized: Black book
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435149
    m_Localized: The ancient tome written by mighty zebra shamans and containing
      their forbidden knowledge. But it is not just the dark spells and terrible
      rituals described in the book that are of interest. The book itself is also
      an extraordinarily powerful artifact, protecting its owner from black magic
      and giving the ability to absorb the vital energy from enemies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435150
    m_Localized: 'The black book! A tome, written in ancient times by mighty zebra
      alchemists, containing their forbidden knowledge. You would really like to
      know what secrets are hidden in this book, but it is written in an unfamiliar
      language. And perhaps, this is for the best.

      Having the book with you,
      you get some protection from black magic, as well as an ability to absorb the
      vital energy of ponies, zebras, griffins, and alicorns you kill'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435151
    m_Localized: Magical barrier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435152
    m_Localized: This spell enables you to summon a magical barrier in a specific
      location, absorbing enemy bullets and magical spells. The barrier has limited
      endurance and time of existence, after which it dissipates. Importantly, it
      lets your bullets and missiles come through
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435153
    m_Localized: Magical shield
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435154
    m_Localized: This spell surrounds you with a protective field, increasing your
      armor stats. It protects from any external damage, however strong blows, armor-piercing
      bullets and explosions can overwhelm the shield and cause a somewhat reduced
      damage. It has limited endurance and existence time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435155
    m_Localized: Kinetic blast
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435156
    m_Localized: This spell releases all your telekinetic power in one mighty impulse.
      All enemies around you get knocked back with enormous force and might even
      get stunned. It is very useful when you are surrounded
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435157
    m_Localized: Kinetic dash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435158
    m_Localized: This spell uses your telekinetic powers to give you a powerful directed
      impulse. Can be used for evading attacks in combat or getting to hard-to-reach
      places
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435159
    m_Localized: Distortion field
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435160
    m_Localized: This spell surrounds you with a magic field that slows movements
      of any hostile objects. Improving "Magic" skill increases a radius of the field
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435161
    m_Localized: Crystal shield
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435162
    m_Localized: This spell creates a shell around you that looks like a crystal.
      It absorbs any external damage, consuming magical energy instead of health.
      To use it, hold down the spell key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435163
    m_Localized: Moonblade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435164
    m_Localized: The spell summons a spirit moonblade, fighting on your side
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435165
    m_Localized: Ghost wall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435166
    m_Localized: Allows you to create a ghost wall impassable for your enemies. The
      wall has a certain limit of durability and lifetime. It is fully permeable
      for all inanimate objects, like bullets and shells, and for its creator. The
      wall cannot be created in doorways and on staircases
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435167
    m_Localized: Blood shield
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435168
    m_Localized: The spell uses some of your blood to create an impenetrable magic
      shield for a few seconds. It gives complete invulnerability to any external
      damage and can save you at the most critical moment at the cost of some blood
      loss. It won`t work if you don`t have enough blood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435169
    m_Localized: Reinforced fabric
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435170
    m_Localized: Durable material made of several layers of thick fabric with interlayers
      of polymer fiber for better ballistic protection. Used for manufacturing light
      body armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435171
    m_Localized: Radiation-resistant fabric
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435172
    m_Localized: A material enriched with metallic fiber, able to reflect radiation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435173
    m_Localized: Rubberized fabric
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435174
    m_Localized: A rubber-saturated material, impenetrable for liquid and gaseous
      substances. Protects well in the aggressive environment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435175
    m_Localized: Tanned leather
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435176
    m_Localized: Firm pieces of chemically hardened leather, can be used to enhance
      and repair leather armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435177
    m_Localized: Metal plate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435178
    m_Localized: Hard and shiny metal plate, that not just any bullet can break through.
      Can be used to repair and enhance metal armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435179
    m_Localized: Armored plate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435180
    m_Localized: A plate made of ceramics and complex polymers. Very firm and light,
      it is used in a modern combat armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435181
    m_Localized: Enchanted plate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435182
    m_Localized: A plate of indistinct material, greatly enhanced by magic. Used
      in a magic armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435183
    m_Localized: Chitinous plate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435184
    m_Localized: A fragment of a thick and sturdy chitinous shell. With enough skill
      you can make a decent armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435185
    m_Localized: Camouflage plate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435186
    m_Localized: A plate of composite materials with a special textured surface.
      Used to repair or improve scout armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435187
    m_Localized: Power armor fragment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435188
    m_Localized: A fragment of one of the greatest achievements of equestrian science
      and technology. Perhaps, if you collect enough of these parts, you can build
      a complete set of armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435189
    m_Localized: Aramid fabric
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435190
    m_Localized: Aramid is stronger than steel and five times lighter. A multilayer
      fabric of this material can stop a pistol bullet and is quite fireproof
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435191
    m_Localized: Leather belt
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435192
    m_Localized: Still looks like new
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435193
    m_Localized: Fan blade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435194
    m_Localized: A bit rusty, but quite sturdy and sharp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435195
    m_Localized: Rubber band
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435196
    m_Localized: Even after all those years it is still elastic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435197
    m_Localized: Duct tape
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435198
    m_Localized: Essential in any household
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435199
    m_Localized: Lighter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435200
    m_Localized: Indispensable accessory of any smoker
