  - m_Id: 2729435221
    m_Localized: Spring
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435222
    m_Localized: An elastic part of some device
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435223
    m_Localized: Electric motor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435224
    m_Localized: Electric motor from a broken circular saw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435225
    m_Localized: Wonderglue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435226
    m_Localized: Can glue anything to any surface of any material for good
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435227
    m_Localized: Turpentine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435228
    m_Localized: Organic solvent, obtained from the resin of coniferous trees. Toxic
      and flammable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435229
    m_Localized: Weapon fragments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435230
    m_Localized: Different details that can be used for repair or assembly of new
      weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435231
    m_Localized: Industrial battery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435232
    m_Localized: A Spark-battery used for powering up machinery and equipment. Heavy
      and not very powerful, yet very long-lasting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435233
    m_Localized: Piston compressor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435234
    m_Localized: A simple device for air compression
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435235
    m_Localized: Pressure cooker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435236
    m_Localized: A hermetically sealed pan for cooking at high temperature
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435237
    m_Localized: Manometer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435238
    m_Localized: A device, measuring pressure, equipped with a safety valve
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435239
    m_Localized: Electromagnet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435240
    m_Localized: A very powerful one, can hold stuff 200 fold heavier than itself
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435241
    m_Localized: Levitation talisman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435242
    m_Localized: A compact magical device, allowing holding small items in air
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435243
    m_Localized: Focusing crystal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435244
