      for focusing energy flows
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435245
    m_Localized: Superconductor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435246
    m_Localized: It has zero electrical resistance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435247
    m_Localized: Capacitor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435248
    m_Localized: An element of high capacitance, capable of producing high discharge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435249
    m_Localized: Passwords database
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435250
    m_Localized: A memory module containing 300,000 most used passwords. It can be
      used to create a device that would help hacking terminals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435251
    m_Localized: Fan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435252
