  - m_Id: 2729435311
    m_Localized: Taint extract
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435312
    m_Localized: A substance of magical nature. On contact with a living material
      it causes horrible mutations, but in precisely selected doses and in combination
      with other reagents may cause advantageous alterations
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435313
    m_Localized: Hydra`s blood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435314
    m_Localized: An incredibly potent magical reagent. When properly used, it helps
      to wake up hidden potential of the body
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435315
    m_Localized: A liquid rainbow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435316
    m_Localized: Pretty versicolored liquid with a horrible taste. Has prominent
      magical properties
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435317
    m_Localized: Star dust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435318
    m_Localized: Sparkling silvery dust, that might be found in places of meteorite
      landing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435319
    m_Localized: Moonstone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435320
    m_Localized: A rare opaque mineral of blue-white color. According to beliefs,
      it has a connection to ancient mystical forces
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435321
    m_Localized: Mysterious essence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435322
    m_Localized: Actually, nopony knows what it is exactly, but not a single really
      powerful potion is possible without it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435323
    m_Localized: Fiery crystal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435324
    m_Localized: An orange crystal resembling a tongue of flame. And even warm to
      the touch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435325
    m_Localized: Absolute salt
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435326
    m_Localized: Very rare alchemical reagent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435327
    m_Localized: Dark Shard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435328
    m_Localized: It appears to be materialized dark magic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435329
    m_Localized: Pulse grenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435330
    m_Localized: Hellhound Claw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435331
    m_Localized: A particularly long and sharp claw once belonging to a large hellhound.
      You can use it to make a weapon or sell it for a good price
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435332
    m_Localized: Ammo pouch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435333
    m_Localized: A pouch made of thick tarpaulin of a special design by Brass Buckshot.
      With this you can carry more ammo, batteries or explosives without any loss
      of mobility
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435334
    m_Localized: Large Ammo Pouch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435335
    m_Localized: A durable synthetic fabric pouch designed by Steel Rangers specialists.
      With this you can carry more ammo, batteries or explosives without constraining
      your movements
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435336
    m_Localized: Elixir of mind expansion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435337
    m_Localized: An incredibly rare elixir, the recipe of which seems to be lost
      forever. Enhances the magical talent making unicorns capable of holding more
      spells in memory at the same time. The effect is permanent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435338
    m_Localized: Harmony crystal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435339
    m_Localized: A blue crystal of irregular shape. Its purpose is unknown
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435340
    m_Localized: Magnetic resonance horsgregator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435341
    m_Localized: Makes horsgregation using magnetic resonance - you don`t have to
      be a scientist to understand that
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435342
    m_Localized: Ultra-quadruponificator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435343
    m_Localized: Much more powerful than common quadruponificator. A real breakthrough
      in a world of quadruponification!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435344
    m_Localized: Baryon neighralyzer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435345
    m_Localized: Neighralyzes whatever you want and any way you like - this device
      has so much better capabilities compared to its analogues
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435346
    m_Localized: Superluminescent quasistabilitron
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435347
    m_Localized: It can glow in different colors or rectify electric current - depending
      on the state of the quantum field
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435348
    m_Localized: Hyperbeam twilifuser
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435349
    m_Localized: The most important thing to remember when working with this device
      - where that plug goes into. Incorrect plugging may cause dire consequences
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435350
    m_Localized: Enclave Power Armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435351
    m_Localized: Power armor for pegasi. You will not be able to wear it properly
      without some modifications
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435352
    m_Localized: Dictionary of foul language
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435353
    m_Localized: Dear Reader! If you hold this opus in your hooves, that means that
      you have decided to take the first step in mastering the subtle art of foul
      language. The ability to swear firmly and ornately is actually an important
      and essential part of intelligent speech, and there is absolutely nothing shameful
      in it if used properly. In most cases, simply adding a dirty word to your speech
      is not enough to impress audience and fully express your feelings, and many
      improve their skills of conveying emotions colorfully throughout entire life.
      Sadly, our dictionary will unlikely be enough to raise you to the level of
      real maestros of this art, because the truly masterful swearing should come
      intuitively and from your very heart. But thanks to this book, you can definitely
      get a starting point that will guide you in further improving your talents
      in this field
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435354
    m_Localized: Potion of transformation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435355
    m_Localized: Turns you into a small animal for a short time. This potion is so
      powerful that it`s enough to take just the smallest sip, hence you can use
      it many times
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
