      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435446
    m_Localized: Terminal for electric fence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435447
    m_Localized: Stable exit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435448
    m_Localized: Stable entrance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435449
    m_Localized: Tomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435454
    m_Localized: Telekinesis
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435455
    m_Localized: The "Telekinesis" skill determines your ability to move various
      objects with magic, and can also serve as a support for a jump in the air.
      [br]- With every skill point invested, the magical power consumption for telekinesis
      and "Double Jump" decreases. [br]- With each skill level your telekinetic power
      increase, in particular, you can lift heavier items, and it will be harder
      for enemies to escape from your telekinetic grip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435456
    m_Localized: Melee weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435457
    m_Localized: Skill "Melee weapons" determines combat effectiveness with any melee
      weapon. [br]- Each invested skill point increases damage by #1.[br]- Each skill
      level allows using more advanced weapons. Insufficient skill level decreases
      attack speed and increases action points consumption in S.A.T.S.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435458
    m_Localized: Firearms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435459
    m_Localized: Skill "Firearms" determines your ability to handle pistols, rifles,
      shotguns and, a minigun. [br]- Each invested skill point increases damage and
      accuracy of these weapons by #1.[br]- Each skill level allows using more advanced
      weapons. Insufficient skill level will make you miss more often
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435460
    m_Localized: Energy weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435461
    m_Localized: Skill "Energy weapons" determines your ability to handle different
      laser, plasma or pulse weapons and a flamethrower. [br]- Each invested skill
      point increases damage and accuracy of these weapons by #1.[br]- Each skill
      level allows using more advanced weapons. Insufficient skill level will make
      you miss more often
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435462
    m_Localized: Explosives
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435463
    m_Localized: Skill "Explosives" determines your ability to work with everything
      that is capable of exploding. [br]- Each invested skill point increases the
      damage of your explosives by #1, also increases throwing distance for grenades.[br]-
      Each skill level allows using and creating more advanced explosives, improves
      success rate at defusing and helps you detect enemy mines from a longer distance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435464
    m_Localized: Magic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435465
    m_Localized: Skill "Magic" determines your knowledge of magical arts, directly
      affecting power of your spells, both offensive and defensive. [br]- Each invested
      skill point increases damage of your offensive spells by #1, and defensive
      - by #2.[br]- Each skill level decreases cooldown time for all spells
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435466
    m_Localized: Repair
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435467
    m_Localized: Skill "Repair" helps you keep your weapons and armor in good condition,
      and using mechanisms of all sorts. [br]- Each invested skill point increases
      the effectiveness of repairs by #1 (with base value of #2) and increases damage
      for the crafted weapon by #3.[br]- Each skill level enables you creating advanced
      weapons, also repairing or shutting down more complex mechanisms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435468
    m_Localized: Medicine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435469
    m_Localized: Skill "Medicine" directly affects your health and ability to heal
      yourself without medic`s help. [br]- Each invested skill point increases the
      effectiveness of healing potions and other medication by #1 (with base value
      of #2).[br]- Each skill level increases your maximal health and enables you
      to operate special medical instrumentation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435470
    m_Localized: Lockpicking
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435471
    m_Localized: Skill "Lockpicking" allows you to open mechanical locks. [br]- Each
      invested skill point increases probability to open a lock and decreases chance
      of jamming. [br]- Each skill level allows you to pick locks of more sophisticated
      design
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435472
    m_Localized: Science
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435473
    m_Localized: Skill "Science" represents your knowledge in different scientific
      fields, particularly those about electronics and information technology. [br]-
      Each invested skill point increases the chance of successful hacking of electronic
      locks and protected terminals.[br]- Each skill level enables you breaking through
      more advanced defense systems, and using additional PipBuck features by applying
      special extension modules
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435474
    m_Localized: Sneak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435475
    m_Localized: The "Sneak" skill allows you to move unnoticed by enemies or to
      attack them from ambush, suddenly and deadly. [br]- Each invested skill point
      makes you harder to be noticed or heard. [br]- With each skill level a chance
      to deal critical damage to an enemy who hasn`t seen you is increased by #1.
      It also helps you to shut down alarm systems
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435476
    m_Localized: Barter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435477
    m_Localized: Skill "Barter" helps you to negotiate with all sorts of merchants
      in the Wasteland to get better goods and services for a lower price. [br]-
      Each invested skill point decreases prices for purchasing and repairs by #1.
      [br]- Each skill level expands the selection of merchants` goods and allows
      you to access some exclusive deals, that can`t be found anywhere else
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435478
    m_Localized: Survival
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435479
    m_Localized: This skill represents ancient knowledge almost forgotten by ponies
      but mastered and perfected by zebras. With this knowledge, you will survive
      where others would perish. [br]- Each invested skill point increases your resistance
      to any damage by #1.[br]- Each skill level increases your damage threshold
      by #2 and enables you to prepare magical potions by zebras` recipes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435480
    m_Localized: Attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435481
    m_Localized: With each level of this skill the damage of any weapon is increased
      by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435482
    m_Localized: Defense
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435483
    m_Localized: With each level your resistance to any damage increases by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435484
    m_Localized: Knowledge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435485
    m_Localized: With each level of this skill, you gain an additional ability for
      each level up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435486
    m_Localized: Alicorn Armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435487
    m_Localized: Rainbow wings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435488
    m_Localized: Alicorn Armor is equipped with magical wings that allow flying.
      You can accelerate in flight by holding the @1 key (consumes magic). The "Telekinesis"
      skill level determines maximum flight speed, as well as the magic consumption
      rate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435489
    m_Localized: Titanium armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435490
    m_Localized: The outer shell of Alicorn Armor is made of magically reinforced
      titanium alloy plates. Your damage threshold increases depending on the "Repair"
      skill level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435491
    m_Localized: Healing power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435492
    m_Localized: The Alicorn Armor`s medical systems constantly restore health of
      the wearer. The health recovery rate depends on the level of the "Medicine"
      skill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435493
    m_Localized: "Light speed\u200B"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435494
    m_Localized: The Alicorn Armor has a built-in instant teleportation spell. You
      can use instant teleportation using the @1 key, the magic consumption rate
      depends on the "Lockpick" skill level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435495
    m_Localized: Void shield
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435496
    m_Localized: The Alicorn Armor is equipped with a powerful shield generator.
      You can activate the magical shield by pressing @1 key. The strength of the
      shield depends on the "Science" skill level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435497
    m_Localized: Shadow veil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435498
    m_Localized: The holographic systems of the Alicorn Armor obscures enemies` targeting,
      preventing them from hitting you. Additional dodging bonus depend on the "Sneak"
      skill level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435499
    m_Localized: Active defense
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435500
    m_Localized: The inner lining of the Alicorn Armor is made of the "smart" plastic
      that is normally elastic but instantly hardens when damaged. Resistance to
      any external damage depends on the "Barter" skill level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435501
    m_Localized: Self-levitation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435502
    m_Localized: 'You can levitate yourself using magical power. To do this, press
      and hold @1 while being in the air. Press the @2@3@4@5 movement keys to move
      sideways, down or up. Moving upwards consumes more magical power.

      At
      the second level of this ability the consumption of magic will decrease, and
      the time and range of flight increase'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435503
    m_Localized: Jumper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435504
    m_Localized: '"It`s not very far, just move your little rump. You can make it
      if you try with a hop, skip and jump!" Now you can jump half a meter higher!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435505
    m_Localized: Light step
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435506
    m_Localized: You are always watchful and careful. You never activate a trap or
      a pressure plate, and enemy mines are triggered with a delay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435507
    m_Localized: Explosions fan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435508
    m_Localized: Even though you like to explode stuff, you don`t forget about safety.
      Any explosion causes you less damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435509
    m_Localized: Fire resistance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435510
    m_Localized: Fire inflicts less damage to you. Also decreases a chance for you
      to be set on fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435513
    m_Localized: Bullet Dodger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435514
    m_Localized: Enemies will have a hard time trying to hit you. Your evasion bonus
      increased
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435515
    m_Localized: Iron skin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435516
    m_Localized: Trainings with melee weapons gave great results. Now you are harder
      to get wounded with sharp items. Resistance to cutting damage increased
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435517
    m_Localized: Stone wall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435518
    m_Localized: You got so used to being hit with heavy stuff, now it just tickles.
      Resistance to blunt weapons increased
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435519
    m_Localized: Armored hide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435520
    m_Localized: You lost count of bullets being shot at you. This made you tougher,
      your bullet resistance is permanently increased
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435521
    m_Localized: Size matters
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435522
    m_Localized: You are a fan of veery big guns! You got so used to them that you
      barely notice their weight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435523
    m_Localized: Quick reload
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435524
    m_Localized: You reload weapons twice quicker than before. It is a great advantage
      - less chance to get killed while you desperately try to reload
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435525
    m_Localized: Treasure hunter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435526
    m_Localized: You have a habit of searching through every trash can on your way,
      hence you always find more caps and pre-war bits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435527
    m_Localized: Infiltrator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435528
    m_Localized: You learned to be more careful when picking locks. In case of failure,
      pin break twice less often, and lock is damaged #1 less
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435529
    m_Localized: Cool hacker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435530
    m_Localized: You are such a cool hacker, that even security systems provide you
      with additional attempts for picking a password (#1 instead of #2)!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435531
    m_Localized: Rapid metabolism
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435532
    m_Localized: Your body adsorbs and converts chemicals much faster than average,
      therefore healing potions become #1 more effective and restore health #2 times
      faster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435533
    m_Localized: Action pony
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435534
    m_Localized: You never stay put, always rushing somewhere. You get #1 action
      points extra (to #2 initial points) in S.A.T.S. for every level of this ability
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435535
    m_Localized: Entomologist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435536
    m_Localized: You always showed interest to insects, spiders, and other arthropods,
      and you learned their weaknesses. You cause #1 more damage to radscorpions,
      radroaches, bloatsprites and similar creatures
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435537
    m_Localized: Military anatomy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435538
    m_Localized: You know pony anatomy so well, that you always aim at vital organs.
      You cause #1 more damage to raiders and other equine enemies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435539
    m_Localized: Applied robotics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435540
    m_Localized: You know schematics for any robot by heart, and always aim at their
      weak points. You cause #1 more damage to robots and turrets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435541
    m_Localized: Purifier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435542
    m_Localized: You believe that the Wasteland must be cleansed of monsters and
      mutated beasts. You cause #1 more damage to feral ghouls and mutants
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435543
    m_Localized: Run and Gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435544
    m_Localized: You have learned to shoot accurately even while running or from
      an unsteady position. The accuracy penalty for shooting while running is reduced
      to #1 (with base penalty value #2), and the penalty for shooting while jumping
      or while climbing stairs has been reduced to #3 (base penalty value #4). Does
      not affect shooting with S.A.T.S.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435545
    m_Localized: Cold blooded
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435546
    m_Localized: You keep calm during a fight and prefer systematic shooting or a
      tactical retreat to rushing headlong into battle. Accuracy bonus when firing
      while standing still is increased to #1 (#2 by default), and accuracy loss
      from shooting behind your back is decreased tp #3 (#4 by default). Only affects
      shooting without using S.A.T.S.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435547
    m_Localized: Math logic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435548
    m_Localized: You calibrated your PipBuck so that now any attack in S.A.T.S. consumes
      #1 less action points, and on the second level of ability - #2 less
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435549
    m_Localized: Soldier`s luck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435550
    m_Localized: Good luck always follows you on a battlefield. Your critical damage
      chance is increased by #1 for every level of this perk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435551
    m_Localized: Deadly criticals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435552
    m_Localized: When you get lucky on a battlefield, your enemy can sure feel the
      difference! You get +#1 to critical damage with any weapon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435553
    m_Localized: Duelist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435554
    m_Localized: You are not a fan of big and heavy weapons. Your choice - pistols
      and revolvers, and you sure know how to use them. All your handguns (including
      automatic) get accuracy bonus, and they consume #1 less action points in S.A.T.S.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435555
    m_Localized: Crazy farmer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435556
    m_Localized: Your favorite weapon - a shotgun, with that you are ready to protect
      yourself and your property either from raiders, bandits or a darn army of dragons!
      All your shotguns get armor piercing and increased knockback effects
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435557
    m_Localized: Commando
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435558
    m_Localized: You are absolutely sure that there is no weapon better than an assault
      rifle. And you sure know how to get the best from it. Your assault rifles and
      a minigun cause more damage by 2 points per each bullet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435559
    m_Localized: One shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435560
    m_Localized: You are a great shooter, for whom every bullet counts. All your
      hunting and sniper rifles get a critical hit bonus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435561
    m_Localized: Laser show
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435562
    m_Localized: Laser weapons are your favorites. You know how to handle it so that
      it causes 15% more damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435563
    m_Localized: Plasma greetings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435564
    m_Localized: You love to turn enemies into puddles of slime with plasma weapons.
      You even learned to deal with its drawbacks, so that now your plasma weapons
      are more accurate, and plasma reaches target #1 faster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435565
    m_Localized: Pyromaniac
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435566
    m_Localized: You love to set things on fire since you were little, your favorite
      smell is of petroleum, and your favorite hobby - watch enemies turn into ashes.
      Any weapon causing fire damage (including grenades) becomes more powerful
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435567
    m_Localized: Disintegration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435568
    m_Localized: All your laser and plasma weapons get a #1 chance to disintegrate
      target - that is to completely annihilate it with a single shot (the weapon
      becomes about #2 cooler), providing that the target has no more health left
      than 10 times the weapon`s damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435569
    m_Localized: Weapon maintenance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435570
    m_Localized: You always clean and oil your weapons, and in return they never
      let you down in a critical moment. A probability that a worn weapon misfires
      is decreased #1 times, even though its damage and accuracy still decrease
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435571
    m_Localized: Adaptive metabolism
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435572
    m_Localized: Surprisingly, you adapted well to life in the toxic and irradiated
      Wasteland. You get a bonus to radiation resistance, and also to resistance
      against toxic and corrosive substances
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435573
    m_Localized: Roamer of the wild plains
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435574
    m_Localized: You learned to survive among wild animals and monsters. You get
      a bonus to protection against bites and scratches, stings and spikes and so
      on, and suffer less from wounds and poisoning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435575
    m_Localized: Armor enhancement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435576
    m_Localized: You know how to improve your armor and make it fit perfectly, thus
      increasing its battle qualities. To do this you require workbench and proper
      materials. The second level of this perk allows you to further enhance your
      armor for one more time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435577
    m_Localized: Master of telekinesis
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435578
    m_Localized: The range of your telekinetic grasp is increased. Also, now you
      can lift and perform other telekinetic actions with objects that are out of
      your sight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435579
    m_Localized: Scavenger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435580
    m_Localized: You throw nothing away. To that extent, that it is hard to enter
      your room without breaking legs. On the other hoof, you get additional weapon
      fragments each time you find a weapon that you already have, and also find
      more useful (in your personal opinion) garbage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435581
    m_Localized: Grenader
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435582
    m_Localized: You learned to supply all grenades with an advanced sensor, so that
      now they explode right after hitting an enemy! (To use ordinary grenades, hold
      @1 when throwing)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435583
    m_Localized: Piercing strike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435584
    m_Localized: Any armor has weak spots and you know it very well. Any stubbing-cutting
      weapon (like knives, swords, axes and spears) gets additional armor-piercing
      effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435585
    m_Localized: Stunning strike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435586
    m_Localized: Any blunt weapon (like a bat, a crowbar or a sledgehammer) gets
      a chance to stun enemy for #1 seconds. Its knockback effect is also increased
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435587
    m_Localized: Zero point magical field manipulator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435588
    m_Localized: Not only you are able to move objects with telekinesis, but also
      you can make them plummet through the air! To do that, press @1 when levitating
      an object. You can try to hit an enemy with a heady box or smash him against
      a wall. The second level of this perk allows you to throw objects even faster
      and further. Keep in mind - pushing heavy objects rapidly burns your magical
      power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435589
    m_Localized: Teleportation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435590
    m_Localized: You receive an ability to instantly move between places. To use
      it press and hold @1 while the spell charges, then release to perform teleportation.
      To cancel already charged spell press @2. You must see the point of arrival.
      Consumes quite a lot of magical energy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435591
    m_Localized: Alchemist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435592
    m_Localized: Countless hours spent with a cauldron, a retort, and a boiling cube
      brought their fruits! Now, when making potions, you receive two bottles of
      potion instead of one, consuming the same amount of ingredients. Does not work
      on permanent effect potions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435593
    m_Localized: Mighty kick
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435594
    m_Localized: Damage from your bare-hoof kicks is increased by #1. Now you can
      break sturdy and reinforced doors with your hind legs and stun enemies for
      a short period of time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435595
    m_Localized: Child of radiation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435596
    m_Localized: Radiation does not kill you, but only makes you stronger. The higher
      your radiation level, the fewer injuries you get. Also, radiation can not reduce
      your health by more than 80%
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435597
    m_Localized: Security expert
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435598
    m_Localized: You understand automatic security systems like none other. From
      any terminal controlling the turrets, you can not just simply turn them off,
      but reconfigure them so that they begin attacking your opponents. Meanwhile,
      you get all experience from the turret`s kills
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435599
    m_Localized: Danger zone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435600
    m_Localized: The blast radius for any explosives you use increases by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435601
    m_Localized: Expert sapper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435602
    m_Localized: When it comes to mines and minefields, you have no equal. The mines
      you install are #1 more powerful, and in addition, your mines do not detonate
      from nearby explosions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435603
    m_Localized: Melee master
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435604
    m_Localized: You have mastered the cold steel to perfections. The attack speed
      of any melee weapon (except chainsaw and similar) is increased by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435605
    m_Localized: Battle mage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435606
    m_Localized: You are so used to using attack magic in battles, that it almost
      does not tire you. With each level of this ability, you spend less magical
      energy on combat spells
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435607
    m_Localized: Friendly Fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435608
    m_Localized: You always know how to throw a grenade or shoot a grenade launcher
      so that you are not personally affected by the explosion. With this ability,
      you receive only 25% of the damage from your own explosives, including its
      special varieties
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435609
    m_Localized: Long-term effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435610
    m_Localized: Your medical knowledge helps you use combat chemistry properly.
      Now it works for you #1 times longer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435611
    m_Localized: Combat stimulators
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435612
    m_Localized: You have studied medicine well and you know how to turn yourself
      into a death machine with help of the chemicals. Effects from substances such
      as Mint-als, Buck, Dash, Rage, Med-X, are amplified. At the same time, the
      chances of getting addicted to them are reduced #1 times
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435613
    m_Localized: Wastelands economics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435614
    m_Localized: Your talents as an economist contribute to the development of trade.
      All traders start importing more ammunition, medicine and other popular goods.
      Also, a traveling trader with rare goods begins visiting the "Prancing Pony"
      camp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435615
    m_Localized: Empathy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435616
    m_Localized: A special psychological connection with your companion gives him
      new strength. With each level of this ability, the defense and attack of your
      companion significantly increases
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435617
    m_Localized: Stamina
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435618
    m_Localized: Life in the harsh conditions of the wasteland increased your endurance.
      Now in combat you can run and jump longer without experiencing fatigue. Stamina
      consumption for running and jumping during battle is reduced by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435619
    m_Localized: Hard grip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435620
    m_Localized: You learned to hold the weapon with telekinesis so that there is
      less impact from recoil. Now you can sustain burst fire longer without fear
      of losing a target. This also increases the accuracy of assault rifles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435621
    m_Localized: Perforator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435622
    m_Localized: Let`s make some holes in `em! Your heavy machine guns receive additional
      armor-piercing properties, and their bullet spread is decreased #1 times
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435623
    m_Localized: Dielectric
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435624
    m_Localized: Due to some features of your organism, electricity and lightning
      cause you 20% less damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435625
    m_Localized: Recycling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435626
    m_Localized: You optimized all your weapons that use various batteries to consume
      less energy. With a #1 probability each shot from such a weapon will be free
      of charge, that is, it will not consume the battery charge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435627
    m_Localized: Scrounger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435628
    m_Localized: You are always a little more lucky than other hunters for valuable
      junk. You will find more cartridges and explosives in containers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435629
    m_Localized: Reliable armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435630
    m_Localized: Due to the fact that you always carefully look after your armor,
      it serves you #1 longer. That allows saving considerably on its repair
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435631
    m_Localized: Double jump
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435632
    m_Localized: With help of your telekinesis, you can jump once in mid-air. The
      height of this second jump depends on the skill level of "Telekinesis"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435450
    m_Localized: ERS User
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435451
    m_Localized: You almost died, but got saved by MAS Emergency Rescue System
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435452
    m_Localized: Lifegiver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435453
    m_Localized: Your health became stronger! (+#1 per ability level)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435637
    m_Localized: Mighty spirit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435638
    m_Localized: Your magical power reserve is increased! (+#1 per ability level)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435639
    m_Localized: Diamond skeleton
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435640
    m_Localized: Zebra potion fortified your bones. Now you get #1 fewer injuries
      with each level of this ability
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435641
    m_Localized: Strong immunity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435642
    m_Localized: Zebra potion improved natural defense systems of your body. You
      get +#1 resistance to poisoning, bleeding and radiation for each level of this
      ability
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435643
    m_Localized: Might of Earth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435644
    m_Localized: Zebra potion improved your reflexes and increased aggression. You
      deal #1 more melee damage for each level of this ability
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435645
    m_Localized: Wind walk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435646
    m_Localized: Zebra potion strengthened your muscles and increased stamina capacity.
      You receive +#1 to running speed and fatigue resistance for each level of this
      ability
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435647
    m_Localized: Hawk eye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435648
    m_Localized: Zebra potion augmented your nervous system and sharpened your sight.
      It increases shooting accuracy #1 per each level of this ability
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435649
    m_Localized: Intuition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435650
    m_Localized: Zebra potion strengthened your intuition. You gain +#1 to evasion
      bonus for each level of this ability
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435651
    m_Localized: Critical luck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435652
    m_Localized: Zebra potion enhanced your luck. You gain +#1 to chance of critical
      hit for each level of this ability
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435653
    m_Localized: Ardent spirit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435654
    m_Localized: A magical potion strengthened the connection between you and the
      elemental forces of nature. Your attack spells power is increased by #1 for
      each level of this ability
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435655
    m_Localized: Zombie Exterminator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435656
    m_Localized: You`ve learned a lot about the anatomy of ghouls, and therefore
      inflict them #1 more damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435657
    m_Localized: Enemy of the Unity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435658
    m_Localized: You learned something special about fighting with alicorns. Now
      you deal them #1 more damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435659
    m_Localized: Expanded mind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435660
    m_Localized: You can memorize more spells
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435661
    m_Localized: Burning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435662
    m_Localized: You`re burning! You need to jump into water to stop it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435663
    m_Localized: Aahh, fire! I`m burning, burning!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435664
    m_Localized: Chemical burn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435665
    m_Localized: You got splashed with some corrosive substance, and now it corrupts
      your armor and burns your hide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435666
    m_Localized: Ah! This stuff burns!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435667
    m_Localized: Stealth mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435668
    m_Localized: You are in stealth-mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435669
    m_Localized: Stealth-Buck activated
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435670
    m_Localized: Stealth mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435671
    m_Localized: You are in stealth-mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435672
    m_Localized: Stealth armor camouflage system activated
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435673
    m_Localized: Disorientation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435674
    m_Localized: The concepts "right" and "left" for you temporarily changed places
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435675
    m_Localized: You fell under the telepathic attack!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435676
    m_Localized: Panic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435677
    m_Localized: You can`t control yourself and try to flee to someplace else
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435678
    m_Localized: You fell under the telepathic attack!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435679
    m_Localized: Voices in your head
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435680
    m_Localized: These voices in your head do not stop... and they order you to kill!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435681
    m_Localized: You fell under the telepathic attack!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435682
    m_Localized: Frozen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435683
    m_Localized: Frozen creatures are vulnerable to bullets, strikes and explosions,
      and their speed decreases by #1. Their fire resistance, on the other hoof,
      is increased
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435684
    m_Localized: Blind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435685
    m_Localized: It became almost impossible to aim properly. Accuracy reduced by
      #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435686
    m_Localized: Right in the eye!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435687
    m_Localized: Contusion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435688
    m_Localized: You were hit hard by a blast wave. You have reduced speed (-#1),
      accuracy (-#2) and melee attack speed (-#3), and increased magic energy consumption
      by #4
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435689
    m_Localized: You got a concussion!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435690
    m_Localized: Soaking wet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435691
    m_Localized: You recently swum or got into a heavy rain. In any case, your fire
      resistance is temporarily increased, but resistance to frost and electricity
      is decreased
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435692
    m_Localized: Distortion field
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435693
    m_Localized: The movement of all nearby enemies is slowed down
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435694
    m_Localized: Reanimation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435695
    m_Localized: Reanimation module has recently been used and now is recharging
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435696
    m_Localized: Antidote effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435697
    m_Localized: You have recently taken an antidote, your resistance to poisons
      is temporarily increased by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435698
    m_Localized: Rad-X effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435699
    m_Localized: Radiation resistance increased by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435700
    m_Localized: Mint-als effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435701
    m_Localized: Your intelligence, sight and hearing are improved, and with them
      - ability to pick locks (+#1), hack terminals (+#2) and use explosives (+#3)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435702
    m_Localized: Party-Time Mint-als effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435703
    m_Localized: Your intelligence, sight and hearing are improved, and with them
      - ability to pick locks (+#1), hack terminals (+#2) and use explosives (+#3)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435704
    m_Localized: Mint-als after effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435705
    m_Localized: You`ve got post Mint-als after effects, meaning that you temporarily
      got dumber, with hearing and sight impaired. You lockpicking decreased by #1
      and hacking decreased by #2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435706
    m_Localized: Mint-als addiction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435707
    m_Localized: When you are not under the influence of mint-als, you completely
      lose the sharpness of perception and clarity of thinking, and with them the
      ability to break locks (-#1) and hack terminals (-#2)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435708
    m_Localized: Dash effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435709
    m_Localized: Your speed and jump height are increased by #1 and #2 action points
      were added
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435710
    m_Localized: Ultra-dash effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435711
    m_Localized: Your speed and jump height are greatly increased (+#1) and #2 action
      points were added
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435712
    m_Localized: Dash after effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435713
    m_Localized: You`re slow as hay!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435714
    m_Localized: Dash addiction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435715
    m_Localized: You are so used to Dash that without it you crawl like a snail.
      You lose #2 action points, and your speed is reduced by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435716
    m_Localized: Rage effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435717
    m_Localized: You are in a chemical rage state. Damage by any weapon in increased
      by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435718
    m_Localized: Rage after effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435719
    m_Localized: A feeling of deep apathy took over, you don`t want to fight anymore.
      Damage by any weapon in decreased by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435720
    m_Localized: Rage addiction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435721
    m_Localized: Your abuse of Rage has led to the fact that without it you can no
      longer normally fight. Damage from any of your attacks is reduced by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435722
    m_Localized: Med-X effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435723
    m_Localized: You are temporarily mute to pain, any damage to you is decreased
      by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435724
    m_Localized: Med-X after effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435725
    m_Localized: After pain-killer effect wears off, you feel pain much sharper than
      before
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435726
    m_Localized: Med-X addiction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435727
    m_Localized: Your addiction to Med-X-y made your sensitivity to pain increase.
      Any damage you get is increased by #1 for each level of addiction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435728
    m_Localized: Buck effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435729
    m_Localized: Your strength and endurance are temporarily increased. Health increased
      by #1, stamina consumption for running decreased by #2, damage threshold +#3,
      kick strength +#4
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435730
    m_Localized: Buck after effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435731
    m_Localized: You feel overwhelming weakness and sleepiness. Health decreased
      by #1, stamina consumption for running increased by #2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435732
    m_Localized: Buck addiction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435733
    m_Localized: When you are not under the influence of Buck, your health is decreased
      by #1. Also, running takes #2 more stamina
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435734
    m_Localized: Stampede effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435735
    m_Localized: You are temporarily mute to pain, your damage resistance is increased
      by #2, and the damage of any of your weapons is increased by #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435736
    m_Localized: Stampede after effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435737
    m_Localized: You have a deep depression, and everything hurts. The damage of
      any weapon is reduced by #1, and your resistance to damage is reduced by #2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435738
    m_Localized: Stampede addiction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435739
    m_Localized: Without a regular dose of Stampede, you are in a constant depression.
      The damage of any weapon is reduced by #1, and your resistance to damage is
      reduced by #2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435740
    m_Localized: Regeneration boost
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435741
    m_Localized: Your health is being restored, and traumas and internal injuries
      are being magically mended
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435742
    m_Localized: Hydra after effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435743
    m_Localized: While your organism recovers after shock caused by Hydra, healing
      potions have #1 effectiveness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435744
    m_Localized: Potion of flight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435745
    m_Localized: You can fly!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435746
    m_Localized: Potion of shadows
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435747
    m_Localized: You became a shadow. Enemies can not hurt you, but you can`t fight
      as well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435748
    m_Localized: Wizardry potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435749
    m_Localized: Reduced consumption and faster recovery of magical energy by #1,
      and increased spell power by #2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435750
    m_Localized: Infra-vision potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435751
    m_Localized: Your sight is magically augmented
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435752
    m_Localized: Diver`s potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435753
    m_Localized: You can breathe underwater and swim faster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435754
    m_Localized: Pink potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435755
    m_Localized: Resistance to the Pink Cloud in all its forms is increased
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435756
    m_Localized: Potion of the Last Chance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435757
    m_Localized: Allows you once to avoid death
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435758
    m_Localized: Absolute protection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435759
    m_Localized: No external influence can cause you any damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435760
    m_Localized: Transformation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435761
    m_Localized: You have become a desman. In this form you are able to climb into
      very narrow passages. To return to your original form press @1. Attention!
      Make sure there is enough space!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435762
    m_Localized: Curse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435763
    m_Localized: You`ve been touched by dark and powerful magic. Healing potions
      will not heal you until the curse is lifted. Pay a visit to the nearest practicing
      magician
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435764
    m_Localized: You`ve been cursed!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435765
    m_Localized: Stupor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435766
    m_Localized: Your speed and jumping height are significantly reduced, and you
      are completely deprived of stamina
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435767
    m_Localized: Curse of stupor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435768
    m_Localized: Weakness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435769
    m_Localized: Your magic has temporarily weakened, therefore your accuracy, damage
      from melee weapons and magic decreased, as well as strength of the telekinetic
      throw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435770
    m_Localized: Curse of weakness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435771
    m_Localized: Sacrifice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435772
    m_Localized: The moment this effect wears off you will receive damage equal to
      #1 of your maximum health
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435773
    m_Localized: The curse of the sacrifice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435774
    m_Localized: Pain connection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435775
    m_Localized: You receive #1 of the damage you deal to enemies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435776
    m_Localized: Curse of pain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435777
    m_Localized: Shackles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435778
    m_Localized: The magical chain binds you to the point where you were at the moment
      the curse was cast, and does not allow you to leave it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435779
    m_Localized: Curse of shackles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435780
    m_Localized: Poisoning by the Pink Cloud
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435781
    m_Localized: The toxin of the Pink Cloud got into your blood and now slowly kills
      you from inside
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435782
    m_Localized: Pink Cloud poisoning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435783
    m_Localized: Anti-life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435784
    m_Localized: Healing potions have no effect on you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435785
    m_Localized: Curse of anti-life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435786
    m_Localized: Blood shield
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435787
    m_Localized: Complete invulnerability to any external damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435788
    m_Localized: Head injuries
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435789
    m_Localized: Accuracy reduced by #1, melee attack speed reduced by #2, magic
      consumption increased by #3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435790
    m_Localized: Body injuries
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435791
    m_Localized: Maximum health reduced by #1, stamina recovery reduced by #3, stamina
      consumption for running and jumping increased by #2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435792
    m_Localized: Leg injuries
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435793
    m_Localized: Running speed reduced by #1, walking speed reduced by #2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435794
    m_Localized: Blood loss
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435795
    m_Localized: Resistance to any external damage reduced by #1, damage of your
      weapons reduced by #2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435796
    m_Localized: Magical exhaustion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435797
    m_Localized: Maximum weight you can lift by telekinesis is reduced by #1, combat
      spells damage reduced by #2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435798
    m_Localized: No armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435799
    m_Localized: Drunkenness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435800
    m_Localized: "You got a serious doze of alcohol. Your protection and damage from
      melee weapons are increased, but accuracy and reaction are impaired, and magic
      consumption increased. \nDamage resistance #1, melee damage #2, accuracy #3,
      evasion bonus #4, magic consumption #5"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435801
    m_Localized: Caffeine effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435802
    m_Localized: Thanks to the stimulating effect of coffee, your ability to open
      locks (+#1) and hack terminals (+#2) has been increased
    m_Metadata:
