  - m_Id: 2729435838
    m_Localized: '[Empalu] - concept, programming, graphics.

      [DipFanken] -
      graphics, locations design.

      [Mihasik] - English localization.

      [Apple_Snack],
      [GreyGazer], [Shadow_Of_History] - participation in development.

      The
      game is based on the "Fallout: Equestria" story by [kkat].

      This game
      is a non-commercial project and is distributed free of charge.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435839
    m_Localized: 'Music:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
