  - m_Id: 2729435985
    m_Localized: Difficulty level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435986
    m_Localized: Health
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435987
    m_Localized: Your general health state. Defines how much damage you can take
      before you lose consciousness and get transferred to a check-point
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435988
    m_Localized: Radiation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435989
    m_Localized: Magical radiation sickness decreases your health level. Take RadAway
      to clear your body off radiation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435990
    m_Localized: Poison
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435991
    m_Localized: Amount of poison in your body. You will lose health points until
      you take an antidote or until poison effect wears off with time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435992
    m_Localized: Open wounds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435993
    m_Localized: Open wounds make you gradually lose blood. Even though bleeding
      will stop eventually, it`s better to use bandages
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435994
    m_Localized: Body condition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435995
    m_Localized: Shows your internal injuries, separately for the head, body, and
      limbs. They are difficult to heal in the field, just using medical potions
      is not enough. You will need the help of a qualified medic or skills in medicine
      and special equipment. Head injuries cause penalties for accuracy, attack speed
      and magic, body injuries reduce endurance, and leg injuries - movement speed.
      Serious blood loss also affects your ability to cause damage and resist pain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435996
    m_Localized: Head
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435997
    m_Localized: 'Condition: perfect'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435998
    m_Localized: Absolutely alright
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729435999
    m_Localized: 'Condition: OK'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436000
    m_Localized: 'Diagnosis: a bloody lump, an ear scratch, and a black eye - nothing
      to worry about'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436001
    m_Localized: 'Condition: poor'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436002
    m_Localized: 'Diagnosis: a mild traumatic brain injury. May cause headaches,
      dizziness, and nausea. With such a trauma it`s hard to think straight, use
      magic or aim weapons. Consult your doctor at the first opportunity'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436003
    m_Localized: 'Condition: horrible'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436004
    m_Localized: 'Diagnosis: a severe skull and brain injury. Sight and hearing are
      impaired. Possible memory loss, hallucinations, inadequate reaction to external
      stimuli. The magic limit decreased. A life threatening condition, visit a doctor
      as soon as possible'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436005
    m_Localized: Body
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436006
    m_Localized: 'Condition: perfect'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436007
    m_Localized: Your body is ready
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436008
    m_Localized: 'Condition: OK'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436009
    m_Localized: 'Diagnosis: a couple of bruises, burns, and cuts. Please, be more
      careful'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436010
    m_Localized: 'Condition: poor'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436011
    m_Localized: 'Diagnosis: one or more ribs are broken, some inner organs are slightly
      damaged. May decrease stamina, cause dyspnea, painful breathing. A good rest
      in bed is recommended'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436012
    m_Localized: 'Condition: horrible'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436013
    m_Localized: 'Diagnosis: multiple rib fractures, multiple internal injuries,
      backbone damage suspected. Danger of heart failure. A life threatening condition,
      immediate hospitalization is required'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436014
    m_Localized: Legs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436015
    m_Localized: 'Condition: perfect'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436016
    m_Localized: Nothing hurts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436017
    m_Localized: 'Condition: OK'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436018
    m_Localized: 'Diagnosis: a sprained ankle. Don`t step on this leg at least for
      a week'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436019
    m_Localized: 'Condition: poor'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436020
    m_Localized: 'Diagnosis: at least one leg is broken, others have multiple minor
      injuries. You can not run and jump as usual in this condition. It is highly
      recommended mending the fractured bone, fix the broken leg and avoid any physical
      activities'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436021
    m_Localized: 'Condition: horrible'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436022
    m_Localized: 'Diagnosis: multiple open fractures, ankle ligament rupture, a knee
      shot. It is surprising that you can move at all in this condition. Immediately
      contact the nearest Ministry of Peace office'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436023
    m_Localized: Blood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436024
    m_Localized: 'Condition: perfect'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436025
    m_Localized: You are full of strength
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436026
    m_Localized: 'Condition: OK'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436027
    m_Localized: 'Diagnosis: you lost some blood, but that`s OK. A good rest and
      well nourishment will bring you back to normal'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436028
    m_Localized: 'Condition: poor'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436029
    m_Localized: 'Diagnosis: you suffer from severe blood loss. Possible sudden muscle
      weakness, dizziness, loss of consciousness. Donor or synthetic blood transfusion
      is recommended'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436030
    m_Localized: 'Condition: horrible'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436031
    m_Localized: 'Diagnosis: you are dying from blood loss. Immediately take the
      necessary actions before it`s too late'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436032
    m_Localized: Magical power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436033
    m_Localized: 'Condition: perfect'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436034
    m_Localized: You have maximum magical power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436035
    m_Localized: 'Condition: OK'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436036
    m_Localized: You are tired a little, but your magical power is still ok
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436037
    m_Localized: 'Condition: poor'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436038
    m_Localized: Your magical power requires restoration. Spells and telekinesis
      may be somewhat weaker than usual
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436039
    m_Localized: 'Condition: horrible'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436040
    m_Localized: Your magical power is on the verge of complete exhaustion. Spells
      and telekinesis are considerably weakened. It is strongly advised to have some
      rest, perform restorative procedures and at all cost avoid using complex spells
      in this condition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436041
    m_Localized: 'Condition: burnout'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436042
    m_Localized: Your magical power is depleted. You can hardly even lift small objects,
      not to mention any spells
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436043
    m_Localized: no addiction yet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436044
    m_Localized: 1st level - weak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436045
    m_Localized: 2nd level - medium
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436046
    m_Localized: 3rd level - strong
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436047
    m_Localized: Slightly dizzy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436048
    m_Localized: Drunk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436049
    m_Localized: Wasted from alcohol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436050
    m_Localized: Alcohol intoxication
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436051
    m_Localized: Alcohol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436052
    m_Localized: HP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436053
    m_Localized: Damage threshold
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436054
    m_Localized: This value is subtracted from any damage you take (except from prolonged
      effects - for example, it doesn`t reduce damage from burning, bleeding, or
      poisoning)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436055
    m_Localized: Armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436056
    m_Localized: The amount of physical damage you take is reduced by the armor level
      value, that is if bullet or melee weapon hit your armor. Affects only physical
      damage such as from bullets, melee weapons, blast damage etc. It depends on
      type and condition of the armor you wear. If condition drops below 50%, protection
      decreases
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436057
    m_Localized: Magic protection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436058
    m_Localized: This value is subtracted from magical energy damage, if magical
      beam or projectile hit armor. Affects only magical damage such as fire, laser,
      plasma, lightning, or frost. Depends on type and condition of the armor you
      wear. If condition drops below 50%, protection decreases
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436059
    m_Localized: Armor coverage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436060
    m_Localized: This value shows how much body surface is covered by your armor.
      In fact, it is a probability that a strike or a projectile hits your armor,
      in which case damage will be reduced, or an uncovered body part. Depends on
      type and condition of the armor you wear. If condition drops below 50%, protection
      decreases
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436061
    m_Localized: Evasion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436062
    m_Localized: The higher this indicator is, the more often enemies with long-range
      weapons miss. The probability of hitting you is divided by the absolute value
      of evasion. For example, the "+ 20%" bonus means that the probability of hitting
      you is divided by 1.2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436063
    m_Localized: Stealth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436064
    m_Localized: The higher this indicator is, the harder it is for enemies to see
      you, and the more time it will take them to discover you. Does not account
      for a StealthBuck effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436065
    m_Localized: External damage resistance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436066
    m_Localized: Only for external damage. Does not protect against health reduction
      resulting from poisoning, bleeding and other internal damage
    m_Metadata:
