  - m_Id: 2729436197
    m_Localized: armor-piercing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436198
    m_Localized: Armor-piercing round has a special bullet with a hard core and a
      soft shell, designed to pierce armor. However, such bullets are less effective
      against unprotected targets and have a weaker stopping action
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436199
    m_Localized: expansive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436200
    m_Localized: The expansive round has a bullet that deforms when it hits a soft
      environment, such as the victim`s body. Such bullets do more damage to unprotected
      targets, but at the same time they are very bad at penetrating armor, therefore
      are not effective against armored targets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436201
    m_Localized: armor-piercing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436202
    m_Localized: In this ammo, 5 arrow-shaped bullets are used instead of the usual
      shot, good for penetrating armor but having a weaker stopping action
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436203
    m_Localized: incendiary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436204
    m_Localized: A cartridge that has a magically enchanted bullet that ignites the
      target on impact
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436205
    m_Localized: magical
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436206
    m_Localized: A cartridge that allows exploiting magical energy technologies with
      common firearms. When hitting a target, the bullet from such a cartridge turns
      into a ball of plasma
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436207
    m_Localized: enhanced charge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436208
    m_Localized: A battery of increased power. Improves damage and gives weapons
      ability to burn armor, but a weapon wears out more quickly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436209
    m_Localized: optimized
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436210
    m_Localized: Fuel with special additives that significantly increase the combustion
      temperature
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436211
    m_Localized: plasma
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436212
    m_Localized: A more powerful magical energy model of grenades
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436213
    m_Localized: pulse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436214
    m_Localized: Grenade with a pulse charge, designed for fighting against robots
