    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436420
    m_Localized: '- Components'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436421
    m_Localized: Components for weapons, armor, explosives and electronic devices.
      Everything you need to work on a workbench
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436422
    m_Localized: '- Ingredients'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436423
    m_Localized: Alchemical ingredients, herbs, monster body parts. All that is useful
      for potions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436424
    m_Localized: Leave some of the weapons at the weapon stand and put unnecessary
      items into the storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436425
    m_Localized: You are overloaded with heavy items. In this state you will not
      be able to run and dash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2729436426
    m_Localized: You are heavily overloaded with items. In this state you may only
      trot and can barely jump
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
