  - m_Id: 2733629506
    m_Localized: You don`t have time for this
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629507
    m_Localized: Overload! Too many items
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629508
    m_Localized: Test loc
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629509
    m_Localized: Test loc 2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629510
    m_Localized: Technical tunnels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629511
    m_Localized: Beginning of your journey
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629512
    m_Localized: Surface
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629513
    m_Localized: Equestrian Wasteland, harsh and cruel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629514
    m_Localized: Raiders` den
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629515
    m_Localized: Ruins, occupied by a large raiders gang
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629516
    m_Localized: Falls Springs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629517
    m_Localized: A small settlement in which the slavers are based. Here is the entrance
      to the stable 88
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629518
    m_Localized: '"Prancing pony" camp'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629519
    m_Localized: One of those rare safe places where you can rest, treat your wounds
      and replenish supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629520
    m_Localized: Factory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629521
    m_Localized: A partly destroyed "ManeTec" factory complex, occupied by raiders.
      Apart from them you should watch out for automatic defense systems and occasional
      monsters
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629522
    m_Localized: Department of special research
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629523
    m_Localized: The brain center of the ManeTec factory, where research and development
      was previously conducted. The central maneframe is somewhere here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629524
    m_Localized: Sewers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629525
    m_Localized: Sewage tunnels, filled with sludge, toxic and radioactive waste.
      It is a lair for various monsters, and wild ghouls pose a significant threat.
      Many passages and rooms are flooded
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629526
    m_Localized: Abandoned stable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629527
    m_Localized: Its population died many years ago, and those who remained turned
      into wild ghouls. Security robots and turrets are especially dangerous there
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629528
    m_Localized: The core of the stable 88
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629529
    m_Localized: Here are the overmare office, the main security office, the main
      server and the reactor core, which gives energy to the whole stable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629530
    m_Localized: Hankey Garages
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629531
    m_Localized: Meeting place according to the Mentor instructions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629532
    m_Localized: Manehattan ruins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629533
    m_Localized: There are many dangers in the ruins of Manehattan. Here you can
      often encounter squads of slavers and mercenaries. Also, some time ago reports
      started coming about groups of the Goddess`s alicorns appearing there
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629534
    m_Localized: Military base
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629535
    m_Localized: A military base in the past, now - base of the Steel Rangers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629536
    m_Localized: Canterlot ruins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629537
    m_Localized: The former capital of Equestria. Now filled with the deadly Pink
      Cloud and inhabited by various monsters
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629538
    m_Localized: M.A.S. tower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629539
    m_Localized: A tall, but heavily destroyed skyscraper, in the past - one of the
      regional offices of the Ministry of Arcane Sciences
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629540
    m_Localized: Maze
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629541
    m_Localized: 'Find the way out of the maze. Tip: to get into narrow passages
      at the height of one block, press [W] + [A] or [W] + [D]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629542
    m_Localized: You will easily find the right path by using an infra-vision potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629543
    m_Localized: Slime kingdom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629544
    m_Localized: 'Get to the end without stepping on slime. Tip: use a chemical protection
      suit to minimize acid damage'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629545
    m_Localized: Gamma radiation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629546
    m_Localized: 'Get through the radioactive zone without dying. Tip: use all available
      means of radiation protection'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629547
    m_Localized: 'For jumping in the horizontal direction use dash move [Shift] +
      [A], [A] or [Shift] + [D], [D]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629548
    m_Localized: Combination lock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629549
    m_Localized: Pressing the appropriate buttons, open all the armored doors
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629550
    m_Localized: Only one combination opens all the doors. The hint number is written
      on the wall behind the box. This number in binary form is the correct code
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629551
    m_Localized: Fall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629552
    m_Localized: Overcome the lift from the working anti-gravity elevator. You need
      to get the sufficient falling speed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629553
    m_Localized: The third teleport is hidden under the floor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629554
    m_Localized: Shooting buttons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629555
    m_Localized: Activate all the red buttons by shooting them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629556
    m_Localized: To press the lower button, use a grenade together with telekinesis
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629557
    m_Localized: Two sides
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629558
    m_Localized: Activate two buttons on the sides of the room simultaneously
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629559
    m_Localized: To prevent the automatic door from closing place something in the
      doorway
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629560
    m_Localized: Throwing grenades
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629561
    m_Localized: 'By throwing explosives accurately, press all the red buttons. Tip:
      use S.A.T.S. for better aim. To throw a grenade farther, learn "explosives"
      skill. You can adjust the force of the throw by changing cursor position'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629562
    m_Localized: To press the nearest button use telekinesis with a dynamite stick.
      To press the farthest button use S.A.T.S. and choose the correct trajectory
      of the throw. You will need the "explosive" skill of 3rd level at least
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629563
    m_Localized: Battle rainbow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629564
    m_Localized: You need to press all buttons. Each button responds to one particular
      type of damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629565
    m_Localized: Laser, fire, electricity, acid, plasma, frost
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629566
    m_Localized: Falling tower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629567
    m_Localized: Use boxes to get to the passage at the top
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629568
    m_Localized: Build an inclined tower by placing one box on the edge of the other.
      After fulfilling the trial, pull out the box at the bottom. Physics!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629569
    m_Localized: Cargo transportation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629570
    m_Localized: Use equipment in the room to get to the passage at the top. Do not
      fall down!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629571
    m_Localized: Build the tower of boxes on the moving platform. If you drop anything
      into the pit, exit the room and try again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629572
    m_Localized: Confusion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629573
    m_Localized: Jump on platforms and ladders to get to the top within the allotted
      time. Too easy? Then do the same with the "left" and "right" reversed!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629574
    m_Localized: Excavation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629575
    m_Localized: There is a safe somewhere. Find it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629576
    m_Localized: There are lots of treasures underground - use a sledgehammer or
      dynamite to get them. Beware, the ground vibration attracts monsters
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629577
    m_Localized: Sink
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629578
    m_Localized: Do you like swimming in radioactive water? Well, you`ll have to,
      there is no other way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629579
    m_Localized: Drain water by punching out the plugs. Use an anti-radiation suit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629580
    m_Localized: Speed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629581
    m_Localized: You need to press the button here, then run to the other side before
      the door closes. It`s simple, just don`t run out of time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629582
    m_Localized: Water at the lower level will slow you down, get rid of it. Use
      chemicals to run faster and jump higher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629583
    m_Localized: Bloatsprites nursery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629584
    m_Localized: Destroy all bloatsprites` nests
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629585
    m_Localized: Bloatsprites are vulnerable to magical energy weapons. Destroy nests
      as quickly as possible, or they will produce more and more new bloatsprites
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629586
    m_Localized: Ant tunnels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629587
    m_Localized: Destroy all ant nests
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629588
    m_Localized: Ant nests are most vulnerable to explosions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629589
    m_Localized: Cabinet of the factory CEO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629590
    m_Localized: Get valuable items from the safe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629591
    m_Localized: Data room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629592
    m_Localized: Data storage and server room. Entrance is authorized only for the
      overmare, the technical service officer and the sysadmin. Attention! On intrusion,
      security systems open fire without warning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629593
    m_Localized: Flooded tunnels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629594
    m_Localized: Can you hold your breath for a long time, navigate through muddy
      water, fix mechanisms? If not, you shall not pass here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629595
    m_Localized: Moving platforms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629596
    m_Localized: Using moving platforms, get to the safe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629597
    m_Localized: Laser traps
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629598
    m_Localized: Avoid laser traps, disarm them or force your way through
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629599
    m_Localized: Laser sensors react only on hostile targets. Like you. They can
      be disabled having a sufficient level of the "Science" skill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629600
    m_Localized: Danger zone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629601
    m_Localized: Get through the passage guarded by turrets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629602
    m_Localized: There is a detonator behind a fragile wall, opening path to the
      pool with water. Water will protect you from energy weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629603
    m_Localized: Robots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629604
    m_Localized: Raiders
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629605
    m_Localized: Sentinels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629606
    m_Localized: Zombies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629607
    m_Localized: Pit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629608
    m_Localized: Scorpion pit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629609
    m_Localized: Raiders` den
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629610
    m_Localized: Slavers` den
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629611
    m_Localized: Bloatsprite king
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629612
    m_Localized: Gravitational anomaly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629613
    m_Localized: Defeat enemies under lunar gravity conditions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629614
    m_Localized: Radio tower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629615
    m_Localized: Make it so that all buttons become activated
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629616
    m_Localized: Use the X-37 radio mines
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629617
    m_Localized: Technical department
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629618
    m_Localized: Find the passage through the labyrinth of technical compartments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629619
    m_Localized: Surprise
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629620
    m_Localized: Danger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629621
    m_Localized: Raiders leader (boss)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629622
    m_Localized: Ultra-sentinel (boss)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629623
    m_Localized: Alicorn (boss)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629624
    m_Localized: Boss of the factory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629625
    m_Localized: Boss of the slavers camp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629626
    m_Localized: Boss of the abandoned stable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629627
    m_Localized: Boss of the Manehattan ruins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629628
    m_Localized: Generator room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629629
    m_Localized: Library
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629630
    m_Localized: Dark and dangerous cellar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629631
    m_Localized: Do not open this door, death awaits you inside
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629632
    m_Localized: A mysterious cellar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629633
    m_Localized: Weird place
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629634
    m_Localized: Camp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629635
    m_Localized: Prison camp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629636
    m_Localized: Somewhere along the way to Canterlot...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629637
    m_Localized: Covertsign
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629638
    m_Localized: A small settlement sheltering a small group of zebras
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629639
    m_Localized: Water treatment plant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629640
    m_Localized: A small building where a temporary camp was arranged by Steel Rangers
      under the command of SteelHooves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629641
    m_Localized: Ministry of Image
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629642
    m_Localized: The main office of one of the ministries of the Great War epoch
      - the Ministry of Image
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629643
    m_Localized: Bunker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629644
    m_Localized: Storage bunker of Steel Rangers. Protected better than any other
      object in the region. Trying to get in here is a real madness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629645
    m_Localized: Stable-Tech office, service entrance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629646
    m_Localized: Alicorns` lair
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629647
    m_Localized: Battle for the Factory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629648
    m_Localized: Fight several waves of opponents, coming one after another. The
      time for the destruction of each wave is limited. Try not to die in the process,
      otherwise you`ll have to start again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629649
    m_Localized: Battle for the Sewers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629650
    m_Localized: Battle for the Stable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629651
    m_Localized: Battle for Manehattan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629652
    m_Localized: Battle for Canterlot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629653
    m_Localized: Boss of Canterlot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629654
    m_Localized: Boss of the Military base
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629655
    m_Localized: Rapid shooter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629656
    m_Localized: Make all 6 buttons glowing at simultaneously. Shoot very quickly
      and accurately!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629657
    m_Localized: Use Little Macintosh and S.A.T.S.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629658
    m_Localized: Dark spheres
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629659
    m_Localized: Use dark spheres to get to the end of the room. You can interact
      with them like with buttons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629660
    m_Localized: Jumping
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629661
    m_Localized: Enclave base
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629662
    m_Localized: A large building built by the Enclave on top of the mountain. The
      Enclave did not make any attempts to contact Wasteland inhabitants and, judging
      by the number of troops at the base, it is unlikely that they came with peaceful
      intentions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629663
    m_Localized: Enclave outpost
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629664
    m_Localized: The gates to the main base
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629665
    m_Localized: Command post
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629666
    m_Localized: The command post located at the very top, above the cloud barrier.
      The base commander must be here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629667
    m_Localized: Gun workshop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629668
    m_Localized: The workshop used to produce large-caliber guns. Due to the powerful
      and still functioning security system this place still hasn`t been pillaged
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629669
    m_Localized: Legion headquarters
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629670
    m_Localized: The well-disguised temporary headquarters of the Zebra Legion. According
      to the good old zebra tradition, path towards it is probably protected with
      whole lots of mines and traps
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629671
    m_Localized: Moving targets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629672
    m_Localized: Make all six moving targets light up at the same time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629673
    m_Localized: Electric fence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629674
    m_Localized: Do not touch metal floor, stairs, beams and doors until the electric
      fence is turned off..
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629675
    m_Localized: Lightnings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629676
    m_Localized: Pass through electrical discharges
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629677
    m_Localized: Kennels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629678
    m_Localized: Locker room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629679
    m_Localized: Battle of the Enclave Base
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629680
    m_Localized: Boss of the Enclave Base
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629681
    m_Localized: Stable Pi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629682
    m_Localized: A completely autonomous secret shelter built at the beginning of
      the war and designed to save the best Equestrian scientists and engineers.
      Your home
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629683
    m_Localized: Fort Rocks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629684
    m_Localized: One of the most impregnable fortresses of Equestria. It has powerful
      artillery and anti-air defense systems
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629685
    m_Localized: Stable Pi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629686
    m_Localized: Stable Pi entrance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629687
    m_Localized: Thunderhead
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629688
    m_Localized: Somewhere near Stable Pi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629689
    m_Localized: Your journey begins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629690
    m_Localized: NEW LEVEL RECEIVED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629691
    m_Localized: Attention! User`s health condition is critical, continuing mission
      is impossible. [br]Commencing emergency evacuation to base
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629692
    m_Localized: Your health condition is critical, continuing mission is impossible.[br]Seek
      medical attention
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629693
    m_Localized: You are overloaded with heavy items![br]Leave some of the weapons
      at the weapon stand and put spare items into the storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629694
    m_Localized: Press @1 or @2 to move left and right
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629695
    m_Localized: Press @1 to jump. [br]Hold the key to jump higher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629696
    m_Localized: Press @1 to climb upstairs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629697
    m_Localized: Press @1 to go downstairs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629698
    m_Localized: Press @1 to crawl and @2 to stand up.[br]Use crawling to get through
      narrow corridors
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629699
    m_Localized: Press @1+@2 to jump down
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629700
    m_Localized: Check various containers that you encounter during your journey.
      This wall cabinet probably contains something interesting.[br]Come closer,
      move your cursor over it and press @1 to look inside
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629701
    m_Localized: Use telekinesis to lift and move stuff around. To do this, move
      your cursor over the item and press @1. To drop the item press @2 one more
      time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629702
    m_Localized: The wooden wall at the end of the corridor looks quite rotten. It
      can probably be broken down with a couple of strong kicks. Come closer and
      press @1 to strike.[br]For a more powerful kick with your hind legs, press
      @2 + @3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629703
    m_Localized: Looks like you can get some useful tools from up there
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629704
    m_Localized: You found medication. Use it to treat wounds that you get in a fight.
      The hotkey for using medication - @1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629705
    m_Localized: This wall looks all cracked and not as sturdy as other walls. You
      can probably break it down with a crowbar. Hover the cursor over the wall section
      and press @1 to hit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629706
    m_Localized: A locked door, huh? Not a problem. Try to pick the lock, and if
      it fails - just break it down with a crowbar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629707
    m_Localized: Using telekinesis, put some boxes on top of each other to access
      the path above.[br]By default you can press the right mouse button to use telekinesis
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629708
    m_Localized: A crowbar can be used not only for breaking walls. There are some
      radroaches down there. Have some practice on them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629709
    m_Localized: Press @1 to use the PipBuck. This device has multiple functionalities
      - from viewing your current health level to browsing through your inventory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629710
    m_Localized: For easier aiming you can use Stable-Tec Arcane Targeting Spell
      (S.A.T.S.).[br] To do this press @1 (or middle mouse button by default)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629711
    m_Localized: You can switch weapons using PipBuck, numeric buttons or @1 and
      @2 (or scrolling by default)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629712
    m_Localized: A crowbar! You can use it as a weapon and to break stuff as well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629713
    m_Localized: A screwdriver! Quite a useful tool. It can help you open simple
      locks. Try it on that chest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629714
    m_Localized: Self-charging pistol - a lucky prize. It belongs to magical energy
      weapons class, that does not need Spark-batteries. The charge is restored automatically
      over time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629715
    m_Localized: Firearms - you can never get enough of those. Press @1 to reload
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629716
    m_Localized: You found a book describing spell "Telekinetic bullet". To use it,
      equip it like an ordinary weapon. Spells don`t require ammo, but consume your
      magical power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629717
    m_Localized: Do not ignore terminals. Some of them may contain valuable data,
      other can control doors locks, mechanisms, and security systems. Protected
      terminals can be hacked
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629718
    m_Localized: You found schematics for a hoof-made weapon. If you have all necessary
      components, you can try creating this weapon at the workbench
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629719
    m_Localized: You can jump over this pit, but you will have to run to gain speed
      and jump right at the edge.[br]Hold @1 while running and jumping to move faster
      and to jump further!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629720
    m_Localized: In case you can`t make it, this thing here will help you this time.
      But seriously, it is not that hard!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629721
    m_Localized: Looks like you`ll have to swim. Press and hold @1 to swim upwards
      and jump out of the water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629722
    m_Localized: Hold @1 and move cursor to move camera. Press @2 to change zoom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629723
    m_Localized: You got the ability[br]Double Jump
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629724
    m_Localized: While jumping, press @1 again to jump off air with telekinesis.[br]Using
      this technique you can jump much further
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629725
    m_Localized: You can also use a double jump to get into hard-to-reach places
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629726
    m_Localized: Hold @1 + @3(@2) to climb one block high without jumping, or climb
      through narrow passages at the level of one block
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629727
    m_Localized: Go left to continue exploring the complex. [br]Or go right to go
      to the surface
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629728
    m_Localized: Don`t stay long in places with high background radiation, especially
      don`t linger near magical radiation waste unless you want to experience deadly
      radiation sickness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629729
    m_Localized: Use RadAway to remove magical radiation from your body. Using healing
      potions won`t help here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629730
    m_Localized: Run faster here (holding @1) and you won`t fall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629731
    m_Localized: While moving, hold @1 to go upstairs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629732
    m_Localized: Hold @1 to raise your weapon higher.[br]You can activate the red
      button by shooting it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629733
    m_Localized: Press @1 to grab the ladder in a jump
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629734
    m_Localized: You can hide in wall niches, behind crates and furniture. While
      you are under cover you get bonuses to stealth and evasion. To hide, stand
      in front of a cover and press @1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629735
    m_Localized: It is not necessary to fight every enemy, some of them can be avoided.
      Wait when enemy looks away, then try to pass unnoticed. Use the wall niche
      to hide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629736
    m_Localized: Holding @1 or @2, press @3 to jump off the ladder to the left or
      to the right, respectively
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629737
    m_Localized: Press @1 to jump down off the ladder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629738
    m_Localized: Press @1 twice to jump off the beam.[br]While falling, hold @2 to
      pass through other beams
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629739
    m_Localized: Holding @3, quickly tap @1 or @2 twice to dash.[br]This trick might
      help you reach certain places, and you may also use it in a fight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629740
    m_Localized: While holding @3, quickly press @1 or @2 twice to dash.[br]By making
      a dash toward the attacking enemy, you can avoid taking damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629741
    m_Localized: A mark of the Ministry of Awesome points to the secret places and
      hidden stashes. Sometimes such places are hidden behind fake walls, that can
      be smashed by any weapon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629742
    m_Localized: You would like to offer balefire phoenix some treat, but you do
      not have anything suitable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629743
    m_Localized: Balefire phoenix likes your treat. He makes a melodious trill and
      disappears. Perhaps you`ll meet again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629744
    m_Localized: Your adventures end here. Rest in peace,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629745
    m_Localized: You`ve got injuries incompatible with life. Rest in peace,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629746
    m_Localized: Entering the door, you will get to a deeper level of the factory.
      There you will encounter new enemies, new trials and new rewards.[br]Use the
      MAS terminal to visit the base camp, replenish supplies and restore health
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629747
    m_Localized: Behind this door is a passage to sewers. You will need a key to
      open it.[br] Recommended for adventurers of at least 6th level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629748
    m_Localized: There is a passage to an abandoned stable. [br]This place is considered
      quite dangerous. Recommended for adventurers of at least 10th level.[br]Or
      you can go down to deeper levels of the sewers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629749
    m_Localized: Half an hour later, after @lp finished her tale of her Wasteland
      adventures...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629750
    m_Localized: A couple of days later...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629751
    m_Localized: ADVANCED CONTROLS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629752
    m_Localized: Holding @1 - raise a weapon higher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629753
    m_Localized: Same while lying by holding both @2 and @1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629754
    m_Localized: '@1 near a box, a piece of furniture or a niche in a wall - hide
      behind a cover'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629755
    m_Localized: Twice @1 - jump down off a beam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629756
    m_Localized: '@1 + @2 or @3 - crawl into a narrow passage'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629757
    m_Localized: '@1 + @2 or @3 - walk at a slow pace'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629758
    m_Localized: Quickly press @1 + @2 or @3 - turn around
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629759
    m_Localized: '@1 + twice @2 or @3 - side dash, dodge from an attack'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629760
    m_Localized: '@1 - kick with a front leg, @2 + @3 - back-kick'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629761
    m_Localized: '@1,@2 - weapon selector, view quick access slots'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629762
    m_Localized: '@3 + @1,@2 - change ammunition type'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629763
    m_Localized: Holding @1 - unload a weapon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629764
    m_Localized: In inventory - @1-@2 (digit keys) - assign a weapon, armor, or item
      to a quick access slot. Press the same key in game to use the assigned item
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629765
    m_Localized: In inventory - @3 + @1-@2 - the same for additional slots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629766
    m_Localized: '[Right mouse button] in the PipBuck "weapons" section - hide unused
      weapons'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629767
    m_Localized: '[Shift] + [click] when trading - select maximum quantity of goods'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629768
    m_Localized: '@1 - use the last attack spell'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629769
    m_Localized: '@1 - use an equipped defensive spell'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629770
    m_Localized: '@1 - order the companion to move or attack'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629771
    m_Localized: Holding @1 - order the companion to return
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629772
    m_Localized: '[Insert] - redraw the current room (in case of visual bugs)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629773
    m_Localized: '[End] - command line'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629774
    m_Localized: GLOSSARY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629775
    m_Localized: '[The Great War] - a global war between Equestria and the Zebras
      Empire, which happened about 200 years ago. This war ended in the mutual extermination
      and transformation of Equestria into the Wasteland'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629776
    m_Localized: '[Megaspells] - ordinary spells strengthened by many orders of magnitude,
      which were used in the Great War as weapons of mass destruction'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629777
    m_Localized: '[Balefire-bomb] - zebra megaspell base on the dragon fire, concealed
      in a special device. When activated, it explodes with a monstrous force that
      can destroy entire cities with a shock wave and poison the area with magical
      radiation'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629778
    m_Localized: '[Pink cloud] - A terrible megaspell that destroyed the capital
      of Equestria, Canterlot. This is a deadly cloud of an extremely toxic gas of
      pink color, capable of killing all lifeforms. There is no protection from it'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629779
    m_Localized: '[Stable-Tech] - a corporation that existed before the Great War.
      Known for building a variety of shelters-stables in which ponies were supposed
      to survive in the event of weapons of mass destruction going off'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629780
    m_Localized: '[PipBuck] - a portable computer designed by Stable-tech, which
      ponies can wear on a front leg. It has many functions - tracking the health
      of the user, sorting inventory, mapping and navigation, viewing any files and
      keeping records'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629781
    m_Localized: '[S.A.T.S.] - Stable-Tec Arcane Targeting Spell. A special spell
      built into PipBuck, which allows you to stop the subjective flow of time and
      help to aim from any weapon'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629782
    m_Localized: '[Stable] - a fully autonomous underground shelter for ponies, designed
      for long-term use. During the War, more than a hundred stables were built,
      but most of them, for various reasons, are now abandoned, and all of their
      inhabitants died'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629783
    m_Localized: MINISTRIES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629784
    m_Localized: 'Six government organizations created during the Great War by the
      ruling princess Luna, whose common goal was to win the War and preserve the
      state integrity of Equestria. The ministries were ruled by the keepers of the
      Elements of Harmony.

      [Ministry of Arcane Sciences], abbreviated [MAS]
      - a ministry headed by Twilight Sparkle. MAS was mainly engaged in the development
      of magical weapons and combat spells.

      [Ministry of Image] is a ministry
      headed by Rarity. It was engaged in decorating streets, issuing printed materials,
      and also was responsible for censorship.

      [Ministry of Peace] - Ministry
      headed by Fluttershy. It dealt with health issues, production of medicines
      such as medicinal potions, and helping wounded in combat. It is this ministry
      that is responsible for the invention of megaspells

      [Ministry of Morale]
      is a ministry headed by Pinky Pie. Officially it took care of patriotic education,
      supporting the population morale and organization of holidays. Unofficially
      it was engaged in espionage and counterintelligence.

      [Ministry of Wartime
      Technology] - the ministry headed by Applejack. It was engaged in development
      of the newest weapons and means of protection, such as power armor.

      [Ministry
      of Awesome] - the ministry headed by Rainbow Dash. What it did exactly was
      not really known'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629785
    m_Localized: What happened? Where am I?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629786
    m_Localized: I need to... get up......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629787
    m_Localized: I`d better get going
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629788
    m_Localized: MAS Terminals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629789
    m_Localized: Attention! Unknown signal detected
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629790
    m_Localized: Decoding...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629791
    m_Localized: "Signal decoded.\n                    PipBuck signature identified.\n                   
      Connection established.\n                    Initializing system..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629792
    m_Localized: "Welcome, New User.\n                This is the Emergency Rescue
      System by the Ministry of Arcane Sciences"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629793
    m_Localized: You were successfully registered in the system and can now access
      all its privileges
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629794
    m_Localized: 'In case of critical hazard to your life, such as: sudden zebra
      attack, terror action, megaspell explosion or falling from a staircase, you
      will be automatically teleported to safety - to the nearest available MAS terminal.
      You will also get a necessary medical treatment there'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629795
    m_Localized: 'Warning: the system is currently in beta. Some minor errors and
      malfunctions may be experienced. We thank you for your patience'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629796
    m_Localized: Inventory manual
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629797
    m_Localized: "[Inventory manual]\n                Everything that you find and
      collect during a journey will be stored in your inventory. You can browse through
      the inventory using PipBuck (key @1 or @2), [Inventory] section.\n               
      This section has several subsections that you can switch between using buttons
      in the upper part of the interface - [Weapons], [Armor], [Equipment], [Ammunition],
      [Other]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629798
    m_Localized: "In the [Weapons] section you can see every weapon that you have.
      From here you can equip it, check its characteristics, condition and how much
      corresponding ammo you have.\n                Likewise, section [Armor] allows
      you to equip armor and check its characteristics and condition"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629799
    m_Localized: "Subsection [Equipment] shows all items that you can use - medications,
      repair kits, books etc.\n                You can use items from here, through
      PipBuck interface, or in-game using @1 key.\n                Press @5 to use
      the item, shown in the top left corner of the screen, right below your health
      bar. Press @2 or @3 to choose the previous or next item.\n                To
      use medication, you can press hotkey @4 - the most suitable healing potion
      will be applied"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629800
    m_Localized: Sections [Ammo] and [Other] contain all the rest - ammo, artifacts,
      valuable items and garbage of all sorts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629801
    m_Localized: Oh no, I can not jump over this...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629802
    m_Localized: Unless...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629803
    m_Localized: I could give myself a little push with telekinesis!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629804
    m_Localized: End of tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629805
    m_Localized: A corridor? It seems there is light coming from the right - this
      is probably an exit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629806
    m_Localized: And on the left is just darkness. I guess I should head toward the
      exit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629807
    m_Localized: Or should I explore these catacombs first?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629808
    m_Localized: You have successfully reached the exit and are awarded with a level
      up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629809
    m_Localized: With each level up you receive skill points and abilities. Use them
      to improve your skills - via PipBuck, the "Status" section - "Skills"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629810
    m_Localized: Uh-oh... Something is wrong with this water...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629811
    m_Localized: As far as I know, it shouldn`t be this color
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629812
    m_Localized: This ceiling turret looks dangerous, and I don`t even have a decent
      weapon. I don`t think it`s worth fighting it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629813
    m_Localized: But this is not necessary, right? If I want to get to other side,
      I can just sneak past it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629814
    m_Localized: Right, let`s do this!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629815
    m_Localized: Turrets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629816
    m_Localized: Turrets are stationary defensive robots, installed in particular
      places and equipped with powerful weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629817
    m_Localized: While in a combat mode, they automatically recognize nearby hostile
      targets and open fire without warning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629818
    m_Localized: There are quite a few functional pre-war turrets in the Wasteland
      that, even after all these years, continue to guard entrusted objects. And
      this definitely represents a big problem for those eager to get easy loot from
      industrial plants and military objects
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629819
    m_Localized: Luckily, turrets are quite easy to get rid of, despite their deadly
      firepower. You can use armor piercing or impulse weapons, or just shut them
      down through security terminal. The most important part - stay away from bullets,
      which is not that hard. Because turrets can`t move, they will not chase you
      after you leave their detection range
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629820
    m_Localized: Bloatsprites
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629821
    m_Localized: "Bloatsprites are believed to be former parasprites mutated from
      taint and magical radiation exposure.\n          While having new, dangerous
      abilities, they also inherited the notorious gift of rapid reproduction, hence
      you can find quite a few of them roaming Equestrian Wasteland"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629822
    m_Localized: "Some of them are able to spit poisonous thorns and acid, others
      will attack their prey using very sharp teeth.\n          The most dangerous
      type injects eggs into victim`s body, and newborn insects devour it from inside"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629823
    m_Localized: While single bloatsprite doesn`t represent much threat, a swarm
      may cause you a deep trouble. These creatures are hard to kill with a bullet
      - try using magical energy and melee weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629824
    m_Localized: There is definitely something behind this wall. I hear some kind
      of suspicious buzzing noise
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629825
    m_Localized: Hmm... the wall does not look particularly strong. I can try making
      a hole in it, but is it worth it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629826
    m_Localized: There`s a whole lot of explosives in there! I could try to disarm
      it, but I doubt that my skill is high enough
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629827
    m_Localized: I can probably just shoot it...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629828
    m_Localized: But first I`d better take a couple of steps away!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629829
    m_Localized: I hope the walls won`t collapse...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629830
    m_Localized: Message from Mentor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629831
    m_Localized: Suddenly your PipBuck turns on by itself. On its screen the usual
      interface is replaced by a series of symbols, forming words and sentences.
      You do not understand what is going on, but the standard PipBuck software cannot
      do that and you are well aware of it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629832
    m_Localized: Greetings, "Chosen-25" @lp. I am the Mentor, my task is to direct
      your actions and point the way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629833
    m_Localized: What?! What is this now? Who is it talking to me... and how can
      I answer you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629834
    m_Localized: 'Now you probably would like to know who I am, how I got into your
      PipBuck and why you should trust me at all. The questions are more than reasonable
      and I, of course, will answer them as best as I can.

      For now my identity
      must remain hidden. One thing I can say is that we are well acquainted, and
      I`m by no means your enemy.

      These messages have been uploaded to your
      PipBuck in advance and are now being shown to you. And, if I guess right what
      you are thinking now - no, there is no direct connection, you can not respond
      or ask me questions. For now.

      As for why you should trust me, here is
      my first and main argument'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629835
    m_Localized: PipBuck starts playing an audio recording. Amazingly, you recognize
      your own voice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629836
    m_Localized: 'Hi, @lp from the future - says @lp, that is, you, only a few days
      ago. - I leave to you... I mean, myself... this message, to briefly explain
      the situation. Because some time ago you woke up in an unknown place and with
      strange blankness in your memory. And so, since I know that I, that is, you
      will not believe anyone but myself, let me tell you this:

      I, that is,
      you, are entrusted with a very important mission. Really important for the
      whole Stable, and I, that is, you, really think so. Presently you are under
      the influence of a spell blocking some of your memories. I-you agreed to undergo
      this spell absolutely voluntarily, without the slightest coercion or threat.
      I did it because it was necessary. Just trust me... that is, yourself'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629837
    m_Localized: For safety reasons you will not remember where is your home, your
      friends and family. But remember that it`s temporary. For now just follow the
      instructions of the Mentor, he will tell you what to do. He won`t lie to you,
      I can assure you of this. While you are on a mission, your code name is "Chosen-25".
      That`s all. Good luck to you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629838
    m_Localized: The recording ended and new messages appeared on the screen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629839
    m_Localized: 'Well, now that we are through with the main questions, I`m sending
      your instructions. Remember, it`s in your best interest to execute them as
      soon as possible.

      Soon you will find yourself in a place called the
      "Equestrian Wasteland". Observe extreme caution, according to my information
      this place is very dangerous. You may encounter aggressive savage ponies and
      mutant animals. Areas contaminated with radiation also pose danger. Try to
      make contact with locals.

      You will receive the next message when the
      time comes. Remember, your task is very important for all of us. Until next
      time, "Chosen-25"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629840
    m_Localized: Messages disappeared and PipBuck returned to normal. In the "Quests"
      section, new entries appeared
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629841
    m_Localized: I remember my Stable! I remember something... vaguely...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629842
    m_Localized: Argh!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629843
    m_Localized: Memory spell? How could I agree to this? But it surely was my voice
      on the recording, and if I was so confident about this... Mentor, then there
      had to be a reason
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629844
    m_Localized: In any case, I do not have much of a choice. Either I will stay
      forever in this place, or I will carry out the instructions of the Mentor,
      and then we shall see what comes next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629845
    m_Localized: So this is the Equestrian Wasteland?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629846
    m_Localized: It`s so... spacious...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629847
    m_Localized: Oh! I feel dizzy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629848
    m_Localized: I can`t believe it, am I really climbing down a rat hole?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629849
    m_Localized: Why am I even doing this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629850
    m_Localized: First meeting with a raider
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629851
    m_Localized: Wait, I think I saw somepony there
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629852
    m_Localized: E.F.S. marks a hostile target! Even if it is a pony, it is not too
      friendly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629853
    m_Localized: Still, should I really attack first? Or perhaps I should at least
      try talking to it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629854
    m_Localized: Err.. Hi! Do you live here? I...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629855
    m_Localized: Wha? Who the fuck are you???|Wha? Who the hay are you???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629856
    m_Localized: Hey, come here everypony! We are going to have some fun!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629857
    m_Localized: I... killed a pony?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629858
    m_Localized: No! Whatever it was, this psycho did not have much left from a pony!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629859
    m_Localized: Raiders` ambush
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629860
    m_Localized: Hello, my little pony. What are you doing here all alone? Don`t
      you want to have fun with us?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629861
    m_Localized: You want to play, huh? Well then, come closer, let`s see who will
      be having more fun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629862
    m_Localized: Ha-ha-ha, that`s what I like! Today is our lucky day. Now, we...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629863
    m_Localized: Huh, what the fuck?|Huh, what the hay?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629864
    m_Localized: Hey ya! Take cover!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629865
    m_Localized: Meeting Calamity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629866
    m_Localized: Hey, are ya crazy or what, walkin` all alone here? Ah`m glad that
      Ah came jus` in time, otherwise Ah can`t even imagine what these raiders would
      do t` ya
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629867
    m_Localized: Err... thanks for helping of course, but I had everything under
      control
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629868
    m_Localized: Yeah, right. Ah could see your "under control". One pony without
      armor an` a normal weapon agains` a whole lotta scumbags
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629869
    m_Localized: An` why are ya lookin` at me like that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629870
    m_Localized: I`m sorry. I`ve never seen a pegasus before. In our... I mean, in
      a place where I came from there were no pegasi at all
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629871
    m_Localized: Ah, Ah see! Ah reckon, there are not so many of us in the Wasteland...
      Wait, what place are ya talkin` about?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629872
    m_Localized: Well... I`m not local, my home is far away
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629873
    m_Localized: 'How far?.. Hold your horses. Lemme guess: are ya from the Stable?
      Mah word! You must be from there! An` this funny costume. Yup, it`s all clear
      now. T` tell ya the truth, there are so few stables with live ponies left,
      that Ah rarely meet ponies like ya nowadays'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629874
    m_Localized: You are right. But let`s not talk about it now, ok? You`re one of
      the locals, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629875
    m_Localized: Well, ya could say that. Nice t` meet ya, Ah`m Calamity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629876
    m_Localized: Nice to meet you too, I`m @lp. Listen, Calamiti, unless it`s too
      much trouble for you, could you show me the way to the nearest town or other
      settlement?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629877
    m_Localized: Of course, Ah`ll even accompany ya. There is a camp nearby, "Prancin`
      Pony". Ah`m sure, there ya`ll find everythin` ya might be needin`. Tell me
      when ya`re ready t` go
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629878
    m_Localized: 'Congratulations! You have cleared [the first level of the factory].
      To go to the [second level], go through the door on your right. At each next
      level, new trials, new enemies and new rewards will be waiting!

      You
      can also use [MAS terminal] to teleport to the Base Camp for healing and replenishing
      supplies'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629879
    m_Localized: Aha, let`s see... it looks like the general plan of the factory...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629880
    m_Localized: Now I`m on the first level. Below are the second, third and... many
      more
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629881
    m_Localized: The maneframe that I am looking for is in the special research department.
      Its entrances are on the third level and below. I have to go deeper. Yes, and
      it seems that to enter it I will need a security access key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629882
    m_Localized: Yeah, this factory is really huge. If I wanted, I could be exploring
      it forever...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629883
    m_Localized: Yes, it seems, I am on the right track. Special Research Department
      is down the corridor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629884
    m_Localized: Go straight down the corridor to enter the [Special research department]
      and fulfill your mission. Or enter the [Exit] door to continue exploring a
      new factory level. You can return here when you are ready
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629885
    m_Localized: Looks like this is the special research department. I need to find
      the maneframe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629886
    m_Localized: System error. Please contact the administrator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629887
    m_Localized: First conversation with Mentor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629888
    m_Localized: You connect your PipBuck to the maneframe terminal. For a while
      nothing happens, then a series of characters run through the PipBuck screen,
      which then get replaced by a download indicator. After that, the big screen
      of the terminal comes to life, and one by one lines start to appear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629889
    m_Localized: Authorization...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629890
    m_Localized: System starting...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629891
    m_Localized: Searching for files...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629892
    m_Localized: '"Rainbow" project files found...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629893
    m_Localized: Remote connection established. Transfer begins, please wait...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629894
    m_Localized: Looks like everything is going as planned!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629895
    m_Localized: Suddenly you hear a voice coming from dynamics hidden somewhere
      inside the machine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629896
    m_Localized: Hello, @lp. It`s me, Mentor. Congratulations, you`ve successfully
      completed your first mission. Right now we are getting files that we have been
      waiting for almost two centuries
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629897
    m_Localized: What? Mentor? Are you talking through this terminal? And I can answer
      you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629898
    m_Localized: Yes, @lp. Just now your PipBuck launched a program on the maneframe,
      through which we can communicate. Of course, you have many questions. Now you
      can ask them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629899
    m_Localized: Questions? Oh, sure. Who are you?... And who am I? Why don`t I remember
      anything about my past? And... what is in these files that you were looking
      for?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629900
    m_Localized: The answers to all these questions are interconnected. I`m really
      your mentor, a pony you`ve known all your life. I can not tell my name yet.
      Your home, the place where you were born and grew up - Stable Pi. I also have
      no right to disclose any details about it, as well as about those files that
      you found. This information is top secret. For the safety of our common home,
      we had to cast a memory spell even on yourself. So that if you get caught by
      enemy, they could never get anything from you. I hope you understand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629901
    m_Localized: Was it really so necessary?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629902
    m_Localized: Unfortunately, yes. We have many enemies. When you complete the
      mission and return, I will remove the spell, and memories will return to you.
      But not before. You yourself agreed to such terms, didn`t you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629903
    m_Localized: Yes, I heard the recording. But it doesn`t make it any easier!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629904
    m_Localized: I understand... but I believe that you will succeed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629905
    m_Localized: But can you tell me at least something about the purpose of my mission?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629906
    m_Localized: That`s the main reason why we are talking right now. Long before
      the War was finished, Stable Pi was a secret haven for scientists and engineers
      involved in the most important studies for the Equestrian army. After the bombs
      fell and the old Equestria came to an end, we switched to a completely autonomous
      existence. The entire Stable complex is deep underground, and you won`t find
      the entrance on any map. Secrecy is very important to us. We are no warriors,
      we cannot protect our invaluable knowledge from greed of Wasteland inhabitants.
      Therefore, we almost never contact the outside world
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629907
    m_Localized: I see. But why did you need to send me to the surface?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629908
    m_Localized: One of Stable Pi`s latest developments before the judgment day was
      the "Sun" project. I cannot tell you anything about it, but it is extremely
      important not only for our small society, but for the whole of Equestria. Unfortunately,
      by that time the project hadn`t been completed, because it was closely connected
      with another important development - same time, work on the "Rainbow" project
      was performed in parallel in the ManeTec labs. According to our information,
      this second project was completed, and the entire set of schematics and technical
      documentation was to be sent to us. But for some reason this never happened.
      Communication lines with their maneframe survived, but the server did not respond
      to our attempts to operate it remotely
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629909
    m_Localized: And that`s why you needed me to kick this server back to work? And
      why did you call me "Chosen-25"? And why did you send me? Was I really the
      best choice for an important mission?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629910
    m_Localized: The title "Chosen" is a tradition. The first attempt to send an
      emissary to the surface was made almost a hundred years ago. Then he was called
      the "Chosen One", because he was elected from many other candidates for his
      competence. He was transferred to the Wasteland by a teleportation spell, but
      he did not fulfill the mission and did not return. Then we sent others. Fighters
      and diplomats, strong and cunning, single and whole teams. So there were "Chosen-2",
      "Chosen-3" and so on. No one succeeded. But you. So yes, it turned out in the
      end that it`s you who was the best choice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629911
    m_Localized: Well, I`m glad I could help. Now I need to return?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629912
    m_Localized: I`m sorry, @lp, but no. Obtaining files was the first, but not the
      only goal. For the projects "Sun" and "Rainbow" we also require some components
      that we don`t have at the Stable Pi. You will have to get them. We need time
      to study schematics we received, but one of the missing components is already
      known. It is the Quantum Cogitor, and we have evidence that it was stored in
      the Stable 88 - the research Stable somewhat similar to ours, but with much
      more resources and focused on research in the robotics field. Unfortunately,
      for some reasons unknown to us, after sealing the Stable, the communication
      channel with it was soon interrupted. Your task is to check the status of the
      Stable 88 and get the Quantum Cogitor from the ponies that inhabit it. Entrance
      to Stable 88 is located in a place called Falls Springs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629913
    m_Localized: The files are almost done loading, the connection will be interrupted
      any minute. Do you have any more questions?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629914
    m_Localized: I have lots of questions, actually. How about...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629915
    m_Localized: File transfer is complete. Connection closed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629916
    m_Localized: Luna dammit!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629917
    m_Localized: That means, I`m stuck here for a long time? And what`s more, I have
      to risk my life again?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629918
    m_Localized: But "me" from the past was confident in the importance of this mission.
      Did I know everything about my future mission then? That I would have to stay
      here for so long?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629919
    m_Localized: Still, even if I didn`t, it doesn`t mean that I have to give up
      on everything. The task assigned to me is extremely important, and this means
      that I have to fulfill it. This way or another
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629920
    m_Localized: Information obtained from the maneframe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629921
    m_Localized: Ok, good. Perhaps this cute little piece of metal would also like
      to tell me something?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629922
    m_Localized: 'Query: The "Sun" project'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629923
    m_Localized: "*Search complete*\n            *Files found: 0*\n            *Logs
      matches: 5*"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629924
    m_Localized: That`s it, huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629925
    m_Localized: 'Query: The "Rainbow" project'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629926
    m_Localized: "*Search complete*\n            *Files found: 0*\n            *Logs
      matches: 5*"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629927
    m_Localized: Arrgh! It looks like the files were deleted from memory after transferring.
      Great. Just great
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629928
    m_Localized: 'Query: Logs for the "Rainbow" project'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629929
    m_Localized: "*Search complete*\n            *File history:\n            69 457
      days ago: file downloaded;\n            69 452 days ago: file transfer attempt.
      ERROR: THE OPERATION WAS NOT CONFIRMED BY THE RECIPIENT. FILE TRANSFER CANCELLED;\n           
      81 days ago: file accessed;\n            3 minutes ago: file transferred*"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629930
    m_Localized: Looks like I won`t find out anything new... Wait, what?! Well, well...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629931
    m_Localized: "*File accessed:\n            File was accessed 81 days 5 hours
      18 minutes ago from an authorized PipBuck device, serial number PX 457095004132
      L*"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629932
    m_Localized: PipBuck user, huh? I don`t remember seeing anyone on the surface
      having a PipBuck. What if... what if it was "Chosen-24"?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629933
    m_Localized: Yes, that must be her. Perhaps she is already very far from here,
      maybe even dead. Anyhow, I still have to try finding her. What if she visited
      the "Prancing Pony"? I must ask Calamity - if anyone saw something, it`s him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629934
    m_Localized: "Conversation with Calamity about \xABChosen 24\xBB"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629935
    m_Localized: Calamity?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629936
    m_Localized: Howdy, @lp. Needin` somethin`?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629937
    m_Localized: Well, yes. Tell me, in the last few months have you seen anypony
      like me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629938
    m_Localized: Huh? Ya mean, lookin` like ya? A lil` one? Or an adventurer like
      ya?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629939
    m_Localized: Khmm.. No, not that. I mean, somepony from the Stable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629940
    m_Localized: Ah, that kind. Ayep, Ah saw one. A funny character t`be honest,
      ya could tell that she`s jus` outta Stable. But good. Ah mean, she has a kind
      heart. Ah also wanted t`ask ya if she was a friend of yer`s, but somehow it
      slipped mah mind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629941
    m_Localized: Anyhow, she came here `bout three or four months ago. She was weak
      an` hungry, she almost went t` bed but stopped when she noticed Doc`s corner.
      He was fixin` a couple of our fellas shot by `em Raiders. So she went in, talked
      t` him about somethin` for `bout five minutes an` stayed t` help. Since then
      she was workin` with Doc. He praised her a lot, but between us he grumbled
      that our newcomer was tryin` t` give sick folks medications fer free
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629942
    m_Localized: And why she is not here anymore? Doctor Sepsis kicked her out?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629943
    m_Localized: No, `f course not. But in truth, Ah`m afraid that it`s even worse.
      But ya know, better ask Doc himself... He`ll tell ya everythin` better than
      me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629944
    m_Localized: Conversation with Doc about Velvet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629945
    m_Localized: Look, Doc, we need to talk. It`s very important...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629946
    m_Localized: If it`s venereal, let`s discuss your case behind this curtain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629947
    m_Localized: No, it`s not that. I want to ask you about a Stable dweller. Did
      you know her? I was told that some time ago she was helping you here in the
      clinic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629948
    m_Localized: Ah, but of course, I remember her. Velvet Remedy - that was her
      name. Yes, she helped me here for a while. Very capable, and good in medicine,
      despite being self-educated. She learned from books, you can see it at once.
      Little practice, especially in surgery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629949
    m_Localized: But very kind, too much even. Wanted to help everypony for free.
      Not just ponies, every creature. We had a few quarrels with her about this,
      because her kindness made the clinic go into a negative balance. But we managed
      to find a compromise
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629950
    m_Localized: She asked a lot about our life, but above all she was interested
      in ghouls. Tried to reveal a secret of their anti-life, did not believe my
      words that this is the black magic of zebras. As a result, she decided to get
      to the truth herself. Stupid idea, if you ask me. Ghouls can no longer be cured
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629951
    m_Localized: First she was just searching for them around... I tried to dissuade
      her, but it was useless. Then she said that she found out where those creatures
      were most abundant. I guess, in some sewers or other forsaken hole. And then
      she just left and, well, that`s it. I haven`t seen her ever since
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629952
    m_Localized: Pity... probably found more ghouls than it was necessary. Be careful,
      do not repeat her mistake
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629953
    m_Localized: And you did not even look for her?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629954
    m_Localized: We looked. Calamity flew around, even checked sewage pipes. We found
      no trace
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629955
    m_Localized: I see... Thank you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629956
    m_Localized: That was nothing... And why do you ask? Were you acquainted?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629957
    m_Localized: Yes... I mean, no...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629958
    m_Localized: I don`t know
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629959
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629960
    m_Localized: Well, I`ll mind my own business then
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629961
    m_Localized: Stop! It`s dangerous to go further! I need to find another way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629962
    m_Localized: A camp? Here? Interesting...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629963
    m_Localized: I should look around more carefully
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629964
    m_Localized: Sewage camp inspection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629965
    m_Localized: Sooo. No trace of ghouls - that`s good
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629966
    m_Localized: But there are signs of struggle. The mattress is crumpled, as if
      a pair of ponies stomped all over it. One stack of books is turned over. Same
      for the pot and those bottles from the table. They are broken, as if they fell
      after somepony kicked the table under them with all their strength. Or something
      like that. And all this remained untouched for quite some time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629967
    m_Localized: But most importantly, there is no blood. Perhaps the owner of the
      camp is alive... I need to look for some more traces
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629968
    m_Localized: Velvet`s diary found
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629969
    m_Localized: 'Oh, and here`s the diary! Probably belongs to the owner of the
      camp. Aha... There is a signature: "Velvet Remedy"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629970
    m_Localized: (reads) Well-well-well... She studied ghouls here, conducted some
      experiments... I need to study the diary in more detail later
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629971
    m_Localized: However, the camp was empty for a long time, and she clearly did
      not move out by her own free will. Who could find her here, besides ghouls?...
      The slavers from the camp above?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629972
    m_Localized: Conversation with the griffins` captives about Velvet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629973
    m_Localized: Psst, be quiet. I`m going to free you now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629974
    m_Localized: Thank you, stranger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629975
    m_Localized: But if you came for your friend, I am sorry, she`s no longer with
      us
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629976
    m_Localized: Wait, who are you talking about?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629977
    m_Localized: Another pony. We ran with her from the slavers, and she wore exactly
      the same piece of metal on her leg as you do. Are you from the same clan?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629978
    m_Localized: Please, tell me more
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629979
    m_Localized: A black unicorn with a silver mane. She said that her name was Velvet
      Remedy. After the escape, we wandered together for a while. She did not talk
      much about her past, but she was a very good medic. We separated after we met
      zebras. These creatures lured her to go with them. They pretended that they
      were ill, and your friend took the bait. We tried to talk her out of it, but
      she would not listen. By now she must be in the stomachs of the striped. I
      am sorry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629980
    m_Localized: Hmm... thank you for telling me this
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629981
    m_Localized: Congratulations! You have completed [the first level of the sewers].
      You can leave the sewer system by climbing the stairs, or go deeper by entering
      the [Exit] door. At deeper levels you will find more enemies, trials and rewards,
      and at the end of each level you can find the way out as well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629982
    m_Localized: Conversation with slavers` captive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629983
    m_Localized: Hey! You are not one of them? You don`t look like one of those...
      please, help me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629984
    m_Localized: What happened? Who put you in a cage?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629985
    m_Localized: And who are "they"?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629986
    m_Localized: The slavers! There`s a whole gang of them. They captured us during
      a raid - me and the other ponies. And now hold us in cages until they take
      us to Filly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629987
    m_Localized: They kidnap other ponies to... just use them as if they were some
      kind of property?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629988
    m_Localized: Yes! Please don`t leave me here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629989
    m_Localized: I won`t! Neither you, nor other captives
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629990
    m_Localized: But the cage is locked... I am not sure that I can handle this lock...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629991
    m_Localized: Slavers must have keys. Most likely, the chief warden has a copy.
      But don`t even think about stealing them, and taking them by force... There
      are too many of them for you alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629992
    m_Localized: We shall see about that!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629993
    m_Localized: Where are the other captives?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629994
    m_Localized: I don`t know. Must be in that big building. I hope they are still
      ok...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629995
    m_Localized: I will try to pick the lock on your cage. And if it doesn`t work,
      I`ll have to get the key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629996
    m_Localized: I just can`t believe things like this are actually happening!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629997
    m_Localized: Talk with a chief warden
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629998
    m_Localized: Ah, here you are! So, it`s you we should thank for causing us so
      much trouble?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733629999
    m_Localized: That`s right. And you must be chief warden? Do you have the keys
      from the captives` cages?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630000
    m_Localized: You bet! You want to free all that meat? Well, I sure have the keys.
      Come closer... so I can give it to you...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630001
    m_Localized: Meeting Butch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630002
    m_Localized: Oh, wow... you are a huge one! Can ponies even be of this size?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630003
    m_Localized: Er, shit, I don`t get it! What the fuck is going on here??? What
      is all this shooting? Did you lose you damned mind?|Er, I don`t get it! What
      the hay is going on here??? What is all this shooting? Did you lose you damned
      mind?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630004
    m_Localized: HEY, ARE YOU FUCKING DEAF!!?? GET YOUR ASSES HERE YOU BASTARDS,
      RIGHT NOW!!!|HEY, ARE YOU DEAF!!?? COME HERE YOU BASTARDS, RIGHT NOW!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630005
    m_Localized: Spare your breath, big boy, nopony comes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630006
    m_Localized: What`s this squeaking down there? Who are you, a flea?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630007
    m_Localized: Your gang is no more, and your captives are free. Any last words?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630008
    m_Localized: I will crush you with my left hoof, little cunt. You are finished|
      I will crush you with my left hoof, pipsqueak. You are finished
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630009
    m_Localized: Sharp Shooter`s note
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630010
    m_Localized: 'Butch! You son of a bitch! Not only do you not follow my orders,
      but you also run away so I can`t kick your ass in person? Remember, if I find
      out that you once again ignore your duties, this operation will be your last
      in my squad!

      Did I order you to start looking? I did, even you bitch
      can`t deny it. You were instructed to get your guys and personally scout the
      square 15:28 for the entrance to the Stable. It was to be done yesterday! And
      what the fuck you`ve been doing all that time? Just sitting, drinking and scratching
      balls?

      Your last chance: tonight you need to take a dozen of your bastards
      and execute my order to find the house of that sugary bitch with PipBuck, which
      your guys found a week ago. There might be a bunker just a couple of miles
      underground filled to the brim with the finest meat, and we can not miss it.
      Do you understand, Butch? We Can Not!

      If I come back from the Stable
      88, and you are still here - I`LL KICK YOUR ASS OFF!

      And yes: if I find
      out that you`ve told guys the real purpose of this little walk, I`ll cut your
      tongue myself.

      Sharp Shooter|Butch! You bastard! Not only do you not
      follow my orders, but you also run away so I can`t kick your ass in person?
      Remember, if I find out that you once again ignore your duties, this operation
      will be your last in my squad!

      Did I order you to start looking? I did,
      even you can`t deny it. You were instructed to get your guys and personally
      scout the square 15:28 for the entrance to the Stable. It was to be done yesterday!
      And what the hay you`ve been doing all that time? Just sitting, drinking and
      scratching balls?

      Your last chance: tonight you need to take a dozen
      of your bastards and execute my order to find the house of that sugary lass
      with PipBuck, which your guys found a week ago. There might be a bunker just
      a couple of miles underground filled to the brim with the finest meat, and
      we can not miss it. Do you understand, Butch? We Can Not!

      If I come
      back from the Stable 88, and you are still here - I`LL KICK YOUR ASS OFF!

      And
      yes: if I find out that you`ve told guys the real purpose of this little walk,
      I`ll cut your tongue myself.

      Sharp Shooter'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630011
    m_Localized: Light, water and fresh air!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630012
    m_Localized: FUCK IT!|Sweet!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630013
    m_Localized: A note! Let`s see what`s in it?..
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630014
    m_Localized: Oh, no... Seems like these bastards captured the "Chosen-24"! We
      need to find her and save her as soon as possible
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630015
    m_Localized: Who is this Sharp Shooter, a local boss? Judging by the note, he
      is somewhere in Stable 88. Can`t wait to meet him!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630016
    m_Localized: Stop! I do not know who you are, but do not go any further!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630017
    m_Localized: Why? What is there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630018
    m_Localized: Not what, but who. Butch, head of the slavers. Huge as a buffalo,
      and ferocious like a manticore. If he sees you, you are dead!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630019
    m_Localized: We`ll see! Don`t worry about me, let`s open your cage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630020
    m_Localized: The door to Stable 88... What can I say, quite impressive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630021
    m_Localized: You have reached the end of [the first level of the abandoned Stable].
      Enter the [exit] door to go to [second level]. At deeper levels you will find
      more enemies, trials and rewards, and it will help you gain the necessary experience
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630022
    m_Localized: Hmm... so far I have not seen a place I`m looking for. I need to
      go into deeper levels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630023
    m_Localized: This corridor to the right... As far as I know a plan of a typical
      Stable, it leads to the Stable Core and the central server. Perhaps the Quantum
      Cogitator is there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630024
    m_Localized: Go along the corridor to the right to get to [Stable Core]. Or enter
      the [Exit] door to continue exploring the new Stable level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630025
    m_Localized: Slavers` conversation about a robot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630026
    m_Localized: Report
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630027
    m_Localized: Err... Boss! There`s no way to get in while this fucking robot is
      sitting there!|Err... Boss! There`s no way to get in while this fricking robot
      is sitting there!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630028
    m_Localized: Whose problem is this? Mine? I gave the order, it means that the
      passage must be clear. You were taught dealing with robots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630029
    m_Localized: But, ehem... Boss! This is not just any robot! He killed five of
      ours within seconds!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630030
    m_Localized: I DON`T GIVE A FUCK! YOUR TASK IS TO DO AS I ORDER, AND IF I ORDER
      YOU TO KILL YOURSELF, YOU GO AND KILL YOURSELF! YOU MUST HAVE CLEARED THIS
      SECTOR THREE FUCKING DAYS AGO! DO YOU UNDERSTAND WHAT IT MEANS? IT MEANS THAT
      IF AFTER ONE HOUR I COME BACK AND DON`T SEE THIS ROBOT FUCKING BLOWN TO PIECES,
      I WILL SHOOT YOU! DO YOU UNDERSTAND, SUCKER?! DO! YOU! UNDERSTAND?!|I DON`T
      CARE! YOUR TASK IS TO DO AS I ORDER, AND IF I ORDER YOU TO KILL YOURSELF, YOU
      GO AND KILL YOURSELF! YOU MUST HAVE CLEARED THIS SECTOR THREE FRICKING DAYS
      AGO! DO YOU UNDERSTAND WHAT IT MEANS? IT MEANS THAT IF AFTER ONE HOUR I COME
      BACK AND DON`T SEE THIS ROBOT BLOWN TO PIECES, I WILL SHOOT YOU! DO YOU UNDERSTAND,
      MAGGOT?! DO! YOU! UNDERSTAND?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630031
    m_Localized: Got it, boss! Err... We`ll do it right now! Could we, you know...
      take impulse grenades?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630032
    m_Localized: Take everything you need. An hour later this robot must not be there
      anymore, I don`t care how you do it, you understand? I`m so fucking tired of
      you morons...|Take everything you need. An hour later this robot must not be
      there anymore, I don`t care how you do it, you understand? I`m so tired of
      you morons...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630033
    m_Localized: "\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630034
    m_Localized: They can`t get through here? Perhaps this is the place I was looking
      for. And this must be Sharp Shooter. Now, let`s have a chat with him...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630035
    m_Localized: "Still\u2026 what robot they were talking about?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630036
    m_Localized: Notes found on the body of the slavers` chief
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630037
    m_Localized: Oh, damn it, he`s dead! How can I learn about other "Chosen" now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630038
    m_Localized: Wait, what is this? Some kind of notes. Let`s see
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630039
    m_Localized: "Just rubbish here. Let`s read further:\n- Day five. Nothing.\n-
      Not here.\n- No\u2026\n- Aha, there!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630040
    m_Localized: Son of a bitch...|Darn bastard...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630041
    m_Localized: She escaped! Holly Celestia, she escaped!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630042
    m_Localized: Sharp Shooter`s diary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630043
    m_Localized: So, only a few hours passed after our conversation, and our glorious,
      shining, Hope of all Ponies, our Saviour, fuck-his-ass Red Eye has already
      got rid of me. Send to clear the old Stable? Seriously, bitch? Perhaps I should
      take a shovel myself, shouldn`t I, our dearest Rebuilder? I have never met
      such a vengeful bastard in my life. All right, fuck it. At least I`ll have
      some rest, while my guys have fun shooting at the tins|So, only a few hours
      passed after our conversation, and our glorious, shining, Hope of all Ponies,
      our Saviour, kiss-his-flank Red Eye has already got rid of me. Send to clear
      the old Stable? Seriously? Perhaps I should take a shovel myself, shouldn`t
      I, our dearest Rebuilder? I have never met such a vengeful bastard in my life.
      All right, screw it. Perhaps I`ll finally have some rest, while my guys have
      fun shooting at the tins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630044
    m_Localized: Day 1. My detachment gathered at dawn and went out through the northern
      gate. When I passed under the arch, I heard sentries giggling from the tower.
      These freaks lost all fear and continued laughing about my quarrel with the
      "red-eyed", even when I looked in their direction. I shot both of them, because
      you don`t mess with me. If anyone asks, I say that was for disrespecting the
      leader
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630045
    m_Localized: 'Day 21. The usual routine was interrupted with the arrival of the
      Butch`s gang. The detachment was sent to prepare maps of underground sewers,
      and during that task they came across a lone unicorn, playing with some corpse
      in a dark corner. But this is not the main thing. The thing is that she has
      a PipBuck. Guards who caught her sincerely believe that this is a scribe of
      the Steel Rangers. I won`t make them doubt their beliefs, but my experience
      says something completely different. The Steel Rangers would never have sent
      out a lone unarmed scribe. In this world, there are only three types of ponies
      that have access to such rarities as PipBuck: Steel Rangers, elite Red Eye
      guards and inhabitants of the still closed Stables. The latter are so rare
      that many believe there are no functioning Stables at all, but our captive
      clearly does not belong to the first two categories. Nooo, she`s from a Stable!
      If so, then, it seems, I am the luckiest bastard from here to Canterlot itself.
      This little chick looks like she`s just out of a test tube, and she certainly
      won`t last long in our world. So her house must be very close. If I find an
      untouched Stable full of residents... this will be the biggest prize in my
      life!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630046
    m_Localized: Day 22. Yesterday I gave my guest a day to wrack her brain and tell
      me where her home is. Today the time is out, but she is deaf to the voice of
      reason. She claims that she "does not remember" this. Hah! Unfortunately, today
      she didn`t say anything important. We will continue our conversation tomorrow.
      But dear goddess, how sweetly she shouts under the blows of a whip...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630047
    m_Localized: Day 25. The prisoner is still silent. Choking in tears, assuring
      that she remembers nothing, but does not crack. Well, I`ll give her that, in
      her Stable they really know how to teach keeping their mouth shut. I`ll have
      to start searching myself. The problem is that among Butches guys there must
      be at least a pair of spies from my competitors. As soon as they find out that
      we have found a Stable, they run off the very same evening and report to their
      masters. Hence, we will support the myth of the Steel-ass`s scribe. I`ll put
      my most reliable guys at the head of the search teams, only they will know
      the real purpose of the search
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630048
    m_Localized: Day 26. Escape of slaves. A newbie guards fell asleep at the post,
      and several fuckers escaped, including our tough chick. No longer I can hope
      to learn about the Stable entrance from the first hooves. Both of the suckers
      were hanged at dawn, but what does it matter now? Now we have to rely only
      on luck and thorough search|Day 26. Escape of slaves. A newbie guards fell
      asleep at the post, and several captives escaped, including our tough chick.
      No longer I can hope to learn about the Stable entrance from the first hooves.
      Both of the idiots were hanged at dawn, but what does it matter now? Now we
      have to rely only on luck and thorough search
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630049
    m_Localized: Central core status report
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630050
    m_Localized: The safety force fields are disabled
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630051
    m_Localized: 'State of the system:

      Reactor core: 17.56% power.

      Central
      maneframe: operational.

      Security systems: active.

      Ultra-Sentinel:
      active'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630052
    m_Localized: 'Attention!

      Leakage of radioactive materials from the reactor.

      Visiting
      the F-17 zone at this time is not recommended'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630053
    m_Localized: Quantum Cogitator... this is it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630054
    m_Localized: I did it! I did it! Hooray!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630055
    m_Localized: But now I need to contact the Mentor. I wonder... can I do it with
      help of that mainframe? It looks exactly the same as the one at the ManeTec
      factory...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630056
    m_Localized: Second conversation with the Mentor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630057
    m_Localized: "I really hope it works\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630058
    m_Localized: '*Installing new device*

      *Device connected: personal computer
      "PipBuck", model PX 778185578322 S*

      *Access rights: guest*

      *Warning:
      users of the "guest" category have limited rights. You can: create new text
      documents, view documents of the "F" category, request a communication session
      with the addressees from the contact list, adjust the temperature and humidity
      parameters of the room, play "Guess the Word" game*'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630059
    m_Localized: Open the list of available contacts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630060
    m_Localized: '*Contact list: "Internal" category - 47 addresses; "External" category
      - 35 addresses; "Primary" category - 3 addresses.*'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630061
    m_Localized: 'Search: Stable Pi'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630062
    m_Localized: '*Address "Stable Pi": matches - 1. Address status - active. Requesting
      a communication session...*'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630063
    m_Localized: '*Minutes pass by*'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630064
    m_Localized: Hello, @lp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630065
    m_Localized: Yes, it worked!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630066
    m_Localized: Hush, do not shout, I just woke up! Do you even realize it`s two
      in the morning?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630067
    m_Localized: Forgive me, I did not follow the time while I was breaking through
      the huge Stable full of robots and slavers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630068
    m_Localized: Full of what?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630069
    m_Localized: Just listen. A large group of ponies is operating here, in Stable
      88, who catch and enslave other ponies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630070
    m_Localized: "I know who slavers are, @lp\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630071
    m_Localized: .. which caught the Chosen-24 some time ago and went looking for
      our Stable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630072
    m_Localized: Wait a minute. If there is a threat to the Stable Pi, we will have
      to take very strict security measures. Are you sure about what you are saying?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630073
    m_Localized: Yes, absolutely. I read their orders. However, because of their
      paranoia, these guys kept the knowledge about our Stable secret which only
      their officers knew. I eliminated them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630074
    m_Localized: Eliminated their officers? That is... impressive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630075
    m_Localized: Nevertheless, @lp, with all due respect, I simply can not blindly
      trust your words. From this day I have no choice but to take additional precautions.
      For me and you this means that such communication sessions are no more acceptable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630076
    m_Localized: So, do you have anything to say about your main assignment?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630077
    m_Localized: I have the Cogitator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630078
    m_Localized: Splendid! Well done, @lp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630079
    m_Localized: 'So, the situation is as follows: the Cogitator is just one of several
      elements that we require. The two remaining: the Alicorn Amulet and the Black
      Book. Those are the ancient artifacts, which were studied before the war pony
      and were planned to be used in the "Rainbow" project. Both were far away from
      us in the day when the world was hit by mega-spells'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630080
    m_Localized: According to our archives, Alicorn Amulet was studied at the Research
      Institute of M.A.S. in Manehattan, while the Black Book was kept in Canterlot.
      They are your next goal. About the Cogitator - you need to give it to us. I`ll
      send you the coordinates and time for our next meeting, where a reliable...
      pony will be waiting for you. He will talk to you through the sprite-bot. Do
      not worry, you will immediately recognize that it is the one you need to talk
      to. He will take the cogitator from you, and then he will tell you whatever
      you want to know. We still can not let our secrets get into enemy hooves through
      you, but I think you deserve the right to learn more about your past
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630081
    m_Localized: Um, no! I`m going to get answers right...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630082
    m_Localized: '*Connection lost*'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630083
    m_Localized: ...now. Darn it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630084
    m_Localized: Unexpected meeting with Steel Rangers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630085
    m_Localized: Hey, you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630086
    m_Localized: Easy now. I do not wish you any harm, er, metal ponies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630087
    m_Localized: I will ask you questions, and you will answer them. Is this your
      sprite-bot?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630088
    m_Localized: What? What do you mean?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630089
    m_Localized: I asked you a question. We have a sprite-bot here in front of us.
      Is it yours?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630090
    m_Localized: You are mistaken. I do not own any sprite bots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630091
    m_Localized: Hold on, Rose. It seems that we have a misunderstanding
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630092
    m_Localized: Excuse my friend, little one. She did not mean to scare you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630093
    m_Localized: What was that, Diamond?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630094
    m_Localized: Be quiet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630095
    m_Localized: Tell me, dear, where did you get this thing on your leg?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630096
    m_Localized: Stop talking to me like this. And this "thing" belongs to me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630097
    m_Localized: Sorry, little one, but you`re wrong. The fact is that such technologies
      are a legacy of ancient times. And we are Steel Rangers, a brotherhood whose
      duty is to preserve these technologies. Therefore, we, unfortunately, do not
      have the moral right to leave such an item in danger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630098
    m_Localized: Besides, you`re not here by chance, are you? When we found this
      bot, it just hovered in one place, hiding in the bushes. Unusual behavior for
      a thoughtless machine, is it not? All the more unusual is that this robot tried
      to escape the very moment it spotted us. Somepony controlled this bot, and
      it was going to meet here with a certain pony, who was by chance passing by
      this abandoned, uninteresting place at this right moment. Do you understand
      what I mean, girl?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630099
    m_Localized: In short - you are going with us. Now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630100
    m_Localized: Why so rude? Darling, once again please forgive rude Rose. We are
      not your enemies. But we must take you to our home, where you will give us
      your PipBuck and tell us where you got it from and who controlled the sprite-bot.
      This way you will do everypony great favor, I assure you! And for this, we
      will treat you well and give you supplies for the journey. Deal?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630101
    m_Localized: I`d say this was the most unusual attempt to rob me as long as I
      can remember. No, I`m not going anywhere with you, and I am not giving you
      my PipBuck. Do you understand?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630102
    m_Localized: Yes, wanderer. We understood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630103
    m_Localized: A mercenary`s note
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630104
    m_Localized: 'Peck, this is Stinker. In short, here`s the situation. My group
      was reassigned to strengthen the main detachments of catchers, and the supervision
      of the territory was entrusted to you. There`s no time to look for you personally,
      so I leave you this note. You may think I`m fucking with you - you can leave
      everything, run to the headquarters and show her to Tweak, I`d be happy to
      watch as he kicks your butt for "insubordination." I`m serious, buddy, no lies
      now.

      You were not at the briefing of the rear-guard commanders, so I`ll
      give you the short version. We do not really expect anyone, but just in case
      everypony should watch out for the Steel-asses. These shit-mashers got a habit
      of sending spies to the places of our operations. Personally I give them no
      shit, but this kind of surveillance makes the employers nervous. Therefore,
      it is ordered to shoot every bitch on sight. It is simple to tell one: these
      gear-fuckers never, under no circumstances refuse to let go of PipBucks. It
      contradicts their principles or something. So just tell your guys to make holes
      in everypony who has such a gadget on his leg. And do not kill anypony by mistake,
      the employer needs locals alive. The convoy will be sent to you from time to
      time to pick up those ponies that you catch on the perimeter, so you don`t
      have to separate the group. I hope your guys have eyes sharp enough not to
      confuse PipBucks with bandages? Haha!|Peck, this is Stinker. In short, here`s
      the situation. My group was reassigned to strengthen the main detachments of
      catchers, and the supervision of the territory was entrusted to you. There`s
      no time to look for you personally, so I leave you this note. You may think
      I`m joking with you - you can leave everything, run to the headquarters and
      show her to Tweak, I`d be happy to watch as he kicks you up for "insubordination."
      I`m serious, buddy, no lies now.

      You were not at the briefing of the
      rear-guard commanders, so I`ll give you the short version. We do not really
      expect anyone, but just in case everypony should watch out for the Steel-flanks.
      Those mud-mashers got a habit of sending spies to the places of our operations.
      Personally I don`t mind them, but this kind of surveillance makes the employers
      nervous. Therefore, it is ordered to shoot every bastard on sight. It is simple
      to tell one: these gear-lovers never, under no circumstances refuse to let
      go of PipBucks. It contradicts their principles or something. So just tell
      your guys to make holes in everypony who has such a gadget on his leg. And
      do not kill anypony by mistake, the employer needs locals alive. The convoy
      will be sent to you from time to time to pick up those ponies that you catch
      on the perimeter, so you don`t have to separate the group. I hope your guys
      have eyes sharp enough not to confuse PipBucks with bandages? Haha!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630105
    m_Localized: Observation of the Manehatten Ruins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630106
    m_Localized: Here, a good place to look around
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630107
    m_Localized: You take out binoculars and observe surroundings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630108
    m_Localized: There are only ruins everywhere... yeah, the War did not spare this
      place...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630109
    m_Localized: Stop!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630110
    m_Localized: A tall skyscraper with a large symbol of the Ministry of Arcane
      Sciences. Strongly damaged, but even now there are at least thirty floors left
      in it. Perhaps this is the scientific research institute of M.A.S. If there
      is a place to look for the Alicorn Amulet, it is there
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630111
    m_Localized: So, what is a better way to get there... There is no passage from
      below, everything is covered with debris... But the skyscraper is connected
      with a monorail road, and you can get there from the roof of a nearby building
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630112
    m_Localized: But what are these black specks around the institute? I don`t see.
      Let me zoom in...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630113
    m_Localized: Alicorns! Fuck them manticore! There`s a whole flock of them|Alicorns!
      Celestia darn them! There`s a whole flock of them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630114
    m_Localized: But why are there so many? Perhaps that means the Amulet is really
      there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630115
    m_Localized: Trains used to run on this road... and now it`s just a hideout for
      bloodwings. But I can use it to get to the tower of MAS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630116
    m_Localized: Go to the right to get to the [MAS tower]. Or enter the [Exit] door
      to continue exploring Manehattan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630117
    m_Localized: Sprite-bot inspection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630118
    m_Localized: What do we have here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630119
    m_Localized: Looks like a common sprite-bot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630120
    m_Localized: At second glance, it doesn`t. It lacks several elements. The armament
      was removed, the "infinite" battery was replaced with a more compact and short-term
      analog. Inside the case, there is a large cavity in place of the removed elements,
      separated from other parts with roughly welded planks. No doubt, this is the
      sprite-bot, which was supposed to take the cogitator from me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630121
    m_Localized: So, the meeting failed. Sprite-bot is destroyed, and whoever was
      going to take the cogitator from me does not have such an opportunity anymore.
      Oh, buck you Nightmare Moon, freaks!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630122
    m_Localized: At least the Mentor gave explanations about two more missing elements
      of the project. I only need to find them... in the ruins of the two largest
      cities of the past... where they might be, or they might not. Wonderful, let`s
      hit the road!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630123
    m_Localized: Well, we certainly got somewhere. Looks like here they`re not going
      to shoot me right away. I need to look around and ask some questions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630124
    m_Localized: Welcome to "Prancing Pony" - the most peaceful and safe place in
      the Wasteland. Here you can rest, trade, repair equipment and get medical treatment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630125
    m_Localized: Please obey the rules. Fighting, shooting, stealing and furniture
      displacement are prohibited. Violators will be terminated
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630126
    m_Localized: The Health section of your PipBuck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630127
    m_Localized: Remember to often check your health condition! To do that, go to
      "Health" section in your PipBuck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630128
    m_Localized: "Don`t forget, you won`t survive long using health potions only.
      They sure make you feel better, but don`t get rid of serious injuries and traumas.\n         
      If you like to scout in all sorts of dangerous places, but are not an expert
      in medicine yourself, you definitely should visit a doctor on a regular basis"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630129
    m_Localized: Using a workbench
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630130
    m_Localized: Use a workbench if you need to create, repair or improve your equipment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630131
    m_Localized: "To assemble new weapons and explosives you need schematics, materials
      and appropriate skills.\n          For repairing weapons and armor you need
      necessary components and repair skill. Or you can just pay the merchant to
      do it.\n          Avoid using worn out armor and broken weapons - they will
      surely let you down in the most critical moment"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630132
    m_Localized: Welcome to the training grounds. Here you can train with melee weapons,
      firearms, grenades and magic, without disturbing anypony
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630133
    m_Localized: While you are here, your weapons will not break, and your ammo will
      not end. Shoot as much as you like!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630134
    m_Localized: You can fight any boss again, but only after you get his key. The
      boss level will match yours
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630135
    m_Localized: Meeting Daiquiri
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630136
    m_Localized: Welcome to my bar "Prancing Pony". By the way, that`s also the name
      of our settlement. We are always happy to see peaceful travelers here. Do not
      cause problems, and we will get along. And my name is Daiquiri
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630137
    m_Localized: Hi, I`m @lp. As I understand, you are in charge of this camp?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630138
    m_Localized: Sort of. At least I try to resolve all important issues. Ask me
      if you need something or just want to have a drink
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630139
    m_Localized: If you want to trade or earn a few caps, visit merchants in the
      main hall. They always have work to be done, maybe they`ll hire you to help
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630140
    m_Localized: Well, if you need to patch up, visit the clinic. Our Doc is the
      best doctor you can find around here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630141
    m_Localized: Thank you for your hospitality. If I ever need information, I will
      definitely pay you a visit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630142
    m_Localized: (to herself) Well, the first contact is officially established.
      Now I need to find out anything that might help me in my search for the factory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630143
    m_Localized: Destroyed factory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630144
    m_Localized: I came from afar and don`t know these lands. Are there any places
      worth visiting or, on the contrary, that one should avoid?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630145
    m_Localized: The only attraction here is the destroyed prewar factory. It didn`t
      get much damage during the bombing, because most of its buildings were underground.
      There are lots of valuable things preserved, locals usually go there for loot.
      The factory is simply huge, it seems it`s impossible to explore it completely
      even in ten years
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630146
    m_Localized: Factory? Sounds interesting, I`ll definitely take a look
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630147
    m_Localized: 'Sure, you are welcome, but be careful. Raiders often visit it,
      and in some places turrets are still active. You can even encounter mines -
      so look under your feet. But you will not get lost: in the corridors between
      all departments you`ll find maps, you can always find a way out with them'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630148
    m_Localized: So, how do ya find this place? Ya like it here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630149
    m_Localized: Quite alright, ponies seem friendly, and the camp itself... charming.
      And are there many places like this in the Wasteland?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630150
    m_Localized: Neigh, quite few. Aroun` here this is the only settlement, where
      they won`t try t` kill ya, rob ya or put ya in chains
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630151
    m_Localized: Do you live here, too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630152
    m_Localized: Me? No. But mah house is close by. I come here for work
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630153
    m_Localized: And what do you do, unless it is a secret?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630154
    m_Localized: There`s no secret - most o` the time Ah`m guardin` caravans here.
      But for the next few days Ah`ll be stuck here, so feel free t` ask if ya need
      anythin`
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630155
    m_Localized: Daiquiri about Falls Springs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630156
    m_Localized: I have a question for you, it`s very important to me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630157
    m_Localized: Ask away
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630158
    m_Localized: Falls Springs. Do you know this name?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630159
    m_Localized: Of course. It`s not too far from here, maybe a day`s journey or
      so. Go east along the old road you won`t miss it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630160
    m_Localized: Only... why do you want to go there? Do you know what place it is?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630161
    m_Localized: What do you mean?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630162
    m_Localized: Falls Springs is the lair of slavers. Do you have any business with
      them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630163
    m_Localized: What? With slavers? No, of course not!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630164
    m_Localized: Then it`s in your best interest not to go. Unless you want to get
      into a cage. I heard, they are especially interested in unicorns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630165
    m_Localized: "\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630166
    m_Localized: Hey, @lp! Could Ah have a word with ya?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630167
    m_Localized: Calamity about Falls Springs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630168
    m_Localized: Ah accidentally heard your conversation. Tell me honestly - ya don`t
      have any business with slavers, do ya?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630169
    m_Localized: What business? If you want to know my opinion, slave trade is disgusting!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630170
    m_Localized: Good. Ah`m glad ya think so. But why then do ya need t` go there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630171
    m_Localized: Personal matters. Do you have something against it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630172
    m_Localized: They`ll either kill ya there or put in chains an` sell t` the Red
      Eye. Ah jus` don`t understand what kind of need pulls ya there
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630173
    m_Localized: Alright. You helped me out, so I`ll tell you. Stable 88 - you heard
      about this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630174
    m_Localized: Ah, that`s why... Yeup, Ah heard that there is an entrance to some
      Stable in Falls Springs. But I also heard that ponies never come back from
      there
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630175
    m_Localized: But why? Because of the slavers?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630176
    m_Localized: No, they appeared there only recently. The main problem is not even
      them. The Stable is full of `em robots. Stable 88 is abandoned, an` no pony
      knows how long it`s been like that. Maybe they built it that way from the beginnin`,
      without ponies. Ah don`t know... it`s just rumors. Yes, there can be a lot
      of valuable good, but the risk... no, Ah would not stick mah nose into such
      a place without a good reason
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630177
    m_Localized: Its inhabitants perished? Wow... And yet I need to go there
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630178
    m_Localized: Ya`'re a stubborn one, Ah like it! Then if ya want t` survive, listen
      t` mah words very carefully
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630179
    m_Localized: The slavers camp is well fortified. Around it - a high wall, impossible
      t`climb over, and with towers for snipers and machine gunners. Ya come straight
      to the main gate - ya get a dozen extra holes in yer body. But ya can try t`
      enter through the sewers. One runaway slave told me that he had escaped this
      way. It`s dangerous there as well, but at least there ya`ll have a chance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630180
    m_Localized: Hmm... thank you. Your advice might save my life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630181
    m_Localized: Well, good luck then! If ya manage to get into that Stable under
      slavers` nose... Oh yeah, that will be some news! Many folks here will sure
      ask ya t` bring some things from there. Ya can make good money, ya know
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630182
    m_Localized: Calamity about Manehattan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630183
    m_Localized: Here you are, @lp!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630184
    m_Localized: You were waiting for me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630185
    m_Localized: Of course! You don`t meet a pony every day, who manage to kick slavers`
      flanks!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630186
    m_Localized: After yer askin` `bout Falls Springs, Ah was worried `bout ya, @lp.
      Ah decided to fly an` look in case ya got in the hooves of `em freaks. But
      what Ah found was a bunch of corpses and empty cages. Ah reckon ya really know
      how t` stand up for yourself
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630187
    m_Localized: And you didn`t just shoot a bunch of bad ponies, @lp. This group
      could threaten our camp. And my experience says that if it were not for you
      and your courage, in the near future we would surely have to stain our hooves
      with their blood. Or try on slave chains
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630188
    m_Localized: As the head of this settlement, I can not leave your action unnoticed.
      For help in dealing with slavers threat, you deserve a good reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630189
    m_Localized: Thanks for this. But, to be honest, I did it primarily for my own
      purpose, not out of altruism. Do not waste your compliments on me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630190
    m_Localized: Oh, by the way. Have ya achieved yer goal, @lp? Unless, ya know,
      it`s secret
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630191
    m_Localized: Yes, it`s alright, I got what I needed from there. But now it seems
      that I need to go even further
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630192
    m_Localized: Oh yeah? An` where now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630193
    m_Localized: Manehattan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630194
    m_Localized: Don`t
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630195
    m_Localized: Why?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630196
    m_Localized: Except that it`s quite far? Red Eye and the Goddess are having a
      big hunt there now. Poor local ponies are chased like animals and taken to
      Fillydelphia
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630197
    m_Localized: '@lp, I know that ye`re used t` dealin` with slavers now, but there
      everythin` is different. There are more of `em, and Talons and alicorns will
      join `em'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630198
    m_Localized: Honestly, I don`t even know who those ponies are
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630199
    m_Localized: Oh, you stable ponies...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630200
    m_Localized: Ayep
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630201
    m_Localized: I`ll explain, @lp. Talons are not ponies, they are griffins. Have
      ya heard of such creatures?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630202
    m_Localized: I recall something...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630203
    m_Localized: So, Talons are griffin mercenaries. Ah don`t know how t` say this,
      but... they live a different life. An` have other principles. In general they
      are like normal folks, but instead of conscience they have contracts. Who pays
      `em - that`s their friend. An` now they are paid by Red Eye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630204
    m_Localized: They`ve been mercenaries for decades, an` they`ve earned lots of
      caps fer their work. An` they spend these caps t` buy the most deadly guns
      in the entire Equestrian Wasteland. Thus fightin` even one of `em is a risky
      business. An` there will be a whole battalion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630205
    m_Localized: But even they are not as dangerous as alicorns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630206
    m_Localized: In fact, little is known about what they actually are. They look
      like the Princesses, but they have nothing to do with them. They are ruthless,
      arrogant and selfish. And they are extremely strong in magic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630207
    m_Localized: But that`s not all. I have no idea how, but they are constantly
      connected with each other telepathically. They call this "Unity" and aim to
      forcibly "unite" everypony they capture. It is ruled by a certain Goddess,
      she tells the others what to do, commanding from somewhere deep inside the
      old Mariponi base
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630208
    m_Localized: An` they are partners with Red Eye, so her alicorns are now helping
      slavers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630209
    m_Localized: 'An` here`s a cherry on top: ponies that were rescued from Manehattan
      say they saw a particularly large alicorn. They say it`s scary like an eternal
      night, an` deadly like a pack of hellhounds'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630210
    m_Localized: Do you still want t` go there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630211
    m_Localized: No. I don`t want to go at all. But I must
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630212
    m_Localized: Still going, huh? Pity. Well, then I can only wish one thing, @lp.
      Good luck out there
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630213
    m_Localized: Right. Good luck, @lp. Come back in one piece
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630214
    m_Localized: An` here, take this. Yer goin` t` need it in Manehattan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630215
    m_Localized: Red Eye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630216
    m_Localized: Calamity, I`ve long wanted to ask one thing. Who is this Red Eye?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630217
    m_Localized: I`ve already heard about him several times, including from you,
      but I still do not know anything except that he is the leader of slavers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630218
    m_Localized: Ayep, that`s right. He actually commands `em bastards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630219
    m_Localized: But he not jus` orders `em to grab everypony and send `em to Fillydelphia.
      He seriously believes that he saves folks. Builds a new world. Well, or he
      says so
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630220
    m_Localized: He has a base in Fillydelphia, or rather a whole city. Slaves work
      there `til they die, building factories in which they then build weapons fer
      Red Eye`s armies. They say the city`s grown really big, but Ah`ve never been
      there
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630221
    m_Localized: An` every day he rubs his ideas into folks brains `bout how they
      must suffer fer the sake of their children`s future
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630222
    m_Localized: It`s all bullshit, @lp. What future can be built on bones? Slaves
      die for his ideas, an` his slavers are merely bandits. That ain`t how ya build
      the future
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630223
    m_Localized: But there are those who believe him. That`s how he gets new recruits
      fer his army. And he recruits often, `cuz normal ponies greet his jerks with
      a bullet between eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630224
    m_Localized: Yes, now everything got clearer. Thank you, Calamity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630225
    m_Localized: I`ll try teaching his acolytes some manners
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630226
    m_Localized: Don`t ya get carried away, @lp. The least of all Ah want is fer
      ya t` be killed or taken into slavery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630227
    m_Localized: 'Yeah, one more thin`: in his speeches he often brags that he came
      outta Stable. T` be honest, there are not many intact Stables left now. Did
      anypony leave yer Stable durin` last ten years? Besides ya, `f course'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630228
    m_Localized: I have no idea. He`s from the Stable, you say?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630229
    m_Localized: Ayep
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630230
    m_Localized: It`s getting more and more interesting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630231
    m_Localized: Alicorn Amulet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630232
    m_Localized: Oh!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630233
    m_Localized: STAND STILL, MORTAL. YOU ARE BEING ADDRESSED BY THE EMISSARY OF
      THE UNITY!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630234
    m_Localized: Can you please stop yelling?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630235
    m_Localized: SILENCE! YOU DARED STEPPING ON THE GROUNDS BELONGING THE VOICE OF
      THE GODDESS`S WILL, THE KEEPER OF THE AMULET!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630236
    m_Localized: Alicorn Amulet, I presume?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630237
    m_Localized: SILENCE!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630238
    m_Localized: YOU ALSO DARED KILLING OUR SISTERS, TREACHEROUSLY ATTACKING THEM
      FROM BEHIND!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630239
    m_Localized: UNITY HAS PASSED ITS SENTENCE. YOUR DESERVE ONLY DEATH
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630240
    m_Localized: AND WE COME TO EXECUTE YOU
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630241
    m_Localized: YOU HAVE NO CHANCE WINNING US IN A HONORABLE FIGHT, WORM. THE WRATH
      OF THE GODDESS WILL BURN YOU TO ASHES. SURRENDER, AND UNITY WILL LET YOU DIE...
      LESS PAINFULLY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630242
    m_Localized: Meeting with Blood Moon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630244
    m_Localized: SO, THE MIGHTY KILLER OF ALICORNS PAYED US A VISIT. WE ARE CHARMED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630245
    m_Localized: Right. And you are next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630246
    m_Localized: YOUR SPIRIT IS IMPRESSIVE, BUT YOUR BODY IS WEAK. YOU ARE NOTHING,
      A PITIFUL DUST BEFORE THE HOOVES OF THE GODDESS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630247
    m_Localized: YET YOU ARE NOR HOPELESS, DUST. YOUR POTENTIAL IS GREAT, AND THE
      GODDESS THINKS YOU ARE WORTHY TO BECOME. ONE. OF US.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630248
    m_Localized: ACCEPT YOUR DESTINY, MORTAL, AND BECOME A PART OF UNITY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630249
    m_Localized: What`s in it for me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630250
    m_Localized: THE GODDESS IS WILLING TO LET YOU IN OUR RANKS. YOU CAN MERGE WITH
      US, BECOME A SINGLE AND POWERFUL MIND, BECOME ONE OF THE GREAT, WHO WILL INHERIT
      EQUESTRIA! POWER OF THE GODDESS`S ALICORNS IS NO MATCH FOR ANY PITIFUL SLAVE,
      AND YOU EITHER JOIN THE UNITY OR YOUR BURN IN ITS FLAMES. CHOOSE, MORTAL! CHOOSE,
      FOR THIS THE MOST IMPORTANT MOMENT OF YOUR ENTIRE MISERABLE LIFE!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630251
    m_Localized: Mmm, well... nah, not interested
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630252
    m_Localized: WHAT ARROGANCE. WHAT STUPIDITY!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630253
    m_Localized: THEN YOU DIE, INSECT!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630254
    m_Localized: That`s it, isn`t it? The Alicorn Amulet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630255
    m_Localized: Yes, it certainly is! Just holding it in my hooves, I feel strange
      trembling run through my muscles. I seem to be filling with strength
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630256
    m_Localized: What happens if I put it on?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630257
    m_Localized: Not so fast, Amulet!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630258
    m_Localized: It must not wear it, that`s for certain. And I won`t. I`m good just
      keeping it with me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630259
    m_Localized: I`ll give it to the Mentor`s courier as soon as I have another chance
      to meet him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630260
    m_Localized: Calamity about Canterlot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630261
    m_Localized: Hi Calamity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630262
    m_Localized: 'It`s good t` see ya, @lp. I almost lost hope that ya come back.

      However`s
      that lil business of yours?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2733630263
    m_Localized: Better than it could be
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823744
    m_Localized: It`s done? No more jumpin` into the jaws of danger?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823745
    m_Localized: I`m afraid that it`s not quite finished. Now I need to visit Canterlot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823746
    m_Localized: 'Canterlot?..

      There are easier ways t` die, ya know. What
      business brings ya t` Canterlot?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823747
    m_Localized: I`m doing this for my Stable. Believe me, this is really important
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823748
    m_Localized: 'Ah hoped Ah wouldn`t hear that again.

      Are you sure about
      this?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823749
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823750
    m_Localized: I am
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823751
    m_Localized: 'Suit yerself. But Ah can`t help ya here. Not at all.

      Myself
      Ah`ve never been t` those parts before. Ah only know what others say. An` they
      say lil'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823752
    m_Localized: In any case, I know less than you do. Tell me what you know about
      Canterlot, maybe that will save my life there
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823753
    m_Localized: 'Well, listen then.

      Ah was told many horrible stories about
      this city. Before the war, it was our capital, Celestia and Luna lived there.
      Well, zebras reserved for it the most filthy thin` they could. Some kind of
      fierce gas, which is called the Pink Cloud. It kills very quickly, worse, melting
      and fusing everything it touches'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823754
    m_Localized: '"Fusing"?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823755
    m_Localized: 'Ayep. Ya know, there were two things - now there`s one. Ya are
      carryin` yer PipBuck thingy on yer leg, boom - it`s stuck to ya, so that ya
      can`t put it off without tearing it apart from yer own meat. I don`t know whether
      this is jus` a story t` scare foals or not, but Ah wouldn`t test it.

      Ah
      don`t know what exactly happened, but there`s lots of this Cloud there. An`
      I did not hear `bout anypony returnin` from Canterlot. Unless they jus` peeked
      inside and quickly got outta that place'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823756
    m_Localized: Ah also heard there are ghosts, souls of the dead ponies. They died
      in such a horrible way that they can no longer leave our world, an` now they
      live there, in Canterlot. An` their only joy is to take somepony fresh with
      `em. An` they really can!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823757
    m_Localized: Ah can`t tell ya exactly how t` get there. Ah know that Canterlot
      is far t` the North from us. Ah reckon, all roads should lead there, since
      it was the capital. So in your place, Ah would jus` find a major highway t`
      the north and walk along it, until Ah found something t` guide mahself further
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823758
    m_Localized: I think your bits of advice will help me a lot, Calamity. Thank
      you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823759
    m_Localized: '@lp?

      Ya shouldn`t go there, ya know? Ah don`t know what`s
      goin` on there with your Stable, but no pony should risk their lives that much.
      Ya can stay with us, folks will be happy to let ya in. Ya`ll join the patrol,
      or become apprentice to Winry, maybe open yer business even. Ya`re a good gal,
      everypony can see that. Jus` stay'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823760
    m_Localized: I will stay with you. Someday. But not now. I can not give up my
      mission now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823761
    m_Localized: Ya shouldn`t do this, @lp. It`s yer decision, `fcourse, but Ah say
      ye`re makin` a mistake. At least tell me, what is that ye`re fightin` for?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823762
    m_Localized: Sorry, Calamity. I just can`t. It`s how it should be
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823763
    m_Localized: Well then, good luck to ya. Again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823764
    m_Localized: 'One last question.

      "I hoped I wouldn`t hear that again".
      What was that about?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823765
    m_Localized: Ah don`t know mahself. Don`t ya mind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823766
    m_Localized: Meeting with zebras
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823767
    m_Localized: Stay where you are! Hold your hooves so that I can see them. I don`t
      know if you noticed, but your disguise is not working!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823768
    m_Localized: Do not threaten us, stranger. There is just one of you and five
      of us. You would be better off if everypony just went their own way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823769
    m_Localized: If this is another trick, you`ll regret it. Where are you going?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823770
    m_Localized: Ponies are not friends with the Legion, therefore you are no enemy
      to us. We are going home. Do ponies kill those who return home?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823771
    m_Localized: Legion? What is that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823772
    m_Localized: Our enemy, and yours as well. Zebras, trapped in the past and still
      fighting the War that ended two hundred years ago. They kill ponies without
      warning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823773
    m_Localized: Yes, I`ve met those before. Frankly, because of them, I expected
      you to attack me. I`m glad you are different
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823774
    m_Localized: Zebra should not be enemies of ponies. We fought before, and what
      have we achieved? We always welcome new friends in these lands. And we learned
      that you, ponies, can respond to hospitality with kindness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823775
    m_Localized: In fact, we recently met a very kind pony. The black mare saved
      lives of two of our brothers, and then came with them to our home and now saves
      even more lives. If it was not for her, we would have to say farewell to many
      zebras
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823776
    m_Localized: Black pony? Does she by any chance have a device like this one on
      my leg?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823777
    m_Localized: Yes, she wears the same one. Do you know each other?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823778
    m_Localized: I have to speak with her. Please, take me to your home
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823779
    m_Localized: We will take you with us, stranger. But be aware that we will not
      let you hurt her. Do not even try
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823780
    m_Localized: Deal. Let`s go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823781
    m_Localized: So, this is your settlement? Looks... modest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823782
    m_Localized: We have to survive in difficult conditions. However, in this northern
      wilderness there is little risk of encountering soldiers of the Legion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823783
    m_Localized: Do they bother you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823784
    m_Localized: Fortunately, no. We are considered traitors and criminals, and they
      will kill us at first sight without any warning. Therefore, we are forced to
      hide. But in their eyes we are nothing more than an annoying insect - and as
      long as they have more important problems, they will not be looking for us.
      However when the Legion decides to come, we will be discovered, sooner or later
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823785
    m_Localized: Then, perhaps you should go further to the North?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823786
    m_Localized: There is no use hiding from scouts and spies of the Legion. And
      if we go north, we will move further away from the sources of food and supplies
      known to us. We are not the only zebras who hide from the Legion. But neither
      we nor other settlements have so far been able to find anything worthwhile
      to the north of Canterlot. There is nowhere to go
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823787
    m_Localized: And how are you going to live then?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823788
    m_Localized: More or less the way we live now. At least they are not trying to
      kill us here. That`s already something
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823789
    m_Localized: You wanted to see our pony friend. She must be in that building
      ahead, taking care of Zira
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823790
    m_Localized: Yeah, thank you, uh... We never introduced ourselves, did we?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823791
    m_Localized: Askari
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823792
    m_Localized: '@lp. Thanks again'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823793
    m_Localized: Meeting Velvet Remedy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823794
    m_Localized: Velvet? Chosen-24?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823795
    m_Localized: Have we met?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823796
    m_Localized: 'Sometime in the past - probably. In the present - not yet.

      I
      am Chosen-25. My name is @lp. I was sent to finish the mission that you were
      sent to execute. Glad to finally meet you'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823797
    m_Localized: 'Poor child...

      They erased your memory as well, didn`t they?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823798
    m_Localized: That`s right
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823799
    m_Localized: And sent to get some data to the old factory?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823800
    m_Localized: Yes, they did
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823801
    m_Localized: I hope you were smart enough not to do this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823802
    m_Localized: I found the data and gave it to the Mentor. I also received new
      assignments from him, and one of them leads me to Canterlot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823803
    m_Localized: 'Holy Celestia...

      Do you have any idea what you`re doing?
      Did you learn anything about the project?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823804
    m_Localized: No, it was deleted right after I sent it to Stable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823805
    m_Localized: 'Then there`s still a chance to bring you to reason.

      You
      should not help those ponies, you see? What Mentor is looking for is a weapon,
      and this weapon will only bring pain to this world. Even more pain'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823806
    m_Localized: How do you know?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823807
    m_Localized: I saw the notes. I read them. The "Sun" project has only one goal
      - destruction. The weapon of such power can not do any good
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823808
    m_Localized: Any weapon can be used for protection or at least a warning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823809
    m_Localized: 'Look around, @lp. See? These are the consequences of a "warning".
      Once ponies thought that the more guns they had, the safer they would be. Now
      a handful of their descendants survive on the charred remains of what those
      ponies called home.

      Even if this so-called "Mentor" believes in good
      intentions of this project, the result will still be the same. And Stable Pi
      will rot with everything it touches'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823810
    m_Localized: This world and those ponies do not need any more weapons, @lp. They
      need to live. Live and prosper. Isn`t this our task? We must be helping those
      poor ponies, zebras and other races that live here, not killing them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823811
    m_Localized: Not all ponies are ready to accept help, Velvet. Can`t you see this?
      You were a prisoner of slavers, you know that! How did they treat you? How
      do they deal with all who fall into their hooves? Get rid of weapons, and you`ll
      spend your last days in slave chains!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823812
    m_Localized: There are other ways to protect yourself and without the "Sun" project,
      @lp. For centuries Stable Pi lived without it, it will live on for centuries.
      The Mentor only makes it worse for us and for themselves, trying to complete
      this sinister project of the past
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823813
    m_Localized: You just brush off all Mentors arguments. But why don`t you think
      that this weapon might be intended for some higher purpose? What do you really
      know about its potential use? Those schemes said nothing about this, did they?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823814
    m_Localized: Yes, they did not. But weapons can have only one purpose - to kill.
      And no matter how much its owners pretend to be defenders, sooner or later
      they too become murderers. There are no other options in this goddesses-forsaken
      world. I`ve been here longer than you, @lp, I know this. I see it every day.
      The Mentor will end up the same way, and drag others along with him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823815
    m_Localized: And what if everything is different? What if the weapon helps defeat
      the evil of this world? Defeat the Red Eye, defeat the Goddess? Wouldn`t this
      make Equestria better? Just imagine that the ponies you are helping will no
      longer face the fate of dying in slavery or becoming alicorns. Is it not worth
      fighting for?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823816
    m_Localized: You are very naive, @lp. All the weapons, every carbine and knife
      that were created in Equestria were made for the same purpose that you are
      talking about now. For the sake of protection. And each time they failed and
      made things only worse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823817
    m_Localized: 'But this time we know the price of the mistake, Velvet! This time
      we understand what we are fighting for and what we want to prevent. Those ponies
      that lived then did not know this. And so they died.

      I believe the Mentor.
      I believe that he understands what he wants to achieve. Understands much better
      than me or you. And that he will do no evil'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823818
    m_Localized: 'I can not agree with you, @lp. You have your own truth, I have
      mine. I can only hope that you are right, and I am not, because I won`t be
      able to stop you if everything goes wrong and not as you planned. But I will
      ask you about one thing.

      Promise me that if the Mentor turns not to
      be who you expect him to be, you will not let him do anything wrong to Equestria'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823819
    m_Localized: I promise. I know that he won`t do anything wrong, but I promise
      you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823820
    m_Localized: Thank you, @lp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823821
    m_Localized: I am glad I found you, Velvet. After all, we are from the same Stable.
      It means a lot to find a pony that can understand you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823822
    m_Localized: From the same Stable. With the same story. They erased our memory
      in order to protect themselves from threats, then ruthlessly thrown us out
      to face them. Now few things could really surprise us, don`t you think?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823823
    m_Localized: Yeah
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823824
    m_Localized: Converstaion with Velvet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823825
    m_Localized: Like I said, now I`m heading to Canterlot. Do you know anything
      about that place?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823826
    m_Localized: I still insist that you should forget about your mission, @lp. If
      not for the sake of ridding the world of a potential threat, then at least
      for your own safety
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823827
    m_Localized: I will not give up on my goal, Velvet. I`m sorry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823828
    m_Localized: Alright, I`ll accept your position
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823829
    m_Localized: 'Zebras living here sometimes wander into Canterlot. It is very
      dangerous, but if you know where the threat comes from, there is a chance to
      return from there alive.

      Ask the Zambezi about this, she has already
      been to the city several times. Sometimes the need for survival can make you
      take a terrible risk'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823830
    m_Localized: Thank you. But can you tell me more about this settlement?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823831
    m_Localized: 'Of course.

      Covertsign is the refuge of those zebras that
      rejected the call of the Legion. The zebras of the Legion hate ponies with
      all their hearts and believe that they must destroy us all. They require each
      zebra to stand under its banner in this holy war. If some zebras refuse, they
      become the same enemy of the Legion as ponies'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823832
    m_Localized: Covertsign is their hideout, here Legion won`t find them. But it
      is very difficult to survive in this wilderness. Many get sick, the whole camp
      is forced to starve from time to time. They get the necessary resources either
      by long trips to abandoned cities, or extremely dangerous raids into Canterlot.
      But few dare to take the second option, and those who do are considered as
      heroes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823833
    m_Localized: I came here when I met a group of local zebras that explored the
      ruins of Manehattan. They needed medical attention, which they had nowhere
      to get from. I helped them to reach their home, and now here I am treating
      all those in need. They need help much more than some other ponies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823834
    m_Localized: Thank you, Velvet. Perhaps I will also be able to help them with
      something
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823835
    m_Localized: That would be great
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823836
    m_Localized: This bird, it`s... beautiful...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823837
    m_Localized: Qwirrr!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823838
    m_Localized: I do not know what to say... I would love to have such a friend
      as well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823839
    m_Localized: Zambezi about Canterlot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823840
    m_Localized: Hello!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823841
    m_Localized: Good day to you, traveler. My name is Zambezi. And what is your
      name?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823842
    m_Localized: '@lp. Nice to meet you. I was told that you are the zebra who knows
      about dangers of Canterlot more than anypony else'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823843
    m_Localized: This is true, I will not deny it. I made many journeys to the Damned
      City. Does your path lead to the very same walls?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823844
    m_Localized: Unfortunately it does. I really need to get to Canterlot. Can you
      help me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823845
    m_Localized: Knowledge is a great power, and usually it is not received for free.
      But those who try to profit from those in desperate need will be cursed by
      the spirits of their ancestors forever and ever. I will tell you everything
      I know, @lp, and I will not ask a single cap for it. Listen carefully
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823846
    m_Localized: Once upon a time zebras and ponykind began a war among themselves.
      Small at first, their discord grew every year, and no one could extinguish
      this fire, until the world was burned to the ground in flames of anger and
      fear. When this happened, the strongest zebra shamans resorted to the most
      terrible spells that exist in this world - necromancy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823847
    m_Localized: 'They created a magical gas called the Pink Cloud and placed it
      into amulets, from which it was flowing as an endless stream. These amulets
      were secretly hidden in the bowels of the capital of ponykind, and when the
      hour came, the mighty clouds of pink death burst into streets of the city.

      But
      those who were unlucky to get into these clouds rarely found peace. And after
      death they are doomed to rise again and again, wandering aimlessly through
      the streets that once were familiar to them. If you are unlucky enough to encounter
      these poor souls, make sure that their body is no longer able to rise'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823848
    m_Localized: But not only these poor ponies will threaten you there. So strong
      was hatred of shamans who created the Pink Cloud, that it still lives in the
      shadows of the castles and palaces of the Damned City. Breathing it means death,
      but even the best mask will not protect you from it, and armor will only cause
      your demise. Everything that the cloud touches merges together, and so your
      armor will bite into your body and will never let go. If you have to go into
      these cursed clouds, take off everything that is unnecessary and keep away
      from your body
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823849
    m_Localized: In some places the Pink Cloud became so dense that it turned liquid
      or almost solid state. Do not even think about stepping on those lumps of pink
      slime, as they will burst under your feet like an overripe mutafruit. And then
      you will get to know all the dark power of the Cloud like in the day it was
      released into our world
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823850
    m_Localized: The darkest spawn of the Cloud are the necrosprites. Once you see
      them, you will remember their shapeless appearance until the end of your days.
      The black haze that came to life by an evil trick and set off to kill. Do not
      even try to defeat them with a usual weapon - it will pass through the darkness
      as if you are trying to cut through the shadow. The only thing that can cleanse
      this dark spawn is magic, otherwise you will have no choice but to run and
      not look back, as far as your hooves will carry you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823851
    m_Localized: The dark magic of the Cloud influenced even inanimate objects. Technical
      devices from old times, such as loudspeakers and radio, themselves became transmitters
      of evil power. They fill streets with hymns of insanity and death, and if you
      hear them - destroy the source without approaching it or just leave and do
      not return
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823852
    m_Localized: What, the whole place is a deathtrap? Is there anything that doesn`t
      threaten with a quick death?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823853
    m_Localized: One more thing, a new threat appeared recently in the Cursed City.
      Pale resemblances of your ancient Goddesses, creatures with wings and horns
      roam ancient ruins and catacombs. Dim shadows on the walls betray their presence,
      and terrible fate awaits those who will not notice the danger. I can not tell
      what motivates them, but I would not try to talk to these corrupted creatures
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823854
    m_Localized: It`s... a lot to think about. Perhaps now I want to go there even
      less
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823855
    m_Localized: Only a great need can push ponies and zebras to come to that place.
      If your goal is so important, for its sake you will have to enter the jaws
      of the Abyss
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823856
    m_Localized: 'I was not going to give up. Thank you, Zambezi. Just tell me one
      more thing: what`s the fastest way to get to Canterlot?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823857
    m_Localized: The easiest way to get in there is by the old road to the North
      of the city. To reach it go East from here for half an hour. Then turn right
      along the road, and if you leave now, by the end of the day you will see the
      domes of Canterlot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823858
    m_Localized: Thanks again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823859
    m_Localized: Hey, Velvet! What happened to this zebra, is she sick?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823860
    m_Localized: This is Zira. Yes, I`m afraid she has some kind of fever. For several
      days she remains unconscious, and I can`t do anything. Apparently, my knowledge
      of medicine is still not enough...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823861
    m_Localized: Mind if I have a look?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823862
    m_Localized: If you`re trained in medicine, then of course. Perhaps you can at
      least help to make the right diagnosis
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823863
    m_Localized: You examine the sick zebra, but, apart from the fever and rapid
      breathing, you do not see any particular symptoms. Your knowledge of medicine
      is clearly not enough here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823864
    m_Localized: You examine the sick zebra and notice a number of characteristic
      symptoms. Tons of medical journals you read gave you the opportunity to recollect
      some rare diseases, match the symptoms and establish a diagnosis
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823865
    m_Localized: I think I know what`s wrong with her. By all symptoms it appears
      to be a dusty fever
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823866
    m_Localized: Hmm... Yes, perhaps you`re right. But this is a very rare disease,
      how... well, doesn`t matter. If so, then there is no chance curing her with
      potions or spells. Only the vaccine will help, but I have no idea where to
      get it. You see, everything that we have at our disposal is old pre-war reserves
      and potions of our own production
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823867
    m_Localized: Perhaps Doc Sepsis can help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823868
    m_Localized: May be. At least we can`t find a better doctor anyway. I understand,
      @lp, that you have a lot to do, but if you could...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823869
    m_Localized: Of course, Velvet, no problem. I`ll pay Doc a visit as soon as possible
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823870
    m_Localized: Hurry, please. I don`t know how much time she has
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823871
    m_Localized: Hi, Doc. There is a very urgent matter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823872
    m_Localized: Speak. Somepony needs help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823873
    m_Localized: Yes. One... pony... has a dust fever. I need a vaccine, otherwise...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823874
    m_Localized: Otherwise it dies. I see. But are you sure that it has this disease?
      It is quite rare
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823875
    m_Localized: All symptoms confirm so
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823876
    m_Localized: '"All symptoms"? So you decided to become a doctor now? Do you realize
      that this is not stuff to play with? The very life of a pony depends on your
      decision, and if you misdiagnose the disease, the patient can easily die, while
      you wonder why your treatment didn`t work'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823877
    m_Localized: 'Doc, I understand that this is serious and I don`t have the proper
      education to qualify for the doctoral degree. However, I spent quite a long
      time studying materials on medicine, and the symptoms of the patient exactly
      match with the description of dusty fever: the patient has some lacrimation,
      reddening of the mucous membrane of the eye and inflammation of the eyelid,
      as if from sand, although examination for foreign objects under the eyelids
      and in the eye corners gave no results. The temperature is noticeably higher
      than usual catarrhal temperatures and rather indicates a viral infection, but
      there is no sweating characteristic for such diseases, and...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823878
    m_Localized: Alright, enough. If these are real symptoms, then I agree, most
      likely, the patient really has a dusty fever. I can not say anything for sure
      without a personal examination, but this time I trust your observations
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823879
    m_Localized: Five thousand caps
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823880
    m_Localized: Wow! Isn`t this too much?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823881
    m_Localized: I got one ampoule of this vaccine for four thousand five hundred
      caps from a passing by travelling merchant, and I bought it, not knowing if
      I ever have patients with such a disease at all. And all this time I kept it
      in appropriate storage conditions, which, by the way, consume electricity.
      And the fuel for generators is not free, you know. So better say "thank you"
      for selling you medicine almost at cost price and not mentioning your income
      from selling goods you bring from pre-war ruins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823882
    m_Localized: For goddesses` sake! Alright, give me the vaccine, I`ll pay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823883
    m_Localized: You inject patient with a vaccine and almost immediately notice
      positive changes. Her breathing becomes even and deep, and the heat subsides.
      It seems that the crisis has passed and now she will cure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823884
    m_Localized: That`s better, Zira, get well soon. What a pleasant feeling when
      you help others!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823885
    m_Localized: I should visit her in a day or two and check how she`s doing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823886
    m_Localized: '@lp! I`m glad that you came. It`s about Zira'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823887
    m_Localized: What? What is it? Does she feel better?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823888
    m_Localized: Yes! Most likely, she will have to stay in bed for a long time,
      but the danger has passed, there is no doubt about it. And it`s all thanks
      to you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823889
    m_Localized: Please, it was nothing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823890
    m_Localized: No, @lp! To save somepony`s life is not "nothing"! In fact, at our
      first meeting you seemed to me no better than most of the wasteland inhabitants,
      who only know how to take a life. But you proved that you are capable of more
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823891
    m_Localized: Here, I have a little present for you. This is the figure of the
      best pony, whose kindness and compassion knew no boundaries - Fluttershy, the
      head of the Ministry of Peace. May she always be with you, just as she is with
      me...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823892
    m_Localized: Everything is ok. Now let her have some sleep
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823893
    m_Localized: She urgently needs treatment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823894
    m_Localized: Hello. Aren`t you @lp?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823895
    m_Localized: You woke up? Glad to see that! Hello! Yes it`s me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823896
    m_Localized: Velvet told me that you got the medicine that saved me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823897
    m_Localized: Well, that was not that hard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823898
    m_Localized: "Perhaps it really wasn\u2019t"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823899
    m_Localized: How do you...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823900
    m_Localized: Perhaps it really was easy for you to get that medicine. Perhaps
      I could have recovered without it. Perhaps...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823901
    m_Localized: 'I don`t know what to say. I am surprised!

      Here at Covertsign
      we always help each other. It should be like that, we cannot survive without
      it. But we live together. We are all together. And you... just a passer-by'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823902
    m_Localized: Well, it`s just that since I could help, why should I not?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823903
    m_Localized: 'What is that to you? You helped without getting anything in return.
      In our world this can turn out badly, everypony knows that. It`s not easy to
      survive, every little thing is valuable. You and your friend are so... amazing!
      Yes, amazing.

      If you were stupid that would be understandable. But stupid
      ponies do not live long'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823904
    m_Localized: 'Velvet told us many things. About how the world used to be, that
      we need needs to help others. I don`t know, I don`t think that you can live
      like that now. But the two of you managed somehow.

      Thanks for help.
      For helping me, even though you didn`t know me at all. And that you live not
      like we live. You and Velvet... I do not understand you, but I enjoy seeing
      that you manage living like this'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823905
    m_Localized: I don`t know if my answer helps, I`m just glad to see that somepony
      feels better. Somepony who doesn`t ruin lives of other ponies. Or zebras
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823906
    m_Localized: I do not know you, perhaps I never will. But Velvet said the same
      thing. In this you are similar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823907
    m_Localized: About the Pink Cloud
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823908
    m_Localized: Canterlot! The former capital of Equestria... Once it must have
      been a beautiful city. What have they done to you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823909
    m_Localized: Many dangers await in the ruins of Canterlot, the most dangerous
      among them are the Pink Cloud and dark magic. Remember that armor does not
      protect from dark spells, and only makes effects of the pink cloud worse! Experienced
      stalkers who visited Canterlot strongly advise against wearing any armor at
      all
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823910
    m_Localized: Transmitters
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823911
    m_Localized: What is this... argh! I hear some annoying noise, squeezing my head
      like a vice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823912
    m_Localized: Ah, there it is, a loudspeaker, damned sound is coming from it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823913
    m_Localized: It`s dangerous approaching it any closer. I wonder if I can hit
      it from this distance?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823914
    m_Localized: Meeting with SteelHooves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823915
    m_Localized: Greetings, stranger. I guess, hardly any of us expected to meet
      a sensible pony in this place
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823916
    m_Localized: That`s right. What ponies like you seek in Canterlot?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823917
    m_Localized: Ponies like us? Sounds like you`ve met our comrades before, haven`t
      you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823918
    m_Localized: I have. Unfortunately, we did not get along very well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823919
    m_Localized: Permission to speak, Star Paladin? As far as I can tell, it is the
      pony that killed Riven Diamond and Scarlet Rose
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823920
    m_Localized: Really? Is that true, stranger?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823921
    m_Localized: What? No! That`s not what I meant when I said...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823922
    m_Localized: I saw her on a video recording from the Scarlet Rose`s armor. There
      can be no mistake
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823923
    m_Localized: Just try doing something!..
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823924
    m_Localized: Don`t rush to conclusions. We are not your enemies, unlike you probably
      think
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823925
    m_Localized: Knights that you killed have long been a problem. Moreover, they
      were active supporters of our Elder, Coldsight. I can not approve killing members
      of the brotherhood, but it turned out that in view of... a current situation
      inside our division, your actions have brought more benefit than damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823926
    m_Localized: I see you have a difficult relationship with your brethren
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823927
    m_Localized: Indeed. By the way, what is your name, stranger?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823928
    m_Localized: My name is @lp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823929
    m_Localized: Pleased to meet you. My name is SteelHooves, I am the Star Paladin
      of Steel Rangers, Neighara`s Division. My brethren, whom you see before you
      - Green Wire, Groundshire and Great Gage. It so happened that at the moment
      I and my supporters among the rangers are in... opposition to the most others
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823930
    m_Localized: We do not fight like you, common ponies, are used to do. However,
      unfortunately, ideological differences may often cause misunderstanding and
      confrontation. At the moment, enemy of Coldsight may be our friend. Providing
      she agrees to cooperate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823931
    m_Localized: Depending on what you mean by "cooperation"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823932
    m_Localized: Let`s start with what you are seeking in this city. I visit this
      place not for the first time, maybe I can help you in your search
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823933
    m_Localized: Unless it is some kind of trick, it would be really nice of you.
      I need to know the location for the head office of the Ministry of Image
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823934
    m_Localized: No problem. Just move along this street, then turn left at the first
      crossing and after three blocks you will get to the main city avenue. Follow
      it, and after some time you will reach the Ministry Mall. The Ministry of Image
      is there
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823935
    m_Localized: Thank you for the hint. I hope it will help
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823936
    m_Localized: Our group is now returning to our camp after the last raid. If you
      are interested in continuing our cooperation, you are welcome to visit us.
      At the moment we are based in an old water treatment plant south of the city,
      five miles by walking along the Ponyville railroad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823937
    m_Localized: I`ll stop by when I have time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823938
    m_Localized: SteelHooves gives a mission
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823939
    m_Localized: Why are you here anyhow?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823940
    m_Localized: There is no secret - we are here for the sake of secrets that remained
      hidden by the Cloud in this city after the War
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823941
    m_Localized: 'Until the Last Day, numerous scientific and technological projects
      thrived in Equestria. They were divided between several large organizations.
      One of such organizations was the Stable-Tec corporation.

      This corporation
      was primarily concerned with the creation of the Stables - capacious and incredibly
      protected underground shelters, the purpose of which was to save the lives
      of ponies from mega-spells. However, Stable-Tec was also engaged in scientific
      activities, usually associated with living underground.

      One such project
      was the creation of industrial hydroponic farms'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823942
    m_Localized: Such farms would allow cultivation of various plants without needing
      natural soil and sunlight. This development was much more promising than artificial
      orchards that were introduced in most Stables as the main source of food, but
      the final tests were not completed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823943
    m_Localized: 'We learned about existence of this project from computer logs in
      other Stable-Tec offices, but this research was done in the Canterlot branch
      of the corporation, so detailed data on the farms and the coordinates of their
      testing site can only be found here. Therefore we began to search for this
      branch.

      Unfortunately, my knowledge of the city plan doesn`t cover objects
      related to Stable-Tec Corporation. Therefore, we are forced to search blindly.
      And so far, to no avail'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823944
    m_Localized: I`m counting on that if you find the Canterlot branch of Stable-Tec
      during your journey, you will tell us about its location. Such a gesture from
      you would be a great step to promote our cooperation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823945
    m_Localized: Certainly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823946
    m_Localized: Looks like this terminal is working. Let`s see...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823947
    m_Localized: '*File archive "For the boss"*

      *Access to the archive is
      restricted. Please enter a corporate password class "K" to view the content*'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823948
    m_Localized: What is this? Doesn`t matter, I hacked stuff way worse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823949
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823950
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823951
    m_Localized: What?..
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823952
    m_Localized: 'What do you mean, "no matches in the device storage"? Can the password
      be possibly embedded into the file itself?

      Grr, what kind of nonsense?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823953
    m_Localized: Okay, let`s do it other way. I`ll copy the file and take it to the
      Steel Rangers. Nothing easier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823954
    m_Localized: Hydroponic farms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823955
    m_Localized: Your boss asked me to help with one thing. He needed data on hydroponic
      farms from the Canterlot branch of Stable-Tec. I found their office and entered
      the building, however I could get out only one file, and, unfortunately, it
      is protected with some special encryption
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823956
    m_Localized: Let me see
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823957
    m_Localized: 'The usual password system of Stable-Tec. I have an archive of all
      the codes that have ever been used by the corporation, I don`t think picking
      the right one will take a lot of time.

      Here, actually... that`s all.
      Now let`s see what you found'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823958
    m_Localized: What, that easy?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823959
    m_Localized: Everything becomes easy enough if you have the right tool. And now
      be quiet please, I need to focus on the archive materials
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823960
    m_Localized: Yes, that`s indeed what we were looking for. All the necessary information
      is contained in this archive. If this really was the only file that you were
      able to download from the office terminals, then we are very lucky
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823961
    m_Localized: Have an official appreciation from all of us. Ponies like you prove
      that the principles of SteelHooves about the protection of simple ponies are
      not devoid of meaning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823962
    m_Localized: I was glad to help
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823963
    m_Localized: Phew, wandering in Canterlot is hardly a pleasure. I need to go
      to the Ministry of Image quickly, and then get out of here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823964
    m_Localized: Go right to get to [the Ministry of Style`s main office]. Or enter
      the door [Exit] to continue exploring Canterlot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823965
    m_Localized: Meeting Mchavi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823966
    m_Localized: Um... Hello?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823967
    m_Localized: You are already here, @lp. I expected you later
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823968
    m_Localized: How do you know my name?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823969
    m_Localized: 'For those who travel by the dark path, much that is hidden becomes
      revealed even before it names itself, @lp. The blind pony should not be surprised
      that the seeing one sees his reflection in the mirror.

      But forgive my
      manners. Too many stars I spent surrounded by these brainless corpses. It is
      easy to forget how to talk with the living'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823970
    m_Localized: My name is Mchavi. I am an old shaman of the family that derives
      its origin from the oldest sorcerers of zebras. And I am here on the instructions
      of my lord, the legate Caesarius
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823971
    m_Localized: Who?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823972
    m_Localized: Your friends from Covertsign could tell you more. Legate Caesarius
      is the tyrant of the Legion, the leader of the Zebra race. His destiny is to
      rule everything that is left of our world. My destiny is to become a pebble
      on the road by which he will come to his fate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823973
    m_Localized: So you`re one of those damned thugs, then? And how is it like -
      to kill peaceful ponies?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823974
    m_Localized: Be careful with the words, child. Your ignorance will not bring
      you anything but grief. The Legion never did anything for which it had no reason
      to do so
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823975
    m_Localized: And what was the reason to ambush those who didn`t do anything to
      you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823976
    m_Localized: Not every piece of knowledge can be obtained without preparation.
      Your mind is not ready to accept the truth of the Legion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823977
    m_Localized: Is your truth that you need to kill everypony just for the fact
      of being ponies?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823978
    m_Localized: 'This is what Askari told you at your first meeting, is it not?
      His understanding is a little better than yours.

      You should only know
      that Caesarius has plans for everycreature, and everycreature has a purpose.
      And the rules of our cruel world dictate that for some the ultimate goal is
      to die'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823979
    m_Localized: I`m sick of this epic nonsense
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823980
    m_Localized: It is sad to hear this. However, I knew that you would say this,
      even before your lips opened to utter the first word
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823981
    m_Localized: The ancestors` spirits whisper to me the truth and show the way,
      revealing the future. They predicted that you would come here to help me. You
      see, my lord expects results of studying the ancient spells that our ancestors
      imposed on this city. They will serve the greatness of the Legion, when hundreds
      of our ancient dead enemies will throw themselves upon the enemies that are
      still living. And your heart - the heart of a healthy pony - is the last ingredient
      that I need for a finishing touch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823982
    m_Localized: This is your role in the legate`s plans. Your purpose in life, your
      destiny. Any worthy son of the Legion would be happy to fulfill his destiny,
      you... yes, I already see how you will act
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823983
    m_Localized: I`m alive... And I have a book!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823984
    m_Localized: I can`t even believe it. As if something went not as it was planned
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823985
    m_Localized: Brr... looks like this witch managed to buck my brain after all
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823986
    m_Localized: Anyway, it`s done. Now it remains just to send all my findings home
      somehow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823987
    m_Localized: Perhaps this communication center can reach the Stable?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823988
    m_Localized: That crazy witch was nosing around here for a reason. I should study
      this device more
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823989
    m_Localized: No doubt that this is a communication center. Very powerful. With
      its help one can establish contact with any similar device
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823990
    m_Localized: 'Can I get in touch with the Mentor?

      Of course, it`s worth
      trying'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823991
    m_Localized: '*Scanning the reception area*

      *Responses received: 4*

      *Sorting
      receivers list*

      *Sorting complete. Stations of the Stable-Tec category
      found: 0*'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823992
    m_Localized: And how about this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823993
    m_Localized: '*View contacts list*

      *Connections from the last working
      session: 4*

      *Last session: 72319 days ago*'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823994
    m_Localized: View the connection list
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823995
    m_Localized: '*Connection 1 established 72319 days ago. Contact: Manehattan office
      of the Ministry of Image*

      *Connection 2 established 17 days ago. Contact:
      Neighara military base*

      *Connection 3 established 12 days ago. Contact:
      Neighara military base*

      *Connection 4 established 3 days ago. Contact:
      Neighara military base*'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823996
    m_Localized: Neighara military base? Isn`t SteelHooves from those parts by any
      chance?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823997
    m_Localized: Play connection 2 record
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823998
    m_Localized: '*ERROR: Connection 2 record missing. Reason: deleted by administrator
      12 days ago'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737823999
    m_Localized: Play connection 3 record
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824000
    m_Localized: '*ERROR: Connection 3 record missing. Reason: deleted by administrator
      3 days ago'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824001
    m_Localized: Play connection 4 record
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824002
    m_Localized: '"I wish you a cool night, Elder"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824003
    m_Localized: '"Leave greetings to yourself, witch. Why are you disturbing us?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824004
    m_Localized: '"You know this well. Caesarius will begin preparations very soon,
      as soon as I return with triumph from my pilgrimage to the Damned City. You
      should start your part of the preparation"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824005
    m_Localized: '"Don`t tell me how to command my brethren, witch. I don`t care
      what you`re doing there, but if you want to negotiate, you must tell a specific
      time frame. So?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824006
    m_Localized: '"Spirits lead @lp the right way. In three days she will come to
      me, and on the same day I will start a journey back to my master"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824007
    m_Localized: '"What? What spirits? What @lp? What the hay are you talking about?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824008
    m_Localized: '"You should only know that in five days the soldiers of the Legion
      will march to our meeting place. When they come, your warriors must be in position"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824009
    m_Localized: '"If you were on your own, witch, I would simply laugh at your mumble-jumble.
      But your legate trusts you, and I trust him. Therefore, my soldiers will be
      there on time. Do not disappoint me"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824010
    m_Localized: '"The "Sun" project and Stable Pi will belong to your brotherhood,
      Elder, in return for using these resources in a common fight. Legate Caesarius
      counts on your discretion"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824011
    m_Localized: Wait, what?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824012
    m_Localized: Legion and Steel Rangers? Planning together? Stable Pi?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824013
    m_Localized: I know who will give me answers. SteelHooves!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824014
    m_Localized: Coldsight`s conspiracy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824015
    m_Localized: SteelHooves?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824016
    m_Localized: I`m listening, @lp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824017
    m_Localized: Listen to this
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824018
    m_Localized: '"You should only know that in five days the soldiers of the Legion
      will march to our meeting place. When they come, your warriors must be in position"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824019
    m_Localized: '"If you were on your own, witch, I would simply laugh at your mumble-jumble.
      But your legate trusts you, and I trust him. Therefore, my soldiers will be
      there on time. Do not disappoint me"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824020
    m_Localized: '"The "Sun" project and Stable Pi will belong to your brotherhood,
      Elder, in return for using these resources in a common fight. Legate Caesarius
      counts on your discretion"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824021
    m_Localized: Don`t you want to tell me something?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824022
    m_Localized: This voice... it is Elder Coldsight. Where did you get this record
      and who is the Elder talking to?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824023
    m_Localized: 'Nuh-uh, it`s my turn to ask questions.

      Your Elder is making
      big plans to team up with the Zebra Legion. Don`t you think you should have
      told me that from the very beginning, if you want me to have any kind of "cooperation"
      with you'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824024
    m_Localized: I know no more than you do, @lp. Look, I already told you that at
      the moment we have a secret confrontation with Coldsight. I have no idea about
      his plans, because he considers me his rival
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824025
    m_Localized: Don`t you though?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824026
    m_Localized: You were one against four of us there, in Canterlot. Now you are
      alone against the whole camp of the Steel Rangers. If I was on Coldsight`s
      side, would we leave you alive after we recognized you as a killer of Rose
      and Diamond? Would we leave you alive now, when you have so unreasonably declared
      your awareness of the Elder`s plans?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824027
    m_Localized: Alright, I am convinced
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824028
    m_Localized: Now you tell me where you got this recording from. If it is not
      a forgery, Elder Coldsight is involved in a serious crime against the brotherhood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824029
    m_Localized: In the Ministry of Image I met a Legion`s shaman who was studying
      the Pink Cloud. She also often contacted your Elder through a Ministry communication
      center. I extracted this entry from it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824030
    m_Localized: 'Then my fears are confirmed. Elder Coldsight is a respected leader
      of our department, but his loyalty to the Steel Rangers` ideals is questionable.
      Even his somewhat peculiar understanding of duty should go against plotting
      with zebras. Especially - with the Legion.

      Such an act must have a serious
      cause. Even with all our differences, I still do not believe that the Elder
      could do this without a good reason. I`ll arrange a search for him at once'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824031
    m_Localized: Search?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824032
    m_Localized: Yes. Me and my group deliberately distanced ourselves from the rest
      of the Neighara department that is faithful to Coldsight. Therefore, our knowledge
      of the current deployment of key command figures, including the Elder himself,
      is limited and, perhaps, mostly obsolete. However, among his knights and paladins
      there are several of my secret supporters. I will contact them and find out
      everything we need
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824033
    m_Localized: How long will it take?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824034
    m_Localized: No more than one day. My subordinates will have to restore communications,
      and if we are lucky, we will be able to maintain a stable radio connection
      long enough. After determining the location of Coldsight, I`ll move out to
      face him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824035
    m_Localized: I am going with you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824036
    m_Localized: And what is it to you? This is an internal affair of Neighara Steel
      Rangers. Until recently, you didn`t even know anything about us
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824037
    m_Localized: Now we have common interests
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824038
    m_Localized: Ah, I see now. Stable Pi is your home, isn`t it? This explains PipBuck
      on your leg and your excessive neatness compared to ponies on the surface
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824039
    m_Localized: I don`t...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824040
    m_Localized: Alright. So, you take me with you or not?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824041
    m_Localized: If you are from Stable Pi, this may make sense. According to that
      recording of yours, Elder Coldsight seeks to gain control over your Stable,
      and I`m sure he doesn`t want it just out of greed. Perhaps you can negotiate
      with him on behalf of your Stable and find a compromise that excludes bloodshed
      and union with zebras. We still have a chance to solve the problem peacefully
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824042
    m_Localized: 'Thank you for your trust, SteelHooves.

      But since you found
      out my secret, I also want to ask you something. What are your disagreements
      with Coldsight?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824043
    m_Localized: Coldsight is one of those ponies whose souls have been wiped clean
      of all traces of emotion by life in the Wasteland. For him there is no compassion,
      his main goal is the prosperity of the Steel Rangers and no one else. This
      directly violates the original principles of the Steel Rangers, who were created
      by Applejack to protect all ponies. But his position is now shared by many
      influential commanders of our fraction, and they are extremely obstinate in
      promoting their policies. To oppose them means to start a civil war among Rangers.
      I want this even less than leaving Coldsight in power. Therefore, my supporters
      and I try to avoid conflicts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824044
    m_Localized: But, unfortunately, Coldsight is too suspicious and understands
      that I am able to influence his subordinates. Therefore, he looks at me only
      as a direct competitor in a struggle for power. Until now, we have been able
      to smooth sharp edges out in our relationship. Sincerely I hope that this will
      continue being so in the future, even despite the upcoming difficult conversation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824045
    m_Localized: Well, enough chitchat. If you`re going to join me in the negotiations,
      you should pick up the better equipment. Armor most of all. Even though I hope
      for a peaceful outcome, we must prepare for the worst
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824046
    m_Localized: Alright, I`ll take care of it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824047
    m_Localized: Did you manage to find out where Coldsight is?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824048
    m_Localized: Yes. From a reliable source we learned that he is in command of
      an old military base not very far from here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824049
    m_Localized: Then we move out?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824050
    m_Localized: Couldn`t say you are prepared well enough for a possible encounter.
      However we can not waste time - if Coldsight decides to move to another base
      of the Neighara division, it may be much more difficult to meet him. Mooving
      out at once!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824051
    m_Localized: Confrontation with Rangers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824052
    m_Localized: Stand still!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824053
    m_Localized: Put the guns down, Riddle. It`s us
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824054
    m_Localized: Star Paladin SteelHooves! Elder Coldsight accused you and your detachment
      of treason. We are ordered to shoot you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824055
    m_Localized: These accusations are absurd! Let me in to talk to the Elder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824056
    m_Localized: We do not negotiate with traitors. Open fire!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824057
    m_Localized: About treachery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824058
    m_Localized: What was that? Why did they call you a traitor?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824059
    m_Localized: Alea iacta est. Coldsight crossed the line and started a conflict.
      Perhaps he somehow learned about the murder of his accomplice and decided that
      I was somehow involved. Maybe something else. Anyway, the war has begun, and
      now we have to act
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824060
    m_Localized: Coldsight moved first, this means that many brethren supporting
      me are in danger. I must immediately return to our base and plan the next move.
      You are on your own now. Protect your Stable as you see fit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824061
    m_Localized: Can I join you in this conflict?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824062
    m_Localized: Although I`m counting on our cooperation, I still don`t trust you
      enough, Stable dweller. In addition, my subordinates don`t have combat experience
      working with lightly armored allies, and we might even hurt you in battle.
      It will be better for everypony if you just lie low for a while
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824063
    m_Localized: We`ll see
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824064
    m_Localized: Meeting Coldsight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824065
    m_Localized: Damned barbarian! How dare you invade the Steel Rangers` base and
      kill my soldiers?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824066
    m_Localized: You started it. You should`ve kept your hooves away from Stable
      Pi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824067
    m_Localized: Is this your motive?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824068
    m_Localized: How many fellow ponies have you killed today? How much blood did
      you shed? We only protect our home!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824069
    m_Localized: By destroying my home! Spare your tirades for somepony else
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824070
    m_Localized: Ponies from the Stable Pi store secrets that could save lives of
      many! You are greedy, jealous and immensely stupid, these technologies should
      not belong to you alone!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824071
    m_Localized: I see that it`s useless talking to you... My home will be safe only
      after your death
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824072
    m_Localized: Information received from SteelHooves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824073
    m_Localized: Hello, @lp. Looks like I underestimated you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824074
    m_Localized: Why?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824075
    m_Localized: 'You killed Coldsight. My supporters among his rangers told me about
      this just now. You made a very dangerous move.

      Until that moment, you
      were nopony for the Steel Rangers. After the murder of the Elder, his followers
      will never forget you. From now on, you should travel with even more caution'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824076
    m_Localized: His followers? Isn`t you conflict over after his death?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824077
    m_Localized: On the contrary, now it will become even more fierce. However, this
      was inevitable. The only chance of avoiding bloodshed was my refusal from command
      and voluntary exile. Maybe I should have done that. Too many have already died
      because of this confrontation, and many more will perish in the future
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824078
    m_Localized: I think you need to know something. Since you have proven yourself
      a consistent and implacable enemy of Coldsight`s ideas, I believe that I can
      trust you more than ever. And I think it is time to provide you with information
      that can help you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824079
    m_Localized: 'First: the treacherous collusion of Coldsight and the Legion appears
      to have very deep roots. Apparently, almost all the commanders of his divisions
      and even common knights are aware of this union and are ready to accept it.
      This means that the interaction of these two forces will continue and, probably,
      zebras will also join the conflict soon. We still don`t know the reasons for
      this unification, but my subordinates are working to obtain the necessary information'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824080
    m_Localized: 'Second: Coldsight had schematics of some experimental combat exoskeleton,
      which, apparently, is being developed in your Stable. Apparently, this exoskeleton
      was the main reason for Coldsight`s interest in the Stable Pi. It is an armor
      and a weapon at the same time, with deadly combat power'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824081
    m_Localized: 'However, only one such unit can exist: it requires unique pre-war
      artifacts that don`t have any analogs that I know of. In truth, I never heard
      about them until I received the documentation for this exoskeleton. Projects
      for its creation have the names "Sun" and "Rainbow". I correctly understand
      that you were sent to the surface to collect the necessary artifacts?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824082
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824083
    m_Localized: I`m not going to take them away from you or attack your Stable,
      you have a word of a paladin. The enemy of my enemy is my friend. You helped
      me, I`ll help you. If your Stable is threatened by an invasion of Neighara
      Steel Rangers or the zebras` Legion, we will stand for its defense
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824084
    m_Localized: I`m glad to hear it, thank you. But I hope that my Stable will avoid
      danger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824085
    m_Localized: I wouldn`t rely just on hope. Our enemies are strong, and we have
      much to do if we want to protect ourselves from them. Right now, groups of
      my loyal knights are engaged in battle in several places at once, defending
      important fortifications and trying to free those brethren who were captured
      at the first enemy attack. Perhaps in the near future this war will draw in
      new participants, either at their will or against it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824086
    m_Localized: This means that the danger threatens many ponies, and not just us
      and my Stable! I was too selfish. I must warn residents of two settlements
      at once about the coming threat. They must not be caught off guard by the attack
      of the Steel Rangers and the Legion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824087
    m_Localized: 'I understand your haste. As soon as you warn everypony you need,
      I`m waiting for you here: we may need your help'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824088
    m_Localized: Bunker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824089
    m_Localized: Are there any strategic objects of Coldsight`s Steel Rangers nearby?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824090
    m_Localized: Yes. The pre-war storage bunker southeast of us. One of several
      main warehouses of our division. However, it is well protected, I would advise
      against trying to get inside
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824091
    m_Localized: We`ll see about that
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824092
    m_Localized: Not this time, @lp. This bunker was designed specifically to protect
      its contents from an attack of a small army. In a locked state its doors can`t
      be destroyed even by the explosion of a tactical balefire bomb. To capture
      it, it would take a several month-long siege and to starve its defenders
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824093
    m_Localized: To capture it - maybe. But what about infiltration?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824094
    m_Localized: I`m not your commander, @lp, but I can`t help but note that such
      a risk is simply not justified. We have more pressing matters at the moment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824095
    m_Localized: If you still decide to go there... Just advice - visit scribe Amaranth
      first. She may have something that will help you pass beyond the entrance.
      And now we all have work to do
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824096
    m_Localized: Threat to the "Prancing Pony"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824097
    m_Localized: '@lp! I`m mighty glad to see ya! Are ya done with that Canterlot
      business of yers?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824098
    m_Localized: Yes, I did everything I needed. However, now we have a lot of work
      to do
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824099
    m_Localized: '"Us"?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824100
    m_Localized: 'I brought bad news, Daiquiri. Hard times are coming.

      Steel
      Rangers of the Neighara division became friends with zebras from the Legion.
      Not everyone liked it, and now the northern territories are burning in flames
      of the civil war. It is very likely that our settlement will also be involved
      in these battles'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824101
    m_Localized: '"Our settlement", huh...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824102
    m_Localized: Hard times indeed. You wouldn`t tell us this if it wasn`t serious,
      @lp. And if so, then we really should get ready
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824103
    m_Localized: Ah will arrange for us new patrols, chief, and Ah myself will scout
      twice more often. They ain`t gonna pass
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824104
    m_Localized: And we need to get more heavy guns. You can`t get those steel-flanks
      with usual rifles. Of all troublemakers you could expect...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824105
    m_Localized: Can I help with something?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824106
    m_Localized: We are used to defend ourselves, we`ll manage somehow. But if you
      are ready to help us - your guns are always welcome
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824107
    m_Localized: By the way, ya could help Stalwart, our armorer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824108
    m_Localized: Calamity`s right. Usually we don`t talk about this, but you have
      a right to know. Oak is a former Steel Ranger. I do not know why he left, he
      doesn`t tell. But his knowledge will help us a lot now. And if he needs help,
      then we should do everything we can
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824109
    m_Localized: I`ll talk to him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824110
    m_Localized: Howdy, @lp. You look worried. What`s wrong?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824111
    m_Localized: Hello. Daiquiri said that you are a former Steel Ranger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824112
    m_Localized: "Um... Yes, it`s true.\nThe sheriff wouldn\u2019t tell you that
      without reason. Spill it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824113
    m_Localized: Steel Rangers of the Neighara division are fighting each other.
      And the Legion zebras joined one of the sides. We may be at risk of an attack
      from them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824114
    m_Localized: Ow... That was a bolt out of the blue. How so?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824115
    m_Localized: 'Long story. In short: their Elder was very fond of nosing around
      and making himself enemies'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824116
    m_Localized: Coldsight?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824117
    m_Localized: Yep, that`s the guy. Do you know him?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824118
    m_Localized: Yes, I did. But enough talking about my past. What do you want me
      to do now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824119
    m_Localized: 'The right question is: what do YOU want me to do. You are our chief
      expert on Steel Rangers around here, you know more about how we could protect
      ourselves from them. If you need help, I am ready to provide it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824120
    m_Localized: Well, I can`t come up with a whole plan right away, of course. But
      I have some thoughts on this subject...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824121
    m_Localized: Threat to Covertsign
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824122
    m_Localized: Glad to meet you, @lp. Any news?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824123
    m_Localized: 'Unfortunately yes.

      Recently I`ve been involved in matters
      that I would rather not touch. And I learned a lot of disturbing things that
      I have to share with you'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824124
    m_Localized: Did something happen in Canterlot?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824125
    m_Localized: 'Not only there. We are talking about much more than just old ruins.

      It
      became known to me that the Steel Rangers` Neighara division formed a military
      alliance with the Legion and Caesar. The reasons are unknown, but the consequence
      was an armed conflict among Steel Rangers. At the moment it is expanding dramatically.
      Considering that many of their targets are located in relative proximity to
      Covertsign, I am afraid that you might be in danger. If not from the Steel
      Rangers, then from the Legion soldiers'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824126
    m_Localized: Disturbing news. Very disturbing. Are you confident in your words,
      @lp?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824127
    m_Localized: Absolutely
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824128
    m_Localized: Then we will be forced to focus our efforts on reconnaissance and
      patrolling. We already have few zebras bringing supplies, and a new threat
      robs us that little we have. I will gather the council and we decide what we
      can do to protect ourselves. We may need your help soon, @lp. If you will be
      ready to provide it. We have nothing to repay you, but every hoof counts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824129
    m_Localized: I will help you with what I can
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824130
    m_Localized: The council will make decisions that are extremely important to
      us. We cannot decide the fate of the community without our chief scouts, and
      they have not yet returned from supply runs. I will inform you when they come
      and we will plan our further actions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824131
    m_Localized: Keep an eye on your stuff
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824132
    m_Localized: Harsh times are coming
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824133
    m_Localized: Aiding "Prancing Pony"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824134
    m_Localized: 'Ok, to defend ourselves against such a strong enemy as Steel Rangers...

      We
      definitely need big guns'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824135
    m_Localized: I have some reliable sources...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824136
    m_Localized: 'No, @lp. BIG Guns.

      If we arm ourselves with just anti-mech
      rifles, we might be able to manage an even fight against power armor. But believe
      me: Coldsight`s Steel Rangers are not ones afraid of fighting on equal terms.
      They won`t stop if they decide to crush us, and even if we win, we would pay
      too much for such victory'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824137
    m_Localized: If we cannot make Steel Rangers fear us, then at least we must delay
      the assault on the camp. And this can only be achieved if the cost of attacking
      the "Prancing Pony" is sky-high
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824138
    m_Localized: To be honest, I am not sure how this can be done
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824139
    m_Localized: 'Luckily I am sure enough. Listen.

      When I was with the Rangers,
      we had access to the archive containing a detailed map of our Factory. From
      there we learned about the assembly lines for manufacturing naval guns and
      ammunition placed on one of the underground floors. Guns for destroyers, to
      be precise. Small caliber guns for ships, big enough for us'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824140
    m_Localized: We, Steel Rangers, should have dealt with them long ago, but there
      was little use for them in the Wasteland, and we always had more important
      stuff to do. Now it will play into our hooves, hooves of the "Prancing Pony"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824141
    m_Localized: And I must explore those production lines?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824142
    m_Localized: If you are willing to help, yes. I will show you the exact location
      of the desired rooms, and you will go down and find out if there are at least
      a couple of these weapon systems left in the warehouses. And make sure that
      when our scavenging teams come, they won`t be met with fire from security turrets.
      I know you are good at it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824143
    m_Localized: The "Prancing Pony" is safe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824144
    m_Localized: It`s all good, Oak. Warehouses are still full, there are lots of
      shells, and neither robots nor turrets will harm anypony scavenging there anymore
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824145
    m_Localized: 'Very well. In truth, even a single weapon of this kind would be
      enough to make Coldsight`s troopers think twice before attacking us, but it
      never hurts to have extra.

      We can`t put them on wheels and use them
      as offensive weapons, but a static defense will be more than enough. Now we
      have a lot of work to do, and I hope that we are not too late'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824146
    m_Localized: I hope that if something goes wrong, me and SteelHooves` rangers
      will be close enough to come to the rescue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824147
    m_Localized: 'SteelHooves? If it`s him opposing Coldsight you shouldn`t worry.
      That old fox has ears everywhere. Coldsight really shouldn`t have crossed him:
      with all respect, he simply won`t be able to defeat a commander with almost
      two hundred years of experience'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824148
    m_Localized: With how many years of experience?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824149
    m_Localized: "You didn\u2019t know? SteelHooves is a Canterlot ghoul. He fought
      in the Great War. You should`ve told me earlier that he is our ally. He has
      great authority among the rangers. And he, unlike Coldsight, treats the Wasteland
      ponies with enough kindness. If the \"Prancing Pony\" is indeed at war, we
      should do our best to gain his support"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824150
    m_Localized: 'I didn`t expect this, really. But you`re right: if Coldsight`s
      soldiers attack peaceful settlements, he will intervene.

      To tell the
      truth, at least one more settlement definitely needs help. So unless I`m still
      needed here, I`d better hurry there'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824151
    m_Localized: 'You don`t have time to waste, do you? Of course, run along. We
      will manage here ourselves.

      If you meet SteelHooves, say hello from
      me. And thanks for telling us about him. Perhaps it`s the best news we had
      lately'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824152
    m_Localized: 'Good day, @lp. You are just in time: all members of our council
      have already arrived from expeditions. Tonight we will meet to discuss our
      next steps'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824153
    m_Localized: Good. There is much to discuss
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824154
    m_Localized: Covertsign Council
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824155
    m_Localized: 'We all know why we are here. Let`s not lose time: @lp, tell us
      in full detail what kind of threat looms over us'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824156
    m_Localized: I have nothing much to add to what I said earlier. The Legion and
      the Neighara Steel Rangers formed a military alliance. Why and against what
      - I don`t know. However, they are planning to attack... my home. And this alliance
      resulted in a split within rangers` ranks. Open armed conflict is flaring up
      right now, and it is unlikely to end until the complete destruction of one
      of the sides. This means that, most likely, those rangers who started an alliance
      with the Legion will surely request support from new friends
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824157
    m_Localized: How does this concern us?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824158
    m_Localized: As far as I can tell, rangers are used to a positional war. They
      will fight for important bases and warehouses, as well as for the territory
      around them. One of the bases is located relatively close to here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824159
    m_Localized: And that means the risk of an accidental encounter with our troops
      or even the settlement itself. While we could solve the rangers problem peacefully,
      the Legion will deploy forces for our annihilation without a second thought
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824160
    m_Localized: This war is unlikely to last long. If we gather enough supplies
      and go north for a few months, we can wait out this storm and then come back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824161
    m_Localized: Wait, it`s too early to judge. @lp, how do you know all this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824162
    m_Localized: 'I was getting there.

      First, I know the leader of one of
      the sides of this conflict. The one that is against friendship with the Legion.
      Second... in Canterlot, I happened to meet a Legion sorceress. Her name was
      Mchavi'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824163
    m_Localized: This is bad...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824164
    m_Localized: If the Legion sent necromancers to this region we already are at
      risk. Many of them have the gift of sight. Our discovery is now a matter of
      time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824165
    m_Localized: '...And even if we go north now, we cannot go back if the Legion
      wins. If necromancers are here, this means that Caesar is planning to settle
      in these parts for good.

      We must attack. Now, before they find us. We
      have fighters, surprise is on our side. I`m tired of hiding! Strike the enemy,
      take advantage of the moment and let rangers finish them! Enough running away!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824166
    m_Localized: ... stupid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824167
    m_Localized: "This is suicide, Mwimbaji. Surprise attack will work only once.
      As soon as the Legion finds out about us, we are doomed. We will be hunted
      down and slaughtered, sooner or later. We do not even know the exact balance
      of power in this conflict. So far, Mshauri\u2019s proposal sounds the most
      logical"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824168
    m_Localized: What if I help you? Even if the Legion finds out who attacked them,
      I`m just a pony, my actions will not give out your presence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824169
    m_Localized: It will be difficult to do it single-hoofedly. You need to know
      exactly where to hit. And even in this case, chances are not particularly high
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824170
    m_Localized: 'Still it really would protect ourselves. And even if this pony
      fails, the Legion is unlikely to take her alive, it is not their style.

      But
      we cannot rely on success. In any case, we must begin preparations for leaving'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824171
    m_Localized: '"Not their style"?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824172
    m_Localized: 'For all its faults, the Legion does not permit torture of those
      brave enough to confront it. This is a very ancient tradition, a sort of paying
      respects: a brave enemy should die on the battlefield, not in chains. Even
      a pony. A noble tradition... and so irrational'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824173
    m_Localized: There only small thing that remains - to die bravely
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824174
    m_Localized: "...\n\tI would rather not die at all"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824175
    m_Localized: 'However, we cannot tell you where you can find agents of the Legion.
      And we won`t look for them either. The risk is too high.

      Preparations
      for moving north will take a lot of time. If you somehow succeed and buy us
      some time, we would appreciate it. But we cannot wait'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824176
    m_Localized: I think I know who can help me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824177
    m_Localized: Then so be it. @lp, we are all very grateful to you for your determination
      and your helping hoof. We will understand if you change your mind, and remember,
      it is better to save your life than reach your goal and die, because your death
      would be a greater loss
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824178
    m_Localized: Aiding Covertsign
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824179
    m_Localized: Hello SteelHooves. I have a proposition which will likely suit both
      of us
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824180
    m_Localized: I am listening, @lp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824181
    m_Localized: Do your scouts know anything about the Legion movements?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824182
    m_Localized: 'Just as much as Coldsight`s followers know. My informants tell
      me a lot, but sending patrols for monitoring zebras is too irrational.

      At
      the moment, the Legion has focused its efforts on helping my former brethren.
      It is strong enough for an open battle, but prefers to hinder the actions of
      my forces with ambush and sabotage'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824183
    m_Localized: Are there any vulnerabilities in their strategy?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824184
    m_Localized: Hard to tell. Perhaps destruction of their field headquarters in
      this region could cause confusion in their operations and force them to temporarily
      curtail their activities. However, zebras are closely watching every step of
      my troops, and sending an assault team might fail. They would just relocate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824185
    m_Localized: You aren`t just asking out of pure interest, right? If you are intending
      to visit zebra command, I can tell you their current location. Destroying the
      field Legion leadership will provide operating space for our offensive, and
      your skills in independent operations give serious chances for success. Clever
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824186
    m_Localized: Thank you! Sure, I will pay the Legion commanders a visit soon.
      By the way, one pony sends his regards. Oak Stalwort
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824187
    m_Localized: Oak? I remember him. Nice fellow. But way too curious
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824188
    m_Localized: Covertsign is safe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824189
    m_Localized: Good news, Askari. I found the Legion`s regional headquarters, killed
      their commander and took all the papers I could find. I don`t know zebra language
      though. Could you please have a look?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824190
    m_Localized: Sure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824191
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824192
    m_Localized: These are orders and reports. Quite a lot of them. But not a single
      mention of us or other outcasts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824193
    m_Localized: 'This is very good news for us, @lp. I know how Legion works. Distraction
      of command is a big problem for them, and they will not recover anytime soon.
      And if the Legion zebras discovered us one way or another, it would have been
      written here.

      We can be sure that we are safe for now. At least we can
      devote more time to collecting and preparing supplies. And maybe we don`t have
      to leave at all. Your help is invaluable to us!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824194
    m_Localized: I also have news for you. While you were away, a sprite bot visited
      your friend. I know it may sound strange, I know, but it just flew in and asked
      about her. It also said it needs talking to you. Now the bot and Velvet are
      in that building
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824195
    m_Localized: Meeting the Watcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824196
    m_Localized: Hello @lp. Good thing you showed up just in time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824197
    m_Localized: Uh... hi? I don`t think we know each other, perhaps you`d better
      introduce yourself
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824198
    m_Localized: 'Yes, of course, forgive me my rudeness. My real name won`t tell
      you anything, so just call me Watcher.

      If you remember, after your success
      at Stable 88 Mentor asked you to bring the cogitator to Hankey garages. I was
      the one you were supposed to meet. Unfortunately, we were interrupted'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824199
    m_Localized: How did you find me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824200
    m_Localized: Both of you. Fortunately, I found both you and the Chosen-24. That
      wasn`t easy. Velvet and I have already discussed a lot, now we need to talk
      with you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824201
    m_Localized: Wait a minute. Velvet, can he be trusted?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824202
    m_Localized: Yes, I suppose so. He told me enough to make me believe him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824203
    m_Localized: Good. I not only found the cogitator, but also the Alicorn Amulet!
      And the Black Book too. Did Mentor tell you that they are also important for
      the projects? I suppose they should be transferred as soon as possible, because...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824204
    m_Localized: '...Neighara Rangers teamed with the Legion and are planning an
      attack on Stable Pi. We are aware of that, @lp.

      No, the artifacts must
      stay with you. I`m afraid you will need them more. I will explain why. But
      first let me tell you about yourself'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824205
    m_Localized: 'Mentor has already told you that you were sent on a mission to
      collect the missing components required to complete the "Sun" and "Rainbow"
      projects. As well as that you voluntarily agreed to temporarily block your
      memory in order to ensure safety of your home. This technology has a significant
      drawback: images in your memory are blocked as whole objects, but not each
      individual part of them. This means that if you restore a part of your memories,
      you will remember everything that is directly related to the restored part.
      Listen: Mentor has a silver-gray mane...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824206
    m_Localized: '...and light purple coat. He has a hockey stick cutie mark, he
      wears glasses and really loves his job! And also apple jam.

      Oh Goddess,
      I really remembered him!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824207
    m_Localized: See? However, now it`s much more important for you to remember the
      details of the projects on which he is working
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824208
    m_Localized: He`s right, @lp. Now we have the responsibility of protecting our
      home. And no matter how hard it is for me to admit it, the weapons that Mentor
      is trying to complete may be our fail-safe in case something goes wrong
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824209
    m_Localized: The "Sun" and "Rainbow" projects are interconnected. "Rainbow" is
      a powerful exoskeleton equipped with almost impenetrable armor and wings that
      can lift an earth pony or a unicorn into the air. And the "Sun" is an extremely
      complex Rainbow-based system, the purpose of which is to artificially enhance
      survivability and magical abilities of the owner. Together they are able to
      give power second only to the legendary might of Celestia and Luna. But only
      by destruction capabilities
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824210
    m_Localized: Yes, I remember that. Those systems are incredibly complex to operate,
      a real miracle of technology. Mentor, like his predecessors, believed that
      only they were able to ensure the complete safety of Stable Pi when the time
      comes to become open for the surface. And they... we all wanted to finally
      end our isolation. But they were afraid to do it without protection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824211
    m_Localized: While we were sitting in our high-tech shell, surface ponies suffered
      and died, generation after generation, waiting until we assemble a gun large
      enough to shoot them all if something goes wrong. So that it`s not too scary
      to say hi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824212
    m_Localized: Velvet, the surface is full of ponies that only respect the size
      of your guns in a conversation. And it will only make surface life better and
      safer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824213
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824214
    m_Localized: For good or for worse, but things have developed like this. For
      two hundred years, Stable Pi was isolated from the Wasteland, and ponies living
      in it saved much of the technological past of Equestria. @lp, have you ever
      wondered why you can access full functionality of M.A.S. terminals?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824215
    m_Localized: Because they recognize my PipBuck signature?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824216
    m_Localized: Exactly. Only PipBucks of Stable inhabitants still possess the software
      necessary for recognition by terminals, as well as much other M.A.S. equipment.
      Memory in those used by rare lucky surface ponies has been erased many times
      already. But this is nothing in comparison with the many projects on which
      your Stable worked before the Last Day came. This includes the "Sun" and "Rainbow"
      projects
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824217
    m_Localized: It was those which attracted Coldsight. But for now, there is still
      an opportunity to solve everything... more or less peacefully
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824218
    m_Localized: Our Stable is at risk of an open invasion. How can we solve this
      "peacefully"?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824219
    m_Localized: There is a way. But there is no guarantee
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824220
    m_Localized: I don`t call myself Watcher for nothing, @lp. Using a network of
      sprite bots I learn a lot about what is happening in the Wasteland. And the
      Mentor learns this from me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824221
    m_Localized: 'I know why Coldsight decided to attack Stable Pi, and why his alliance
      with Caesarea became possible. A threat appeared in the Wasteland, capable
      of forcing even irreconcilable enemies to unite against them. The Enclave.

      When
      the Last Day came, Equestria pegasi abandoned their dying country and blocked
      the sky. Since then there has not been a single sunny day in the Wasteland.
      Pegasi themselves have been living above the cloud barrier for two hundred
      years. I don`t know what`s going on there, but recently at least some of them
      came to a conclusion that voluntary isolation should end. A large detachment
      of pegasi, calling themselves the Great Pegasus Enclave, descended to the surface
      about four months ago and established a military base, not letting anypony
      approach it'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824222
    m_Localized: I am familiar with one pegasus. His name is Calamity. Do you know
      him? He has nothing to do with this, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824223
    m_Localized: He has a complicated story. But no, he has nothing to do with it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824224
    m_Localized: Coldsight`s Steel Rangers attempted to get in touch with the Enclave
      but received no response. The memory of the old betrayal of pegasi and suspicion
      of the old elder made him perceive the new power as a threat to Steel Rangers
      in general and to himself in particular. Despite lacking evidence for hostile
      intentions of the Enclave towards surface ponies, he began preparing for war.
      Like a paranoid spider, he weaved his web inside the Neighara branch, separating
      those he trusted from the rest, and dedicating them to his plans to attack
      the Enclave base
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824225
    m_Localized: 'But he was intelligent enough for making a sober estimate of his
      forces and possible forces of the enemy. He understood that the base could
      be just a tip of an iceberg: after all, he didn`t know anything about how pegasi
      have been surviving for the last two hundred years and what proportion of the
      pre-war military power they managed to preserve. And he found himself an ally
      in the form of Caesar, who also saw a great threat in the appearance of a new
      force in the Wasteland'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824226
    m_Localized: And so he planned an attack on Stable Pi, @lp. He knew about the
      projects, and he planned using them to win the impending war. And if there
      is no war...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824227
    m_Localized: ...there would be no threat to our home. Is Mentor aware of all
      this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824228
    m_Localized: 'Yes. And he asked me to give you a new task: to find out why the
      Enclave came down to the surface and how to make it leave'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824229
    m_Localized: Right now the Rangers and the Legion are fighting a fierce battle
      with each other. It will also lose meaning if the Enclave disappears. Given
      Coldsight`s death, opponents may even sit at the negotiating table. So this
      will not only be a blessing for Stable Pi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824230
    m_Localized: But... is it possible? How can we achieve it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824231
    m_Localized: I don`t know. The Enclave also refused to contact me. They shot
      every Sprite bot I sent. Before you act, you have to learn more about them
      and their goals. As Velvet said, there is no guarantee this will work. But
      for now this is the best option of all we have
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824232
    m_Localized: And if it doesn`t work, we will have to prepare for defending Stable
      Pi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824233
    m_Localized: I can infiltrate the base and find out what pegasi are looking for
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824234
    m_Localized: Perhaps we have no other options. But please, @lp, by all means
      try to find a peaceful solution. We don`t need even more blood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824235
    m_Localized: And if a peaceful contact fails, you become the first line of defense
      for Stable Pi. Therefore, the artifacts remain with you. You must survive and
      succeed, and they will increase your chances
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824236
    m_Localized: It seems the gun assembly lines are here. I hope I don`t encounter
      anything more dangerous than several turrets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824237
    m_Localized: Although it`s strange this place hasn`t been loo...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824238
    m_Localized: '(voice from a speaker) Attention! Unauthorized entry detected.
      Initiating 144-F security protocol.

      Electric fence activated.

      Anti-flight
      spell activated.

      Anti-teleportation spell activated'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824239
    m_Localized: Holy hot sex with Celestia!|Friggin` piece of...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824240
    m_Localized: Electric fence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824241
    m_Localized: Electric fence... I recall that we had something similar in our
      Stable. This is bad... very bad! This means that every metal object in this
      room becomes deadly. I can`t step on metal floor, touch metal walls, doors
      and furniture, otherwise electric discharges will seriously damage my health.
      And I can`t even touch them with telekinesis - the telekinetic field will serve
      as a conductor and I will get a full blast of it or even worse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824242
    m_Localized: Only concrete, wood and plastic are relatively safe. Those materials
      do not conduct current; I can step on them or move them by telekinesis
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824243
    m_Localized: But there might be good news! If this system is similar to ours,
      there should be control terminals somewhere from which the fence can be disabled.
      I`m sure that I can hack them. With all my experience how can I possibly fail?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824244
    m_Localized: 'So, let`s see what we have here. Specification... naval gun, model
      8210 "Raven". Designed to destroy torpedo boats and other small ships. It can
      be installed on ships of any type or used to equip ground firing points. Technical
      characteristics: caliber - 75 mm; barrel length - 3.8 m; weight - 790 kg; projectile
      weight - 8.7 kg; initial speed - 750 m/s; fire rate - 15 rounds per minute;
      maximum firing range - 6.1 km'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824245
    m_Localized: Cool! If we install at least a couple of such guns near the camp,
      not a single Steel Ranger will dare to approach it. What the heck, let them
      come with a tank! Now "Prancing Pony" will for sure become the most fortified
      settlement in the area
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824246
    m_Localized: Perhaps the caliber is a bit too big even... Well, that`s not my
      problem anymore, ponies from the camp will figure it out somehow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824247
    m_Localized: 'Please note: electrical protection is designed to protect important
      strategic objects. The primary task is to prevent infiltration by enemy agents
      and theft of important documentation containing military secrets. A secondary
      task is personnel protection. Based on this, each employee is required to know
      the rules of conduct during activation of the electrical fence:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824248
    m_Localized: Upon hearing the alarm, immediately get off the metal floor; do
      not touch metal walls, stairs, doors, furniture and equipment. Move upon the
      concrete floor, and where there is none, climb onto wooden or plastic desks,
      sofas or boxes. Stay there until the fence is powered down
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824249
    m_Localized: All pegasi are forbidden to fly into the air, all unicorns - to
      touch metal objects with telekinesis and teleport. Such actions  can be deadly
      while the electrical fence is activated. Also remember that rubber shoes or
      protective suits will not save you from electric shock, although they will
      weaken its effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824250
    m_Localized: For the duration of the electrical fence, the robotic security enters
      the alert state. Do not make sudden movements in the presence of security robots
      and keep your ID cards in sight. Remember that your life and safety depend
      on knowledge and strict compliance with these rules
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824251
    m_Localized: Velvet about home
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824252
    m_Localized: And to think that we remained ignorant of our home for so long and
      discovered nothing new in the end
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824253
    m_Localized: Aren`t you glad about possibility of a soon return?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824254
    m_Localized: Are you, @lp?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824255
    m_Localized: Me? I am not sure. I want to see home again. But...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824256
    m_Localized: But knowing about thing happening here on the surface won`t let
      you sleep, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824257
    m_Localized: "...\n\tRight. And the fact that we could have intervened long ago..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824258
    m_Localized: ...doesn`t make the welcome home party seem so fun anymore? You
      are not hopeless, @lp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824259
    m_Localized: What are you talking about?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824260
    m_Localized: I am saying that the inhabitants of the Wasteland can count on you
      when the time comes for Stable Pi to finally open up to the world
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824261
    m_Localized: Unless it will soon be unsealed by enemies against our will. For
      the first and last time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824262
    m_Localized: We still have an opportunity to resolve the situation in a better
      way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824263
    m_Localized: While you make reconnaissance of the Enclave base, I will help with
      Covertsign zebras` preparations. And the Watcher will do his best to clarify
      the current situation in the region. We must be prepared for any development
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824264
    m_Localized: Conversation with the Watcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824265
    m_Localized: Watcher, isn`t it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824266
    m_Localized: Yes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824267
    m_Localized: I don`t quite understand yet... Why are you helping Stable Pi? You`re
      not one of us, are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824268
    m_Localized: 'No, and I`ve never even been there.

      Let`s say, I have been
      following your attempts to get to the artifacts for quite some time now. And
      I have long been in contact with your Mentor'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824269
    m_Localized: Why, didn`t you get them yourself then? This would save many former
      Chosens
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824270
    m_Localized: Sprite bots can hardly be called good instruments for penetrating
      places where such objects are stored, and I have no other ones. Be grateful
      for finding out at least approximate location of these relics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824271
    m_Localized: It was you who found them? Mentor said that information about them
      was taken from the archives
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824272
    m_Localized: As if pre-war ponies needed such secrets laying around in some random
      archives. Apart from personnel directly involved, at best, members of the most
      senior command were aware of the location of such strong and dangerous items
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824273
    m_Localized: You didn`t answer my question. Why are you helping us?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824274
    m_Localized: Oh, that`s a good question. But it is too early to answer it. I
      will tell you about my goals when it is necessary, not before
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824275
    m_Localized: Conflict with the Enclave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824276
    m_Localized: Captain! Captain, look! Another trashy one! Permission to shoot
      her? Fleetfoot was shooting the last time!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824277
    m_Localized: Permission granted. Your turn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824278
    m_Localized: Wait a minute! I came in peace! I am...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824279
    m_Localized: ... and you will rest in peace. You shouldn`t have entered the Enclave
      territory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824280
    m_Localized: 'Why? Why it always ends like this? I wanted... to make peace...

      Why
      don`t they all want to live in peace?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824281
    m_Localized: Why must I kill ponies again?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824282
    m_Localized: Command center. It`s time to end this!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824283
    m_Localized: Enclave Plans
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824284
    m_Localized: Stand still, you bastard!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824285
    m_Localized: Easy, easy! I surrender, I surrender! Don`t kill me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824286
    m_Localized: 'I can`t guarantee you anything, murderer.

      What are you doing
      here?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824287
    m_Localized: What? Who do you mean by "us"?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824288
    m_Localized: You, Celestia clop you! Enclave! What are you doing here in the
      Wasteland? Why did you come down here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824289
    m_Localized: We just... We just did research! We explored this place!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824290
    m_Localized: You are lying. You wouldn`t send so many soldiers here for "research".
      Lie to me again and you will regret it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824291
    m_Localized: I am not lying! I`m not lying! We need soldiers only for protection!
      Don`t be offended, but here on the surface you ponies may be very... mmm...
      of alternative friendliness. Yes, alternative friendliness!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824292
    m_Localized: Me? Your soldiers attacked me near the entrance, without giving
      me a chance to negotiate!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824293
    m_Localized: Because your kind has deceived us and killed our guards more than
      once! Oh, sorry! I meant "some ponies, looking similar to you". Don`t shoot
      me, please, I didn`t mean anything like that!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824294
    m_Localized: What exactly did you study here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824295
    m_Localized: Well, you see, we... Pegasi shut themselves off from the surface
      a long time ago. Of course, occasionally we take a look here from above, you
      know, just out of interest. But we didn`t mean anything bad! Honest!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824296
    m_Localized: Calm down and tell me everything. I won`t shoot you now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824297
    m_Localized: 'Really?

      Ok, so we were told to study you. The surface, I
      mean. How much you changed, what`s new, what can we use... Well, buy it from
      you. We explored opportunities for interacting with local fauna, learn about
      threats and pony societies. So that if we decide to descent to you, we would
      know what to expect. We needed to create a research facility on the ground
      for these purposes and... here we are'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824298
    m_Localized: What, in a really, really peaceful way? No capturing territory,
      resources, homes?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824299
    m_Localized: Well... um... I do not decide on these matters. I really don`t know,
      believe me! Let me go, and I will try to persuade the command not to send a
      punitive expedition here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824300
    m_Localized: A punitive what?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824301
    m_Localized: Nothing, nothing!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824302
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824303
    m_Localized: We had orders! If the base is attacked and suffers significant personnel
      losses, this is immediately reported up there! If I could, I would not allow
      it, I do not want a war! I would say that we had... a misunderstanding, yes!
      Didn`t understand each other. Maybe our president would even soften up and
      merely razed a couple of villages. Tell me where you are from, and they won`t
      even come there!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824304
    m_Localized: Your superiors... will send an army? And will kill everypony for
      this attack?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824305
    m_Localized: Um... I did not vote for them! I will gather a forum, yes, a forum,
      we won`t allow sending down an army! You don`t even have useful resources!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824306
    m_Localized: Celestia have mercy...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824307
    m_Localized: Argh! Die, you bastard! It`s all your fault! All of you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824308
    m_Localized: Excuses
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824309
    m_Localized: Velvet... I... I...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824310
    m_Localized: We know @lp. The chaos you committed allowed me to get inside the
      base
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824311
    m_Localized: It was a slaughter, @lp. A terrible slaughter. Maybe pegasi were
      hostile to you, but...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824312
    m_Localized: We cannot blame her for what she did, Velvet! Everything indicated
      the impossibility of negotiations. After all the horrors of the Wasteland,
      in her situation...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824313
    m_Localized: The only thing that was required "in her situation" was caution!
      Don`t you understand the consequences? Doesn`t death of so many ponies concern
      you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824314
    m_Localized: I have seen enough acts way worse and can provide a sober estimate
      of the situation, young lady! Her decisions were justified! It is our fault
      we didn`t predict the consequences. This is not the time for tearing your mane
      out. It`s time to act!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824315
    m_Localized: 'Please... I understand what I did. I made a mistake and went too
      far. But then... I just couldn`t do otherwise.

      Watcher is right. We
      need to act'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824316
    m_Localized: 'We must notify everypony about what happened. Everypony we can.
      War is coming, and we have little time.

      There, at this base you killed
      much more ponies than a dozen of Enclave soldiers, @lp. Much more'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824317
    m_Localized: 'Velvet! You shouldn`t make such accusations.

      I am already
      working on notifying surface settlements. And you, @lp, have to warn Mentor.
      And give him the artifacts. Perhaps he will be able to complete the "Sun" and
      "Rainbow"  projects. Perhaps he will even agree to help us'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824318
    m_Localized: Sorry @lp, but I will stay to help the Watcher. No matter how I
      want returning home with you, my skills will be more important here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824319
    m_Localized: 'Good. Then I move out immediately.

      ...

      Forgive me,
      Velvet. I... I tried to be nice'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824320
    m_Localized: No need apologizing to me. You will be your own judge. And no pony
      could be as strict on yourself as you can
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824321
    m_Localized: And yet, @lp, even though you massacred everypony there at the base,
      you spared the commander who surrendered
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824322
    m_Localized: Yes, I spared him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824323
    m_Localized: Just one step forward after everything that happened. But this step
      saved a life of a pony. Perhaps not just one
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824324
    m_Localized: You may have made a mistake, @lp, but this action says a lot about
      you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824325
    m_Localized: The commander you killed... he surrendered
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824326
    m_Localized: Yes. I killed him because... I don`t know. I thought it would fix
      something. I did not quite understand then what I was doing. And I did not
      believe him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824327
    m_Localized: The Watcher was right when he said that you had reasons for this
      violence. But still, there are borders that should not be crossed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824328
    m_Localized: Way home
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824329
    m_Localized: How can I return to Stable Pi?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824330
    m_Localized: This is much easier than you might think. The teleportation system
      built into the MAS Emergency Rescue System terminal will bring you home
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824331
    m_Localized: A terminal? So simple!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824332
    m_Localized: Err... Or not?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824333
    m_Localized: I can only teleport to where I was before. I have no idea where
      my home is
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824334
    m_Localized: You don`t need its coordinates to return home. All you need is a
      PipBuck belonging to its true owner and containing access codes for Stable
      Pi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824335
    m_Localized: And I have those codes?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824336
    m_Localized: No. But I have. Right now they are being transferred to your PipBuck.
      Just a little longer... there. Now you can use PipBuck map to go home. Perhaps
      we meet again, @lp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824337
    m_Localized: Wait! You never told me who you really are. If you aren`t a resident
      of Stable Pi, then what is your relation to it? What is your relationship with
      Mentor, where did you get the access codes and all the information that you
      told me? I have a right to know, don`t you think?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824338
    m_Localized: Yes, we really should know. Trust must be mutual, right? You know
      so much about us, but I can`t say we know anything about you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824339
    m_Localized: '*** The Sprite bot makes a strange sound. As if somepony at the
      other end of the line took a deep breath ***'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824340
    m_Localized: Very well.. You are right, I will tell you about myself. A little
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824341
    m_Localized: The most extraordinary thing you should know about me is that I
      am a dragon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824342
    m_Localized: A dragon?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824343
    m_Localized: A dragon? But... I only saw dragons in books! You still exist?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824344
    m_Localized: I have not seen any of my kind for a very long time. Perhaps I am
      the last dragon in this area. But more important is that, being a dragon, I
      can live for a very long time. I still remember what Equestria was before the
      war with zebras
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824345
    m_Localized: And... are you really more than two hundred years old?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824346
    m_Localized: I was a personal assistant of Twilight Sparkle, head of the Ministry
      of Arcane Sciences. And while the Stables were mostly outside our jurisdiction,
      Stable Pi was very closely connected to us. As soon as I found a way to contact
      you after the Last Day, I helped you as much as I could. Including with the
      search for artifacts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824347
    m_Localized: That is, you help us because you actually were there at our origins?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824348
    m_Localized: Yes and no. My and Stable Pi`s paths rarely crossed until the end
      of the War. But when the world was destroyed, I began grasping at every fragment
      possible to save. Most of the time I was unable to do anything. However, while
      your Stable lives, this world has one more piece of Equestria I remember. I
      want to help protect it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824349
    m_Localized: But still... A dragon...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824350
    m_Localized: However, all this doesn`t matter now. I am too far away to help
      you otherwise than with sprite bots, and I... cannot abandon my place. What
      matters now is that we must act. @lp, now you can teleport home through the
      terminal at any time. I helped you with what I could, and now I have to fly.
      But let`s keep in touch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824351
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824352
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824353
    m_Localized: Well... That definitely was not what I expected
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824354
    m_Localized: Yes! I`m home at last!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824355
    m_Localized: Mentor? Is that you? Yes... now I finally remember everything...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824356
    m_Localized: Oh, my head...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824357
    m_Localized: Hello @lp. After so many months... I`m glad to see you. Don`t worry,
      a headache is just a side effect of a memory spell wearing off, it will soon
      pass. And, of course, congratulations on successfully fulfilling your mission.
      I`m... really proud of you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824358
    m_Localized: Thank you... I`m also glad to be back home. Yet we have a lot to
      discuss
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824359
    m_Localized: Of course @lp. We do it right away
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824360
    m_Localized: The Watcher tells me a lot about what is happening, but, Holy Celestia,
      he never brought me such news! So you are saying that pegasi are about to descend
      from the clouds and start a war on the surface?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824361
    m_Localized: Yes, exactly. My attack on the base will most likely provoke the
      Enclave into a retaliation campaign. Soon the surface will turn into a battlefield.
      Or a slaughterhouse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824362
    m_Localized: Oh, what times we have to live in! But don`t worry, dear. Now you
      are here, home and safe. Here you will rest, take a rehabilitation course,
      and your life will return to its former, peaceful course. At your request we
      can erase memories of all nightmares of the surface
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824363
    m_Localized: Excuse me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824364
    m_Localized: 'Aren`t you glad to be here again? Just imagine: now that you have
      acquired the artifacts, we are going to complete such an amazing project! We
      all struggled for so many years - so many centuries to find a solution! Were
      we ever this close to completing the project?

      I understand, @lp, you
      had a lot to go through. But we will help you. Mrs. Heartrose will provide
      you with professional psychological assistance, your colleagues and relatives
      will help you to get back on your feet. You will be honored, @lp. Honored as
      a hero, the first Chosen able to achieve the goal'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824365
    m_Localized: And... you will let surface ponies die?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824366
    m_Localized: As far as I know, "dying" is quite a normal condition for them.
      For two hundred years they have been exterminating each other in every way
      they could. I don`t understand your question
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824367
    m_Localized: How can you even say that? How can you now, at such a minute, just
      lock yourself up and go about your business as if nothing happened?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824368
    m_Localized: Hush, hush! Don`t be angry. As I understand, you managed to become
      attached to the surface inhabitants. Perhaps there even is some sense in your
      desire to help them. But if we consider the whole situation, it is simply unreasonable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824369
    m_Localized: Alright. I`ll try to be patient now. But you have to listen to me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824370
    m_Localized: I know that our Stable has been sealed for almost two centuries.
      I know that our main goal has always been the "Sun" project, and that we denied
      contacts until we secure ourselves. But right now there are settlements and
      organizations on the surface which we could make a lasting peace with. They
      can help us establish a connection with the surface, and we would help them
      live and prosper. And right now they are in mortal danger. We can try to complete
      the exoskeleton and protect them. Otherwise, we may simply end up with nowhere
      to go and no pony to contact
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824371
    m_Localized: Now I hear my student talking! You always knew how to express your
      thoughts, and I always appreciated it in you. But you are missing one important
      aspect. We are not all-powerful, @lp. We don`t know how strong this so-called
      Enclave is, and we don`t know how far they can go in their war. Yes, we might
      lose potential friends if we refrain from helping them. But if we interfere,
      we will be at risk of facing mortal danger with them. And we can`t even tell
      how high this risk might be
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824372
    m_Localized: We cannot afford to risk our Stable so recklessly. The very thought
      of losing Stable Pi and all the knowledge we possess... If we stay here and
      complete the project, we have much better chances for survival. This should
      be decisive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824373
    m_Localized: 'I... I see your reason. You`re right. You shouldn`t risk lives
      of ponies living here for a war that doesn`t concern them.

      In that case
      I will give you the artifacts needed to complete the projects and leave this
      place'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824374
    m_Localized: What? Are you out of your mind, @lp?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824375
    m_Localized: Maybe you can sit here in your little sanctuary, enjoying peace
      and quiet, but there is a war about to begin up there because of me! And I
      can`t stay here knowing what`s going on!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824376
    m_Localized: I won`t let you, @lp! For your good, I forbid you to leave Stable
      Pi! The necessary psychological assistance will be provided to you, we will
      give you a rehabilitation course!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824377
    m_Localized: You forbid me? Well, then make me obey this order
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824378
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824379
    m_Localized: You are making a big mistake, @lp. The Wasteland has already injured
      you enough. Your consciousness is experiencing the Hoofington syndrome. I am
      warning you. Don`t leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824380
    m_Localized: Still I have to say no. Take the artifacts. I hope you can complete
      the project
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824381
    m_Localized: Well... I wasn`t exclude this possibility. May Celestia have mercy
      on you...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824382
    m_Localized: Before you leave... Did you manage to find Velvet Remedy?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824383
    m_Localized: Yes, we met out there. She`s fine, but as I understood, she has
      no intention to return to Stable Pi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824384
    m_Localized: I thought so. I made a mistake letting her go, even though she volunteered.
      Now it`s obvious that her goal was just to escape from us... although I still
      don`t understand why
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824385
    m_Localized: Apparently, some ponies are simply not meant to be living in a cage,
      even if this cage is made of gold
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824386
    m_Localized: A cage? We have never been a cage! We are your home. And we will
      be your home no matter what
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824387
    m_Localized: Yo, @lp, I am so glad you`re back! You have changed so much. Though,
      what am I saying?! Of course, anypony would change after returning from the
      surface
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824388
    m_Localized: Hi, Transistor. And you have not changed a bit. Still messing around
      with your chips?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824389
    m_Localized: Of course, this is my specialty, but what else could I do? Can`t
      wait until I can start working with a quantum cogitator. This is a real miracle,
      a triumph of technology. When Mentor informed us that you managed to acquire
      it, I almost went crazy! Frankly, I did not believe in your success at all,
      according to my calculations, its probability was 3720 to...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824390
    m_Localized: Enough talking about chances already
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824391
    m_Localized: Heeey!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824392
    m_Localized: Better explain what role the cogitator plays in the "Sun" project?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824393
    m_Localized: What do you mean, what role? It will help to turn the user of the
      "Rainbow" exoskeleton into a super-soldier. It will evaluate a situation on
      a battlefield right up to probable trajectories of each bullet and vulnerabilities
      of each enemy. It will calculate how to move, how to aim, how to control each
      movement on the ground and in the air and will predict the movements of each
      enemy. It`s like S.A.T.S., only a thousand times cooler with everything working
      in real time! We already have all the algorithms, we only need a very powerful
      processor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824394
    m_Localized: I shudder to think what it`s like fighting such an enemy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824395
    m_Localized: Well... There is only a single copy of a quantum cogitator, nothing
      like this exists anywhere. It`s like a whole maneframe in your pocket! And
      now we have it, so you shouldn`t worry that it could be used by enemies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824396
    m_Localized: Is it really that unique? And to think that I used it as an expansion
      module for my PipBuck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824397
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824398
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824399
    m_Localized: "... @lp, you didn\u2019t use it as a hammer as well by any chance,
      did you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824400
    m_Localized: Well, perhaps just once... You know, up there I had many various
      adventures
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824401
    m_Localized: ... Don`t do this again, okay? Let me give you my extension module
      instead. It does the same thing, with the only difference that it is not a
      piece of unique and incredibly valuable technology
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824402
    m_Localized: Alright, relax. You know, sitting in a workshop all the time makes
      you kind of nervous. I was glad to see you, don`t work yourself to death
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824403
    m_Localized: '@lp, so this is whom we owe for the "Rainbow" armor schematics!
      You can`t imagine how long I waited for an opportunity to look into them'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824404
    m_Localized: Lime Fizzy, how is the foundry doing?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824405
    m_Localized: The work is in full swing, the "Rainbow" armor is almost ready.
      If we do everything right, this will be a true masterpiece
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824406
    m_Localized: Is this armor really so special? I have seen a lot on the surface,
      it will be hard to impress me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824407
    m_Localized: Believe me, this armor will be special. First, it is equipped with
      wings and will allow its owner to fly. Second, those magical artifacts that
      you obtained will incredibly increase its protective properties. And third,
      it should significantly increase magical power and efficiency of weapons for
      its owner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824408
    m_Localized: Therefore, we are planning to call it the "Alicorn Armor". The one
      who puts it on will not be inferior even to the goddesses Celestia and Luna
      themselves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824409
    m_Localized: It sounds really impressive. I hope such power won`t ever be used
      for evil. I saw too much violence there on the surface... I myself caused a
      significant portion of it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824410
    m_Localized: It was tough, hey? How is it... up there? Really bad?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824411
    m_Localized: How should I put it... Yes and no. Up there life can be harsh. And
      very cruel. Often it`s either kill or be killed. But at the same time, that
      life... is real. I don`t know how to explain...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824412
    m_Localized: I think I understand. That is precisely why we are creating the
      "Alicorn Armor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824413
    m_Localized: No. I`m afraid you still don`t get it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824414
    m_Localized: Oh, @lp, I`m glad you stopped by. I heard you`re planning to return
      to surface?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824415
    m_Localized: Hi, Mrs. Heartrose. Yes, I should return as soon as possible, I
      have a very important business left unfinished up there
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824416
    m_Localized: Can I somehow convince you to stay?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824417
    m_Localized: I don`t think so. Sorry, I don`t need psychological assistance.
      At least not right now. Terrible things will soon start happening above, and...
      to some extent... it`s my fault
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824418
    m_Localized: I see. Then I will not discourage you or annoy you with my advice,
      especially since I don`t feel it`s my place to give it to you. Obviously, you
      have experienced many things that I have no idea about, so I`m hardly able
      to correctly assess the situation and make a decision for you. Is it a feeling
      of responsibility that drives you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824419
    m_Localized: Probably. And there are also my friends who will soon need my help
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824420
    m_Localized: Then go. Otherwise you will never be able to forgive yourself for
      standing apart
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824421
    m_Localized: By Celestia, the only thing we have been doing all of our lives
      is standing apart...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824422
    m_Localized: Thank you. I actually feel a little better
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824423
    m_Localized: Good. Then let me give you small advice. Don`t leave right now,
      a couple of hours will hardly make a difference. Take a walk around the Stable,
      see your friends, take a look into your room. After all, this is your home,
      and even a short stay at home will surely have a beneficial effect on you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824424
    m_Localized: Ok, I will follow your advice. And don`t worry about me, we`ll see
      each other again, and then there will be time for serious heart-to-heart talks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824425
    m_Localized: Hello professor. I`m not disturbing?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824426
    m_Localized: What? Ah, @lp, not at all, not at all... So it means you came back
      after fulfilling your great mission? I believed in you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824427
    m_Localized: Yes, yes, and not just came back, but with those darn artifacts.
      You can`t even imagine how much trouble it cost me to get them! Was it really
      impossible to do without them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824428
    m_Localized: Oh, I wish it was... You see, these artifacts are absolutely unique,
      nothing can replace them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824429
    m_Localized: Then could you at least explain in more detail what for I had to
      put my health at risk?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824430
    m_Localized: Oh, of course. The Alicorn Amulet is an ancient and unique object
      in many respects. We know a lot about it from research reports of the Ministry
      of Arcane Sciences. It is based on a large crystal of arcanite of the finest
      purity - an extremely rare mineral, one even might say, a legendary one. This
      mineral has ability to repeatedly enhance various energies directed at it,
      including unicorn magic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824431
    m_Localized: However, the magical disturbances arising from it can extremely
      negatively affect personality of the magician himself, distorting his thinking
      and perception. The creators of the Amulet could not eliminate this effect,
      so for centuries it was considered to be cursed, enslaving souls of its owners.
      But we have all the power of both pre-war and modern science on our side, and
      I know the ways how to completely protect the user of our "Alicorn Armor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824432
    m_Localized: And what about the Black Book?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824433
    m_Localized: Ah, this artifact is something completely different, but also very
      remarkable. For a long time ponies considered zebras to be a sort of dumb savages,
      thanks to the propaganda machine during the Ministries times. This, of course,
      is complete nonsense. Zebras bypassed us in many areas of knowledge, their
      shamanism, alchemy and necromancy are in no way inferior to our magic. Otherwise,
      how could the Great War last so many years and end the way it ended?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824434
    m_Localized: Believe me, professor, over the past weeks I`ve learned a lot about
      zebras that sure wasn`t written in your books. I would prefer not to know any
      of this
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824435
    m_Localized: Very interesting. I would greatly appreciate if you put this newly
      acquired knowledge on paper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824436
    m_Localized: Maybe later...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824437
    m_Localized: Err... yes. So, the Black Book. It was created many centuries ago
      by an insane zebra alchemist, written in blood, bound in zebra skin and enchanted
      with the help of evil shamanism unknown to us. That`s only what it is on the
      outside. In fact, we don`t know much about it. But that little that we know
      is amazing! For example, with its help you can make objects almost indestructible.
      Just imagine this feature being applied in the production of armor! The book
      itself also cannot be destroyed by any means known to us
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824438
    m_Localized: But then why didn`t zebras create such armor themselves?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824439
    m_Localized: Good question. Apparently, the knowledge contained in the Black
      Book was considered forbidden and secret even among zebras themselves. In addition,
      these spells are undoubtedly dark and may require a considerable price, say,
      a small part of the caster`s soul. However, we are ready to pay this price,
      I will pay it myself if necessary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824440
    m_Localized: And there is more. But I can only tell the rest after I see the
      Book with my own eyes. Magicians from the Ministry of Style who studied the
      Book classified results of their research, we only got small pieces of data.
      But this is what doesn`t surprise me at all. Both the Book and the knowledge
      contained in it are certainly very dangerous
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824441
    m_Localized: Well, professor, now I can better see the whole picture. Good luck
      with your research!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824442
    m_Localized: Calamity and the Enclave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824443
    m_Localized: Calamity? What are you doing here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824444
    m_Localized: Howdy, @lp! Didn`t expect me here, huh? Glad t` see ya, pipsqueak!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824445
    m_Localized: While you were at the Stable, the Watcher warned everypony his sprite
      bots could get about the imminent invasion. To our surprise, in response the
      "Prancing Pony" camp offered to unite forces
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824446
    m_Localized: Well, ayep, sorta
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824447
    m_Localized: '"Unite forces"? With who?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824448
    m_Localized: With SteelHooves` steel rangers... and Covertsign residents. The
      zebras living here decided they had been hiding long enough
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824449
    m_Localized: Our folks were all down for it, @lp. Our squad of the best shooters
      should already be approaching the rangers camp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824450
    m_Localized: That`s good, I suppose... but why, Calamity? What are you counting
      on? The Enclave is a powerful enemy, and we may be defeated
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824451
    m_Localized: So wha`, should we be sittin` nice and quiet? Your friend with the
      sprite bot here said that Enclave will take revenge on everypony, and ya know,
      I believe him. I used to be there mahself, I know their habits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824452
    m_Localized: You were the Enclave`s soldier?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824453
    m_Localized: Captain Deadshot Calamity, retired. At your service. You can jus`
      call me "cap", Ah won`t mind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824454
    m_Localized: Why did you leave?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824455
    m_Localized: 'Well, ya know, ya saw their ways yourself. I left a long time ago,
      before they even started talkin` about the surface, but still... Believe me,
      @lp, they didn`t mean anything good for us in any case.

      You may say
      this`s personal for me now'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824456
    m_Localized: You could just leave. Go somewhere far away. Especially you, Calamity,
      because if you know the Enclave so well, you could show a place where its troops
      wouldn`t find you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824457
    m_Localized: 'Ain`t our way, @lp. And we have nowhere to go Ah reckon. And yet,
      we all know one pony that wouldn`t do that.

      You know, @lp, you may not
      notice anythin`, but many folks follow your example. Ah wasn`t even surprised
      when Ah found out that you also managed to help zebras and rangers. We had
      somepony to talk about'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824458
    m_Localized: "...\n\tThank you"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824459
    m_Localized: But still, it was my actions that provoked the Enclave. You are
      all in danger now because of me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824460
    m_Localized: Forget it, @lp. Ah`m tellin` ya. If these soldiers came down here,
      it means they ain`t gonna leave by their own will. Believe me, Ah know. Ya
      didn`t provoke anythin`
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824461
    m_Localized: It is all `bout resources, wars are always fought because of `em.
      Pegasi lived behind the clouds for a long time, but it couldn`t go on forever.
      Ya know, there is neither metal nor coal in the clouds, and, speakin` frankly,
      not much food either. They would start an invasion anyway, if not now than
      next year
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824462
    m_Localized: Calamity flew here to coordinate actions with Covertsign. But Askari
      should also be approaching the Steel rangers` camp, @lp. SteelHooves has a
      plan on how to unite our forces
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824463
    m_Localized: Very well, but why do zebras want war? They were planning to move
      north
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824464
    m_Localized: Actually, I convinced them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824465
    m_Localized: ??!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824466
    m_Localized: The zebras here are hoping for the best, but in fact, going north
      is almost certain death for most of them. Fighting here for an opportunity
      to stay is more or less their only real chance to survive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824467
    m_Localized: But you have always been against violence. What changed now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824468
    m_Localized: 'Nothing. But when it comes to choosing between war and certain
      death... I`m not a fool, @lp. And surface ponies deserve living much more than
      these feathered militarists. The best option would be not fighting at all,
      but since it is not possible, it`s better to be the first ones to take up arms.

      Also,
      Calamity noted that you were an example to many in his camp. Trust me, you
      are an example here as well'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824469
    m_Localized: Your friend is right, @lp. Ah say, if there were more like ya and
      her, life would have been better here in the Wasteland
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824470
    m_Localized: Look, @lp, Ah`m flyin` to join everypony at the council. Oak told
      us about SteelHooves, if he was tellin` the truth, it`s worth listenin` to
      what he`s plannin` there. And Ah think it would be nice if ya show up as well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824471
    m_Localized: Your fighting skills may come in handy. Don`t worry about us, @lp,
      we have ponies here capable of organizing work
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824472
    m_Localized: Velvet, about Mentor...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824473
    m_Localized: He refused, didn`t he? Decided to lock up and sit quietly, hoping
      that Stable Pi would remain untouched? This doesn`t surprise me, @lp. He would
      never have courage to defend those in need. Don`t blame yourself for that
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824474
    m_Localized: Right. Then I think I`ll join Calamity. If there is anything I can
      help SteelHooves with, I`ll do it, promise
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824475
    m_Localized: I have no doubt about that
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824476
    m_Localized: War council
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824477
    m_Localized: Greetings @lp. I have to admit, you managed to surprise me yet again.
      Thanks to you and your friends, I suddenly got new allies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824478
    m_Localized: ... as well as new enemies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824479
    m_Localized: Calamity said that you have already been brought up to speed. Let`s
      not waste time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824480
    m_Localized: Alright. As I was saying, we are on the same boat now, therefore
      we have common enemies. If we plan to conduct joint military operations, we
      need to deal with current threats first, and do this before the Enclave makes
      its move. We need to attack and capture Fort Rocks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824481
    m_Localized: 'You might assume that I`m trying to use you to get rid of competitors.
      However, I suggest thinking about this: the followers of now dead Coldsight
      and the Caesar Legion are waging an implacable war against my rangers, and
      it won`t stop until one of us surrenders. If we don`t end the war now, my opponents
      will use the nearest opportunity to stab us in our backs at the most unfavorable
      moment'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824482
    m_Localized: I must add that the territory around our fortifications is constantly
      crawling with Legion scouts. I regret to admit that none of our measures succeeded
      in eliminating this threat. This means that no matter what decision we make
      today, Caesar will be informed of our contact with you. You are all on their
      threat list
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824483
    m_Localized: Thank you scribe. However, the situation is not as bad as it may
      seem. My troops at the moment have achieved significant territorial and numerical
      superiority over the enemy. Strictly speaking, the enemy has already lost.
      We just need to finish off the remnants of its resistance. Which brings us
      back to Fort Rocks. Currently, this pre-war fortress serves as headquarters
      of the Coldsight`s Rangers and the only citadel remaining in their hooves.
      It is where they concentrated their main forces, as well as significant reinforcements
      from the Legion. The remaining detachments are scattered at several military
      bases and observation posts. The assault on Fort Rocks would be a strike that
      will make the enemy unable to fight any longer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824484
    m_Localized: With all respect, star paladin, Fort Rocks is one of Equestria`s
      most powerful fortresses in all its history. Its walls are impregnable, and
      its artillery is overwhelming. If we attempt an assault with all forces available
      to us, it would be a massacre. I suppose you have a different plan?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824485
    m_Localized: Indeed, a front attack is in no way acceptable. Before we received
      the news of the imminent arrival of the Enclave, I hoped to starve this fortress,
      but now this is no longer an option as well. Therefore, we have to rely on
      a different plan of action. To be honest, it is risky, but we have no other
      solution. Please, scribe Amaranth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824486
    m_Localized: We have a fairly detailed plan of the fortress and we know in detail
      the principles of its functioning. Fort Rocks is equipped with the most advanced
      artillery systems that Equestria managed to create before its demise. This
      means that all driving and charging mechanisms of the guns operate on electric
      servos. Same goes for the main gates. In case of a power outage, all defensive
      mechanisms are equipped with capacious batteries, but after two hundred years
      they suffered irreparable damage from environmental conditions. We have long
      abandoned all attempts to fix them. Therefore, if you disconnect the mechanisms
      from a direct energy source, they will stop functioning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824487
    m_Localized: Simply put, if you turn off the generators - the guns will become
      silent, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824488
    m_Localized: Absolutely. At the moment, all systems are powered by a single power
      plant. The problem is that it is located inside the fort. To shut it down,
      you have to get inside. We will have to rely on a saboteur who could pass the
      fortress walls, get to the power station and cut the power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824489
    m_Localized: And that`s the catch, right? Ya know, Ah don`t see how this can
      be done. Ah reckon Ah could try flyin` over the wall with a lil bomb...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824490
    m_Localized: This could work, but, unfortunately, the fort is equipped with anti-air
      guns. Attempting to reach the target with the bomb will surely fail, and rising
      with such a load beyond reach of the air defense systems would be much more
      than any pegasus is capable of
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824491
    m_Localized: We also do not possess any artillery capable of sending a projectile
      at a higher distance than the range of the fortress cannons. That`s why I`m
      asking your suggestions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824492
    m_Localized: "Perhaps I have a solution.\n\tIn ancient times, even before my
      homeland was in a war against yours, we often had to oppose enemies who relied
      on their strongholds. We know a way to defeat them. Our shamans invented a
      potion that can turn one into another creature for a short time. His soul and
      mind will remain the same, but his body will change. Our chosen warriors thus
      turned into mice, birds or insects, penetrated fortresses, and then, after
      returning to their normal shape, opened gates from the inside. Our alchemist,
      Zambezi, stores one portion of this potion just for such cases"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824493
    m_Localized: I don`t think we can rely on some shaman brews
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824494
    m_Localized: We heard you, scribe. Chief Askari, are there any restrictions or
      difficulties in using this potion?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824495
    m_Localized: Yes, there are. The first is the time of its action. The potion
      prepared by the strongest shamans of antiquity could sustain a warrior in a
      different shape for several days, but we can hardly count on more than a few
      minutes. The second - a warrior in the guise of a small animal, although being
      less noticeable, will at the same time be very weak and vulnerable. But then
      he will be able to penetrate the fortress through any crack, pipe or even a
      rat hole, which no pony would care to guard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824496
    m_Localized: Hmm... although I don`t really like this option, I must admit that
      we simply have no other choice. It remains to be decided who will become our
      saboteur
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824497
    m_Localized: I can become one. If it helps us win, I`m in
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824498
    m_Localized: Brave words, @lp. Given the abilities you demonstrated in battle,
      I believe you can be entrusted with this mission. However, if you change your
      mind, I won`t hold anything against you. For many here you are a good acquaintance
      or even a friend
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824499
    m_Localized: Still I will go
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824500
    m_Localized: Ah can pull it out later when the job`s done. Since all the guns
      are on electricity, that means the anti-aircraft guns as well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824501
    m_Localized: 'So, does anypony have any objection to this plan? None? All agreed?

      Then
      this is decided. We shall notice the moment the guns are shut down. Our assault
      squads should be ready to strike immediately, without giving the enemy time
      to restore the station. With the guns powered down and the gates unlocked it
      will be too easy. Let`s do this!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824502
    m_Localized: 'Attention!

      After you enter Fort Rocks, you will no longer
      have time to do anything besides the main mission until the war is over.

      It
      is recommended to save the game in a separate slot'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824503
    m_Localized: Here it is, the control panel of the generator. So many buttons...
      Hmm, what if I try this, big red one?..
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824504
    m_Localized: Aha, looks like it is the right one! Always works! Let`s see how
      you manage without electricity!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824505
    m_Localized: It`s probably time to leave. Better not wasting time, their reinforcements
      will arrive soon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824506
    m_Localized: Ah, there ya are, @lp! Ah was looking just for ya. Come on, let`s
      get goin`, it`s about to become real hot here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824507
    m_Localized: The guns seem to be silent. It worked?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824508
    m_Localized: You bet! As soon as SteelHooves realized that your diversion was
      a success, he ordered to attack immediately. Right now his rangers are storming
      the gates of the fort
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824509
    m_Localized: I can stay and help them...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824510
    m_Localized: Ya already did more than any of us. Iron-heads will handle it on
      their own, it`s their job after all. Ah reckon it`s better to get out of here
      while we can, unless, of course, you have other plans
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824511
    m_Localized: Victory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824512
    m_Localized: So... how did it go?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824513
    m_Localized: We won!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824514
    m_Localized: Everything went according to plan. We marched to the fortress the
      very moment the guns were powered down, and were able to get to the gate before
      the enemy could block them by hooves. After we successfully entered the citadel,
      most of the rangers laid down their arms, and only the Legion zebras attempted
      an escape. However, with the only way out being under our control, this turned
      out to be impossible
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824515
    m_Localized: Yeehaw! That`s how we do it in Wasteland!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824516
    m_Localized: Does this mean that enemies are going to capitulate now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824517
    m_Localized: We can`t tell for sure. However, it`s a fact that even if the remaining
      forces loyal to Coldsight and their allies decide to continue the fight, they
      no longer have opportunity to do us any serious harm. Now their scattered and
      relatively small groups don`t even have an overall command. We may not be afraid
      of them stabbing our back in the ensuing war with the Enclave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824518
    m_Localized: Ah say we should celebrate!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824519
    m_Localized: Of course. My soldiers need a good rest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824520
    m_Localized: Perhaps my comrades will agree to keep you company
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824521
    m_Localized: I know we are in for some hard times ahead, but there is some sense
      in your proposal. We will need strength
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824522
    m_Localized: So, we have...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824523
    m_Localized: Invasion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824524
    m_Localized: Bad news, friends. Especially for you, @lp. The Enclave began the
      invasion. And... I`m afraid its main target is Stable Pi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824525
    m_Localized: What? How... why? How did they?..
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824526
    m_Localized: 'I can only guess. My sprite bots recorded descent of a huge number
      of soldiers and pegasi vehicles in several areas. One of them is the place
      where the main entrance to your home is hidden.

      They seem to know where
      to go and what to do. They are getting ready to break inside!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824527
    m_Localized: We must not let this happen. We move immediately, all together!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824528
    m_Localized: I can go to Stable Pi through the terminal. I must be there now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824529
    m_Localized: Then I will show the way to others. Good luck @lp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824530
    m_Localized: '@lp? Thank Celestia, it`s you! Wait, I`ll turn off the barrier
      now and let you in'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824531
    m_Localized: Attack of the Enclave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824532
    m_Localized: Quick, tell me what happened here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824533
    m_Localized: 'They attacked us, pegasi in strange armor...

      We all were
      minding our own business, everything as usual. Suddenly we heard a rumble and
      the ground shuddered. The general alert sounded and stopped. We think they
      blew up the outer wall, and then somehow got access to the Stable door mechanism
      and our security system. I don`t understand how this is possible... And five
      minutes later a real nightmare began! They burst inside, killing everypony
      in their path!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824534
    m_Localized: Fortunately, after the first explosion Mentor understood that this
      was an attack from outside and managed to warn everypony on speakerphone. We
      hope that most of stable residents took refuge in workshops and labs. You know,
      they have their own autonomous defense systems, force fields or armored doors.
      However, what`s the point? There are no supplies, no food, no weapons. No matter
      how long we sit there, sooner or later they will get us
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824535
    m_Localized: Motherfucking cunts! You were attacked by the Enclave, and this
      enemy is just fucking strong!|Discord`s spawn! You were attacked by the Enclave,
      and this enemy is just frickin` strong!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824536
    m_Localized: Where`s Mentor?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824537
    m_Localized: He is wounded, @lp... Mortally wounded, I`m afraid. We retreated
      here, to workshop one, because it was here we were working on the "Sun" project.
      We stumbled upon a group of enemies. Mentor got a plasma bolt right in his
      chest. I managed to cast a mass daze spell and, while enemy was coming to their
      senses, dragged him here, under the protection of the field. However I`m afraid
      he still isn`t going to survive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824538
    m_Localized: But why didn`t you use the Alicorn Armor? Is it not ready?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824539
    m_Localized: Professor Brownie, Transistor and Lime Fizzy are continuing working
      on it right now. There, the next room. You can come in to see for yourself,
      if only this still matters...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824540
    m_Localized: Ah, @lp... you came back... Holy Celestia... To think how stupid
      it all turned out... All the decades of work, all that secrecy... in vain.
      All our knowledge, all technologies will be... taken by murderers from behind
      the clouds... And all of us will simply die...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824541
    m_Localized: No way! I will not allow it! Not everything is lost yet, my friends
      from the surface will help us, together we will repel this attack! And what
      about the Alicorn Armor?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824542
    m_Localized: We did not have time to complete it, did not have time to configure,
      test... But still... how can it get any worse? You`re right... Use it. Kill
      this scum... You have more combat experience than any stable resident
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824543
    m_Localized: Thank you for trusting in me, Mentor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824544
    m_Localized: Trust?.. Pure pragmatism... Who would have... kha.. more chances
      than you?..
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824545
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824546
    m_Localized: Pain... So much...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824547
    m_Localized: ......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824548
    m_Localized: Forgive me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824549
    m_Localized: Time to get the armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824550
    m_Localized: What? @lp, you`re here? But how did you...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824551
    m_Localized: There is no time for chitchat, enemies are literally hammering on
      our door and may soon burst through and come right here. I intend using your
      Alicorn Armor against them. Quick, help me put it on and explain how to use
      it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824552
    m_Localized: What do you mean, "help you put it on"? You don`t seem to understand
      what you are saying. And where is your Mentor?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824553
    m_Localized: Mentor is dead! They killed him, and now you all are gonna listen
      to me if you want to survive and save the Stable!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824554
    m_Localized: He died?! What do we do now...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824555
    m_Localized: But we haven`t even tested it! This might be dangerous both for
      you and for everypony around you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824556
    m_Localized: So I`ll test it right in battle! Come on! No time to argue!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824557
    m_Localized: 'Okay, @lp... It... should work. I hope. If it does, the enemy will
      have no chance against you.

      Guys, let`s run the integration protocol'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824558
    m_Localized: Errr... what protocol?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824559
    m_Localized: The neural interface of the "Alicorn Armor" should merge with your
      nervous system. It might be... a bit painful
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824560
    m_Localized: Integration has been successfully completed. Compatibility with
      the user`s brain is above average
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824561
    m_Localized: All systems report normal. Working capacity... uh... 19 percent
      of the estimated, but continues to increase...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824562
    m_Localized: How are you feeling @lp?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824563
    m_Localized: Very strange feeling. I don`t feel myself wearing any armor at all,
      as if it is a part of me... And yet, I feel... power...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824564
    m_Localized: "This is normal, your brain is now feeling euphoric, but don`t let
      it deceive you. Remember, Ali\u0441orn Armor does not make you invulnerable"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824565
    m_Localized: Working capacity - 24 percent of the estimated, no longer increasing.
      We need to revise input parameters and adjust...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824566
    m_Localized: But this will take hours!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824567
    m_Localized: There is no time! I will manage with what we`ve got
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824568
    m_Localized: Here is data from security sensors. The enemy is concentrating forces
      at the main entrance. They are preparing a new assault group! Use the evacuation
      tunnel - there, on the left, it will lead you almost to the very entrance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824569
    m_Localized: Don`t let your guard down. And don`t get shot too much
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824570
    m_Localized: We will pray to Celestia for you. You are our last hope
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824571
    m_Localized: '"Alicorn Armor"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824572
    m_Localized: "\"Alicorn Armor\" is an impressive merge of magic and technology
      developed at Stable Pi. It gives its owner excellent protection, ability to
      fly, strengthens his weapons and magical abilities, automatically restores
      his health.\nSkills of the owner affect armor efficiency, giving it new properties
      (see the \"Skills\" tab in your PipBuck).\nThe armor comes with several special
      weapons that don`t require ammunition (see the \u201CWeapons\u201D tab in your
      PipBuck).\nEnhancements and abilities:\n- Ability to fly and accelerate in
      flight.\n- Improved health and defense characteristics.\n- Magical enhancement
      of all types of weapons and combat magic.\n- All weapons are protected from
      damage and wear.\n- Built-in combat spell, teleport and shield spells.\n- Immunity
      to injuries, regeneration of health and magical powers.\nImpossible:\n- Use
      of chemistry, magic potions and food.\n- Use of other protective spells except
      for the built-in shield spell.\n- Use of MAS terminals"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824573
    m_Localized: '@lp? What`s that you are wearing?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824574
    m_Localized: Hi, SteelHooves. This is the result of my Stable`s project that
      Coldsight was so eager to get. To be honest, I`m a little surprised that you
      recognized me in this
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824575
    m_Localized: My locator has identified you as a friendly target
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824576
    m_Localized: I see. Seems you`re doing pretty well here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824577
    m_Localized: Amateurs. The enemy has significant numerical superiority and excellent
      equipment, but their command gets distracted after the very first encounter
      with a trained enemy and cannot adequately coordinate interaction of groups.
      So far, a tactical advantage is on our side. I`ll make sure it stays that way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824578
    m_Localized: Askari? You`re here too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824579
    m_Localized: We lent you a helping hoof at Fort Rock. We will help you here as
      well. Time for hiding is over
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824580
    m_Localized: All these bodies - is this your doing?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824581
    m_Localized: They never knew what hit them. Don`t worry @lp, we will take care
      of those flying rats
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824582
    m_Localized: Thunderhead
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824583
    m_Localized: Well @lp, doesn`t this remind ya of anythin`?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824584
    m_Localized: It sure does! About our first meeting. Only I am not the pony I
      was before. And stakes are now much higher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824585
    m_Localized: By the way, you have changed too. Where did you get the Enclave
      armor?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824586
    m_Localized: Took this as a souvenir when Ah retired mahself from their army.
      And now it came in handy. Have ya been in your Stable? How are they doin` over
      yonder?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824587
    m_Localized: Enclave troops got inside, but it seems that we managed to destroy
      most of them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824588
    m_Localized: Err... sorry to disappoint ya, but there is a small problem... actually
      it is a big one. Very big
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824589
    m_Localized: Show me the enemy. I have something to discuss with him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824590
    m_Localized: It ain`t gonna be easy. Ah`m afraid the Enclave sent the [Thunderhead]
      after us. We don`t see it `cause of the clouds, but mah armor has the same
      radio communication system as theirs, and Ah heard all their conversations
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824591
    m_Localized: That name doesn`t ring a bell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824592
    m_Localized: This is a huge flyin` fortress. With a bunch of guns, a landin`
      party and a protective shield. So far we`ve only been fightin` the landin`
      party, because they intended to capture your Stable instead of bombing it,
      that`s why Thunderhead itself didn`t show up. But as long as it`s hangin` out
      there in the sky, we ain`t gonna win. It can deploy more troops, come down
      and level this place, or drop bombs directly on our heads
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824593
    m_Localized: There is no way we can beat such an enemy, @lp. If we had an entire
      anti-aircraft battery and a couple of dragons too...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824594
    m_Localized: But we can`t just give up! This armor I`m wearing... it makes me
      much stronger than you could imagine. And now I have wings, I can try to destroy
      Thunderhead in the air!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824595
    m_Localized: This is suicide, @lp. Although... ya`re a too small target for Thunderhead
      guns to aim. Ah reckon, If ya keep spinnin` around all the time, preventin`
      yourself from getting hit, and if ya manage to overwhelm its shield... Then
      ya could get inside through the landin` hatch and smash its reactor to pieces.
      It ain`t gonna survive that
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824596
    m_Localized: Overwhelm the shield, get inside, destroy the reactor. Don`t get
      blown up by guns. Got it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824597
    m_Localized: And then get the hay outta there real fast. It`ll explode so much
      like ya`re ain`t gonna forget. Okay @lp, if ya`re sure... Ah`ll show ya the
      way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824598
    m_Localized: We will hold this position
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824599
    m_Localized: The enemy won`t pass!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824600
    m_Localized: Which way?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824601
    m_Localized: Do ya see that big cloud blazing with lightnin`? That`s where ya`re
      headin`. Thunderhead`s pegasi ain`t gonna react to ya right away, they ain`t
      expectin` anythin` like that. Probably. In short, fly faster and ya will have
      time to get close enough to shoot until they start firin` at ya
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824602
    m_Localized: And, @lp. Try to survive okay? Ya`ve overcome too much to end like
      this...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824603
    m_Localized: This armor won`t let me die, Calamity. Now I could even destroy
      an entire city. Don`t worry about me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824604
    m_Localized: Thunderhead can do that too. Be careful
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824605
    m_Localized: Don`t fret. I`ll be careful
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824606
    m_Localized: The shield is off! Now let`s get inside!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824607
    m_Localized: And now let`s get the hay out of here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824608
    m_Localized: Wha... what was that? What the hay? I`m falling?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824609
    m_Localized: I was hit by explosion! And... I no longer control the armor! Did
      it shut down?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824610
    m_Localized: No-no-no-No!!! Work, freakin wings!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824611
    m_Localized: No use...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824612
    m_Localized: What should I do?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824613
    m_Localized: Ah! Telekinesis! Self-levitation! Slow down the fall!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824614
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824615
    m_Localized: I can`t
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824616
    m_Localized: No strength left...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824617
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824618
    m_Localized: So that`s how this is going to end?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824619
    m_Localized: I`ll just crash falling from the clouds?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824620
    m_Localized: How lame...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824621
    m_Localized: Gotcha!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824622
    m_Localized: Calamity!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824623
    m_Localized: Ayep!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824624
    m_Localized: That was a mighty huge blast! Yeeeee-haw!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824625
    m_Localized: Ouch!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824626
    m_Localized: Don't do this ever again, okay? Just bring me down to the ground
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824627
    m_Localized: Okay, @lp! Whatever ya say
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824628
    m_Localized: How is it on the surface?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824629
    m_Localized: Ah don`t know. But look! The Enclaves no longer fly down!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824630
    m_Localized: What are they doing then?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824631
    m_Localized: Ah don`t understand yet! But it seems, they`re gonna turn back!
      Ah would`ve done the same if our Thunderhead got blown up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824632
    m_Localized: Then let`s hurry to our friends! Whatever happens, we should be
      there right now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824633
    m_Localized: No @lp, Ah`m sorry but Ah reckon ya aren`t a good fighter at the
      moment. Besides you`ve done your job already. They can finish the battle without
      ya
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824634
    m_Localized: And finally...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824635
    m_Localized: It seems everypony is here, @lp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824636
    m_Localized: Holy Celestia. How many ponies died
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824637
    m_Localized: Ponies, zebras. Earth ponies, unicorns... pegasi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824638
    m_Localized: And this is not the end
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824639
    m_Localized: But at least we`ll have a break. Losing their flagship and most
      of the accompanying strike group stunned the enemy. To such extent that, according
      to our reports, they suspended military operations in other regions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824640
    m_Localized: Ayep. We haven`t had such losses... They. They haven`t had such
      losses since... Well, never, Ah reckon. We haven`t won yet, `f course. But
      now they`re gonna have a mighty commotion up there, in the clouds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824641
    m_Localized: We are here to honor the mentor of @lp and Velvet. I think a discussion
      of the strategy should be left for later
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824642
    m_Localized: A mentor, a colleague. For some, a friend. We all lost friends and
      ponies we know. Now is the time to honor one of them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824643
    m_Localized: '*HERE LIES

      SILVER MANE

      A pony who wanted to bring
      back the past*'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824644
    m_Localized: May Celestia embrace his soul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824645
    m_Localized: He was not alone in his aspirations. Many ponies I knew wished for
      the same thing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824646
    m_Localized: But not everypony understood this was impossible
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824647
    m_Localized: The past... The past perished with him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824648
    m_Localized: No. We all stand on a foundation of the past. It defines us and
      makes us what we are. And it eventually brought us all here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824649
    m_Localized: I wonder... Could things have been different? If the Mentor hadn`t
      sent us to the surface, if I hadn`t found artifacts. And if... not for the
      events at the Enclave`s base
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824650
    m_Localized: Who knows. Ah`d say that it could have been different. But not much
      different. All that would happen sooner or later
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824651
    m_Localized: Perhaps. Stable Pi couldn`t stay sealed forever. Sooner or later
      this was to happen, one way or another
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824652
    m_Localized: But there is something that could never happen then. We could never
      meet ponies who were ready to face horrors of the Wasteland and wouldn`t let
      it devour themselves. Ponies who would refuse to accept the order of things
      in this world. And which would give us hope for a better future
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824653
    m_Localized: Truly so. This world has long been bogged down in despair and misery.
      But while there are those who believe in a better world, hope remains
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824654
    m_Localized: And yet... War never changes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824655
    m_Localized: But ponies... Ponies can
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824656
    m_Localized: Hey, @lp. Ah know this may not be the best time, but, ya know, you
      sure did great job smashin` that Thunderhead into pieces! That armor - is that
      the project for which they sent you here to us?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824657
    m_Localized: Yes, even though I didn`t remember about it. I think Mentor had
      other plans than to use this exoskeleton in the war against Enclave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824658
    m_Localized: Yeah. But it really helped us a lot. Well, ya did, Ah mean. Does
      it still work?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824659
    m_Localized: I don`t think it will ever function as good as before. But at least
      it can still fly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824660
    m_Localized: That ain`t bad too. Listen, remember how Ah suggested ya to put
      down roots in our good ol` Prancin`? If ya don`t change your mind, mah deal
      is still on the table
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824661
    m_Localized: I don`t know yet. But thanks. At least I will definitely stop by
      from time to time. Especially first time until we defeat the Enclave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824662
    m_Localized: Ya know, `bout that. Ah ain`t gonna explain everythin` in detail,
      but perhaps there won`t be any war for some time. We have a complex society
      above the clouds, and the Enclave is not that all-powerful there at all. Perhaps
      after such losses it will even be swept away. Or maybe not. But it will definitely
      have problems besides us
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824663
    m_Localized: Good news. Thank you, Calamity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824664
    m_Localized: Well, it`s still uncertain. We shall see Ah reckon. When everythin`
      settles down, come visit us, we`ll do some flyin` together. It`s been a long
      time since I was flyin` with any of my friends
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824665
    m_Localized: Of course
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824666
    m_Localized: You know, deep down in my heart I always knew how it was going to
      end. Perhaps I left Stable because I wanted to prevent this from happening
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824667
    m_Localized: And yet this is actually my fault
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824668
    m_Localized: 'Yes, it`s your fault too.

      But the blame lies with me as
      well. After all, it was me who, as a result of my refusal, forced Mentor to
      send a new Chosen one to the surface. If not for me, you would have stayed
      home. And who knows what would have happened if I had fulfilled my mission'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824669
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824670
    m_Localized: If you could return to the past, to the day you volunteered to become
      Chosen, would you agree to go to the surface anyway, knowing what awaits you
      here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824671
    m_Localized: Of course. After all that I saw on the surface, my desire fix at
      least something here only grew stronger. It will be a long way, @lp, a very
      long way. But if I don`t believe that we can bring peace back with these ponies,
      I don`t know what to believe in at all
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824672
    m_Localized: I will help Stable ponies here. It will be very difficult for them
      now, after and discovering a completely new world and losing so many ponies.
      But when things get back to normal, I will return to Covertsign zebras. They
      need me. And what are you going to do?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824673
    m_Localized: I have no choice. I owe Equestrian Wasteland too much. We already
      talked about it, remember? Now that I saw this place with my own eyes, I can`t
      abandon ponies here. So do you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824674
    m_Localized: There is much you never told me about yourself. Perhaps the time
      has come?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824675
    m_Localized: I don`t think this is important
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824676
    m_Localized: But still?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824677
    m_Localized: "...\n\tAs I said before, I have been in touch with your Stable
      for a very long time. You know, these days, almost two hundred years after
      the War, life in the Wasteland is no picnic at all, but then, during the first
      decades, it was absolutely terrible. At some point, I thought that I would
      become the last intelligent being. Therefore, I tried to find such islands
      of civilization as your home, and protect them. I helped them, talked about
      what was happening around, warned of dangers. I was hoping that when the time
      comes for Stable Pi to open its doors, it wouldn`t be... like that"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824678
    m_Localized: Why didn`t you persuade us to open up to the world? Our help could
      save lives of so many ponies here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824679
    m_Localized: And many ponies would want your death. Believe me @lp, many times
      I`ve seen how stables like yours unsealed only to be destroyed or enslaved.
      I did not want such a fate befall you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824680
    m_Localized: What were you hoping for? Why did you think it would become better
      later on?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824681
    m_Localized: 'I didn`t think it would be better. I was just hoping. And tried
      to find the right ponies.

      Remember, I lived before the War and knew
      many... amazing ponies. It`s hard to believe now, but @lp, there are ponies
      who can change the world. Even now, in our harsh times, there is hope that
      sooner or later they will come and turn everything upside down here'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824682
    m_Localized: But such ponies are one in a million and are extremely difficult
      to meet. However, there are still those who are changing this world for the
      better. Askari said the right thing about you. You and Velvet - you do not
      accept this world. You want to change it, you want to help those brought on
      the brink of survival, having to deal with new dangers every day. And you are
      succeeding
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824683
    m_Localized: These are very kind words. But in the end, my invasion of the Enclave
      base started a war in which hundreds have died already. If I changed the world,
      it`s not for the best at all
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824684
    m_Localized: This`s just how it seems to you. You probably didn`t notice, but
      your and Velvet`s actions brought hope to surface ponies. In their life they
      saw too much evil, cruelty and indifference. Many began forgetting that everything
      could be different. With your selfless help and dedication you reminded them
      that it can
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824685
    m_Localized: 'Every story should have a moral, right? Perhaps for the story of
      Stable Pi it would`ve been like this: "The road to hell is paved with good
      intentions." It is unfortunate that it all ended so. But as for you... Your
      story is not finished yet. And I think I should help you write it'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824686
    m_Localized: Then, I suppose, you should start by telling yours in more detail
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824687
    m_Localized: Sounds fair. Yes, I think I will tell you my story in due time.
      Or even better - I`ll invite to my place when this war is over. Are we agreed?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824688
    m_Localized: Agreed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824689
    m_Localized: Just think about it. I spent so much time here on the surface. But
      only after everything that happened I see such a beautiful sky
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824690
    m_Localized: The pegasi forces were forced to hastily retreat upward after the
      loss of Thunderhead. And they did it so disorganized they violated the integrity
      of their cloud barrier. Unfortunately, this will not last long
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824691
    m_Localized: I was told that you have been living for two hundred years already.
      Is this true?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824692
    m_Localized: Yes, it is true. It just so happened that I became a ghoul. A Canterlot
      ghoul, to be exact. I was lucky to keep my sanity, and unlucky to see this
      world slipping into the abyss of madness and devastation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824693
    m_Localized: So you saw Equestria before the war?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824694
    m_Localized: 'Yes. And I know what you`re thinking @lp. You are right, the sky
      is now exactly the same as it used to be then.

      Good times...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824695
    m_Localized: Is there any chance... Can we ever recover our past?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824696
    m_Localized: I don`t know. I have hoped so many times over the years, clutching
      at false promises. But still, as long as there are ponies who want bringing
      back Equestria like it was before, we still have a chance. Maybe not us, but
      our descendants will be able to live under such a clear and beautiful sky
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824697
    m_Localized: What are your future plans?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824698
    m_Localized: The war with the pegasi is not over. But at least we can now live
      without fear of the Legion executioners. Thanks to your help, we no longer
      need to hide. My settlement will never forget this
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824699
    m_Localized: I`m sorry for what happened to your home. The enemy is treacherous
      and ruthless. But many ponies survived. Are you going to be with them now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824700
    m_Localized: At least for the first time, I`ll help them defend themselves. And
      what we`ll see what happens next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824701
    m_Localized: You must never forget your roots, @lp. There is nothing harder than
      breaking with your homeland
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824702
    m_Localized: You know all about that, huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824703
    m_Localized: I do. But now my home is Covertsign, my roots are zebras living
      in it. And ponies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824704
    m_Localized: I wish your home prosperity in the future
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824705
    m_Localized: We must live on
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824706
    m_Localized: 'I know my dear @lp. Just think: you and I have worked together
      for so many years, and now... A total fiasco, hey?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824707
    m_Localized: We are alive and standing here. In our situation, this is already
      a success
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824708
    m_Localized: But at such a price, such a huge price... And we no longer have
      Alicorn Armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824709
    m_Localized: Can we fixed it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824710
    m_Localized: No... A hasty launch at low power turned out to be fatal for it.
      The quantum cogitator could not stand the damage, and the Alicorn amulet, apparently,
      completely lost its power. Only the skeleton remains, a pale imitation of the
      real thing! For two hundred years we all have been working so hard to complete
      the project, and now we are here, among the graves of our comrades, whom we
      have failed. All our work was in vain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824711
    m_Localized: Pull yourself together, professor. If we hadn`t done this, we all
      would`ve perished. It`s hard for me to say this, but this is how you get iron
      will. Many of us have a burden of guilt, and for some it`s very heavy. But
      we must live on. Stable Pi must survive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824712
    m_Localized: '... Yes. Yes, you are right.

      We have a lot of work to do.
      Those invaders not only killed ponies, they did serious damage to the stable.
      We need to recover, and first of all we need to find a way to protect ourselves
      in the future'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824713
    m_Localized: A new project?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824714
    m_Localized: A new project? I don`t think so. It would not be possible... We
      have to come up with something else
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824715
    m_Localized: What about the Black Book? I can leave it with you, maybe you can
      find a use for it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824716
    m_Localized: Oh, no-no-no, keep it to yourself. While I was working with this
      thing, I seemed to begin hallucinating. You`d better throw it away altogether
      - zebras weren`t afraid of such witchcraft for nothing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824717
    m_Localized: Perhaps we should seek help from our new allies?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824718
    m_Localized: Perhaps. This is not for me to decide. We won`t be deciding anything
      now, first we must pay respects to those who are not with us anymore
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824719
    m_Localized: Right
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824720
    m_Localized: What do you think, how did the Enclave manage to find Stable Pi
      so easily, and even open the outer door without any effort?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824721
    m_Localized: You know, this bothers me since the day of the attack. Of course,
      I didn`t have much time, but I still did some digging through the archives
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824722
    m_Localized: And what did you find out?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824723
    m_Localized: It turns out that all this time we were very naive, believing that
      the location of the Stable was unknown to everypony else. Well, think for yourself
      how much effort is required to build it, how many workers involved, how much
      equipment, supplies... and all this was documented somewhere, and too many
      knew about it. Of course, with the devastation that is happening now on the
      surface, all this information has long been lost and forgotten. But the Enclave
      is a different matter. Judging by what I know about them, they have preserved
      many pre-war databases. All they had to do to find a location of any Stable
      was just make right inquiries
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824724
    m_Localized: And how did they open the door? After all, it was designed to withstand
      even mega-spells
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824725
    m_Localized: At first I thought that they hacked the security system from an
      external terminal. But it was nothing of the kind. They simply had access codes!
      It turns out that an external door of any Stable can be opened by entering
      such codes. And we didn`t even know if such a thing exists. Well, that is,
      I didn`t know... Mentor should have known, but for some reason he didn`t take
      any precautions. Just mechanically blocking the door would be enough. I assume,
      there were some rules forbidding it from two centuries ago
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824726
    m_Localized: But I promise you, everything will be different now. I will personally
      reorganize the entire security system. This will not happen again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824727
    m_Localized: Huh, I really would never have thought that Silver would die like
      this. A death in bed at ninety or so would suit him much better
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824728
    m_Localized: Such death doesn`t suit anypony
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824729
    m_Localized: Are you talking about the one in bed? Or about the murder?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824730
    m_Localized: Both
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824731
    m_Localized: Ah, erm... Right
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824732
    m_Localized: You know, you saved us all in the end. They told me how you shot
      down that enclave flagship. If it wasn`t for you and the armor, they would
      have killed us all. Probably
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824733
    m_Localized: Thanks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824734
    m_Localized: Thanks yourself. I don`t know if your memory has returned to you
      or not, but I remember how you and I used to work together. You were so calm.
      I would never have thought that you would become, ahem, a hero
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824735
    m_Localized: I am not a hero. And if I hadn`t become what I am now, I would not
      have survived
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824736
    m_Localized: Oh, by the way, you still owe me my SuperPony magazines
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824737
    m_Localized: Oops. So it has returned then
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824738
    m_Localized: How are the rest of the Stable residents feeling now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824739
    m_Localized: Downhearted. Almost everypony are either shocked or stressed. Most
      of them will overcome it on their own, but I will make sure that no one falls
      into depression. Such events do not happen every day
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824740
    m_Localized: Seems to me, they must be feeling somewhat similar to what I felt
      on my first day in the Wasteland. Only on a larger scale. The inhabitants of
      the Stable will never be the same again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824741
    m_Localized: Of course they won`t be the same. But we still could return to our
      former way of life. If we are allowed to
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824742
    m_Localized: I can`t speak for everypony. I can only hope that the others will
      choose to lend us a helping hoof. But I promise that I personally will do everything
      I can to protect my home
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824743
    m_Localized: Tell me, @lp. How fast did you get used to seeing deaths of other
      ponies?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824744
    m_Localized: Um... I had a lot of practice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824745
    m_Localized: You and I need to talk about this more thoroughly at the earliest
      opportunity. Your new life is very dangerous, @lp, not only for your physical
      health, but also for the psyche. I know you understand that yourself. Don`t
      forget about it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824746
    m_Localized: Ok, at the earliest opportunity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824747
    m_Localized: Welcome back, @lp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824748
    m_Localized: Glad to see you`re still kicking, Daiquiri
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824749
    m_Localized: The pleasure is all mine! I really thought it would be the end of
      us all. Enclave, my Gracious Celestia! If you told me this a year earlier,
      I would never believe it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824750
    m_Localized: Well, now you can breathe again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824751
    m_Localized: Yeah. All those raiders and slavers will now seem a piece of cake
      to us. The whole camp is buzzing about how you cracked that tin! Believe me,
      they aren`t going to forget that anytime soon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824752
    m_Localized: Please, let`s not dwell on that. For me that battle is a memory
      of dead inhabitants of Stable Pi, and not some glorious stories of valor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824753
    m_Localized: As you please. We won`t. But still, @lp, after everything that happened,
      you will never ever be a stranger here. Remember this
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824754
    m_Localized: Greetings, wanderer. You have walked a long and difficult path since
      our last meeting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824755
    m_Localized: Yes, it was difficult. But it is not finished yet, is it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824756
    m_Localized: It is not. While you are alive, your destiny will guide you. But
      it is burdened with a black shadow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824757
    m_Localized: What is that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824758
    m_Localized: The Black book. The news that this damned thing was in hooves of
      a wrong pony reached me too late
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824759
    m_Localized: It was necessary for completing the project
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824760
    m_Localized: Of course it was necessary. Just as it was necessary for all those
      unfortunate souls it has destroyed before. Necessity brings all of you to the
      Black Book. But it will never give you what you desire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824761
    m_Localized: However the project was completed, and the armor helped protect
      my home from the invaders
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824762
    m_Localized: 'Invaders? Have you ever heard of those invaders before the damned
      book revealed itself?

      Remember @lp. Remember what happened to you and
      your loved ones since you got this thing. How many times did you feel happy?
      Or did threats and sorrows start falling on you, as if from under the hoof
      of the Mare of The Stars? Have you been yourself?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824763
    m_Localized: You are telling me, that...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824764
    m_Localized: Fate is incomprehensible to us mortals. But such artifacts, creations
      of insane minds, stand above the world of living. They can change it like clay
      in hooves of a skilled potter - subtly, but inexorably. If you want to live
      in peace the rest of your life, stay away from this evil thing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824765
    m_Localized: This is... too strange to be true. No, it`s nonsense. Sorry, Zambezi,
      this book may be disastrous, but I won`t leave such a powerful artifact just
      lying around somewhere
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824766
    m_Localized: This mistake might cost you dearly in the future. But I can`t force
      you. When the Black Book brings you to your doom and your bones are polished
      by desert wind, I will come and bury them. But only after I bury this damned
      thing deep underground
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824767
    m_Localized: Umm... Thanks?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824768
    m_Localized: I thought we were friends
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824769
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824770
    m_Localized: When Calamity returned, he told us a lot about your new costume
      and its magic. You had the Alicorn Amulet! I would give anything to have a
      look at it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824771
    m_Localized: Sorry, but it was required for more important things. Like saving
      my home, for example
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824772
    m_Localized: I know, I know. But still - at least you could`ve brought it just
      for a second. Do you still have it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824773
    m_Localized: No, it burned out in battle and no longer exists. I`m sorry that
      I took the liberty of using it in the battle that decided the fate of hundreds
      of other ponies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824774
    m_Localized: '...

      I`m sorry, I should`ve been more polite. But holy Celestia,
      the Alicorn Amulet is a real legend! And what a legend! Legends were made about
      its legendarity! And those legends were...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824775
    m_Localized: Yeah, it seems I really should have brought you the amulet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824776
    m_Localized: This armor... Holy Celestia, what is it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824777
    m_Localized: The scientific project from my Stable. It was very useful in the
      battle with the Enclave, but now it can only make me fly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824778
    m_Localized: '"Only make you fly"? You know, anypony in the brotherhood would
      sell his soul just for that! But then, what was it capable of before?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824779
    m_Localized: Exploiting a force incomprehensible to its creators and bring trouble,
      that`s all
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824780
    m_Localized: 'This concludes the story of a pony named @lp.

      But not your
      game. You can continue to travel through the Wasteland, fight enemies, complete
      missions, get levels and collect items.

      We hope you enjoy playing this
      game as much as we enjoyed working on it'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824781
    m_Localized: 'And there will be no final credits! What are they even for anyway?
      Who reads those tons of text and long lists of names of those who took the
      tiniest part in the product`s creation process? Probably no one except for
      the creators themselves.

      So we won`t bore you any longer so you could
      go on playing the game!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824782
    m_Localized: Hey! I see you don`t have any armor. Just... a jumpsuit? You won`t
      last long in the Wasteland in such clothes! You want to survive - think about
      your defense
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824783
    m_Localized: What? Oh... well, yeah. But I have nothing else. Say, can you help
      me fix this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824784
    m_Localized: Of course, armor is my business! Though, I`m afraid there is nothing
      for your size now. Perhaps only these fortified overalls and a pair of protective
      suits. Here, have a look, still better than nothing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824785
    m_Localized: Doesn`t look that great, to be honest. Are you sure there is nothing
      better?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824786
    m_Localized: Sorry. Until now, only foals were of your size in this camp. And
      don`t waste your time asking other traders - I`m the only armor dealer here.
      But don`t you worry, I expect new deliveries soon, then we will surely find
      something suitable for you. Meanwhile, ready your caps, good armor is not cheap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824787
    m_Localized: Oh, and if you damage your armor - well, you know, get into a fight
      or catch a nail - bring it to me, I`ll fix it in no time. Not for free, of
      course
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824788
    m_Localized: And if you know how to fix armor yourself, well, feel free to use
      my workbench, I won`t mind. Just don`t break or lose anything
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824789
    m_Localized: Here, as promised, a fresh delivery. There are two items of your
      size - this leather armor and this metal one. Choose which one you like best
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824790
    m_Localized: Interesting. And which one is better?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824791
    m_Localized: Each has its pros and cons. Metal protects well against bullets,
      collisions and laser weapons, but it`s pretty heavy and will slow you down.
      The leather armor is light, it will protect from fire, monsters` fangs and
      claws, but cannot really stop bullets. The choice is yours
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824792
    m_Localized: And what if I wear both? You know, leather under metal?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824793
    m_Localized: Pffft, a good one!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824794
    m_Localized: And do you have something special?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824795
    m_Localized: Special? Like what?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824796
    m_Localized: Well, something different from standard armor?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824797
    m_Localized: There is no such thing as "standard armor", all types I know have
      their own characteristics. But I understand what you mean. My old friend Wolf
      once gave me schematics to make armor from the shells of radscorpions. As you
      probably know, their chitinous shells are very strong, yet light and flexible,
      which makes them an excellent material. However I never found time to experiment
      on this, and I don`t know if I ever will. So, if you want, I can sell you a
      copy for a very reasonable price
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824798
    m_Localized: I see, you found use for my schematics. How`s the armor?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824799
    m_Localized: A bit too tight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824800
    m_Localized: It can use some fitting. Then it can serve you even better
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824801
    m_Localized: Just yesterday the caravan arrived to our town, and among other
      stuff for sale there was a whole shipment of pre-war combat armor. Your size
      too! Do you want to have a look?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824802
    m_Localized: Show me, what have you got there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824803
    m_Localized: A well-preserved sample of developments by MWT. Polymer-ceramic
      plates, fireproof fabric with kevlar lining. It is cut so that id doesn`t hinder
      your movements. Ideal for medium and short range combat conditions against
      opponents with firearms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824804
    m_Localized: And what about protection against energy weapons?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824805
    m_Localized: Well, not so great. This armor was created even before such weapons
      became widely used
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824806
    m_Localized: However, if you need protection from magical energy blasts, I can
      help you. In the warehouse I have an unsold magic armor set. It was created
      specifically to counter such weapons and copes well with the protection of
      the carrier from lasers, plasma and electricity. If you plan to visit a military
      plant or another place with a bunch of robots, this armor is the best choice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824807
    m_Localized: So, if I put on a combat armor, and on top of it - a magic one a
      couple of sizes larger, will I be protected from everything?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824808
    m_Localized: It doesn`t work like that, @lp. With time you will understand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824809
    m_Localized: Heya! Do you like blowing shit up? Well, you know - boom! Pow! Bang!
      Whatcha like more - dynamite, grenades or mines?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824810
    m_Localized: Hmm... I have no idea...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824811
    m_Localized: If you ask me, the coolest thing is the grenade launcha. Whooosh!
      Booom! All enemies into pieces! Hot stuff
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824812
    m_Localized: Though of course mines have their thing. If you wanna make enemy
      a surprise, ain`t better way t` do it. Hide a couple of these beauties in their
      path, they ain`t gonna know what hit `em
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824813
    m_Localized: Or, say, you need to loot a safe or some room full of some sweet
      booty, but it has one of them fancy-ass locks? A good bomb or a pair of dynamite
      packs will solve your problem n
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824814
    m_Localized: Wow, do explosives have so many uses? Somehow I didn`t think about
      it until now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824815
    m_Localized: You bet! Anyways, if you wanna buy some fireworks, Smoky Pit and
      his shop are at your service
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824816
    m_Localized: Hey, missy, come over, this season only - energomagical grenades.
      There`s plasma - rules against meat, and pulse - against those walkin` buckets
      of screws. Take `em while hot and fresh
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824817
    m_Localized: Are these grenades more powerful than usual ones?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824818
    m_Localized: Wha, don`t you know any shit? Its whole lotta percent more powerful!
      True, there ain`t no real rumble from em blasts, that sucks. Ain`t exciting
      at all
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824819
    m_Localized: Listen! You have so many explosives in one place, and you smoke
      all the time. Is it not dangerous?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824820
    m_Localized: ....
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824821
    m_Localized: ...........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824822
    m_Localized: Naaah.........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824823
    m_Localized: 'You`re interested in real big guns? No shit, real frickin` huge!
      Here, check it out: a multi-shot grenade launcha and a rocket launcha'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824824
    m_Localized: And here - hoofmade bombs, can turn any wall into fuckin` dust,
      any armored door, or crack a safe - made it myself!|And here - hoofmade bombs,
      can turn any wall into frickin` dust, any armored door, or crack a safe - made
      it myself!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824825
    m_Localized: What, really, any wall?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824826
    m_Localized: ....
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824827
    m_Localized: Well, when you put it like that - neigh. A half-meter steel wall
      gonna hold alright. But any other - easy-peasy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824828
    m_Localized: Whoa, damn cool armor you`ve got there! Where can I get one?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824829
    m_Localized: Guns, rifles, ammo... Come and pick some
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824830
    m_Localized: What do you sell, weapons?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824831
    m_Localized: Naturally! I am Brass Buckshot, and my family has been running this
      business for three generations
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824832
    m_Localized: I have only the best barrels, quality guaranteed, we do not keep
      any trash ... So what weapons do you prefer, firearms or magical energy ones?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824833
    m_Localized: And which one would you advise?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824834
    m_Localized: I prefer good old firearms. It is cheaper, more reliable, easier
      to maintain, and can work where magical energy won`t - like underwater. But
      the problem is that there are a lot of different calibers, and ammo from one
      gun, most likely, will not fit another. Well, what can you do
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824835
    m_Localized: Magical energy weapons, however, use standard spark-batteries, which
      are suitable for anything, and this, I must say, is very convenient. In addition,
      laser, plasma or fire can help where bullets can not. There are such creatures
      in the Wasteland, against which only flamer will work. Take slime for example
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824836
    m_Localized: Also, of course, I sell any ammunition and batteries. And if you
      want to practice, we have a specially equipped shooting range, take the door
      to the right
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824837
    m_Localized: A large arrival of new guns! Come, choose
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824838
    m_Localized: Welcome to the clinic of Doc Sepsis (it`s me, for your information).
      Wide spectrum of medical services. Treatment of wounds, contusions, fractures,
      radiation sickness and (my specialization) blood infection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824839
    m_Localized: Hi, Doc, I`m @lp. This place doesn`t look much like a clinic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824840
    m_Localized: Yet it`s the best you can find in this area. When you are shot by
      a raider, or bitten by a wild ghoul - and this sure happens sooner or later
      - you`ll have nothing else left to do but to come to me. Only then you`ll be
      able to see the real value of this place
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824841
    m_Localized: And why can`t I just use healing potions?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824842
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824843
    m_Localized: You`re not very strong in medicine, aren`t you? "Healing potions"
      as you called them are nothing more than potent reparative drugs. If you get
      a serious injury, say a fracture or a concussion, your only chance to recover
      is a good doctor with medical equipment required...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824844
    m_Localized: Repra.. what drugs?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824845
    m_Localized: Reparative, meaning regenerating. In short - your body always tries
      to recover to its normal state, curing on its own various cuts, bruises and
      so on, and reparative drugs speed up this process several times. But if you
      are injured, with which the body can not cope on its own, your potions will
      not be able to help you anymore
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824846
    m_Localized: I see you have a PipBuck? This device must have a medical module
      that monitors user`s health. Of course, you can notice a sticking bone or a
      deep cut yourself, but a working medical module is able to control all the
      processes in your body and compare them with the normal condition. That is,
      it will notice that something is wrong with you, even if you feel fine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824847
    m_Localized: Aha, It`s not even on! Just a moment...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824848
    m_Localized: 'The medical module is now available in PipBuck. [Status] tab -
      [Health]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824849
    m_Localized: All set! The service cost is a hundred caps. Just kidding, I won`t
      take money for this. But just in case, here, get acquainted with the price
      list for medical services
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824850
    m_Localized: Wow, your prices are not small
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824851
    m_Localized: They can`t be small. If you think that medications are cheap, I
      am sorry to disappoint you. Almost all the money that I receive go to the purchase
      of new medicines and equipment, I leave only a meager part to myself. And if
      my clinic goes belly up because I keep low prices, guess who lose the most
      from this
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824852
    m_Localized: However, I`m not a monster, you know. When you happen to be dying
      without any caps to pay me, you can count on a couple of treatments free of
      charge. But only for the first time. It`s not nice to profit from somepony
      else`s kindness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824853
    m_Localized: '@lp, come here, I have an offer for you. Since you are my regular
      customer, I had enough opportunities to form an idea of the peculiarities of
      your body. And the thickness of your wallet. Therefore, I consider it possible
      to offer you special services of the clinic: cybernetic implants'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824854
    m_Localized: What? But I don`t want to become a cyborg at all!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824855
    m_Localized: If you picture it as iron hooves and eyes instead of normal ones,
      then no, I`m not going to saw your leg off to attach a cyber-leg in its place.
      My implants are invisible and do not cause any loss in mobility or sensitivity
      of the client
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824856
    m_Localized: Suppose I agree. What is required of me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824857
    m_Localized: Just your money. You pay for the implant, I bring you into a state
      of general anesthesia and perform the operation. You close your eyes, and when
      you open them again, you will have the new implant and new abilities
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824858
    m_Localized: You are not going to stub me, are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824859
    m_Localized: I don`t make mistakes in my work, otherwise I wouldn`t be here.
      And specifically, I definitely will not kill a goose that lays golden eggs.
      You can calm down your paranoia. By the way, I also provide psychiatrist services,
      be my guest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824860
    m_Localized: Hi! Welcome to my humble workshop! I`m Winry, what`s your name?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824861
    m_Localized: Hi, Winry, I`m @lp. What are you doing here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824862
    m_Localized: A little bit of everything. I repair weapons, irons, toasters, dismantle
      old rubbish for spare parts. Here you can fix your equipment, buy necessary
      parts, tools, and all sorts of useful little things
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824863
    m_Localized: I also craft and sell melee weapons. Well, you know - everything
      that can cut, stab and smash, from knives to sledgehammers. Unlike firearms
      or magical energy weapons, it does not require ammunition, never jams or misfires.
      You just need to know how to use it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824864
    m_Localized: And can I make weapons myself?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824865
    m_Localized: Of course! To begin with, you will need schematics. Unless you are
      able inventing things right in your head, of course. Schematics can be bought
      from masters, and you can try your luck search in different places in the wasteland
      - in abandoned buildings, in safes, desks or bookcases. If air in the room
      was dry, and the paper is good, maybe it won`t fall apart right in your hooves.
      Sometimes I can also share some with you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824866
    m_Localized: Then, if you have all the required parts, and your hooves are in
      the right place, the weapons can be assembled on a workbench, like the one
      I have here in my workshop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824867
    m_Localized: With some training, you will be able to make stuff no worse than
      what used to be produced by pre-war factories
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824868
    m_Localized: Did you manage to fix the old AutoDoc? My respect! I wasn`t able
      to succeed with it after all
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824869
    m_Localized: And here you are, I`ve been waiting for you, @lp!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824870
    m_Localized: Of course you waited for me. How could I not come here? It was predestined!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824871
    m_Localized: Uh... And you will not ask how I know your name?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824872
    m_Localized: No, and I also know your name, Dusty Nebula. I can literally see
      it written beside you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824873
    m_Localized: Ah, I see. So you also have this gift - knowing names of other ponies
      before you speak to them. This allows us to think that you have a potential
      for magic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824874
    m_Localized: Really? But so far I failed at any spell, except for telekinesis.
      I always thought that magic is not for me...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824875
    m_Localized: On the contrary. If you want to become a magician, I can help you
      and teach you the real magic. But you must develop the magical power yourself,
      you can not master this art until you learn to draw magic from yourself. Visit
      me sometimes, I will watch changes in your potential and teach you new spells
      when you are ready
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824876
    m_Localized: What else do you offer besides spells?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824877
    m_Localized: My scope includes not only magical knowledge. If you have the proper
      patience and attentiveness, I can teach you the art of alchemy. I will give
      you lessons, supply with recipes, magic herbs and laboratory equipment. Also...
      do you like my crystal orb?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824878
    m_Localized: Oh, yes, the best orb I`ve ever seen! Does it predict the future?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824879
    m_Localized: It can do that, too. But you can use it for other purposes - to
      change your appearance. Worry not, it is just an illusion that only you can
      see. Your friends will not notice anything and will recognize you just like
      before
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824880
    m_Localized: Hello, sweety! You`re here for the first time, aren`t you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824881
    m_Localized: Hello, Mrs. That`s right, I just arrived here. My name is @lp, and
      yours?..
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824882
    m_Localized: Holly Shine. It`s so nice to see new faces in our camp! I`m sort
      of a head chef here, so if you get hungry, I`m always happy to feed you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824883
    m_Localized: Sounds great! And what do you have on the menu?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824884
    m_Localized: Everything! Pre-war canned food, vegetables and fruits from farms,
      meat, even pastries...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824885
    m_Localized: Meat!? You eat meat here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824886
    m_Localized: And why are you surprised? I thought everypony eats meat. Of course,
      it is not the most delicious dish, but when there`s no food, you`ll be ready
      to chew your own tail. Have you ever been really hungry before?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824887
    m_Localized: Ok, I got it. But you also mentioned something about farms. Do you
      have farms here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824888
    m_Localized: Here - no. But there are ponies who are keeping farms out there.
      They are few, and the lands where you can grow something are even less. Therefore,
      products from the farm are usually not cheap. But they are tastier and more
      healthy! I have oats, potatoes, cucumbers, milk and butter from farmers` brahmins,
      and grains for baking bread. Sometimes they bring something else
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824889
    m_Localized: Now, this sounds much better! When I get hungry, I`ll definitely
      buy something from your farm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824890
    m_Localized: Hey. Are you also a Steel Ranger?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824891
    m_Localized: Affirmative. Scribe Amaranth from the order of the Star Paladin
      SteelHooves. I guess you`ve already met, since you were allowed to stay here
      in our camp. Please do not touch anything here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824892
    m_Localized: Scribe - is your title? But I thought that all the Steel Rangers
      - earth ponies in power armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824893
    m_Localized: This is a misconception. Unicorns can also join the ranks of the
      Steel Rangers, but usually become scribes. Unlike knights and paladins, we
      are engaged in various non-combat activities. We take care of all economic
      and organizational problems, maintenance, scientific research and so on
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824894
    m_Localized: Accordingly, instead of power armor, we wear scribes` clothes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824895
    m_Localized: In this camp, I am personally responsible for supplying the group
      with rations, ammunition, communication with the command center, repair of
      weapons, armor and equipment. Poisoned air of Canterlot disables even the best
      power armor very quickly, so there is a lot of work. More questions?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824896
    m_Localized: Questions, questions... Can we trade?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824897
    m_Localized: It is possible. Personally, I believe that trading with the inhabitants
      of the Wasteland will benefit us all
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824898
    m_Localized: And what about power armor? Can you sell it to me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824899
    m_Localized: Negative. First, only Steel Rangers have the right to wear power
      armor. Second, every knight in the group has only his own set of armor, there
      are no extra ones. And third, the armor is not fit for unicorns anyway
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824900
    m_Localized: But I can sell you some weapons and ammunition surpluses, as well
      as fix your equipment if necessary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824901
    m_Localized: Pulse bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824902
    m_Localized: Don`t say a thing. I heard your conversation with the commander.
      You want to infiltrate the bunker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824903
    m_Localized: For your information, I do not approve it. There`s nothing for you
      to do there, it`s not good for somepony like you to kill Rangers and take away
      the technologies collected with such difficulty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824904
    m_Localized: But now they are in the hooves of our enemy, and the damage done
      to them will be to our advantage. Therefore, I will help you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824905
    m_Localized: What do I need to know about this bunker?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824906
    m_Localized: 'It is the most protected object I`ve ever seen. And it`s not even
      about its guards. You have to overcome the most powerful gates at the entrance
      to the bunker, and even if you manage to get inside, the second echelon of
      defense will be waiting: a force field that is virtually impossible to break
      through with brute force'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824907
    m_Localized: But this field has a vulnerability. It can be temporarily de-energized
      by hitting the control terminal with a powerful electromagnetic pulse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824908
    m_Localized: Like a pulse grenade?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824909
    m_Localized: Of course not. You`ll need something much more powerful - a pulse
      bomb. My own development, just for such cases. I can sell you a few, but remember
      - the force field will be only be shut down briefly and will soon recover,
      you won`t be able to get out the same way. Is it clear?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824910
    m_Localized: Yes, ma`am
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824911
    m_Localized: You call this a power armor?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824912
    m_Localized: A very valuable key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824913
    m_Localized: Hey, psst. May I have a word?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824914
    m_Localized: What do you want? You didn`t show any interest in conversation before
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824915
    m_Localized: Well, I just wasn`t sure if you could be trusted. But now I see
      that you are one of us, and therefore I can open a terrible secret to you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824916
    m_Localized: In short, I have something for you. A key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824917
    m_Localized: Key? But what does it open?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824918
    m_Localized: One of Canterlot`s cellars. I know for sure that something very
      valuable is locked there. You just have to go and get it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824919
    m_Localized: Really? And why didn`t you go and take this valuable thing yourself?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824920
    m_Localized: What do you think? My life is dear to me, you see, I haven`t yet
      lost my mind to go to Canterlot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824921
    m_Localized: And what makes you think that I`m going there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824922
    m_Localized: Oh yes, you certainly will, I wouldn`t worry about that. So let`s
      do this. I`ll sell you this key, and you will find that cellar, take everything
      valuable from it and keep it. Well, how about it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824923
    m_Localized: Nope! It`s clear as day that you are trying to trick me! Do you
      think I`ll pay for this key of yours out of curiosity?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824924
    m_Localized: Yeah
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824925
    m_Localized: Argh! No! I have no interest in what is in that cellar, and whether
      it exists at all! Do you understand??!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824926
    m_Localized: Whatever you say, your curiosity will prevail in the end. And I`ll
      be waiting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824927
    m_Localized: Test
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824928
    m_Localized: Test test test
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824929
    m_Localized: Complete part 1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824930
    m_Localized: Complete part 2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824931
    m_Localized: Complete part 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824932
    m_Localized: To exit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824933
    m_Localized: You found yourself in abandoned auxiliary tunnels, all alone and
      without any equipment, and the most important - you have no clue how you ended
      up here. Find your way back to surface, and in the meantime try to scout this
      place for some useful and valuable stuff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824934
    m_Localized: Get to the exit to surface
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824935
    m_Localized: Find all cogwheels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824936
    m_Localized: 'Cogwheels found:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824937
    m_Localized: Contact locals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824938
    m_Localized: Peaceful settlements should exist somewhere in the Equestrian Wasteland.
      They can be base camps for further operations. Find such a settlement and meet
      local ponies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824939
    m_Localized: Reach the nearest settlement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824940
    m_Localized: Gather information
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824941
    m_Localized: Chosen-24
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824942
    m_Localized: A few months earlier, the "Chosen-24" was entrusted with the same
      mission as you. But the signal from her PipBuck was lost seventy-two days ago.
      Your task is to find "Chosen-24" and find out the reasons why the contact with
      her is lost. Then proceed according to circumstances
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824943
    m_Localized: Obtain any information about the "Chosen-24"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824944
    m_Localized: Explore the camp in the sewers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824945
    m_Localized: Save "Chosen-24" from slavers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824946
    m_Localized: Find "Chosen-24"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824947
    m_Localized: Chasing the rainbow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824948
    m_Localized: Somewhere in the vicinity of your landing point there must be a
      ManeTec factory or at least what is left of it. Your main goal is the central
      maneframe, its disks must contain the information that we require. Just connect
      your PipBuck, everything else will be done by the programs installed on it.
      So far this is all the information I can share with you. Attention! Do not
      try to take off your PipBuck! The success of the mission depends on it, and
      so does your life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824949
    m_Localized: Find out the location of the ManeTec factory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824950
    m_Localized: Find and study maps of the factory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824951
    m_Localized: Get the security key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824952
    m_Localized: Enter the department of special research
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824953
    m_Localized: Connect your PipBuck to the central maneframe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824954
    m_Localized: The Quantum Cogitator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824955
    m_Localized: Your main task now is to get hold of the Quantum Cogitator. It is
      an extremely powerful yet very compact processor capable of supporting artificial
      intelligence of the highest class. The only place where it can be obtained,
      according to our information, is Stable 88, known for its developments in the
      field of computers and robots with advanced AI. The entrance to Stable is somewhere
      in the town of Falls Springs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824956
    m_Localized: Ask Daiquiri about the location of Falls Springs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824957
    m_Localized: Enter the Stable 88
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824958
    m_Localized: Find the Quantum Cogitator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824959
    m_Localized: Report to the Mentor about your success
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824960
    m_Localized: Rescue captives
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824961
    m_Localized: Raiders hold their captives in cages. Find a way to release them.
      Break cage locks or find a key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824962
    m_Localized: 'Captives rescued:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824963
    m_Localized: Meeting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824964
    m_Localized: Send the Quantum Cogitator to our trusted person through his sprite-bot.
      The meeting place is Hankey garages
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824965
    m_Localized: Come to the meeting place
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824966
    m_Localized: Give the quantum cogitator to the sprite-bot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824967
    m_Localized: Inspect the remains of the sprite-bot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824968
    m_Localized: Alicorn Amulet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824969
    m_Localized: The new main task is to get the Alicorn Amulet, which is hidden
      somewhere in the ruins of Manehattan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824970
    m_Localized: Ask Daiquiri about the road to Manehattan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824971
    m_Localized: Rise to the roof of one of the still standing skyscrapers and look
      around
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824972
    m_Localized: Get to the entrance to the M.A.S. tower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824973
    m_Localized: Meet with the leader of alicorns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824974
    m_Localized: Find the Alicorn Amulet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824975
    m_Localized: The Black Book
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824976
    m_Localized: The new main task is to get the Black Book, an artifact of zebra
      necromancers. The last known location of the Book is the main office of the
      Ministry of Image, Canterlot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824977
    m_Localized: Ask Calamity the directions to Canterlot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824978
    m_Localized: Travel to Canterlot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824979
    m_Localized: Locate the Black Book
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824980
    m_Localized: Get the Black Book
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824981
    m_Localized: Way back home
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824982
    m_Localized: Now that all the required components have been collected, you need
      to find a way to return home, to Stable Pi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824983
    m_Localized: Attempt contacting the Mentor through the communication unit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824984
    m_Localized: Find some other way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824985
    m_Localized: Deal with the Enclave threat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824986
    m_Localized: Talk to Velvet and Watcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824987
    m_Localized: Ask Watcher about the way home
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824988
    m_Localized: Return to Stable Pi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824989
    m_Localized: Steel Rangers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824990
    m_Localized: It seems that the Elder of the local Steel Rangers division conspires
      with zebras of the Legion and plans an attack on Stable Pi! You must take measures
      at once
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824991
    m_Localized: Talk to SteelHooves in his camp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824992
    m_Localized: Find out about the new armor from Oak Stalwort
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824993
    m_Localized: Enter the base of the Steel Rangers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824994
    m_Localized: Eliminate Coldsight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824995
    m_Localized: Report to SteelHooves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824996
    m_Localized: Warn citizens of "Prancing Pony" about the danger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824997
    m_Localized: Talk to Oak Stalwart
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824998
    m_Localized: Warn citizens of Covertsign about the danger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737824999
    m_Localized: Aiding the "Prancing Pony"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825000
    m_Localized: A serious talk requires serious arguments, like a couple of large
      caliber guns. Measures should be taken to ensure that the "Prancing Pony" camp
      is able to defend itself against the Steel Rangers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825001
    m_Localized: Talk with Oak about the mission
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825002
    m_Localized: Find and explore the Mane-Tech gun workshop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825003
    m_Localized: Tell Oak what you found
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825004
    m_Localized: Aiding Covertsign
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825005
    m_Localized: Covertsign has nothing to help them withstand the Legion`s might.
      Askari decided to gather a community council for discussing the situation and
      finding a solution
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825006
    m_Localized: Wait for the community council to gather
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825007
    m_Localized: Visit the community council
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825008
    m_Localized: Ask Steelhoves about the location of the regional Legion headquarters
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825009
    m_Localized: Infiltrate the regional Legion headquarters
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825010
    m_Localized: Get rid of the centurion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825011
    m_Localized: Find secret documents
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825012
    m_Localized: Tell Askari about your success
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825013
    m_Localized: Check on Velvet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825014
    m_Localized: Shadow of the Enclave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825015
    m_Localized: Find out what the Pegasus Enclave forgot on the surface, what are
      its goals and what its presence means for all of us
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825016
    m_Localized: Visit the Enclave base and try to negotiate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825017
    m_Localized: Reach the command center
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825018
    m_Localized: Interrogate the base commander
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825019
    m_Localized: The storm is coming
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825020
    m_Localized: The Mentor refused to participate in some random wars on the surface.
      But you can`t just leave your new friends in danger while hiding in a safe
      Stable. You have to go back to the Wasteland
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825021
    m_Localized: Tell Velvet about the latest events
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825022
    m_Localized: Meet SteelHooves at the water treatment plant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825023
    m_Localized: Infiltrate the Fort Rocks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825024
    m_Localized: Power off artillery guns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825025
    m_Localized: Talk to SteelHooves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825026
    m_Localized: The last battle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825027
    m_Localized: The Enclave is attacking your home, Stable Pi. Protect it at all
      costs!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825028
    m_Localized: Return to Stable Pi and find Mentor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825029
    m_Localized: Get the "Alikorn Armor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825030
    m_Localized: Stop the invasion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825031
    m_Localized: Destroy Thunderhead
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825032
    m_Localized: Survive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825033
    m_Localized: Hey!!! Where are you going???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825034
    m_Localized: What the hay is this?!!!???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825035
    m_Localized: (deadly voice) I will suck your soul!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825036
    m_Localized: Aaah!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825037
    m_Localized: This enemy can not be defeated! Run, @lp, run!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825038
    m_Localized: Make friends with a balefire phoenix
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825039
    m_Localized: The balefire phoenix, it seems, is not afraid of you and does not
      show any aggression. Rumors say, these birds are unusually intelligent and,
      with proper care, can become loyal friends. Try to make friends with one
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825040
    m_Localized: 'Offer radioactive cookies:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825041
    m_Localized: Talk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825042
    m_Localized: Balefire phoenix
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825043
    m_Localized: '*** balefire phoenix, turning its head, looks at you with one eye
      ***'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825044
    m_Localized: You know ... you are the most beautiful creature I`ve ever met in
      my life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825045
    m_Localized: '*** the balefire phoenix looks very pleased, it ruffles feathers
      on its head and turns to show you first one side, then another ***'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825046
    m_Localized: You... understand me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825047
    m_Localized: '*** balefire phoenix nods, issuing a sound, apparently in confirmation.
      Then spreads its wings and issues a series of new melodic sounds ***'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825048
    m_Localized: It`s so strange, but I feel as if I also understand you. You are
      saying you want to accompany me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825049
    m_Localized: '*** The phoenix nods again, then takes off, getting ready to follow
      you ***'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825050
    m_Localized: About companions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825051
    m_Localized: It might be dangerous, coming with me, but if you really want to
      travel together, then I won`t mind your company at all
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825052
    m_Localized: '*** the balefire phoenix soars next to you, you feel the warmth
      radiating from it. Now you don`t feel so lonely ***'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825053
    m_Localized: "[Balefire Phoenix] becomes your companion. He will follow you,
      helping in battle.\n          Balefire phoenix has fiery breath that burns
      through armor. It will attack those enemies it sees, and against which its
      weapons are effective. If it dies in battle, it will revive itself after some
      time with incomplete health.\n          [Radioactive cookies] heal it (can
      be used from inventory, like any other item), and it will also restore health
      each time you receive a dose of radiation"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825054
    m_Localized: "To summon or dismiss a phoenix, use [whistle] from your inventory.\n         
      Use the companion communication key @1 to give commands. A single tap means
      a command to move to the specified point or attack the specified enemy. Holding
      the key you give a command to return back to you"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825055
    m_Localized: Perhaps I should try this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825056
    m_Localized: '*** inhales ***'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825057
    m_Localized: Cough-cough ... Wow, what a junk! It seems, nothing happens
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825058
    m_Localized: I feel no...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825059
    m_Localized: Ow...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825060
    m_Localized: O-o-oh...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825061
    m_Localized: A-a-ah...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825062
    m_Localized: We-e-e...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825063
    m_Localized: Everything around is sort of... flat...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825064
    m_Localized: Oh, I think it`s over. Oh, no ... not just yet...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825065
    m_Localized: Now, it`s back to normal. Yeah, well, it was weird...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825066
    m_Localized: Soo... what do we have here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825067
    m_Localized: Hm....
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825068
    m_Localized: Hmmmm....
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825069
    m_Localized: Well, what can I say? This thing is definitely broken. But I have
      no idea how to fix it...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825070
    m_Localized: Yeah, in repairs I`m a complete zero. What I can, is only to break
      it down completely. I should at least read a book about it...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825071
    m_Localized: Let`s see... Yeah, this AutoDoc knew better times. Many parts clearly
      require replacement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825072
    m_Localized: What about mechanics? The motor is useless... a broken spring...
      the seals dried up. This can be glued, and that fastened with tape...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825073
    m_Localized: Electronic stuff also is a mess. The battery has expired, capacitors
      burned out, the processor should also be replaced
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825074
    m_Localized: And what`s this, a diagnostic module? The ultrasound scanner needs
      to be changed, the old one is completely dead. The guide laser doesn`t work,
      magnetic clamps are non-functional
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825075
    m_Localized: Weeell... quite some work we have here, so many things need replacement...
      It`s a miracle this device survived at all. I will make a list of necessary
      parts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825076
    m_Localized: "Parts for repairing the AutoDoc:\n\t- Wonderglue (3 pcs)\n\t- Duct
      tape (3 pcs)\n\t- Rubber band (2 pcs)\n\t- Industrial battery (1 pc)\n\t- Electric
      motor (1 pc)\n\t- Spring (2 pcs)\n\t- Capacitor (1 pc)\n\t- Multipurpose chip
      (1 pc)\n\t- Electronic elements (10 pcs)\n\t- Ultrasonic scanner (1 pc)\n\t-
      Laser pointer (1 pc)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825077
    m_Localized: We need to fix this device. Only, I do not have all the necessary
      parts, and without them I`m not likely to achieve anything. Perhaps Winry has
      something from the list?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825078
    m_Localized: Well, let`s try to fix this old wreck, shall we?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825079
    m_Localized: Like that. This goes here. This we`ll put there... tighten screws...
      glue that together. And what`s this, an extra part and two nuts? Okay, it must
      have been something unnecessary, it should work just fine without it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825080
    m_Localized: Done! Everything works. It wasn`t that difficult
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825081
    m_Localized: Fixing such a simple machine? It won`t make the slightest problem
      at all!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825082
    m_Localized: Let`s see... Hey, this thing isn`t broken at all! All it needs is
      just some loving care. A little twist here, a small push there... Now just
      turn it off and back on
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825083
    m_Localized: Aaand there you go, works just great! They should have called me
      sooner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825084
    m_Localized: Cure a sick zebra
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825085
    m_Localized: A zebra named Zira is seriously ill, and Velvet can do nothing to
      help her. Your knowledge of medicine will be very helpful
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825086
    m_Localized: Determine the diagnosis
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825087
    m_Localized: Get the vaccine from dusty fever
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825088
    m_Localized: Give vaccine to Zira
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825089
    m_Localized: Come after some time and ask Velvet about the patient
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825090
    m_Localized: Bunker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825091
    m_Localized: The storage bunker of the Steel Rangers surely contains many valuable
      things. They wanted to attack your home and plunder it, so pay them with the
      same price!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825092
    m_Localized: Talk to Amaranth about the bunker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825093
    m_Localized: Enter the bunker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825094
    m_Localized: Get to the storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825095
    m_Localized: Find armor schematics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825096
    m_Localized: You need to find schematics for the secret armor, which are hidden
      somewhere in the destroyed factory. I presume, it is hidden the office of the
      factory CEO. Or not. But where else, if not there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825097
    m_Localized: Get armor schematics from the CEO`s safe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825098
    m_Localized: Bring back the schematics and get a reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825099
    m_Localized: Schematics for a special armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825100
    m_Localized: Looking for some work? There is one for you. Have you already been
      in a ruined factory? Actually, it`s pretty dangerous there, but you can also
      get all sorts of good stuff
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825101
    m_Localized: I see. Are you interested in something specific?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825102
    m_Localized: Exactly. I`ve taken a lot of goodies out of this place myself, but
      there is one thing that I could never find. In one of the working terminals
      I found information about the factory`s secret developments. As I understood,
      it was some kind of special armor, but there was no detailed information. And
      my business requires me to know about such things
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825103
    m_Localized: And you want to get this armor?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825104
    m_Localized: Of course. Although, I doubt that you will find the armor itself,
      as I understood, they never managed to produce a working model. But I would
      be happy enough with schematics and technical documentation. You won`t find
      any use for them anyway, and I will not only pay well, but, who knows, might
      even be able to reproduce this armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825105
    m_Localized: Here, is this what you were looking for?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825106
    m_Localized: Let me see...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825107
    m_Localized: Hmm... Of course it`s hard to tell right away, but it seems that
      these are exactly the schematics that I needed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825108
    m_Localized: And you can reproduce the armor using them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825109
    m_Localized: Perhaps. First I need to study the schematics in detail, and then
      to check stocks for necessary materials or more or less suitable substitutes.
      But be sure, if I succeed, you`ll be the first to know
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825110
    m_Localized: Power armor - components required
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825111
    m_Localized: Say, do you sell power armor?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825112
    m_Localized: What?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825113
    m_Localized: What made you think I might sell power armor?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825114
    m_Localized: You`re an armorer, right? And power armor is still an armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825115
    m_Localized: You`re joking, right? If you`re going to say something to me, then
      get straight to the point
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825116
    m_Localized: Alright, I get it. That was a stupid question
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825117
    m_Localized: Hmm... yeah, it really was. Only Steel Rangers have power armor,
      and even if you understand the principles of operation of the exoskeleton devices,
      your knowledge will be useless without necessary components
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825118
    m_Localized: That is, you can get it only from Steel Rangers?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825119
    m_Localized: Hmm, if you think about it, no. Not Steel Rangers invented this
      armor, it was created even before the mega-spells. Therefore, such armor could
      be found on some abandoned military base. You can stumble upon the remains
      of a deceased patrol. You can just take it from the Steel Rangers, if you have
      enough strength. If you really need it, then there are options
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825120
    m_Localized: So, is this possible? Excellent! I`ll bring the materials
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825121
    m_Localized: I can design a power armor specially for you. You bring the components,
      I will make it, fit it to your size, if possible, and modify the helmet so
      that a unicorn can wear it. But you`ll have to pay for the work... let`s say...
      twenty thousand caps
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825122
    m_Localized: Sapper Armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825123
    m_Localized: Congratulations @lp - you`ve proved yourself to be a good partner.
      Do you remember the schematics you brought? They really contained all the information
      I needed. I figured everything out and I am going to start manufacturing new
      armor. Normally I wouldn`t do such offers, but to you, as the former owner
      of these drawings, I`m ready to provide a good discount for the set
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825124
    m_Localized: Oh, and what is this new armor?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825125
    m_Localized: In the documentation it was called "Sapper Armor". It is supposed
      to protect its owner against shock waves, flames, splinters and overpressure
      arising from the explosion of mines and shells in the immediate vicinity of
      a pony. Of course, I did not have all the required materials, and I had to
      improvise with what I had. And one cannot achieve the proper level of armor
      coverage and insulation with the equipment in my workshop... But anyway, it`s
      the best you can offer to one who likes playing with explosives
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825126
    m_Localized: Power armor - in progress
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825127
    m_Localized: So, are these fragments enough to make one working set of armor?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825128
    m_Localized: I think yes, it should be enough. Give them here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825129
    m_Localized: And how much time will it take to finish it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825130
    m_Localized: No idea! Maybe a day, maybe a week. Maybe some element will be missing,
      and you will have to find it. I`ve never done this before. Stop by from time
      to time, and I`ll let you know when it`s done
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825131
    m_Localized: And can you also equip my exoskeleton with a huge...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825132
    m_Localized: No!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825133
    m_Localized: Power armor - ready!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825134
    m_Localized: Your power armor is ready, you can pay the agreed amount and take
      it. This order is a unique work, nopony else will be fit in an armor of this
      size. Therefore, I hope that you can afford it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825135
    m_Localized: Wow! Is it just as cool as Steel Rangers`?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825136
    m_Localized: Of course not. I do not have the necessary equipment, and the parts
      you brought had many defects from the damage, so many functions had to be sacrificed.
      However, what was left there is enough to protect the owner from any attacks.
      I painted it in a defiantly orange color, which will make it clear to your
      enemies that it is they who must hide because you are not going to. They will
      soon learn to avoid it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825137
    m_Localized: Power armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825138
    m_Localized: If you want to get a power armor specially created for you, get
      at least a few fragments of it. I do not care how you get them, but the electronic
      components must be in working condition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825139
    m_Localized: Get fragments of power armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825140
    m_Localized: Give Oak Stalwart the materials for the armor and wait for the completion
      of the work
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825141
    m_Localized: Kill Mad Fox
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825142
    m_Localized: Have you heard about the Mad Fox gang? They say their lair is somewhere
      in the old factory. Whoever finds and finishes these degenerates off, would
      deserve my eternal gratitude
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825143
    m_Localized: Kill Mad Fox
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825144
    m_Localized: Get a reward from Oak Stalwart
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825145
    m_Localized: Get the paint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825146
    m_Localized: I`m looking for sprays with paint of different colors. For a start,
      the common ones will do
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825147
    m_Localized: Red
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825148
    m_Localized: Green
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825149
    m_Localized: Blue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825150
    m_Localized: Yellow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825151
    m_Localized: White
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825152
    m_Localized: Bring back all the paint and get a reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825153
    m_Localized: Get the paint - 2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825154
    m_Localized: Again I`m looking for paint sprays, but now I require more rare
      colors
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825155
    m_Localized: Grey
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825156
    m_Localized: Purple
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825157
    m_Localized: Orange
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825158
    m_Localized: Brown
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825159
    m_Localized: Light blue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825160
    m_Localized: Khaki
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825161
    m_Localized: Dark green
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825162
    m_Localized: Bring back all the paint and get a reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825163
    m_Localized: Get the paint - 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825164
    m_Localized: Another hunt for paint. I need special colors, see the list attached.
      As usual - you bright paint, I pay caps, but this time the reward is bigger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825165
    m_Localized: Cyan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825166
    m_Localized: Pink
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825167
    m_Localized: Burgundy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825168
    m_Localized: Crimson
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825169
    m_Localized: Lime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825170
    m_Localized: Fiery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825171
    m_Localized: Beige
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825172
    m_Localized: Bring back all the paint and get a reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825173
    m_Localized: Amateur artist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825174
    m_Localized: Why did you need all that paint anyway?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825175
    m_Localized: Why do you care?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825176
    m_Localized: Because it is just sooo interesting!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825177
    m_Localized: I learn painting. You can call this my hobby. If you want to - here,
      take the key to the back room and have a look, just do not touch anything
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825178
    m_Localized: And how is it going?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825179
    m_Localized: Could be better. But it`s hard to learn from experience, and there
      are no manuals for artists even in Nebula`s library
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825180
    m_Localized: Perhaps I could try to find you something useful?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825181
    m_Localized: You`re funny, @lp, have anypony told you? You can`t just find everything
      that everypony needs among some old ruins. No, thank you, I`m good
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825182
    m_Localized: Destroy bloatsprites` lair
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825183
    m_Localized: Bloatsprites, that inhabit the ruins of the factory, recently started
      multiplying out of control. It`s time to end this! I`ll pay to anypony who
      finds a lair of bloatsprites and burns it once and for all
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825184
    m_Localized: Find a lair of bloatsprites
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825185
    m_Localized: Destroy the nests
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825186
    m_Localized: Get a reward from Brass Buckshot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825187
    m_Localized: Find a new focusing crystal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825188
    m_Localized: A focusing crystal in my favorite plasma gun has cracked. I need
      a new one, the largest and purest of course. But if somepony tries to slip
      me a piece of glass again, prepare to get some shot in a rump
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825189
    m_Localized: Find a focusing crystal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825190
    m_Localized: Bring Brass the crystal and get a reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825191
    m_Localized: Return the pistol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825192
    m_Localized: If somepony finds my lost gun, please bring it back. Reward guaranteed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825193
    m_Localized: Find the pistol named "Loyalty"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825194
    m_Localized: Return the pistol to its owner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825195
    m_Localized: Star blaster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825196
    m_Localized: Have you ever heard a story about a weapon that fell from the stars?
      Let them tell that this is just fairy tales! Maybe this weapon never actually
      fell from nowhere, but it definitely exists, and I have a proof - the ammunition
      that I found in the ruins of Manehattan. They do not fit any known model of
      weapons created by ponies or zebras, and I know this sort of things
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825197
    m_Localized: Find a Star blaster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825198
    m_Localized: Show Brass Buckshot the Star blaster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825199
    m_Localized: Valuable gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825200
    m_Localized: How did you lose your gun?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825201
    m_Localized: 'It`s not so simple. In fact, it`s not just about a gun:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825202
    m_Localized: The last time I was on business in Manehattan, I was out of luck.
      Got caught by the slavers. So they put shackles on me and put in cage with
      other slaves. Well, of course they took everything, including the gun. A great
      pistol, by the way, but what`s more important, this pistol was a family relic.
      Got it from my father
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825203
    m_Localized: But it`s hard to take me down with bare hooves, and I managed to
      escape. Although, of course, I was very lucky then. But all my stuff remained
      with them, I didn`t have time to take it back...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825204
    m_Localized: Since then those slavers are long gone for sure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825205
    m_Localized: Oh no, they aren`t. I would not worry so much about them even because
      of the family gun. When I was sitting in a cage, I heard a lot of their babbling.
      The place where they took me serves as a transit camp, and they have already
      been sitting there for several years. And it is guarded by the same group.
      Slave traders use this base to raid nearby settlements and even trade routes.
      If you destroy this camp, it will undermine their work for weeks, if not months
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825206
    m_Localized: Anything else you can tell me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825207
    m_Localized: Their chief`s name - Chopper. Surely he took my gun. When you kill
      him - scrape his pockets, perhaps my gun is still with him. You do not sell
      such rare stuff
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825208
    m_Localized: The gun returned
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825209
    m_Localized: Here, is this your gun?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825210
    m_Localized: Yes, it sure is! Didn`t think I would see it again. Have you met
      Chopper then?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825211
    m_Localized: Yep. We met and had a little chat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825212
    m_Localized: And how is he doing?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825213
    m_Localized: I am afraid he`s not feeling well lately
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825214
    m_Localized: Suits him right! Listen, it would be unfair if I took such a fine
      weapon as "Loyalty" from you without giving something equal in return. Take
      this one, it is no worse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825215
    m_Localized: The Star blaster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825216
    m_Localized: Guess what I`ve got! This is the weapon you were so eager to see
      - the Star blaster!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825217
    m_Localized: Oh, my mare mother! Is it really the Gun? Yes, it definitely is,
      those energy cells that I have are made using the same technology
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825218
    m_Localized: And so, it works? Did you try it in action?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825219
    m_Localized: I sure did! I`ve never seen a weapon more powerful. It is somewhat
      similar to an ordinary laser pistol, but 10 times cooler!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825220
    m_Localized: Only there is a problem with ammunition. Conventional batteries
      do not fit. Listen, you said you have energy cells for it? Can I buy them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825221
    m_Localized: Well, just take them for free, I don`t need them anyway. And just
      one look at such a miracle was worth it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825222
    m_Localized: Thank you very much, I will find them a good use. And do you think
      this blaster really fell from the stars?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825223
    m_Localized: Don`t know. Perhaps this was a secret project from the past, or
      maybe pegasi lost it? Who knows what they are doing there behind the clouds.
      But if they have such weapons... we might have a big problem. We shall see
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825224
    m_Localized: Kill Lucerne
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825225
    m_Localized: Many of you probably remember a pony named Lucerne. Once she was
      a good, decent ghoul, but now, it seems, the process of decay finally reached
      her brain, and she turned into a feral. They say she was seen in the sewers,
      in a place called "Pit", in the company of a whole herd of other ferals. It
      would be nice if somepony decided to end her time on earth - in present state
      she poses a considerable danger for all of us
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825226
    m_Localized: Kill Lucerne
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825227
    m_Localized: Get a reward from Brass Buckshot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825228
    m_Localized: Help with dynamite production
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825229
    m_Localized: I gonna start producing dynamite. Folks, share if you have, or help
      me get the components
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825230
    m_Localized: Find or prepare some more acid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825231
    m_Localized: Find a canister of glycerine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825232
    m_Localized: Give components to Smoky Pit and get a reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825233
    m_Localized: Destroy the ant nests
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825234
    m_Localized: I gonna say it again - those ants will soon become a pain in the
      ass for all of us. If you don`t give a shit, I myself gonna pay to anypony
      who finds and blows up all the fucking ant nests. You can get the dynamite
      from me|I gonna say it again - those ants will soon become a pain in the neck
      for all of us. If you don`t care, I myself gonna pay to anypony who finds and
      blows up all the fricking ant nests. You can get dynamite from me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825235
    m_Localized: Nests destroyed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825236
    m_Localized: Get a reward from Smoky Pit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825237
    m_Localized: Ants problem
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825238
    m_Localized: In short, here`s a deal... Ants, huge like dogs, appeared at the
      factory. And the bitches are up to something, you see, they wanna dig a passage
      right here|In short, here`s a deal... Ants, huge like dogs, appeared at the
      factory. And the bastards are up to something, you see, they wanna dig a passage
      right here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825239
    m_Localized: Are you afraid of ants?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825240
    m_Localized: You don`t know whatcha talking about, I give no shit for the common
      ants. But folks say, there are also those who spit fire, for reals! And here
      I have... Well, you`ve probably got the idea. Fire is not welcome here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825241
    m_Localized: And you have boxes full of explosives here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825242
    m_Localized: That`s what I`m talking. If everything here blows to hell - believe
      me, nopony gonna like that firework
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825243
    m_Localized: And what can be done about those ants?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825244
    m_Localized: Well, whatcha think? Find their fucking nests and blow the hell
      out of them. Here, take some dynamite...|Well, whatcha think? Find their fricking
      nests and blow the hell out of them. Here, take some dynamite...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825245
    m_Localized: And you can count on my part of a deal, though mind me, it`s in
      your best interest too
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825246
    m_Localized: Cryotechnology
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825247
    m_Localized: A new type of explosives, coming soon! For reals! There is a tiny-winy
      thing left, just get them materials, get it together and test it in battle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825248
    m_Localized: Obtain cryo-cells from the laboratory in an abandoned stable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825249
    m_Localized: Create a cryogrenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825250
    m_Localized: Create a cryomine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825251
    m_Localized: Destroy enemies with a cryogrenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825252
    m_Localized: Destroy enemies with a cryomine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825253
    m_Localized: Report to Smoky Pit about test results
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825254
    m_Localized: New kind of explosives
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825255
    m_Localized: '@lp! Let`s have a little chat. Listen, are you any good at making
      them explosives?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825256
    m_Localized: Not too shabby. Why?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825257
    m_Localized: I`ve got a little idea - I wanna create an absolutely new type of
      grenades. How about that? Wanna take part in field trials?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825258
    m_Localized: Sounds interesting. Go on!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825259
    m_Localized: These grenades ain`t gonna blow up or set your enemies on fire,
      but freeze `em. Imagine! I have already made the drawings, and not just for
      grenades, mines too. There is just one prob
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825260
    m_Localized: 'To make the freezing blast, you need such things - cryo-cells.
      Guess what: I do not have them, and I don`t feel like looking for them at the
      moment. So you`ll have to move your rump'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825261
    m_Localized: As usual... And where can they be obtained?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825262
    m_Localized: These things are quite rare. Usually they can be dug out from old
      laboratories. I reckon, they sure are lying around somewhere in the stable.
      Here, take the schemes. Try making both a grenade and a mine, and then test
      them on somepony. I`m expecting results
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825263
    m_Localized: Cryo-explosives
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825264
    m_Localized: About that idea of yours on freezing explosives... The tests went
      successful, both grenades and mines explode as expected. All those getting
      into the explosion area instantly get covered in ice, and that doesn`t look
      very pleasant. And those that get deadly damage just crumble into pieces
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825265
    m_Localized: Awesome! I bet my customers gonna like it. Excellent job, @lp. Here,
      I`ve got a couple of radio mines. A real hot stuff, no shit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825266
    m_Localized: Find schematics of a doomsday grenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825267
    m_Localized: How about a little fair trade? For anypony who snatches me schematics
      of the doomsday grenade, that`s made from Sparkle-cola, I will give drawings
      of my own creation - even more demolishing mine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825268
    m_Localized: Find schematics for the sparkle-grenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825269
    m_Localized: Share a copy of the schematics with Smoky Pit and get rewarded
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825270
    m_Localized: Smoking accessories
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825271
    m_Localized: I`m fed up smoking these crap cigarettes. Who brings me some cooler
      smokes, gets a bunch of caps
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825272
    m_Localized: Joint of magic weed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825273
    m_Localized: Leaf tobacco
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825274
    m_Localized: Bong
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825275
    m_Localized: Smoking pipe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825276
    m_Localized: Smuggled cigars
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825277
    m_Localized: Fix AutoDoc
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825278
    m_Localized: Looks like the AutoDoc finally went to meet its maker. Fix it already,
      somepony! It`s in your best interests, you know!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825279
    m_Localized: Repair the AutoDoc
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825280
    m_Localized: Report to Doc Sepsis and get a reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825281
    m_Localized: Broken AutoDoc
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825282
    m_Localized: Hey, Doc! And what about this strange robot standing in the corner?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825283
    m_Localized: This is the AutoDoc - a pre-war, fully automated medical station.
      It is equipped with a diagnostic module and a full spectrum of surgical instruments.
      In fact, it can cure you of many diseases and injuries all by itself, no doctor
      participation is required
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825284
    m_Localized: But, by the looks of it, now it doesn`t work?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825285
    m_Localized: Correct. It used to be glitching even before - it`s a very old one
      really. And a year ago it broke down completely. Winry does not know how to
      fix such equipment, and in repairs she is better than nopony else among us.
      I tried asking some travelling merchants, but you can figure the result. Since
      then it`s just standing there collecting dust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825286
    m_Localized: Perhaps you understand mechanics better than medicine?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825287
    m_Localized: I can try... but what will I get if I fix it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825288
    m_Localized: I`ll let you use AutoDoc for free. In working condition, it is able
      to compete even with my skills, no matter how much I would like to say otherwise,
      so you will not regret it. The only thing - this device uses the so-called
      biogel for operations
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825289
    m_Localized: What`s biogel?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825290
    m_Localized: It is a complex biochemical composition that accelerates tissue
      regeneration. AutoDoc uses it to heal wounds and close cuts after surgery without
      stitching, and synthesize stimulating biomass, which in its characteristics
      corresponds to healing potions. Without it, an AutoDoc could only cut your
      stomach open and leave it like that. I have some biogel left, and I`ll give
      it to you if you bring the AutoDoc back life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825291
    m_Localized: Ok, I`ll see what can be done
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825292
    m_Localized: AutoDoc works again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825293
    m_Localized: Job`s done, Doc. Your assistant is back in service, works as good
      as new
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825294
    m_Localized: I already know that. How should I explain... Let`s just say that
      all the time that you were tinkering with the machine, I was in the same room
      sitting next to you. At a distance of half a meter. Do you understand what
      I`m getting at?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825295
    m_Localized: But thank you for the job well done. Patching up the AutoDoc is
      a very significant contribution to the functioning of my clinic. As promised,
      from now on you have every right to use the AutoDoc absolutely free of charge
      and not even pay for electricity consumption. In addition, here are all 5 liters
      of biogel that I have left. If you need more, you can try to search it among
      the ruins of pre-war clinics or pharmaceutical factories, other sources of
      biogel still do not exist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825296
    m_Localized: And what about a little discount for medical services?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825297
    m_Localized: Well, no, it was not a part of our agreement. I have one price for
      all, and there can be no other way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825298
    m_Localized: Then at least a fraction of biogel that you receive?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825299
    m_Localized: I can`t tell now if I`ll ever have any biogel at all. And if I have,
      then I need to save some for my customers, right? And I won`t be getting it
      for free, so no. Maximum - I`ll sell you some, but don`t really count on that
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825300
    m_Localized: Collect 20 portions of fish oil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825301
    m_Localized: I read in the old scientific journal about the benefits of fish
      oil, and I am willing to test this theory. The problem is that the nearest
      river is hundreds of miles away. Therefore, I`m ready to buy oil at a triple
      cost. But those who will try selling me melted radpig fat instead of fish oil,
      will become test subjects for verification of those potions without labels
      that were found in the factory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825302
    m_Localized: Collect fish oil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825303
    m_Localized: Bring fish oil and get a reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825304
    m_Localized: Find a working medical talisman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825305
    m_Localized: Will buy an intact medical talisman. I understand that the item
      is valuable and rare and promise a corresponding reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825306
    m_Localized: Find a medical talisman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825307
    m_Localized: Bring Doc the talisman and get a reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825308
    m_Localized: Obtain recipes for potent drugs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825309
    m_Localized: 'I offer a monetary reward to those ponies that can share the recipes
      for Party-Time Mint-als, Stampede and Ultra-Dash. Special information for those
      who like jokes about drug trafficking doctors: Doc Sepsis Clinic does not offer
      discounts to patients whose injuries were acquired during a conflict with the
      owner of the clinic'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825310
    m_Localized: Find a recipe of Ultra-Dash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825311
    m_Localized: Find a recipe of Stampede
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825312
    m_Localized: Find a recipe of Party-Time Mint-als
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825313
    m_Localized: Give copies of the recipes to Doc and get a reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825314
    m_Localized: Find tools
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825315
    m_Localized: 'I am buying rare tools. I require: calipers, a hydraulic bolt cutter
      and an oscilloscope. I`ll pay well for each'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825316
    m_Localized: Bring calipers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825317
    m_Localized: Bring a hydraulic bolt cutter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825318
    m_Localized: Bring an oscilloscope
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825319
    m_Localized: About tools
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825320
    m_Localized: Quite a lot of instruments you have here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825321
    m_Localized: Naturally, this Is a workshop. But in reality, I lack many of the
      most needed tools
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825322
    m_Localized: Which ones exactly? Perhaps I will be able to find them somewhere?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825323
    m_Localized: 'If you find them, I`ll give you a nice reward. But don`t think
      that the tools I need can be found in any closet. These are not just some screwdrivers.
      Now listen:

      First, I need calipers'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825324
    m_Localized: Is it a tool for accurate size measurement?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825325
    m_Localized: Exactly. Using it you can precisely determine, for example, a diameter
      of a bolt or a nut. Try looking in an abandoned factory, I`m sure that there
      these tools were widely used there. But so far no one has ever found this for
      me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825326
    m_Localized: Second, I need a hydraulic bolt cutter. It is a tool that can easily
      cut, well, a thick metal rod for example
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825327
    m_Localized: Must be a useful thing. Where can I find it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825328
    m_Localized: Well, it could be found in the factory, probably. But there is one
      more option. Many years ago this workshop belonged to another mechanic. I know
      for sure that he had a hydraulic bolt cutter. Once he took it and went to the
      old sewers, no idea why, maybe he wanted to open some kind of grate. In any
      case, he never returned from there
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825329
    m_Localized: I can`t promise anything, somehow I don`t feel like repeating his
      sacrifice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825330
    m_Localized: I understand, never had such a desire myself. Finally, I need an
      oscilloscope. Well, you know, an instrument for measuring various parameters
      of an electrical signal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825331
    m_Localized: Yes, we had one in our stable. If I come across a working one, I
      bring it to you at once
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825332
    m_Localized: If you find something, bring it right away. Of course, I will pay
      well for every instrument you find
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825333
    m_Localized: Looking for mole rat fat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825334
    m_Localized: I am buying mole rat fat at a good price to be used as a lubricant
      for mechanisms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825335
    m_Localized: Bring the obtained fat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825336
    m_Localized: '"Cyberpony" Magazine'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825337
    m_Localized: I`m looking for pre-war magazines "Cyberpony". They are very rare,
      they only came out during a single year and in small batches. I`ll pay for
      each, but anypony who brings all twelve numbers will receive a special reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825338
    m_Localized: Bring found magazines
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825339
    m_Localized: Collect old electronic devices
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825340
    m_Localized: Attention to those engaged in scavenging all sorts of ruins and
      junkyards! I need old electrical devices that can be dismantled for spare parts.
      Slightly broken ones will do, but no complete garbage please
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825341
    m_Localized: Fans
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825342
    m_Localized: Desktop lamps
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825343
    m_Localized: Coffee machines
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825344
    m_Localized: Bring all obtained stuff to Winry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825345
    m_Localized: Screws and nuts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825346
    m_Localized: Tired of digging out rusty bolts and nuts from old fans, I`m willing
      to buy new ones. But don`t even think of bringing them one by one, I need a
      whole box. This stuff, in theory, can be found somewhere in the old factory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825347
    m_Localized: Find a box of new screws
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825348
    m_Localized: Find a box of new nuts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825349
    m_Localized: Bring everything to Winry and get a reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825350
    m_Localized: Value of information
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825351
    m_Localized: I am looking for technical documentation on equidroids. For one
      who will be brave enough to sneak into the data storage room of the abandoned
      stable - the reward will be worth an effort
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825352
    m_Localized: Find the data room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825353
    m_Localized: Find the password database
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825354
    m_Localized: Construct the hacker`s module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825355
    m_Localized: Hack the main server and download data on equidroids
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825356
    m_Localized: Bring the data disc to Winry and get a reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825357
    m_Localized: Fascination with robots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825358
    m_Localized: Tell me, @lp, how good are you at hacking terminals?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825359
    m_Localized: I`m pretty good at this, why?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825360
    m_Localized: You see, I`m somewhat interested in everything connected with robots.
      I`m especially curious about equidroids. Heard about them? They are robots
      that look like real ponies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825361
    m_Localized: Go on
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825362
    m_Localized: They usually behave somewhat aggressively, but it`s not their fault.
      And initially they were not like that. Do you know that originally their software
      simulated pony personality?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825363
    m_Localized: No, I didn`t. Is it true?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2737825364
    m_Localized: Yes. They are extremely rare today, but before the war there were
      a few places where they were used especially often. And I heard that you planned
      to enter one Stable near our camp, which, according to rumors, is full of various
      robots. Perhaps you will meet equidroids there as well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018048
    m_Localized: And could it be that those robots went bananas and killed all the
      inhabitants?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018049
    m_Localized: This is quite possible, but there is nopony left to tell the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018050
    m_Localized: In any case, I want to learn more about them. Whatever they might
      say, this is a real miracle of technology. If only we could learn how to reprogram
      them...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018051
    m_Localized: Is it really possible? And what is required of me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018052
    m_Localized: Technical documentation for equidroids and any general information
      about them. I think, if the Stable 88 was involved in their development, they
      must have kept it in their data storage. Of course, there must be information
      security systems, that`s why I asked you about your hacking skills
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018053
    m_Localized: Well, I will certainly try... But I can`t promise anything. There
      is a chance that I won`t be able to crack it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018054
    m_Localized: I have something that can help you. These are schematics for the
      PipBuck module, which can assist with hacking. Here you are! I believe you
      will have no problem with construction of this device
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018055
    m_Localized: Wow, this is cool! Thank you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018056
    m_Localized: Keep your "thank you", I expect the documentation for the robots!
      Good luck out there, @lp. Stay away from trouble
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018057
    m_Localized: Documentation for equidroids
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018058
    m_Localized: Here, take the disc. There`s everything that was possible to find
      out about the construction of equidroids
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018059
    m_Localized: Thank you so much! Was it difficult to get it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018060
    m_Localized: I`ve done more difficult tasks. What are you going to do with this
      data?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018061
    m_Localized: I will study it carefully, of course. And then I`ll figure out how
      to put it to good use. Sorry, but let`s talk later, I just can wait no longer
      to see what`s there!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018062
    m_Localized: Collect precious stones
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018063
    m_Localized: I am looking for especially rare precious stones. They are larger
      than usual and have pronounced magical properties. I will pay you generously.
      And I need ordinary ones as well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018064
    m_Localized: Get emeralds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018065
    m_Localized: Get sapphires
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018066
    m_Localized: Get rubies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018067
    m_Localized: Find a rare marine emerald
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018068
    m_Localized: Find a rare ice sapphire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018069
    m_Localized: Find a rare fire ruby
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018070
    m_Localized: Bring all the stones to Dusty Nebula and get a reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018071
    m_Localized: Library
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018072
    m_Localized: I am buying intact pre-war books for the best price. Any will do,
      providing they can be read. Who brings the most, receives a special reward.
      Reading is magic, yay!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018073
    m_Localized: Bring pre-war books
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018074
    m_Localized: Find all five volumes of the "Celestial Mechanics"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018075
    m_Localized: Talk to Dusty about the reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018076
    m_Localized: Library
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018077
    m_Localized: I see you have a whole library here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018078
    m_Localized: I wish I had... Several shelves with books, that is all. Nowadays
      the books are not published - there is nopony to do it. Ponies almost lost
      interest completely in anything that does not help them survive here and now.
      And almost all pre-war ones are either burned, or rotted from dampness, or
      simply fell apart from time and lack of care. Our time is not kind to knowledge,
      @lp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018079
    m_Localized: But sometimes you can come across almost intact ones. And I consider
      it my duty to preserve them. Let us have a deal - if you find undamaged pre-war
      books somewhere, bring them to me. I will pay you more for them than you can
      get from anypony else
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018080
    m_Localized: Agreed! I`ll search through every bookcase and desk that I find.
      Maybe you are interested in something in particular?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018081
    m_Localized: Actually, yes. I have long desired to read "Celestial Mechanics"
      in five volumes. These are wonderful books, Scarlett Shine herself wrote everything
      she knew about the movement of celestial bodies! You can only imagine of what
      value they were before the war, and now..! However all I know is only rumors
      and references I found in other books. If you find them, for each volume you
      will get a special price
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018082
    m_Localized: And also, I have one rare book that you will surely find interesting.
      Two copies, actually. I will give one to a pony who makes the greatest contribution
      to the expansion of my library. Of course, this pony might be you! Is it not
      wonderful?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018083
    m_Localized: Your contribution to the creation of the library is invaluable,
      @lp. As promised, here is your special prize. I hope you will find it useful
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018084
    m_Localized: Collect Potion Ingredients
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018085
    m_Localized: I am looking for ingredients for one peculiar potion. Who helps
      with collecting them, gets its recipe in reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018086
    m_Localized: Collect magic dust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018087
    m_Localized: Find fiery crystals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018088
    m_Localized: Give Dusty the ingredients and get the recipe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018089
    m_Localized: About apples
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018090
    m_Localized: What do you know about apples, @lp?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018091
    m_Localized: Apples? Hmm... apart from that I ate them almost all my life?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018092
    m_Localized: 'You mean apples grown under the ground? Forget about those pathetic
      excuses for apples! Those have neither taste nor odor, just a name. I`m talking
      about real apples grown on fresh air, under the real sun. Do you know that
      ponies used to make almost everything from them before? Everything you can
      possibly imagine: apple cider, apple wine, apple whiskey, apple vodka, apple
      liqueur, apple bitters...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018093
    m_Localized: Wait, hold on... are you talking about alcoholic drinks made from
      apples? Which happen to be your merchandise?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018094
    m_Localized: Well, I am a barpony after all. What else should I talk about, apple
      pies? Listen, I collect rare pre-war drinks from apples, and I`m ready to pay
      a good price for them. Bring me everything you find, but don`t even think about
      drinking it yourself! You are unlikely capable to appreciate their taste and
      bouquet anyway
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018095
    m_Localized: Big deal... I`m capable of more than you think!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018096
    m_Localized: Rare alcohol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018097
    m_Localized: I`m buying rare pre-war alcohol made from apples. I am interested
      in the very elite drinks, leave cheap hooch for yourself
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018098
    m_Localized: Apple cider "Old farm"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018099
    m_Localized: Apple wine "Pink sunset"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018100
    m_Localized: Apple liquor "Summer flavors"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018101
    m_Localized: Apple Whiskey "Wild Pegasus"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018102
    m_Localized: Apple vodka "Crystal"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018103
    m_Localized: Granny Smith`s Apple bitter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018104
    m_Localized: Apple balsam "The gift of nature"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018105
    m_Localized: Hydroponics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018106
    m_Localized: I need data on hydroponic farms from the Canterlot Stable-Tec office
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018107
    m_Localized: Locate the Canterlot Stable-Tec office
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018108
    m_Localized: Download data on hydroponic farms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018109
    m_Localized: Give the data to scribe Amaranth and receive the reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018110
    m_Localized: Canterlot Alchemy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018111
    m_Localized: I need help collect rare alchemical ingredients that can be obtained
      only from Canterlot monsters. This is a very dangerous work, but I`ll give
      the Elixir of intuition recipe in reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018112
    m_Localized: Pink slime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018113
    m_Localized: Dark soul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018114
    m_Localized: Horn of the Witch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018115
    m_Localized: Bring everything Zambezi and get a reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018116
    m_Localized: Water talisman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018117
    m_Localized: Covertsign lacks a source of clean water. The water talisman could
      solve the problem, but these components are very rare and valuable. We know
      for certain that one talisman can be found in Canterlot, but it seems that
      alicorns made themselves a lair there. Anypony who dares to get a water talisman
      will do the whole settlement an invaluable favor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018118
    m_Localized: Get the water talisman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018119
    m_Localized: Give Zambezi the water talisman and get a reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018120
    m_Localized: Data on the stealth-buck M2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018121
    m_Localized: The main Ministry of Image office, which in the past developed a
      stealth-buck, possibly still stores some data on a prototype of the stealth-buck
      M2 (the second model is much more advanced than the first one). I`ll pay you
      well for any information found
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018122
    m_Localized: Retrieve data about the stealth-buck M2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018123
    m_Localized: Motivators RX-47
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018124
    m_Localized: We really need spare parts for robots, namely the motivators RX-47.
      They can be obtained from any robot of the "Guardian" class
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018125
    m_Localized: Collect motivators
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018126
    m_Localized: Balefire-battery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018127
    m_Localized: Since we are now at war with Neighara Rangers, we need a powerful
      source of energy to properly equip our base. One of the balefire-batteries,
      collecting dust somewhere in a Bunker storage, will do
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018128
    m_Localized: Get the balefire-battery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018129
    m_Localized: Exchange the balefire-battery for a reward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018130
    m_Localized: Technologies of the future
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018131
    m_Localized: If any faction owns technologies more advanced than those of Steel
      Rangers, then this undoubtedly is the Pegasus Enclave. Samples of such technology
      will be generously paid for
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018132
    m_Localized: Magnetic resonance horsgregator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018133
    m_Localized: Ultra-quadruponificator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018134
    m_Localized: Baryon neighralyzer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018135
    m_Localized: Superluminescent quasistabilitron
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018136
    m_Localized: Hyperbeam twilifuser
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018137
    m_Localized: Enclave armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018138
    m_Localized: The Enclave`s power armor is an impressive example of modern technology.
      I would like to get at least one intact sample
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018139
    m_Localized: Find Intact Enclave Power Armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018140
    m_Localized: Bring armor to Amaranth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018141
    m_Localized: Technologies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018142
    m_Localized: May I ask? Steel Rangers see their mission in collecting and preserving
      pre-war technologies, did I understand correctly?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018143
    m_Localized: That`s correct
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018144
    m_Localized: And how do you do it exactly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018145
    m_Localized: We periodically send search parties to ruins of old cities, and
      we also pay to stalkers, traders and scavengers if they bring us valuable items
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018146
    m_Localized: And what are you doing with these items?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018147
    m_Localized: We study them, assign inventory numbers and send to a warehouse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018148
    m_Localized: What, that`s all? You don`t even use them? Never try to reproduce
      them and put them to use? Honestly, I still cannot understand this. Are there
      not enough ponies in the Wastelands that could benefit from these technologies?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018149
    m_Localized: Do not think that you are the first one who asks this question,
      @lp. There are many among the Steel Rangers who would support your point of
      view. However, the majority believes that sharing technology with the "savages"
      is not only not advisable, but even dangerous for everypony. Allegedly, we
      should take care of future generations, preserve technology for them instead
      of trying to save the doomed world around us
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018150
    m_Localized: Do not rush to be indignant. I know how cynical this sounds... but
      no pony cares for my opinion, and even less for yours
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018151
    m_Localized: Hmm... okay. You say that you pay for valuable pieces of technology.
      Is there anything you would especially like to receive?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018152
    m_Localized: Yes ma`am. Enclave Power Armor. Have you ever seen it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018153
    m_Localized: No. I don`t know anything about this Enclave. Who are they?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018154
    m_Localized: The Enclave is a military organization of pegasi. We do not have
      contact with them and know little about them. We only know that they own many
      pre-war and post-war technologies, perhaps the most advanced in the world.
      And their troopers, like our knights, use power armor. But we never managed
      to get a single intact sample
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018155
    m_Localized: If I find one, I will definitely show it to you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018156
    m_Localized: Good. Although I can`t imagine how you will manage that. Remember,
      I need an intact sample, without bullet holes in it, so do not even try to
      bring me an armor taken from the corpse of the Enclave soldier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018157
    m_Localized: Also... a free advice to our ally...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018158
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018159
    m_Localized: The Enclave is a formidable enemy. Do not cross its path unless
      it`s absolutely necessary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018160
    m_Localized: Enclave armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018161
    m_Localized: Look what I have. Enclave Power Armor. Brand new, not a scratch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018162
    m_Localized: Wow, that really is...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018163
    m_Localized: Khm... I mean...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018164
    m_Localized: Affirmative. This is the power armor of the Enclave, although only
      in its basic, the simplest configuration. No protection for wings, no scorpion
      sting, and no advanced spell matrix
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018165
    m_Localized: But still, admit it, you are impressed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018166
    m_Localized: A little surprised. Where did you manage to get it, in the locker
      room of the Enclave? However, I don`t care. I am authorized to give you a reward.
      How much do you want for this sample?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018167
    m_Localized: Sorry, but I could use this armor myself. I am not selling it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018168
    m_Localized: Don`t be silly, this is a pegasus armor! You can`t even wear a helmet
      because of your horn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018169
    m_Localized: Oh, I`m sure armor can be modified. I don`t think it should be that
      difficult. Let`s make a deal - I will give it to you for a while, for studies.
      And you tailor it to my needs. Agreed?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018170
    m_Localized: Alright. As a matter of fact, I don`t think that such armor will
      suit any of our knights or even initiates, it`s too flimsy for them, and sending
      it to the warehouse wouldn`t be much use. Studying it will be enough for me.
      Come back a little later, everything will be done
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018171
    m_Localized: Enclave armor ready
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018172
    m_Localized: Well, what about my armor?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018173
    m_Localized: I managed to study it in detail. Very interesting technology. The
      armor is much lighter than ours, very flexible and doesn`t restrict movements
      that much. But because of this it is also much less durable. In fact, it is
      hardly capable of protecting against a rifle bullet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018174
    m_Localized: "This armor is clearly designed to protect against magical energy
      exposure. And I must admit, it is really good. The spell matrix is \u200B\u200Bvery
      complex with many levels of protection..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018175
    m_Localized: Yeah, yeah... So what about the modification?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018176
    m_Localized: I had to drill a hole in the helmet for the horn. Well, and adjust
      it to your height. For the rest, it should be easy for you to get comfortable
      with this armor, since it is very... well, let`s call it adaptive. It adapts
      itself to the owner. Obviously, the Enclave scientists haven`t been sitting
      on their hooves for the past two hundred years. A war with them will be difficult...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018177
    m_Localized: Oh thank you! Can`t wait to give it a try!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018178
    m_Localized: Don`t mention it. You are a valuable ally. By helping you, we help
      ourselves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018179
    m_Localized: Hey, this used to be my room!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018180
    m_Localized: Wow, it hasn`t changed a bit. As gray as my former life...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018181
    m_Localized: Just think, if I had not been chosen for a mission on the surface,
      I would continue living here. Day after day, year after year, not knowing anything
      about what is happening outside. Safe and...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018182
    m_Localized: useless...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018183
    m_Localized: 'Dear Reader! If you hold this opus in your hooves, that means that
      you have decided to take the first step in mastering the subtle art of foul
      language. The ability to swear firmly and ornately is actually an important
      and essential part of intelligent speech, and there is absolutely nothing shameful
      in it if used properly. In most cases, simply adding a dirty word to your speech
      is not enough to impress audience and fully express your feelings, and many
      improve their skills of conveying emotions colorfully throughout entire life.
      Sadly, our dictionary will unlikely be enough to raise you to the level of
      real maestros of this art, because the truly masterful swearing should come
      intuitively and from your very heart. But thanks to this book, you can definitely
      get a starting point that will guide you in further improving your talents
      in this field

      This book is divided into three main sections, depending
      on the dirtiness and strength of the curses. If you have never encountered
      rude expressions before, we strongly recommend that you start reading from
      the very first, most decent section. All the phrases listed here are universal
      and can be applied in any situation to express anger, resentment or admiration.

      1.
      Light swearing

      This section gives examples of the most frequently used
      curses that are accepted in society as relatively civilized and acceptable
      for use even with foals. They will still allow you to clearly and vividly express
      your thoughts and your mood to the recipient.

      Oh, Celestia curse you(them)!

      Luna`s
      curses!

      Oh, for Celestia`s sake!

      Discord`s spawn!

      Oh Goddesses!

      Let
      you(them) choke on it!

      May Luna smash your silly head!

      May Celestia
      burn you(them)!

      May Celestia and Luna bring curses upon you(them)!

      May
      your friends abandon you!

      May Discord take you!

      Sweet Celestia!

      Flying
      feathers!

      May goddesses damn you!

      Horseapples!

      Pegasus
      horns!

      What the hay!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018184
    m_Localized: "2. Profanity.\nThis section contains samples of swearing considered
      taboo in society. In most cases, it contains abusive words designed to give
      a phrase more rigidity and edge. We recommend resorting to them only in the
      presence of ponies well-known to you who will not be offended by such an expression
      of emotions, and categorically do not recommend using them near foals, law
      enforcement officers and the Overmare/Overstallion.\nFuck!\nFuckity-fuck!\nFuck
      it with a horn!\nFor fuck`s sake!\nShut the fuck up!\nGo fuck yourself (themselves)!\nFuck
      your (their) asses with a hoof!\n(addressing a stallion) Bloody dragonfucker!\nParasprite`s
      dick!\nBloody bitch!\nSon of a bitch!\nBloody cunt!\n(addressing a filly) Bloody
      whore!\n(applicable to unicorn/stallions) Sit on my horn and spin!\nMotherfucking
      cocksucker!\nFucked up beyond all recognition!\nKiss my ass, you shitty little
      motherfucking cocksucking bastard!\nHoof me the fucking keys, you cocksucker,
      what the fuck?\n3. Blasphemy.\nThis part contains ugly and dirty curses, which
      to some extent involve the divine princesses Celestia and Luna. Many believe
      that mentioning them in such an ugly and rude way is a sin in itself, and our
      heavenly patrons may not tolerate such an attitude towards themselves. Therefore,
      use them only at your own risk.\nOh fuck me with Celestia`s forehooves!\nLuna
      rape you (them) with her horn!\nLuna fuck me with the moon.\nLuna shitting
      moon rocks!\nStick a horn where Celestia don`t shine!\nSolar-flaring orgasms
      of Celestia!\nLuna shove my cunt full of moonrocks and call me home.\nCelestia
      clop my clit with a hoof-full of sunfire!\nLuna`s tidal mareheat!\nCelestia
      suckle me!\nCelestia`s solar-flaring mareheat!\nLuna clop me with Her wings.\nOh
      Goddesses fuck me in a three-way\nCelestia`s solar-heated libido!\nLuna-eclipsing
      orgasms!\nHoly hot sex with Celestia!\nConclusion.\nIt does not matter what
      kind of curses you use and how they interact with each other. Remember that
      the most important thing about any swearing is its relevance. The ability to
      be aware of where and when you can, and where and when you shouldn`t swear
      will help you to maintain your culture and not be considered vulgar, at the
      same time creating an image of a harsh and tough pony. Therefore, it will be
      best if you, before starting to demonstrate the knowledge gained from your
      book, evaluate under what conditions your team members consider swearing appropriate
      and what type of curses are most common among them.\nGood luck in this difficult
      but noble art!\nBonus material.\nIn truth, when our team of authors worked
      on this book, we did not expect to add any additional material after the conclusion.
      However, the opus presented below is, without a doubt, simply obliged to appear
      on these pages in view of its unconditional uniqueness and exceptional relevance.
      This text was kindly provided by a representative of the library of our Stable,
      who wished to remain anonymous, and is a well-documented tirade of a senior
      official who lived many centuries before the War. Its uniqueness lies in the
      fact that, with its impressive length and incredible variety of words used,
      it was expressed by the author without any preparation and without purpose
      to get into history, but only in order to reprimand the royal guard who had
      fallen asleep at the post. Through the efforts of Princess Celestia`s adjutant,
      this impromptu was preserved and recorded in its original form, and now, despite
      the abundance of long-obsolete words, it is certainly an example of unsurpassed
      mastery in the art of dirty, but such colorful and amazing swearing (and the
      amazing power of the lungs).\nYou miserable bastard, bloody pants-pissing retard,
      motherfucking moron, buttfucked by a timberwolf, fart-smelling maggot, balllicking
      wanker, frigid son of a bitchy whore, zebra-humping insect-eating asshole,
      Discord`s scrotum sack, Tirek`s cocksucking excuse for a guard, cyka blyat,
      if I ever see you sorry ass asleep at the fucking post, then, for Celestia`s
      sake, I am gonna shove my hoof so far up your ass the water on my knee will
      quench your thirst before you can even fucking say \"horseshit\", do you fucking
      understand?!  \n|*The following sections contain examples of swearing so rude
      and indecent that even a seasoned raider could enrich his vocabulary with more
      than one new phrase*"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018185
    m_Localized: Hardcore zone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018186
    m_Localized: 'Attention!

      You are entering the hardcore zone. Here you
      will have to survive without being able to use checkpoints, return to base,
      use services of traders and doctors. Before moving on, make sure that you are
      ready, in good health, have plenty of ammunition, medicine and explosives for
      locked doors, and your equipment is repaired and ready for battle.

      You
      will need an electromagnetic bomb to enter. One bomb opens the entrance only
      once. If you lose consciousness or return to the base, the entrance will be
      closed and you will need to spend another bomb.

      Walkthrough may take
      more than one hour.

      And although the items you find and the experience
      you gain will remain with you, you may lose the game progress! You can enter
      this zone as many times as you like, but each time from the start.

      Valuable
      rewards await you in the last room. Good luck!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018187
    m_Localized: Ghouls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018188
    m_Localized: 'Ghouls.

      The first time I saw a ghoul was a week after losing
      memory. To be honest, I didn`t even understand what I saw: a terribly looking
      pony rushed straight at me, growling like wild animals. I barely managed to
      escape. Then I thought that it was just sick with some strange illness. However,
      a couple of days later I had an opportunity to examine these creatures closer.
      I was on the second floor of an old building, and there was a huge hole in
      the floor of one of its rooms. Through that I saw two of them below. I quietly
      crept to the edge and carefully studied their appearance. They were corpses,
      actual half-decayed corpses! They did not breathe, did not move at all, just
      stared blankly at the wall in front of them. Since then I tried avoiding meeting
      these creatures. Until I came across a camp full of quite alive and friendly
      ponies.

      There, having become a little familiar, I began asking the inhabitants
      about the world around me. I learned a lot, but what`s really important, I
      found out that ghouls actually have some kind of life. Yes, they are not just
      puppets raised by magic, they are alive! It`s strange, very strange. How can
      an organism maintain life after such monstrous mutilation? Unfortunately, ponies
      in the camp couldn`t give me answers. I decided to put my questions about this
      into my to-do list'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018189
    m_Localized: 'After I`ve learned about the Rainbow project and sent that crazy
      "mentor" where sun doesn`t shine, I got more time. So I returned to my questions.
      Unfortunately, I could learn little from ghouls` bodies: only that after owner`s
      death its dead tissue... well, it remains dead, not showing any life signs.
      I realized that to conduct a real experiment I need to work with subjects in
      a lab. It`s highly unlikely that ponies from the camp will be happy if I bring
      a smelly corpse with me and begin dissecting it. It seems that I will have
      to do experiments far from others.

      I picked the place quickly. The old
      underground sewers were pretty well populated with subjects for my research.
      In addition, it was easy hiding from them on elevated positions, and raiders
      don`t wander there - the biggest danger of all I met in the Wasteland. Really,
      I honestly have no clue why those ponies are so cruel.

      Well, the camp
      is doing well, and I hope that next week I will not be needed there. They are
      good ponies, they will be fine without me for a while. Just in case, I warned
      Calamiti that I am leaving for a week, so that if something happens to me,
      they would find me'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018190
    m_Localized: And so I`m here. Oh, that stench, dear Celestia! But I was lucky
      to find a secluded place almost right away, after only a couple of hours. At
      this height, nopony will notice me, and if they do, zombies will never jump
      this high. I laid out my stuff and prepared a field lab. It`s time to do science
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018191
    m_Localized: 'I caught one of them. It proved to be impossible to catch it alive
      (if this word is even applicable), anyway, for a start the remains will do.
      I carried it to my lab and covered it with a dense cloth, so that the stench
      wouldn`t spread too much. First I examined the tissues for presence of active
      processes. A detailed analysis gave the same results as the previous quick
      review: the natural biological processes in the body of this pony stopped a
      very long time ago. But this concerns not just vital functions, decomposition
      haven`t affected tissues that much. Parasites and molds are absent from the
      body. Even traces of microorganisms that decompose dead flesh are almost indistinguishable!
      Obviously, something is methodically destroying everything that tries to eat
      the flesh of a ghoul. Something...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018192
    m_Localized: 'The subsequent study of various tissues, including brain, did not
      reveal any biochemical differences from normal dead tissue. Mind and soul left
      the body of the unfortunate creature long ago. However, the interesting results
      came from an experiment, which I should`ve done from the very beginning: the
      body contains remnants of some magic. Unfortunately, because of the age of
      the corpse, it faded away almost completely, and I cannot determine what kind
      of magic it was and what an evil pony did it. The fact that the pony was evil
      is obvious - only a monster could commit such a mockery over nature!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018193
    m_Localized: I managed to capture a live ghoul! It was difficult, but the reward
      is great as well. And although I had to conduct observations on the spot and
      then finish off the body, I found out all that I needed. I thoroughly studied
      the streams of magic that moved the body of the ghoul. It is absolutely unfamiliar
      to me, and it is completely unlike any other pony magic I know. The body seems
      to be enveloped in the dark "net" centered in the head, and this network pumps
      up the dead limbs, awakening muscle memory and forcing them to move. Moreover,
      the "center" of this network nourishes the brain, and in some unnatural way
      it comes to life and begins controlling the body! Unfortunately, there is no
      higher cerebral activity, only animal instincts. Still, perhaps there are ghouls
      somewhere in whom the magic is so strong that it revives the mind completely?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018194
    m_Localized: I buried myself in books, which I brought with me, in an attempt
      to find a reference to this strange magic. And I found it! Such witchcraft
      is nothing more than the ancient magic of zebras - strange ponies with which
      our ancestors, according to Calamity, declared a war two hundred years ago
      and burned the whole world. But I honestly don`t understand where it comes
      from. Do zebras still walk through these lands putting curses on dead ponies?
      No, it`s stupid, why would they do that? Anyway, it seems that now I need to
      look for information about that war. And I hardly will find it among these
      books. I will stay here for a little longer, perhaps I will be able to discover
      something else. Something important
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018195
    m_Localized: 'Note 1

      My psychologist strongly recommends making notes
      every time something starts worrying me. I don`t know about this technique
      and how it will calm your nerves, but right now I`m worried about two things.
      First, it is forbidden taking personal notes in our department, so that we
      can`t "steal ideas". Second, we are forbidden to set a password on our own
      terminals. Perhaps these reasons are good enough for being anxious and making
      the first record about them'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018196
    m_Localized: 'Note 2

      I wouldn`t say that we usually have little work to
      do, but the last few days were just horrible! I returned home late every single
      day! These orders from M.A.S. drive me crazy! If we can`t complete the development
      of this processor in the next few days, I`ll take the vacation earlier, barricade
      myself at home with crates of alcohol. They wouldn`t let me, of course, but
      maybe Bloom will help, we`ve known each other for a long time, he`ll understand
      my situation'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018197
    m_Localized: 'Note 3

      There`s a new leading scientist in our department,
      Morning Star. And she is a very cute hot-flank earth pony. But it`s not even
      her appearance that is important. She has such a passion at work, such a spark
      in her eyes... She`s something, that`s for sure. And, to tell the truth, I
      feel that I like her. I need to do something about it. What if we have a chance?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018198
    m_Localized: 'Note 4

      I made up my mind. Today I will go to Morning and
      invite her for dinner. I`m tired of these half-hints in conversations and quick
      little glances. I just need to work up the courage. Yes, I can do it. I`ve
      always been brave, I can do it. I just need to try'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018199
    m_Localized: 'Note 5

      I`ve heard disturbing rumors in the department. They
      say that they might start mobilization of factory workers for the front. And
      not just ordinary workers, but even engineers. This is all the more strange
      since the news didn`t report any major defeats at the front. They wouldn`t
      be lying to us, right? I need to talk about this with Morning. If it gets to
      the point that one of the two of us will be taken away, I will have to come
      up with something. We just became a couple, we will not be separated!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018200
    m_Localized: 'Note 6

      The supervisors read my diary. And in it, I wrote
      too much about things others shouldn`t know about. About Bloom, for instance.
      In other circumstances, nopony would`ve made a big deal of this "will help",
      but now they are just looking for ponies to be sent to the front instead of
      their precious asses. In short, they started the investigation, and I`m sitting
      biting my own hooves. Well at least Bloom quit before that, he`s safe. If only
      I could get out of this...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018201
    m_Localized: 'Note 7

      I`m afraid it`s my last entry here. Officially, the
      investigation gave no results. But my name was put on the list of employees
      who will be sent to military camps in a week. They say, nothing will happen,
      just stay there for a couple of weeks, practicing marching and shooting from
      weapons, which we ourselves will assemble there. But I heard that ponies from
      the Trottingham factory who were also "selected" like us, were sent to the
      war two weeks later. They promised me that my workplace would not be touched
      until I return. I`ll remember you promised that, guys.

      But this is not
      all that torments me now. As soon as Morning found out that they picked me,
      she volunteered at once. This shocked everypony, because she is one of the
      best leading scientists in the history of the department. But she insisted
      on it, very firmly. I don`t know what to think now. On one hoof, she will stay
      next to me, on the other - what will happen if we are sent to battle? Celestia
      save us all'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018202
    m_Localized: '*From: Scarlet Stone

      Message received: 75073 days ago

      Title:
      new order*

      "Hello, Morning. I hope I`m not distracting you? Because
      the fact is that, um, I got a call from the Ministry of Wartime Technology.
      Nothing serious, no, don`t worry! On the contrary, they want to make a new
      order. But, frankly, they want us to start right away. While I wasn`t told
      any specific deadlines, but if in two months we can create and test the pilot
      version, ponies from the Ministry will be very pleased.

      I`ll bring the
      technological documentation in person, but the idea is this: now M.W.T. and
      M.A.S. begin actively working on the new protection for our soldiers at the
      front. Personal Applejack`s order. The project is extremely complex and ambitious,
      but if everything turns out well, at the output we will have an armor not only
      fully protecting the soldier`s body, but also giving him strength to carry
      it like a second hide. The general schematics of the armor have already been
      developed, and now each company involved in the project is assigned to develop
      one of its elements. Our factory is entrusted with a very important part: we
      must create the material from which the protective plates will be melted. The
      requirements are very strict, but I`m sure that we can handle this. I`ll come
      to you right after lunch, please don`t go anywhere"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018203
    m_Localized: '*To: Scarlet Stone

      Message sent: 75073 days ago

      Title:
      (re) new order*

      "Hey, Boss! Excellent news, our department just finished
      the last project, and now just hanging about, doing some quality tests. I`ll
      be there, no prob, I take food from home anyways. And about the order, take
      my word, we`ll finish it in a week. We have tons of data on materials left
      from orders on robots, I bet we won`t even have to do anything, just change
      the alloy a bit, that`s all"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018204
    m_Localized: '*From: Scarlet Stone

      Message received: 75011 days ago

      Title:
      material*

      "Good morning, Morning. I`m sorry that I cannot come to you
      myself, I know that you like to discuss such things personally, but I have
      to leave for an urgent business. It`s been two months since your department
      was given an order for the material for the Steel Pony project. I know that
      you were doing your best all this time, but ponies from the Ministry, unfortunately,
      care only about results. I read the report on your latest developments, that
      you brought to me three days ago. You did a good job, and I am very proud of
      you. But I need to know what to say at MWT. How long will it take to complete
      the project? We are talking about the longest possible deadline. Please don`t
      think that I am putting pressure you, I would never do that, you know me"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018205
    m_Localized: '*To: Scarlet Stone

      Message sent: 75011 days ago

      Title:
      (re) material*

      "Hi. Sure boss, I understand all. But those demands from
      the Ministry are just too tough! You know, we`ve never done anything like this
      before. We still need at least a week to test the material and two more weeks
      in case something goes wrong. So ask for a month, if they agree"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018206
    m_Localized: '*From: Scarlet Stone

      Message received: 74975 days ago

      Title:
      deadline*

      "Good morning, Morning. Please forgive me that I have to write
      you this. But I just got a call from M.W.T. They cannot wait for us any longer.
      All the deadlines have passed. We`ve been given an ultimatum: we must finish
      the work in three days, otherwise they will withdraw all data on the project
      and transfer it to another company. Please tell me that we are on time!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018207
    m_Localized: '*To: Scarlet Stone

      Message sent: 74975 days ago

      Title:
      (re) deadline*

      "Hay, friend, don`t you worry so much! Calm down, no
      need to panic, we are doing great! In fact, I was going to do the finishing
      touches in the documentation and come to you for a report. It`s all ready!
      The material fully meets the requirements of the customer, from A to Z. You
      can call those bigwigs right away and invite them to check out our baby, because
      if I do, they`ll crawl to you on their knees to apologize! Look at them, threatening
      our boss. I can be scary too! I`ll come over in an hour, don`t worry"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018208
    m_Localized: 'Proud Pie`s Lab journal

      I haven`t seen sunlight since we
      got locked in here after zebras` mega-spells attack. Such a small thing, it
      would seem, natural light. But each month I`m missing surface more and more.
      All we have here is a couple of orchards, and they wouldn`t even be able to
      grow anything if it wasn`t for the magic of unicorns from our personnel. They
      call it the most technological Stable. But no one seriously believed that ponies
      would have to live here for many years, or decades perhaps. Nooo, we won`t
      be staying here for so long, it just cannot be.

      This way or another,
      the work continues. Let us be locked underground for now, we can win back our
      Equestria yet! And if we want to achieve this, we have lots to do. Nothing
      more refreshing than recognition of my outstanding knowledge and skills for
      productive work. I just need working hard day after day'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018209
    m_Localized: 'We managed to achieve significant progress in the project. Here,
      in the Stable, we are very limited in resources, but even in such conditions
      I`m doing well. I was able to increase equidroids` ability to learn. By simply
      increasing the amount of short-term memory, it became possible to teach the
      machine conducting an almost conscious dialogue with a live pony and remember
      his preferences. Memorizing doesn`t always occur correctly, but fixing this
      unfortunate error is a matter of time.

      However, not everypony is as
      productive as I am. After so much time, our communication department has not
      been able to establish contact with any of the surface research institutes.
      With other Stables - no problem, but not with Equestria. I understand that
      a huge number of mega-spells hit the surface, but it can`t be that everything
      is destroyed. Nonsense! It`s more like somepony just eats their hay for nothing'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018210
    m_Localized: 'Another month spent in vain. Slackers failed to contact anypony,
      and Overmare rejects all my requests of sending scouts to the outside world.
      Why, I wonder? Personally, I don`t see any logical reasons against it.

      I
      managed to connect all the equidroids to a common Stable database. To do this
      we had to take some components from the ultra-sentinels, but we didn`t need
      so many of those clumsy things in the first place. Within narrow walls of the
      Stable, they would do more harm than good. But the access of equidroids to
      the data bank will provide them with all the necessary information online.
      Invaluable improvement!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018211
    m_Localized: 'There is a conspiracy going on in the Stable! These worthless fools
      are jealous of the few truly talented ponies that are locked here, and put
      spokes in others` wheels. They are smiling and promising to do their best,
      while scheming and planning sabotage behind your back. Why didn`t I guess before?

      But
      if a pony is worthless, it is worthless in everything. Despite all the efforts,
      these bloodsuckers did not stop me from continuing my work. Unfortunately,
      in such conditions it is impossible to create a completely self-sufficient
      artificial personality. However, I managed to create a program that mimics
      the pony consciousness with almost one hundred percent identity. I called her
      Sweetie Cake, and she will be my first and only trusted assistant. Like never
      before, now I need a pony who could untangle this web of lies. That`s why I
      gave Sweetie the personality of one of the most outstanding counterintelligence
      agents of our time, the head of the Ministry of Morale - Pinky Pie. Fortunately,
      all the data about it was in the database. Let`s see what they will say now'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018212
    m_Localized: The hour of reckoning is coming! Sweety Cake has done a great job,
      studying all the residents of Stable 88, and will soon make her verdict. Who
      is a saboteur and who is an honest citizen, who is a spy, and who is faithful
      to Equestria. All equidroids will receive a list and carry out security checks
      and searches. I`m not a beast, no one will be executed or tortured. But as
      soon as all saboteurs are locked in cells, the true patriots of Equestria can
      breathe freely and finally pull us all out of this damned metal box
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018213
    m_Localized: 'Bla-bla. Bla-bla-bla. Welly, welly well.

      Always helps when
      you don`t know where to start. And, after all, I won`t let anypony read it.
      Just have to vent, that`s it.

      So much happened recently. But only one
      thing really matters. We lost our home. We lost Equestria. Everypony in the
      Stable now lives with this thought. Some took it well, some didn`t. Poor Apple
      Sugar, for one, had a breakdown and tried to get out. There`s death now, outside
      the door. This tears my heart the most.

      At some point you want to scream,
      and after ten minutes you lie in bed staring at the wall without a single thought.
      There is no motivation to do anything. I force myself to work only because,
      while I`m busy, the terrible realization of the end of the world is receding
      into the background, absorbed in thoughts about pressing issues.

      It`s
      easier for me because there was nopony there who was really dear to me outside
      the door. My brother is here, my best friend too. But we don`t talk yet. Nobody
      talks. At first, we tried to have fun, play games and sing songs, but this
      only made it worse.

      You look at these metal walls around and think that
      this is all that is left of the world. Everything I`ve ever known, everything
      just... gone. Everything disappeared, burned, leaving only black ashes and
      charred skeletons. Celestia? Luna? Who knows if they are even alive now? Why
      didn`t they protect us? Did we, ponies, bring everything to the point that
      even the Princesses were powerless?

      I just had a tantrum and broke a
      chair against the wall. No, it didn`t help either. Oh, screw this'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018214
    m_Localized: Authorization complete. Good day, Overmare
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018215
    m_Localized: Overmare? I wonder what this terminal has
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018216
    m_Localized: Oh, there is a recording!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018217
    m_Localized: Opening file "Audio record speech of Vice-President of Stable-Tec"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018218
    m_Localized: Hello. This is the founder and vice-president of Stable-Tec corporation
      speaking. My name is Scootaloo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018219
    m_Localized: You were elected as the overmare of Stable-Tec`s Stable 88, the
      one which is special in every sense. You have been selected for your loyalty
      and sense of duty both to your fellow ponies and to our company. And even though
      Stable-Tec headquarters, perhaps... and most likely, already lie in ruins,
      the ideals of the company remain unshakable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018220
    m_Localized: The uniqueness of your Stable is that you may be the only research
      institution that will remain operational after we... we all...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018221
    m_Localized: If this really happens, if it really... happened... you can not
      count on help from outside. According to our calculations, the mutual mega-spell
      attack between us and zebras will be so strong that no control center will
      stand. Except Stables
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018222
    m_Localized: That`s why you, your Stable was equipped with everything necessary
      not only to survive, but also to continue research in a completely autonomous
      mode. And from this moment you carry the burden of saving all ponykind. Everypony
      who remains... remains... Damn it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018223
    m_Localized: Sorry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018224
    m_Localized: But your Stable already should be enough. The projects you are working
      on are truly grand, and even if everything goes by the worst scenario, your
      developments will be able to raise Equestria from the ashes again. And to build
      a new world that will be better than the one we turned ours into
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018225
    m_Localized: Good luck. And thank you for all that you have already accomplished
      and all that you have yet to achieve. And may the Almighty Pony bless you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018226
    m_Localized: Sunrise, you now probably wonder who got into your safe and gutted
      your robo-owl. It was me, Ruby Glow. A thousand apologies for that, I`ll explain
      everything in person, but if you think about it for a minute, you could guess
      for the sake of WHAT project I would rather borrow your owl stuffing, instead
      of going to the warehouse. You know what`s happening lately, and you may guess
      who stands behind it and how everything might end. My sense tells me that if
      we want to do something about it, we need to act now. Therefore, as soon as
      you`re done reading this, go to the section D-5X, I`ll be waiting for you there.
      And, by the way, I am well aware that this robot has been just sitting in your
      safe for a couple of months, so don`t be particularly upset about it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018227
    m_Localized: 'To activate the flight spell, press the green key to the left of
      the terminal. ATTENTION: the use of the spell is allowed only to authorized
      personnel only. Personal use of the device is prohibited, violators will be
      subjected to administrative penalties'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018228
    m_Localized: "You know what will last forever? Creations of MAS. Just think about
      it: twenty years have passed, and not only this tower has not collapsed, but
      even its battery has not been discharged yet! So proud of my profession!\nI
      did not think that someday I would return to Manehattan. Why, really? After
      the war, the glow did not fade here for five years, probably. Though, on the
      other hoof, some hot fillies used to live here before the mega-spells, perhaps
      local ghouls didn`t lose all their beauty? Just kidding, of course, but what
      if?.. Maybe I`ll find a bride for Cherry Strudel here, would be a perfect pair.\nOkay,
      jokes aside. For now I will use this building as a field camp. The place is
      just perfect. If the search succeeds, perhaps our entire community will be
      able to move here. And I just happen to know a couple of chic caf\xE9s nearby.
      I`ll definitely take my Marble to the Crystal Hay. Maybe one of the walls there
      still has the imprint of my forehead after another drunken brawl.\nI must say,
      the city has changed. It feels more melancholic somehow. Maybe it`s all because
      of lack of sun, maybe I can`t get used to empty streets. They were never empty
      here, even at the very late hours. Although, on the other hoof, empty streets
      are better than ones full of bandits and zombies.\nI`d better start searching.
      I have a lot of work to do"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018229
    m_Localized: Nothing! Empty, as inside Donut`s head. It looks as if an entire
      army of scavengers has already passed by and took everything that was not nailed
      to the floor. The only exception, oddly enough - weapons. It would seem to
      me that it`s the first thing you must have in a world where everypony you meet
      will likely try to rob you, or worse - to eat you. But nooo, it seems, everypony
      carries a whole arsenal, they even were lazy to pick up ammo. But to get into
      each house and take out all electronics - easy. Neither water chips, nor solar
      ones. Nothing of advanced technology. They even ransacked traffic lights, darn
      parasprites! Well, the jackpot is yet to come. My dear ministry of MAS. I hope
      my pass is still valid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018230
    m_Localized: 'Nope, it`s not. And I`m serious. The building of M.A.S. is still
      inhabited! I wouldn`t believe it myself! It seems that the shields withstood
      the impact of the mega-spell and protected ponies inside from exposure all
      these years. Anyway, at the entrance I met two security guards. Serious guys,
      you don`t mess with folks like that. They took me inside. Merciful Celestia,
      everything there is same as before! I almost burst into tears, to suddenly
      find myself in the old world! But I didn`t stay long. Local folks listened
      to me and kicked my ass out. They didn`t care that I once was a respected employee
      here, and that we have foals and old ponies in the community who need shelter.
      You see, they don`t want us.

      It seems I came here in vain. Just opened
      up old wounds. And I recently saw a flock of ghouls downstairs. Staying here
      isn`t safe, and there seems to be nothing left to take. Today I return to my
      folks.

      I could, of course, take this terminal with me at least. But,
      meh, I`ll rather let it stay here, it`s nothing special anyway. And, perhaps,
      somepony else will read my little diary. Like, You! Yes, you, at the table!
      Do you think I don`t know that you`re sitting there and are reading these lines
      right now on the screen? Do you think I don`t know your name, @lp? That`s right,
      mate!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018231
    m_Localized: What, your name is not @lp? But just imagine how somepony called
      @lp would feel in your place right now! Hilarious, right? Very well, move along,
      traveler. Let Celestia direct your hooves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018232
    m_Localized: 'ATTENTION: this material is intended and obligatory for reading
      only for the staff of the Ministry of Image in the position of "operator of
      the CBS line" and above. Unauthorized access to this document is prosecuted
      under the law of wartime.

      Update of the protocol for the control of
      unreliable information No. 253:

      As a consequence of the recent incident
      in Zebratown, the leadership of the Ministry decided to impose strong control
      over any information related to zebras - residents of Equestria. Authors and
      editors of news, historical and popular science articles, as well as censors
      of historical and cultural materials, are strongly encouraged to pay attention
      to the following items:

      - News about events in which zebra subjects
      took part;

      - Historical documents mentioning any influence of zebras
      on events in Equestria;

      - Materials on the cultural peculiarities of
      Equestrian zebras;

      - A biography of famous zebras who ever lived in
      Equestria.

      While handling the items above, the following requirements
      are to be met:

      - Avoid any positive assessments of the actions, events
      or phenomena associated with equestrian zebras;

      - Eliminate any information
      about the positive influence of zebras on the prosperity of Equestria;

      -
      Attribute all the historical achievements of the equestrian zebras to the representatives
      of the pony race;

      - Create a negative and disturbing image of zebra
      subjects'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018233
    m_Localized: 'Editor`s Note:

      My friends, we all witnessed the tragic events
      that took place in Zebratown last night. The injustice and cruelty of this
      crime fill me with bitterness, but as a pony with great responsibility, I must
      first think about our common endeavor - protection of Equestria. And now it
      is more than obvious that a new threat is facing our homeland. Our enemy is
      ruthless and dishonorable, and now it has found a new leverage to put pressure
      on our civilian population: from now on it will do everything to destroy the
      will of the ponies to fight using our neighbors - through zebras that have
      lived side by side with us for many decades. Trying to make us feel pity and
      compassion for them, the enemy means to shake our steadfastness in condemning
      its vile deeds, caused by the vicious nature of zebras. And although our zebras,
      our subjects, have no doubt been learned from our example and are most respectable
      and trustworthy, not all good but simple in the judgments ponies will understand
      the difference between our zebras and enemies'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018234
    m_Localized: My friends, our situation can develop only by one of the following
      scenarios. First, we will allow enemy to continue his subversive activities
      and incline good ponies to conformism and betrayal, and the day will come when
      the confused subjects of our beautiful princess Luna will open the gates of
      their own cities to zebra terrorists and saboteurs. Second, we, as true patriots
      and protectors of Equestria, will make every effort to deprive the enemy of
      his weapons and his poison, tearing out the very roots of trouble. Nopony has
      any doubt about how exactly we, our Ministry, should act. And although this
      means that the zebra subjects may now be unfairly tarnished in the public eye,
      all of you, being reasonable ponies, should understand that these measures
      will protect, first of all, zebras themselves, keeping filthy hooves of our
      enemies away from them. From now on we will work with all diligence to break
      the venomous teeth of the deceptive snake reaching out to our defenseless fellow
      citizens. And if each of us makes every effort and focus on eradicating dangerous
      knowledge, our Motherland will prevail
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018235
    m_Localized: '*From: Morning Rain

      Letter received: 73594 days ago

      Title:
      theft*

      "I regret to inform you that the event of a week ago, which was
      originally taken for a single case, is obviously the first in a series of systematic
      subversive activities against our Ministry. Moreover, there is a possibility
      that ponies from the Ministry of Morale itself are standing behind these diversions.

      Last
      night, an unknown person unlawfully infiltrated the Ministry warehouse in the
      city of Manehattan. The target of the intruder was again the circulation of
      posters dedicated to the recent victory of our troops over zebras on the Grizley
      Islands. The whole circulation was taken, other valuables stored in the warehouse
      were untouched. That same night, guards found dozens of inscriptions "Remember
      the massacre on the Grizzly Islands!". Employees of my department had to get
      out of beds and clean up, but the rumor spread among the population was avoided.
      A corresponding conversation was held with the guards.

      The main feature
      of this incident is that only ponies from our Ministry and the Ministry of
      Morale knew about the re-submission of the posters to the circulation, who
      deal with the problem of the Grizley Islands events. I can confidently assure
      that none of my employees are involved in this crime. Therefore conclusions
      that could be made from this situation are very disturbing"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018236
    m_Localized: '*To: Morning rain

      Letter sent: 73594 days ago

      Title:
      (re) theft*

      "We do not yet have enough information to draw such conclusions,
      Morning. However I understand your concern. If there are traitors among the
      Ministry of Morale, this may have catastrophic consequences. The MoM leader`s
      culpability is unthinkable, but one should not turn a blind eye to the possibility
      of involvement of lower ranks in the events that took place recently.

      I
      recommend resorting to the standard working scheme: tell the MoM employee,
      with whom you are cooperating, false information about receiving of the third
      edition of the posters in the warehouse in two days and ready an intercept
      unit at the appointed time. I advise for additional reinsurance also to avoid
      the spread of information about the new circulation among the ponies of your
      department. I, on my part, will contact Pinky Pie personally to arrange monitoring
      of all employees that could potentially be the perpetrator"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018237
    m_Localized: '*From: Morning Rain

      Letter received: 73592 days ago

      Title:
      (re(2)) theft*

      "Our fears were confirmed. The thief appeared in the
      warehouse exactly the day that we told the MoM side. Unfortunately, it managed
      to escape, but the ponies from the intercept team could reliably determine
      the characteristic features of the saboteur`s appearance: middle-aged pony
      with a pale yellow fur and a short mane which color could not be determined.
      The cutie mark and eyes were hidden by a cloak, and their identification was
      impossible"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018238
    m_Localized: '*To: Morning rain

      Letter sent: 73592 days ago

      Title:
      (re(3)) theft*

      "Despite the failure of the interception mission, your
      operation is certainly successful. Ponies from the Ministry of Morale have
      set up monitoring over all those involved in work on the incident on the islands,
      but none of them committed anything suspicious for the entire period of observation,
      thereby ensuring an alibi. This means that the range of suspected ponies was
      much broader than expected. If your observations are correct, these features
      of appearance will allow you to find the suspect in no time"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018239
    m_Localized: '*From: Morning Rain.

      Letter sent: 73591 days ago

      Title:
      (re(4)) theft*

      "I am happy to inform you that the saboteur, whom we
      were trying to capture for the last few days, was successfully captured by
      MoM agents. It was a junior employee in one of their departments, Mrs. Gray
      Shore. After a short interrogation, she agreed to cooperate and told the reason
      for her actions. It turns out her brother was one of the soldiers who died
      during the tragic events on the Grizzly Islands and whose death, along with
      deaths of many other ponies and information about the whole incident, we did
      not disclose to the public in order to preserve morale of the army and population.
      By these thefts and graffiti, she said, she tried to "protect the honor" of
      the deceased relative and "distract herself from gloomy thoughts." At the moment
      she is being held in the investigation department of MoM"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018240
    m_Localized: '*To: Morning rain

      Letter sent: 73591 days ago

      Title:
      (re(5)) theft*

      "Congratulations on the successful completion of the
      investigation. I have already been informed by the representatives of the Ministry
      of Morale. I recommend visiting Gray Shore in the investigation department
      today and conduct an educational talk on the importance of maintaining high
      morale of the population and place of personal feelings in life for citizens
      during wartime. The fate of this pony remains in the hooves of its Ministry,
      this is no longer our problem"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018241
    m_Localized: 'Snails, it`s Snips. Forgive me, my friend, but I have to leave
      right now. And I`m not sure exactly when I will be able to return.

      It`s
      about the project that Mrs. Rarity asked us to take care of. Yes, the Project
      itself. I worked a lot over it for the last few days and came to the conclusion
      that the ritual would be impossible without additional magical amplifiers.
      Unfortunately, my research did not give the slightest hint of what exactly
      could help us. I had to resort to additional techniques, of which I will tell
      you later, and today one of them has borne fruit. However, the conditions are
      such that I don`t have a single minute to meet with you and discuss everything
      tete-a-tete. I will ask you for one favor: tomorrow you will talk to Madame
      Rarity for me and give her a detailed report of what we managed to find out
      at the moment. You know where to find my notes, make sure to read them before
      meeting with Mrs. Rarity. And don`t you dare think that I just took the opportunity
      to put everything on your shoulders! It would be too outrageous of you!

      One
      more thing: please delete this message from your terminal as soon as you read
      it. You understand'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018242
    m_Localized: And what about this recording?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018243
    m_Localized: Play recording for the call #1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018244
    m_Localized: Shiny, pick up, it`s urgent!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018245
    m_Localized: Please, darling, say something!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018246
    m_Localized: We were attacked, Shiny! Zebras attacked us! The city is being bombarded,
      it`s terrible! The princesses raised a shield and are protecting us, but everything
      is getting worse every minute!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018247
    m_Localized: A strange gas is filling the streets. I`ve never seen anything like
      this, but it`s terrible! I hid in the Ministry basement, in a room with a communication
      unit. There is not a single pony in a whole building! Where are they? Where
      is everypony? I don`t know
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018248
    m_Localized: Shiny, if you hear me, run from the city! Run away now! If zebras
      attacked us, then you will be attacked soon too. Don`t waste a second, run!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018249
    m_Localized: Shiny, do you hear me? Shiny?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018250
    m_Localized: I don`t want to die, Shiny! I want to be with you! We will be together
      again soon, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018251
    m_Localized: '*Sob*'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018252
    m_Localized: This can not be happening! It`s all not real! I must be dreaming!
      I`m dreaming, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018253
    m_Localized: Shiny, do you hear? Shiny, speak! Shiny!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018254
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018255
    m_Localized: I shouldn`t have played it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018256
