    m_Localized: Safety can not be pr...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742018999
    m_Localized: Failed to secure pi...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019000
    m_Localized: Your actions are illegal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019001
    m_Localized: Unlawful magical use
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019002
    m_Localized: Order violation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019003
    m_Localized: Unacceptable behavior
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019004
    m_Localized: Another glorious day in Equestrian army!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019005
    m_Localized: Our enemies shall fall!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019006
    m_Localized: Huzzah to patriots!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019007
    m_Localized: Pain is but a weakness leaving the body!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019008
    m_Localized: Everything to the victory!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019009
    m_Localized: Equestria shall prevail!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019010
    m_Localized: Nopony shall break our spirit!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019011
    m_Localized: Our enemies shall be weeping in despair!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019012
    m_Localized: I was made to battle!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019013
    m_Localized: The most glorious profession - protecting our Home!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019014
    m_Localized: I want You to join Equestrian army!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019015
    m_Localized: Fear is weakness!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019016
    m_Localized: Hey there, civilians!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019017
    m_Localized: First - fight zebras, second - ..., third - profit!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019018
    m_Localized: Hey YOU! Ten push-ups!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019019
    m_Localized: At ease!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019020
    m_Localized: That`s how we do it in the army!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019021
    m_Localized: Thank you, general, I`m proud to be Equestrian!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019022
    m_Localized: Avenge our fallen brothers!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019023
    m_Localized: Equestrians never surrender!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019024
    m_Localized: It is a good day to die!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019025
    m_Localized: Ready to die for your country, stripe-face?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019026
    m_Localized: Squad, shoot the bastard!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019027
    m_Localized: Meet Equestrian army!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019028
    m_Localized: I feel lucky today!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019029
    m_Localized: It`s getting hot in here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019030
    m_Localized: Eat metal, zebra!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019031
    m_Localized: Lets make them pay, boys!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019032
    m_Localized: How do you like them apples, striped degenerate?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019033
    m_Localized: Leave no survivors!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019034
    m_Localized: I will use your hide for decoration!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019035
    m_Localized: Ok, now I`m angry!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019036
    m_Localized: You will regret you were born, moron!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019037
    m_Localized: Striped invaders!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019038
    m_Localized: Let`s make a couple of holes in you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019039
    m_Localized: Kill everyone, goddesses will know who`s who
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019040
    m_Localized: You think I can`t hear you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019041
    m_Localized: There is somepony out there, request assistance!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019042
    m_Localized: Enemies approach. Stay alert!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019043
    m_Localized: Hold your position boys, I`ll scout
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019044
    m_Localized: Come out and identify yourselves!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019045
    m_Localized: Are you playing games with me, sucker?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019046
    m_Localized: We will find and question you Pinkie Pie style!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019047
    m_Localized: You think, you can hide from Me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019048
    m_Localized: No use hiding from Equestrian army!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019049
    m_Localized: Typical cowardly zebra maneuver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019050
    m_Localized: Come over here, zebra scum!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019051
    m_Localized: Do you fear me? Yeah, you should!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019052
    m_Localized: We lost them, boys!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019053
    m_Localized: The fun has been canceled
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019054
    m_Localized: The battlefield is ours!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019055
    m_Localized: Those cowards ran away!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019056
    m_Localized: Cease pursuit. Return to your positions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019057
    m_Localized: All the better!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019058
    m_Localized: Cease alarm!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019059
    m_Localized: They`re hiding, bastards!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019060
    m_Localized: Oh, and that`s it???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019061
    m_Localized: Just a scratch!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019062
    m_Localized: Ha, my grandma fights better!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019063
    m_Localized: I hardly even felt that!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019064
    m_Localized: My armor will hold!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019065
    m_Localized: You call that a strike?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019066
    m_Localized: Don`t make me laugh!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019067
    m_Localized: Is this everything you can?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019068
    m_Localized: It just makes me more angry!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019069
    m_Localized: Oh, that`s it then?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019070
    m_Localized: I see darkness...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019071
    m_Localized: Tell mother, I did what I could...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019072
    m_Localized: Please tell my family...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019073
    m_Localized: This is not the end...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019074
    m_Localized: Bury me in Equestria...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019075
    m_Localized: NO! We shall never be defeated...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019076
    m_Localized: Meet you in hell...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019077
    m_Localized: Your cute little magic is nothing to me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019078
    m_Localized: A miserable try, creature
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019079
    m_Localized: Can`t capture me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019080
    m_Localized: So, what now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019081
    m_Localized: Wanna play?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019082
    m_Localized: Teach me about friendship!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019083
    m_Localized: Wanna have some fun?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019084
    m_Localized: At long last...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019085
    m_Localized: Look what I can!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019086
    m_Localized: Well, hello!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019087
    m_Localized: Surprise!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019088
    m_Localized: It`s party time!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019089
    m_Localized: Yaaay!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019090
    m_Localized: Oh! What do we have here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019091
    m_Localized: We have guests?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019092
    m_Localized: I can hear yooou!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019093
    m_Localized: Wait! I`m beggin` you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019094
    m_Localized: Helloo! Where are yoou?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019095
    m_Localized: Don`t run!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019096
    m_Localized: You want to play hide and seek?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019097
    m_Localized: But we just started!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019098
    m_Localized: I will find you anyhow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019099
    m_Localized: But it was so much fun...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019100
    m_Localized: It is so boring again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019101
    m_Localized: And all alone again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019102
    m_Localized: Nopony there...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019103
    m_Localized: Ouch!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019104
    m_Localized: It`s tickling!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019105
    m_Localized: Ouch! What for?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019106
    m_Localized: Why so rude?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019107
    m_Localized: Stop it, bully!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019108
    m_Localized: But I thought we were friends
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019109
    m_Localized: That`s ok, I have an extra co...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019110
    m_Localized: Farewell!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019111
    m_Localized: Oh nooooes!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019112
    m_Localized: But, I can`t just leave you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019113
    m_Localized: Oh! What a rough day!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019114
    m_Localized: Oh wow!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019115
    m_Localized: I can fly!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019116
    m_Localized: Yeah! Give me a ride!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2742019117
    m_Localized: So much fun!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
